ности"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للسي بلس","معايير البرمجة","دليل سي بلس الأساسي","تطوير البرمجيات","برمجة سي بلس","تحسين الأداء"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for C++ Development Agents needing to enforce modern, safe, and idiomatic coding practices based on the C++ Core Guidelines.","zh":"非常适合需要强制执行现代、安全、惯用编码实践的C++开发代理，基于C++ Core Guidelines。","ja":"C++ Core Guidelinesに基づいたモダンで安全でイディオマティックなコーディング慣行を強制する必要があるC++開発エージェントに最適です。","ko":"C++ Core Guidelines를 기반으로 현대적이고 안전하고 관용적인 코딩 관행을 강제해야 하는 C++ 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo de C++ que necesitan aplicar prácticas de codificación modernas, seguras e idiomáticas basadas en las Guías básicas de C++.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement C++ qui ont besoin de faire respecter des pratiques de codage modernes, sûres et idiomatiques basées sur les Lignes directrices de base de C++.","de":"Perfekt für C++-Entwicklungsagenten, die moderne, sichere und idiomatische Codierungspraktiken basierend auf den C++-Kernleitlinien durchsetzen müssen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento C++ que precisam impor práticas de codificação modernas, seguras e idiomáticas com base nas Diretrizes Centrais C++.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки C++, которым необходимо обеспечить соблюдение современных, безопасных и идиоматических правил кодирования на основе Руководящих принципов C++.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى فرض ممارسات برمجة حديثة وأمنية وملائمة لمعايير الأساسيات C++."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce type safety, resource safety, immutability, and clarity in C++ code, utilizing standards derived from the C++ Core Guidelines for C++17, C++20, and C++23, ensuring consistent style across codebases and facilitating architectural decisions.","zh":"赋予代理人执行C++代码中的类型安全、资源安全、不可变性和清晰性的能力，利用C++17、C++20和C++23的标准，确保代码库中的一致性风格并促进架构决策。","ja":"C++17、C++20、C++23の標準に基づいて、C++コード内の型の安全性、リソースの安全性、不変性、明確性を強制するエージェントの能力を提供し、コードベース全体で一貫したスタイルを確保し、アーキテクチャの決定を促進します。","ko":"C++17, C++20, C++23의 표준을 기반으로 C++ 코드의 유형 안전성, 리소스 안전성, 불변성 및 명확성을 강제하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하여 코드베이스 전반에 걸쳐 일관된 스타일을 보장하고 아키텍처 결정에 기여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a hacer cumplir la seguridad de tipos, la seguridad de recursos, la inmutabilidad y la claridad en el código C++, utilizando estándares derivados de las Guías básicas de C++ para C++17, C++20 y C++23, garantizando un estilo coherente en las bases de código y facilitando las decisiones arquitectónicas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de faire respecter la sécurité des types, la sécurité des ressources, l''immuabilité et la clarté dans le code C++, en utilisant des normes dérivées des Lignes directrices de base de C++ pour C++17, C++20 et C++23, garantissant un style cohérent à travers les bases de code et facilitant les décisions architecturales.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Typsicherheit, Ressourcensicherheit, Unveränderlichkeit und Klarheit in C++-Code durchzusetzen, indem Standards verwendet werden, die von den C++-Kernleitlinien für C++17, C++20 und C++23 abgeleitet sind, um einen konsistenten Stil über Codebasen hinweg sicherzustellen und architektonische Entscheidungen zu erleichtern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor segurança de tipo, segurança de recursos, imutabilidade e clareza no código C++, utilizando padrões derivados das Diretrizes Centrais C++ para C++17, C++20 e C++23, garantindo um estilo consistente em código e facilitando decisões arquiteturais.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить безопасность типов, безопасность ресурсов, неизменяемость и ясность кода C++, используя стандарты, полученные из Руководящих принципов C++ для C++17, C++20 и C++23, обеспечивая последовательный стиль кода и облегчая архитектурные решения.","ar":"يتمكّن الوكلاء من فرض سلامة النوع وسلامة الموارد واللا تغير والوضوح في رمز C++، مستخدمين المعايير المشتقة من معايير الأساسيات C++ لـ C++17 و C++20 و C++23، مما يضمن أسلوبًا متسقًا عبر قواعد البيانات وتسهيل القرارات المعمارية."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing consistent coding style across large C++ projects","Reviewing and refactoring existing C++ code for modern standards","Generating C++ code snippets that adhere to the C++ Core Guidelines"],"zh":["在大型C++项目中执行一致的编码样式","审查和重构现有的C++代码以满足现代标准","生成符合C++ Core Guidelines的C++代码片段"],"ja":["大規模なC++プロジェクト全体で一貫したコーディングスタイルを実施する","既存のC++コードをレビューしてリファクタリングし、モダンな標準に適合させる","C++ Core Guidelinesに準拠したC++コードスニペットを生成する"],"ko":["대형 C++ 프로젝트 전반에 걸쳐 일관된 코딩 스타일을 시행한다","기존 C++ 코드를 검토하고 재구성하여 현대적인 표준을满足한다","C++ Core Guidelines에 준하는 C++ 코드 스니펫을 생성한다"],"es":["Hacer cumplir un estilo de codificación coherente en grandes proyectos de C++","Revisar y refactorizar el código C++ existente para los estándares modernos","Generar fragmentos de código C++ que se adhieran a las Guías básicas de C++"],"fr":["Faire respecter un style de codage cohérent dans de grands projets C++","Réviser et réorganiser le code C++ existant pour les normes modernes","Générer des extraits de code C++ qui respectent les Lignes directrices de base de C++"],"de":["Durchsetzen eines konsistenten Codierungsstils in großen C++-Projekten","Überprüfen und Umstrukturieren des bestehenden C++-Codes für moderne Standards","Generieren von C++-Code-Snippets, die den C++-Kernleitlinien entsprechen"],"pt":["Impor estilo de codificação consistente em grandes projetos C++","Revisar e refatorar código C++ existente para padrões modernos","Gerar trechos de código C++ que aderem às Diretrizes Centrais C++"],"ru":["Обеспечить единый стиль кодирования в крупных проектах C++","Просмотреть и переработать существующий код C++ для современных стандартов","Сгенерировать фрагменты кода C++, соответствующие Руководящим принципам C++"],"ar":["فرض أسلوب ترميز متسق عبر مشاريع C++ الكبيرة","مراجعة وإعادة هيكلة رمز C++ الحالي لملاءمته للمعايير الحديثة","توليد شذرات من رمز C++ التي تتبع معايير الأساسيات C++"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of C++17, C++20, or C++23 standards","Limited to C++ coding standards, not applicable to other programming languages"],"zh":["需要C++17、C++20或C++23标准的知识","仅限于C++编码标准，不适用于其他编程语言"],"ja":["C++17、C++20、またはC++23の標準の知識が必要","C++コーディング標準のみに限定され、他のプログラミング言語には適用されない"],"ko":["C++17, C++20 또는 C++23 표준에 대한 지식이 필요합니다","C++ 코딩 표준에만 국한되어 있으며, 다른 프로그래밍 언어에는 적용되지 않습니다"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los estándares C++17, C++20 o C++23","Limitado a los estándares de codificación de C++, no se aplica a otros lenguajes de programación"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances des normes C++17, C++20 ou C++23","Limité aux normes de codage C++, n''est pas applicable à d''autres langages de programmation"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der Standards C++17, C++20 oder C++23","Begrenzt auf C++-Codierungsstandards, nicht anwendbar auf andere Programmiersprachen"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento dos padrões C++17, C++20 ou C++23","Limitado a padrões de codificação C++, não se aplica a outras linguagens de programação"],"ru":["Требует знания стандартов C++17, C++20 или C++23","Ограничен стандартами кодирования C++, не применимы к другим языкам программирования"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بمعايير C++17 و C++20 و C++23","محدود بمعايير برمجة C++، ولا ينطبق على لغات البرمجة الأخرى"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"70919980c635f66db649b7eb1e426fb2098754ed6c9db22f1a7eee0935227d35","repoEtag":"W/\"1d66934774ad40d3d916abf4c33c3e340ab032f8212b35e12a94daa7359886c9\"","qualityScore":95}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/django-verification', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'django-verification', 55024, 6781, 95, '2026-03-01T05:07:39Z', '2026-03-01T05:10:12.974Z', 'b330cd018e559d568990f485f6ba90795e22e4b38dd68911167af88f54388674', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/django-verification","name":"django-verification","description":{"zh":"Django 验证循环是一种确保 Django 应用质量和安全的工具，运行环境检查、lint、测试、安全扫描和部署准备检查","ja":"Django 検証ループは、Django アプリケーションの品質とセキュリティを確保するためのツールです。環境チェック、lint、テスト、セキュリティスキャン、デプロイ準備チェックを実行します","ko":"Django 검증 루프는 Django 애플리케이션의 품질과 보안을 보장하는 도구입니다. 환경 확인, lint, 테스트, 보안 스캔, 배포 준비 확인을 실행합니다","es":"El ciclo de verificación de Django garantiza la calidad y seguridad de tus aplicaciones antes de su lanzamiento o PR","fr":"La boucle de vérification Django assure la qualité et la sécurité de vos applications avant leur lancement ou PR","de":"Der Django-Überprüfungszyklus gewährleistet die Qualität und Sicherheit Ihrer Anwendungen vor der Veröffentlichung oder PR","pt":"O ciclo de verificação em Django é uma ferramenta essencial para garantir a qualidade e segurança do seu projeto, executando migrações, linting, testes e análise de segurança","ru":"Цикл верификации Django - это необходимый инструмент для обеспечения качества и безопасности вашего проекта, выполняющий миграции, linting, тесты и анализ безопасности","ar":"دورة التحقق في Django هي أداة أساسية لضمان جودة وأمان مشروعك، حيث تقوم بتنفيذ الهجرات والتنسيق والاختبارات وتحليل الأمان","en":"Verification loop for Django projects: migrations, linting, tests with coverage, security scans, and deployment readiness checks before release or PR."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":55024,"forks":6781,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:07:39Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"django-verification","description":"Verification loop for Django projects: migrations, linting, tests with coverage, security scans, and deployment readiness checks before release or PR.","bodyPreview":"# Django Verification Loop\n\nRun before PRs, after major changes, and pre-deploy to ensure Django application quality and security.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Before opening a pull request for a Django project\n- After major model changes, migration updates, or dependency upgrades\n- Pre-deployment verification for staging or production\n- Running full environment → lint → test → security → deploy readiness pipeline\n- Validating migration safety and test coverage\n\n## Phase 1: Environment Check\n\n```bash","body":"# Django Verification Loop\n\nRun before PRs, after major changes, and pre-deploy to ensure Django application quality and security.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Before opening a pull request for a Django project\n- After major model changes, migration updates, or dependency upgrades\n- Pre-deployment verification for staging or production\n- Running full environment → lint → test → security → deploy readiness pipeline\n- Validating migration safety and test coverage\n\n## Phase 1: Environment Check\n\n```bash\n# Verify Python version\npython --version  # Should match project requirements\n\n# Check virtual environment\nwhich python\npip list --outdated\n\n# Verify environment variables\npython -c \"import os; import environ; print(''DJANGO_SECRET_KEY set'' if os.environ.get(''DJANGO_SECRET_KEY'') else ''MISSING: DJANGO_SECRET_KEY'')\"\n```\n\nIf environment is misconfigured, stop and fix.\n\n## Phase 2: Code Quality & Formatting\n\n```bash\n# Type checking\nmypy . --config-file pyproject.toml\n\n# Linting with ruff\nruff check . --fix\n\n# Formatting with black\nblack . --check\nblack .  # Auto-fix\n\n# Import sorting\nisort . --check-only\nisort .  # Auto-fix\n\n# Django-specific checks\npython manage.py check --deploy\n```\n\nCommon issues:\n- Missing type hints on public functions\n- PEP 8 formatting violations\n- Unsorted imports\n- Debug settings left in production configuration\n\n## Phase 3: Migrations\n\n```bash\n# Check for unapplied migrations\npython manage.py showmigrations\n\n# Create missing migrations\npython manage.py makemigrations --check\n\n# Dry-run migration application\npython manage.py migrate --plan\n\n# Apply migrations (test environment)\npython manage.py migrate\n\n# Check for migration conflicts\npython manage.py makemigrations --merge  # Only if conflicts exist\n```\n\nReport:\n- Number of pending migrations\n- Any migration conflicts\n- Model changes without migrations\n\n## Phase 4: Tests + Coverage\n\n```bash\n# Run all tests with pytest\npytest --cov=apps --cov-report=html --cov-report=term-missing --reuse-db\n\n# Run specific app tests\npytest apps/users/tests/\n\n# Run with markers\npytest -m \"not slow\"  # Skip slow tests\npytest -m integration  # Only integration tests\n\n# Coverage report\nopen htmlcov/index.html\n```\n\nReport:\n- Total tests: X passed, Y failed, Z skipped\n- Overall coverage: XX%\n- Per-app coverage breakdown\n\nCoverage targets:\n\n| Component | Target |\n|-----------|--------|\n| Models | 90%+ |\n| Serializers | 85%+ |\n| Views | 80%+ |\n| Services | 90%+ |\n| Overall | 80%+ |\n\n## Phase 5: Security Scan\n\n```bash\n# Dependency vulnerabilities\npip-audit\nsafety check --full-report\n\n# Django security checks\npython manage.py check --deploy\n\n# Bandit security linter\nbandit -r . -f json -o bandit-report.json\n\n# Secret scanning (if gitleaks is installed)\ngitleaks detect --source . --verbose\n\n# Environment variable check\npython -c \"from django.core.exceptions import ImproperlyConfigured; from django.conf import settings; settings.DEBUG\"\n```\n\nReport:\n- Vulnerable dependencies found\n- Security configuration issues\n- Hardcoded secrets detected\n- DEBUG mode status (should be False in production)\n\n## Phase 6: Django Management Commands\n\n```bash\n# Check for model issues\npython manage.py check\n\n# Collect static files\npython manage.py collectstatic --noinput --clear\n\n# Create superuser (if needed for tests)\necho \"from apps.users.models import User; User.objects.create_superuser(''admin@example.com'', ''admin'')\" | python manage.py shell\n\n# Database integrity\npython manage.py check --database default\n\n# Cache verification (if using Redis)\npython -c \"from django.core.cache import cache; cache.set(''test'', ''value'', 10); print(cache.get(''test''))\"\n```\n\n## Phase 7: Performance Checks\n\n```bash\n# Django Debug Toolbar output (check for N+1 queries)\n# Run in dev mode with DEBUG=True and access a page\n# Look for duplicate queries in SQL panel\n\n# Query count analysis\ndjango-admin debugsqlshell  # If django-debug-sqlshell installed\n\n# Check for missing indexes\npython manage.py shell << EOF\nfrom django.db import connection\nwith connection.cursor() as cursor:\n    cursor.execute(\"SELECT table_name, index_name FROM information_schema.statistics WHERE table_schema = ''public''\")\n    print(cursor.fetchall())\nEOF\n```\n\nReport:\n- Number of queries per page (should be < 50 for typical pages)\n- Missing database indexes\n- Duplicate queries detected\n\n## Phase 8: Static Assets\n\n```bash\n# Check for npm dependencies (if using npm)\nnpm audit\nnpm audit fix\n\n# Build static files (if using webpack/vite)\nnpm run build\n\n# Verify static files\nls -la staticfiles/\npython manage.py findstatic css/style.css\n```\n\n## Phase 9: Configuration Review\n\n```python\n# Run in Python shell to verify settings\npython manage.py shell << EOF\nfrom django.conf import settings\nimport os\n\n# Critical checks\nchecks = {\n    ''DEBUG is False'': not settings.DEBUG,\n    ''SECRET_KEY set'': bool(settings.SECRET_KEY and len(settings.SECRET_KEY) > 30),\n    ''ALLOWED_HOSTS set'': len(settings.ALLOWED_HOSTS) > 0,\n    ''HTTPS enabled'': getattr(settings, ''SECURE_SSL_REDIRECT'', False),\n    ''HSTS enabled'': getattr(settings, ''SECURE_HSTS_SECONDS'', 0) > 0,\n    ''Database configured'': settings.DATABASES[''default''][''ENGINE''] != ''django.db.backends.sqlite3'',\n}\n\nfor check, result in checks.items():\n    status = ''✓'' if result else ''✗''\n    print(f\"{status} {check}\")\nEOF\n```\n\n## Phase 10: Logging Configuration\n\n```bash\n# Test logging output\npython manage.py shell << EOF\nimport logging\nlogger = logging.getLogger(''django'')\nlogger.warning(''Test warning message'')\nlogger.error(''Test error message'')\nEOF\n\n# Check log files (if configured)\ntail -f /var/log/django/django.log\n```\n\n## Phase 11: API Documentation (if DRF)\n\n```bash\n# Generate schema\npython manage.py generateschema --format openapi-json > schema.json\n\n# Validate schema\n# Check if schema.json is valid JSON\npython -c \"import json; json.load(open(''schema.json''))\"\n\n# Access Swagger UI (if using drf-yasg)\n# Visit http://localhost:8000/swagger/ in browser\n```\n\n## Phase 12: Diff Review\n\n```bash\n# Show diff statistics\ngit diff --stat\n\n# Show actual changes\ngit diff\n\n# Show changed files\ngit diff --name-only\n\n# Check for common issues\ngit diff | grep -i \"todo\\|fixme\\|hack\\|xxx\"\ngit diff | grep \"print(\"  # Debug statements\ngit diff | grep \"DEBUG = True\"  # Debug mode\ngit diff | grep \"import pdb\"  # Debugger\n```\n\nChecklist:\n- No debugging statements (print, pdb, breakpoint())\n- No TODO/FIXME comments in critical code\n- No hardcoded secrets or credentials\n- Database migrations included for model changes\n- Configuration changes documented\n- Error handling present for external calls\n- Transaction management where needed\n\n## Output Template\n\n```\nDJANGO VERIFICATION REPORT\n==========================\n\nPhase 1: Environment Check\n  ✓ Python 3.11.5\n  ✓ Virtual environment active\n  ✓ All environment variables set\n\nPhase 2: Code Quality\n  ✓ mypy: No type errors\n  ✗ ruff: 3 issues found (auto-fixed)\n  ✓ black: No formatting issues\n  ✓ isort: Imports properly sorted\n  ✓ manage.py check: No issues\n\nPhase 3: Migrations\n  ✓ No unapplied migrations\n  ✓ No migration conflicts\n  ✓ All models have migrations\n\nPhase 4: Tests + Coverage\n  Tests: 247 passed, 0 failed, 5 skipped\n  Coverage:\n    Overall: 87%\n    users: 92%\n    products: 89%\n    orders: 85%\n    payments: 91%\n\nPhase 5: Security Scan\n  ✗ pip-audit: 2 vulnerabilities found (fix required)\n  ✓ safety check: No issues\n  ✓ bandit: No security issues\n  ✓ No secrets detected\n  ✓ DEBUG = False\n\nPhase 6: Django Commands\n  ✓ collectstatic completed\n  ✓ Database integrity OK\n  ✓ Cache backend reachable\n\nPhase 7: Performance\n  ✓ No N+1 queries detected\n  ✓ Database indexes configured\n  ✓ Query count acceptable\n\nPhase 8: Static Assets\n  ✓ npm audit: No vulnerabilities\n  ✓ Assets built successfully\n  ✓ Static files collected\n\nPhase 9: Configuration\n  ✓ DEBUG = False\n  ✓ SECRET_KEY configured\n  ✓ ALLOWED_HOSTS set\n  ✓ HTTPS enabled\n  ✓ HSTS enabled\n  ✓ Database configured\n\nPhase 10: Logging\n  ✓ Logging configured\n  ✓ Log files writable\n\nPhase 11: API Documentation\n  ✓ Schema generated\n  ✓ Swagger UI accessible\n\nPhase 12: Diff Review\n  Files changed: 12\n  +450, -120 lines\n  ✓ No debug statements\n  ✓ No hardcoded secrets\n  ✓ Migrations included\n\nRECOMMENDATION: ⚠️ Fix pip-audit vulnerabilities before deploying\n\nNEXT STEPS:\n1. Update vulnerable dependencies\n2. Re-run security scan\n3. Deploy to staging for final testing\n```\n\n## Pre-Deployment Checklist\n\n- [ ] All tests passing\n- [ ] Coverage ≥ 80%\n- [ ] No security vulnerabilities\n- [ ] No unapplied migrations\n- [ ] DEBUG = False in production settings\n- [ ] SECRET_KEY properly configured\n- [ ] ALLOWED_HOSTS set correctly\n- [ ] Database backups enabled\n- [ ] Static files collected and served\n- [ ] Logging configured and working\n- [ ] Error monitoring (Sentry, etc.) configured\n- [ ] CDN configured (if applicable)\n- [ ] Redis/cache backend configured\n- [ ] Celery workers running (if applicable)\n- [ ] HTTPS/SSL configured\n- [ ] Environment variables documented\n\n## Continuous Integration\n\n### GitHub Actions Example\n\n```yaml\n# .github/workflows/django-verification.yml\nname: Django Verification\n\non: [push, pull_request]\n\njobs:\n  verify:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    services:\n      postgres:\n        image: postgres:14\n        env:\n          POSTGRES_PASSWORD: postgres\n        options: >-\n          --health-cmd pg_isready\n          --health-interval 10s\n          --health-timeout 5s\n          --health-retries 5\n\n    steps:\n      - uses: actions/checkout@v3\n\n      - name: Set up Python\n        uses: actions/setup-python@v4\n        with:\n          python-version: ''3.11''\n\n      - name: Cache pip\n        uses: actions/cache@v3\n        with:\n          path: ~/.cache/pip\n          key: ${{ runner.os }}-pip-${{ hashFiles(''**/requirements.txt'') }}\n\n      - name: Install dependencies\n        run: |\n          pip install -r requirements.txt\n          pip install ruff black mypy pytest pytest-django pytest-cov bandit safety pip-audit\n\n      - name: Code quality checks\n        run: |\n          ruff check .\n          black . --check\n          isort . --check-only\n          mypy .\n\n      - name: Security scan\n        run: |\n          bandit -r . -f json -o bandit-report.json\n          safety check --full-report\n          pip-audit\n\n      - name: Run tests\n        env:\n          DATABASE_URL: postgres://postgres:postgres@localhost:5432/test\n          DJANGO_SECRET_KEY: test-secret-key\n        run: |\n          pytest --cov=apps --cov-report=xml --cov-report=term-missing\n\n      - name: Upload coverage\n        uses: codecov/codecov-action@v3\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Check | Command |\n|-------|---------|\n| Environment | `python --version` |\n| Type checking | `mypy .` |\n| Linting | `ruff check .` |\n| Formatting | `black . --check` |\n| Migrations | `python manage.py makemigrations --check` |\n| Tests | `pytest --cov=apps` |\n| Security | `pip-audit && bandit -r .` |\n| Django check | `python manage.py check --deploy` |\n| Collectstatic | `python manage.py collectstatic --noinput` |\n| Diff stats | `git diff --stat` |\n\nRemember: Automated verification catches common issues but doesn''t replace manual code review and testing in staging environment.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:10:12.974Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"Django 验证循环 - AI 工具","ja":"Django 検証ループ - AIエージェント","ko":"Django 검증 루프 - AI 에이전트","es":"Herramientas de verificación de Django con Agentes de IA","fr":"Outils de vérification Django avec Agents IA","de":"Django-Überprüfungstools mit KI-Agents","pt":"Ferramentas de Verificação em Django com Agentes de IA","ru":"ИИ Агенты для верификации Django-проектов","ar":"أدوات التحقق في Django مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"django-verification"},"description":{"zh":"Django 验证循环是一种确保 Django 应用质量和安全的工具，运行环境检查、lint、测试、安全扫描和部署准备检查","ja":"Django 検証ループは、Django アプリケーションの品質とセキュリティを確保するためのツールです。環境チェック、lint、テスト、セキュリティスキャン、デプロイ準備チェックを実行します","ko":"Django 검증 루프는 Django 애플리케이션의 품질과 보안을 보장하는 도구입니다. 환경 확인, lint, 테스트, 보안 스캔, 배포 준비 확인을 실행합니다","es":"El ciclo de verificación de Django garantiza la calidad y seguridad de tus aplicaciones antes de su lanzamiento o PR","fr":"La boucle de vérification Django assure la qualité et la sécurité de vos applications avant leur lancement ou PR","de":"Der Django-Überprüfungszyklus gewährleistet die Qualität und Sicherheit Ihrer Anwendungen vor der Veröffentlichung oder PR","pt":"O ciclo de verificação em Django é uma ferramenta essencial para garantir a qualidade e segurança do seu projeto, executando migrações, linting, testes e aná...","ru":"Цикл верификации Django - это необходимый инструмент для обеспечения качества и безопасности вашего проекта, выполняющий миграции, linting, тесты и анализ бе...","ar":"دورة التحقق في Django هي أداة أساسية لضمان جودة وأمان مشروعك، حيث تقوم بتنفيذ الهجرات والتنسيق والاختبارات وتحليل الأمان","en":"Verification loop for Django projects: migrations, linting, tests with coverage, security scans, and deployment readiness checks before release or PR."},"definition":{"en":"Verification loop for Django projects: migrations, linting, tests with coverage, security scans, and deployment readiness checks before release or PR."},"features":{"zh":["环境检查","lint 和代码检查","测试和覆盖率检查","安全扫描和漏洞检测","部署准备检查"],"ja":["環境チェック","lint とコードチェック","テストとカバレッジチェック","セキュリティスキャンと脆弱性検出","デプロイ準備チェック"],"ko":["환경 확인","lint 및 코드 확인","테스트 및 커버리지 확인","보안 스캔 및 취약점 탐지","배포 준비 확인"],"es":["Verificación de entorno","Análisis de seguridad","Pruebas con cobertura","Verificación de migraciones","Preparación para la implementación"],"fr":["Vérification de l''environnement","Analyse de sécurité","Tests avec couverture","Vérification des migrations","Préparation à la mise en production"],"de":["Umgebungüberprüfung","Sicherheitsanalyse","Tests mit Abdeckung","Überprüfung von Migrationen","Bereitstellung für die Implementierung"],"pt":["Verificação de migrações","Linting de código","Testes com cobertura","Análise de segurança","Verificação de prontidão para deploy"],"ru":["Верификация миграций","Linting кода","Тесты с покрытием","Анализ безопасности","Верификация готовности к deploy"],"ar":["التحقق من الهجرات","تنسيق الكود","الاختبارات مع التغطية","تحليل الأمان","التحقق من جاهزية النشر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Django 验证循环","AI 工具","自动化测试","代码检查","安全扫描","部署准备","Django 应用质量","Django 应用安全"],"ja":["Django 検証ループ","AIエージェント","自動テスト","コードチェック","セキュリティスキャン","デプロイ準備","Django アプリケーションの品質","Django アプリケーションのセキュリティ"],"ko":["Django 검증 루프","AI 에이전트","자동 테스트","코드 확인","보안 스캔","배포 준비","Django 애플리케이션 품질","Django 애플리케이션 보안"],"es":["Agentes de IA para Django","Herramientas de verificación de Django","Pruebas de seguridad para Django","Análisis de código para Django","Implementación de Django","Desarrollo de aplicaciones Django"],"fr":["Agents IA pour Django","Outils de vérification Django","Tests de sécurité pour Django","Analyse de code pour Django","Mise en production Django","Développement d''applications Django"],"de":["KI-Agents für Django","Überprüfungstools für Django","Sicherheitstests für Django","Code-Analyse für Django","Django-Implementierung","Django-Anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["Django","Verificação","Migrações","Linting","Testes","Segurança","Deploy","Agentes de IA","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Django","Верификация","Миграции","Linting","Тесты","Безопасность","Deploy","ИИ Агенты","Инструменты разработки"],"ar":["Django","التحقق","الهجرات","التنسيق","الاختبارات","الأمان","النشر","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات التطوير"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Python-based AI Agents requiring comprehensive Django project verification and security checks","zh":"适用于需要全面Django项目验证和安全检查的Python-based AI Agents","ja":"PythonベースのAIエージェントがDjangoプロジェクトの包括的な検証とセキュリティチェックを必要とする場合に最適","ko":"포괄적인 Django 프로젝트 검증 및 보안 점검을 요구하는 Python 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial basados en Python que requieren una verificación y comprobación de seguridad del proyecto Django integral","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle basés sur Python nécessitant une vérification et des contrôles de sécurité complets du projet Django","de":"Ideal für Python-basierte KI-Agents, die eine umfassende Überprüfung und Sicherheitsprüfung des Django-Projekts erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA baseados em Python que requerem verificação e checagem de segurança abrangentes de projetos Django","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе Python, требующих комплексной верификации и проверки безопасности проектов Django","ar":"مثالي لعمليات الوكلاء الذكية القائمة على Python التي تتطلب التحقق الشامل وتحقق أمان مشاريع Django"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to ensure Django application quality and security by running migrations, linting, tests with coverage, security scans, and deployment readiness checks, leveraging protocols like Git for pull requests and utilizing libraries for dependency management and security auditing","zh":"赋予代理人运行迁移、linting、测试，包括覆盖率、安全扫描和部署就绪检查等功能，以确保Django应用程序的质量和安全，利用Git等协议处理拉取请求，并使用库进行依赖管理和安全审计","ja":"Gitなどのプロトコルを使用してプルリクエストを処理し、ライブラリを使用して依存関係の管理とセキュリティ監査を行うことで、Djangoアプリケーションの品質とセキュリティを確保するために、エージェントにマイグレーションの実行、linting、テスト（カバレッジを含む）、セキュリティスキャン、およびデプロイの準備チェックなどの機能を実行する権限を付与する","ko":"Git와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 풀 요청을 처리하고 라이브러리를 사용하여 의존성 관리 및 보안 감사를 수행함으로써 Django 응용 프로그램의 품질 및 보안을 보장하기 위해 에이전트가 마이그레이션 실행, 린팅, 테스트(커버리지 포함), 보안 스캔 및 배포 준비 체크 등을 실행할 수 있도록 하는 권한을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes para garantizar la calidad y la seguridad de la aplicación Django ejecutando migraciones, análisis de código, pruebas con cobertura, análisis de seguridad y comprobaciones de preparación para la implementación, aprovechando protocolos como Git para solicitudes de extracción y utilizando bibliotecas para la gestión de dependencias y la auditoría de seguridad","fr":"Permet aux agents de garantir la qualité et la sécurité de l''application Django en exécutant des migrations, un analyse de code, des tests avec une couverture, des analyses de sécurité et des vérifications de préparation au déploiement, en exploitant des protocoles comme Git pour les demandes d''extraction et en utilisant des bibliothèques pour la gestion des dépendances et l''audit de sécurité","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, die Qualität und Sicherheit der Django-Anwendung zu gewährleisten, indem sie Migrationen, Code-Analyse, Tests mit Abdeckung, Sicherheits-Scans und Bereitstellungsprüfungen durchführen, wobei Protokolle wie Git für Pull-Requests genutzt und Bibliotheken für Abhängigkeitsverwaltung und Sicherheitsprüfung verwendet werden","pt":"Habilita os agentes a garantir a qualidade e a segurança das aplicações Django, executando migrações, linting, testes com cobertura, varreduras de segurança e verificações de prontidão para implantação, utilizando protocolos como Git para solicitações de pull e utilizando bibliotecas para gerenciamento de dependências e auditoria de segurança","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить качество и безопасность приложений Django, выполняя миграции, линтинг, тесты с покрытием, сканирование безопасности и проверки готовности к развертыванию, используя протоколы như Git для запросов на вытягивание и используя библиотеки для управления зависимостями и аудита безопасности","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من ضمان جودة وتأمين تطبيقات Django من خلال تشغيل عمليات النقل وlinting والاختبارات مع تغطية وفحوصات أمان واختبارات جاهزية النشر، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل Git لطلبات السحب وتطبيق مكتبات لإدارة التبعيات ومراجعة الأمان"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pre-deployment checks for Django projects","Validating migration safety and test coverage","Running full environment pipelines for linting, testing, and security scans"],"zh":["自动化Django项目的预部署检查","验证迁移安全性和测试覆盖率","运行完整环境管道以进行linting、测试和安全扫描"],"ja":["Djangoプロジェクトの事前デプロイチェックの自動化","マイグレーションの安全性とテストカバレッジの検証","linting、テスト、セキュリティスキャンのためのフル環境パイプラインの実行"],"ko":["Django 프로젝트의 사전 배포 체크 자동화","마이그레이션 안전성 및 테스트 커버리지 유효성 검사","린팅, 테스트, 보안 스캔을 위한 전체 환경 파이프라인 실행"],"es":["Automatización de comprobaciones preimplementación para proyectos Django","Validación de la seguridad de las migraciones y la cobertura de las pruebas","Ejecución de tuberías de entorno completo para análisis de código, pruebas y análisis de seguridad"],"fr":["Automatisation des vérifications pré-déploiement pour les projets Django","Validation de la sécurité des migrations et de la couverture des tests","Exécution de pipelines d''environnement complet pour l''analyse de code, les tests et les analyses de sécurité"],"de":["Automatisierung von Vorab-Prüfungen für Django-Projekte","Validierung der Migrations-Sicherheit und der Testabdeckung","Ausführung von Umgebungs-Pipelines für Code-Analyse, Tests und Sicherheits-Scans"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações pré-implantação para projetos Django","Validar segurança de migração e cobertura de testes","Executar pipelines de ambiente completo para linting, testes e varreduras de segurança"],"ru":["Автоматизировать предразвертывание проверок для проектов Django","Проверить безопасность миграции и покрытие тестов","Выполнять полные конвейеры окружения для линтинга, тестов и сканирования безопасности"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في عمليات الفحص قبل النشر لمشاريع Django","التحقق من سلامة النقل وتغطية الاختبار","تشغيل أنابيب بيئة كاملة لتنظيف الكود واختبارات وفحوصات أمان"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Django project setup","Python environment necessary for execution","Dependent on specific libraries for linting, testing, and security scans"],"zh":["需要Django项目设置","需要Python环境进行执行","依赖于特定的库进行linting、测试和安全扫描"],"ja":["Djangoプロジェクトの設定が必要","実行にはPython環境が必要","linting、テスト、セキュリティスキャンには特定のライブラリに依存"],"ko":["Django 프로젝트 설정 필요","실행을 위해 Python 환경 필요","린팅, 테스트, 보안 스캔을 위해 특정 라이브러리에 의존"],"es":["Requiere configuración del proyecto Django","Entorno de Python necesario para la ejecución","Dependiente de bibliotecas específicas para el análisis de código, las pruebas y los análisis de seguridad"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de projet Django","Environnement Python nécessaire pour l''exécution","Dépend de bibliothèques spécifiques pour l''analyse de code, les tests et les analyses de sécurité"],"de":["Benötigt eine Django-Projekt-Konfiguration","Python-Umgebung erforderlich für die Ausführung","Abhängig von spezifischen Bibliotheken für Code-Analyse, Tests und Sicherheits-Scans"],"pt":["Requer configuração de projeto Django","Ambiente Python necessário para execução","Dependente de bibliotecas específicas para linting, testes e varreduras de segurança"],"ru":["Требует настройки проекта Django","Необходимо окружение Python для выполнения","Зависит от конкретных библиотек для линтинга, тестов и сканирования безопасности"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد مشروع Django","بيئة Python ضرورية للتنفيذ","يعتمد على مكتبات محددة لتنظيف الكود والاختبارات وفحوصات الأمان"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b330cd018e559d568990f485f6ba90795e22e4b38dd68911167af88f54388674","repoEtag":"W/\"1d66934774ad40d3d916abf4c33c3e340ab032f8212b35e12a94daa7359886c9\"","qualityScore":95}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/foundation-models-on-device', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'foundation-models-on-device', 55024, 6781, 95, '2026-03-01T05:07:39Z', '2026-03-01T05:10:13.925Z', '8efee7e392b39990e4ed58d85ac0783c1cbaac8e1cd87e7a4ef502f15987963e', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/foundation-models-on-device","name":"foundation-models-on-device","description":{"zh":"Apple FoundationModels 框架允许开发者在 iOS 26+ 设备上实现文本生成、引导生成和工具调用等功能","ja":"Foundation Models on Device は、iOS 26+ でテキスト生成、ガイド生成、ツール呼び出しを実現するための Apple フレームワークです","ko":"Foundation Models는 iOS 26+에서 텍스트 생성, 가이드 생성, 도구 호출 등을 구현할 수 있는 Apple 프레임워크입니다","es":"El marco de FoundationModels de Apple permite la generación de texto y la llamada a herramientas en dispositivos con iOS 26+","fr":"Le cadre de FoundationModels d''Apple permet la génération de texte et l''appel d''outils sur les appareils avec iOS 26+","de":"Das Foundation-Modelle-Framework von Apple ermöglicht die Textgenerierung und den Aufruf von Werkzeugen auf Geräten mit iOS 26+","pt":"O framework Apple FoundationModels permite a geração de texto e chamada de ferramentas em dispositivos iOS 26+ com suporte a LLM","ru":"Фреймворк Apple FoundationModels позволяет генерировать текст и вызывать инструменты на устройствах iOS 26+ с поддержкой LLM","ar":"إطار عمل Apple FoundationModels يسمح بإنشاء النص وتحديد الأدوات على أجهزة iOS 26+ مع دعم LLM","en":"Apple FoundationModels framework for on-device LLM — text generation, guided generation with @Generable, tool calling, and snapshot streaming in iOS 26+."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":55024,"forks":6781,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:07:39Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"foundation-models-on-device","description":"Apple FoundationModels framework for on-device LLM — text generation, guided generation with @Generable, tool calling, and snapshot streaming in iOS 26+.","bodyPreview":"# FoundationModels: On-Device LLM (iOS 26)\n\nPatterns for integrating Apple''s on-device language model into apps using the FoundationModels framework. Covers text generation, structured output with `@Generable`, custom tool calling, and snapshot streaming — all running on-device for privacy and offline support.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Building AI-powered features using Apple Intelligence on-device\n- Generating or summarizing text without cloud dependency\n- Extracting structured data from natural","body":"# FoundationModels: On-Device LLM (iOS 26)\n\nPatterns for integrating Apple''s on-device language model into apps using the FoundationModels framework. Covers text generation, structured output with `@Generable`, custom tool calling, and snapshot streaming — all running on-device for privacy and offline support.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Building AI-powered features using Apple Intelligence on-device\n- Generating or summarizing text without cloud dependency\n- Extracting structured data from natural language input\n- Implementing custom tool calling for domain-specific AI actions\n- Streaming structured responses for real-time UI updates\n- Need privacy-preserving AI (no data leaves the device)\n\n## Core Pattern — Availability Check\n\nAlways check model availability before creating a session:\n\n```swift\nstruct GenerativeView: View {\n    private var model = SystemLanguageModel.default\n\n    var body: some View {\n        switch model.availability {\n        case .available:\n            ContentView()\n        case .unavailable(.deviceNotEligible):\n            Text(\"Device not eligible for Apple Intelligence\")\n        case .unavailable(.appleIntelligenceNotEnabled):\n            Text(\"Please enable Apple Intelligence in Settings\")\n        case .unavailable(.modelNotReady):\n            Text(\"Model is downloading or not ready\")\n        case .unavailable(let other):\n            Text(\"Model unavailable: \\(other)\")\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Core Pattern — Basic Session\n\n```swift\n// Single-turn: create a new session each time\nlet session = LanguageModelSession()\nlet response = try await session.respond(to: \"What''s a good month to visit Paris?\")\nprint(response.content)\n\n// Multi-turn: reuse session for conversation context\nlet session = LanguageModelSession(instructions: \"\"\"\n    You are a cooking assistant.\n    Provide recipe suggestions based on ingredients.\n    Keep suggestions brief and practical.\n    \"\"\")\n\nlet first = try await session.respond(to: \"I have chicken and rice\")\nlet followUp = try await session.respond(to: \"What about a vegetarian option?\")\n```\n\nKey points for instructions:\n- Define the model''s role (\"You are a mentor\")\n- Specify what to do (\"Help extract calendar events\")\n- Set style preferences (\"Respond as briefly as possible\")\n- Add safety measures (\"Respond with ''I can''t help with that'' for dangerous requests\")\n\n## Core Pattern — Guided Generation with @Generable\n\nGenerate structured Swift types instead of raw strings:\n\n### 1. Define a Generable Type\n\n```swift\n@Generable(description: \"Basic profile information about a cat\")\nstruct CatProfile {\n    var name: String\n\n    @Guide(description: \"The age of the cat\", .range(0...20))\n    var age: Int\n\n    @Guide(description: \"A one sentence profile about the cat''s personality\")\n    var profile: String\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Request Structured Output\n\n```swift\nlet response = try await session.respond(\n    to: \"Generate a cute rescue cat\",\n    generating: CatProfile.self\n)\n\n// Access structured fields directly\nprint(\"Name: \\(response.content.name)\")\nprint(\"Age: \\(response.content.age)\")\nprint(\"Profile: \\(response.content.profile)\")\n```\n\n### Supported @Guide Constraints\n\n- `.range(0...20)` — numeric range\n- `.count(3)` — array element count\n- `description:` — semantic guidance for generation\n\n## Core Pattern — Tool Calling\n\nLet the model invoke custom code for domain-specific tasks:\n\n### 1. Define a Tool\n\n```swift\nstruct RecipeSearchTool: Tool {\n    let name = \"recipe_search\"\n    let description = \"Search for recipes matching a given term and return a list of results.\"\n\n    @Generable\n    struct Arguments {\n        var searchTerm: String\n        var numberOfResults: Int\n    }\n\n    func call(arguments: Arguments) async throws -> ToolOutput {\n        let recipes = await searchRecipes(\n            term: arguments.searchTerm,\n            limit: arguments.numberOfResults\n        )\n        return .string(recipes.map { \"- \\($0.name): \\($0.description)\" }.joined(separator: \"\\n\"))\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### 2. Create Session with Tools\n\n```swift\nlet session = LanguageModelSession(tools: [RecipeSearchTool()])\nlet response = try await session.respond(to: \"Find me some pasta recipes\")\n```\n\n### 3. Handle Tool Errors\n\n```swift\ndo {\n    let answer = try await session.respond(to: \"Find a recipe for tomato soup.\")\n} catch let error as LanguageModelSession.ToolCallError {\n    print(error.tool.name)\n    if case .databaseIsEmpty = error.underlyingError as? RecipeSearchToolError {\n        // Handle specific tool error\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Core Pattern — Snapshot Streaming\n\nStream structured responses for real-time UI with `PartiallyGenerated` types:\n\n```swift\n@Generable\nstruct TripIdeas {\n    @Guide(description: \"Ideas for upcoming trips\")\n    var ideas: [String]\n}\n\nlet stream = session.streamResponse(\n    to: \"What are some exciting trip ideas?\",\n    generating: TripIdeas.self\n)\n\nfor try await partial in stream {\n    // partial: TripIdeas.PartiallyGenerated (all properties Optional)\n    print(partial)\n}\n```\n\n### SwiftUI Integration\n\n```swift\n@State private var partialResult: TripIdeas.PartiallyGenerated?\n@State private var errorMessage: String?\n\nvar body: some View {\n    List {\n        ForEach(partialResult?.ideas ?? [], id: \\.self) { idea in\n            Text(idea)\n        }\n    }\n    .overlay {\n        if let errorMessage { Text(errorMessage).foregroundStyle(.red) }\n    }\n    .task {\n        do {\n            let stream = session.streamResponse(to: prompt, generating: TripIdeas.self)\n            for try await partial in stream {\n                partialResult = partial\n            }\n        } catch {\n            errorMessage = error.localizedDescription\n        }\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Key Design Decisions\n\n| Decision | Rationale |\n|----------|-----------|\n| On-device execution | Privacy — no data leaves the device; works offline |\n| 4,096 token limit | On-device model constraint; chunk large data across sessions |\n| Snapshot streaming (not deltas) | Structured output friendly; each snapshot is a complete partial state |\n| `@Generable` macro | Compile-time safety for structured generation; auto-generates `PartiallyGenerated` type |\n| Single request per session | `isResponding` prevents concurrent requests; create multiple sessions if needed |\n| `response.content` (not `.output`) | Correct API — always access results via `.content` property |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- **Always check `model.availability`** before creating a session — handle all unavailability cases\n- **Use `instructions`** to guide model behavior — they take priority over prompts\n- **Check `isResponding`** before sending a new request — sessions handle one request at a time\n- **Access `response.content`** for results — not `.output`\n- **Break large inputs into chunks** — 4,096 token limit applies to instructions + prompt + output combined\n- **Use `@Generable`** for structured output — stronger guarantees than parsing raw strings\n- **Use `GenerationOptions(temperature:)`** to tune creativity (higher = more creative)\n- **Monitor with Instruments** — use Xcode Instruments to profile request performance\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n- Creating sessions without checking `model.availability` first\n- Sending inputs exceeding the 4,096 token context window\n- Attempting concurrent requests on a single session\n- Using `.output` instead of `.content` to access response data\n- Parsing raw string responses when `@Generable` structured output would work\n- Building complex multi-step logic in a single prompt — break into multiple focused prompts\n- Assuming the model is always available — device eligibility and settings vary\n\n## When to Use\n\n- On-device text generation for privacy-sensitive apps\n- Structured data extraction from user input (forms, natural language commands)\n- AI-assisted features that must work offline\n- Streaming UI that progressively shows generated content\n- Domain-specific AI actions via tool calling (search, compute, lookup)\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:10:13.925Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理：Foundation Models 在设备上的应用","ja":"AIエージェント：Foundation Models on Device を使ったテキスト生成","ko":"AI 에이전트: 기기에서 Foundation Models 사용","es":"Modelos de Fundamento de Apple para Dispositivos - Agente...","fr":"Modèles de Fondation d''Apple pour les Appareils - Outils ...","de":"Apple Foundation-Modelle für Geräte - KI-Agenten","pt":"Modelos de Fundação em Dispositivo - Ferramentas de IA","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Foundation Models на устройстве","ar":"عوامل الذكاء الاصطناعي - نماذج الأساس على الجهاز","en":"foundation-models-on-device"},"description":{"zh":"Apple FoundationModels 框架允许开发者在 iOS 26+ 设备上实现文本生成、引导生成和工具调用等功能","ja":"Foundation Models on Device は、iOS 26+ でテキスト生成、ガイド生成、ツール呼び出しを実現するための Apple フレームワークです","ko":"Foundation Models는 iOS 26+에서 텍스트 생성, 가이드 생성, 도구 호출 등을 구현할 수 있는 Apple 프레임워크입니다","es":"El marco de FoundationModels de Apple permite la generación de texto y la llamada a herramientas en d