азработки на Go.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات المراجعة الإلكترونية التي تحتاج إلى تحليل شامل لأنماط تطوير Go."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce idiomatic Go patterns, ensuring simplicity, clarity, and maintainability in Go applications through best practices and conventions, utilizing core principles like simplicity and clarity in Go development.","zh":"Empowers agents to enforce idiomatic Go patterns, ensuring simplicity, clarity, and maintainability in Go applications through best practices and conventions, utilizing core principles like simplicity and clarity in Go development.","ja":"エージェントが固有の Go パターンを適用できるようにし、ベストプラクティスと規約を通じて Go アプリケーションでシンプルさ、明確さ、および保守性を確保し、Go 開発におけるシンプルさや明確さなどの基本原則を利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 고유한 Go 패턴을 강제하여, 최고의 관행 및 규약을 통해 Go 애플리케이션에서 단순성, 명확성 및 유지 보수성을 보장하고, Go 개발의 단순성 및 명확성과 같은 핵심 원리를 활용합니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para aplicar patrones idiomáticos de Go, asegurando la simplicidad, claridad y mantenibilidad en las aplicaciones de Go a través de las mejores prácticas y convenciones, utilizando principios básicos como la simplicidad y la claridad en el desarrollo de Go.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des modèles idiomatiques Go, garantissant la simplicité, la clarté et la maintenabilité des applications Go grâce aux meilleures pratiques et conventions, en utilisant des principes fondamentaux tels que la simplicité et la clarté dans le développement Go.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, idiometrische Go-Muster zu erzwingen, indem sie die Einfachheit, Klarheit und Wartbarkeit in Go-Anwendungen durch bewährte Verfahren und Konventionen sicherstellen, indem sie grundlegende Prinzipien wie Einfachheit und Klarheit in der Go-Entwicklung nutzen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor padrões idiomáticos Go, garantindo simplicidade, clareza e manutenibilidade em aplicações Go por meio de boas práticas e convenções, utilizando princípios fundamentais como simplicidade e clareza no desenvolvimento Go.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать соблюдение идиоматических шаблонов Go, гарантируя простоту, ясность и поддерживаемость в приложениях Go посредством передовой практики и соглашений, используя основные принципы, такие как простота и ясность в разработке на Go.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من فرض أنماط لغة جوهريّة، مما يضمن بساطة ووضوح وقابلية الصيانة في تطبيقات جوهريّة من خلال الممارسات المثلى والاتفاقيات، واستخدام المبادئ الأساسية مثل البساطة والوضوح في تطوير جوهريّ."},"useCases":{"en":["Reviewing Go code for adherence to best practices","Generating idiomatic Go patterns for new code","Refactoring existing Go code for improved efficiency and readability"],"zh":["Reviewing Go code for adherence to best practices","Generating idiomatic Go patterns for new code","Refactoring existing Go code for improved efficiency and readability"],"ja":["ベストプラクティスへの準拠を確認するための Go コードのレビュー","新しいコード用の固有の Go パターンの生成","効率と可読性の向上のための既存の Go コードのリファクタリング"],"ko":["최선의 관행을 따르는지 확인하기 위한 Go 코드 리뷰","새로운 코드를 위한 고유한 Go 패턴 생성","효율성과 가독성 향상을 위한 기존 Go 코드 리팩토링"],"es":["Revisar el código Go para su adherencia a las mejores prácticas","Generar patrones idiomáticos de Go para nuevo código","Reestructurar el código Go existente para mejorar la eficiencia y la legibilidad"],"fr":["Réviser le code Go pour son adhésion aux meilleures pratiques","Générer des modèles idiomatiques Go pour le nouveau code","Réorganiser le code Go existant pour améliorer l''efficacité et la lisibilité"],"de":["Überprüfen des Go-Codes auf Einhaltung der besten Praktiken","Erzeugen idiometrischer Go-Muster für neuen Code","Umstrukturieren des bestehenden Go-Codes zur Verbesserung der Effizienz und Lesbarkeit"],"pt":["Revisar código Go para aderência às melhores práticas","Gerar padrões idiomáticos Go para novo código","Reestruturar código Go existente para melhor eficiência e legibilidade"],"ru":["Проверка кода Go на соответствие передовым практикам","Генерация идиоматических шаблонов Go для нового кода","Перестройка существующего кода Go для улучшения эффективности и читаемости"],"ar":["مراجعة شيفرة جوهريّة لالتزامها بالممارسات المثلى","توليد أنماط جوهريّة متوافقة لأكواد جديدة","إعادة بناء شيفرة جوهريّة موجودة لتحسين الفعالية وقابلية القراءة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Go programming language environment","Limited to Go application development"],"zh":["Requires Go programming language environment","Limited to Go application development"],"ja":["Go プログラミング言語環境が必要","Go アプリケーション開発に限定される"],"ko":["Go 프로그래밍 언어 환경이 필요함","Go 애플리케이션 개발에 한정됨"],"es":["Requiere un entorno de lenguaje de programación Go","Limitado al desarrollo de aplicaciones Go"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de langage de programmation Go","Limité au développement d''applications Go"],"de":["Erfordert eine Go-Programmiersprachen-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von Go-Anwendungen"],"pt":["Requer ambiente de linguagem de programação Go","Limitado ao desenvolvimento de aplicações Go"],"ru":["Требует среды языка программирования Go","Ограничен разработкой приложений Go"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة لغة برمجة جوهريّة","محدود بتطوير تطبيقات جوهريّة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f36a89926fab1e895e7e2e2522e4104e1d7b07452244f31ff09ef1eeb069495c","repoEtag":"W/\"1d66934774ad40d3d916abf4c33c3e340ab032f8212b35e12a94daa7359886c9\"","qualityScore":92}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/security-review', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'security-review', 55024, 6781, 92, '2026-03-01T05:07:39Z', '2026-03-01T05:12:09.280Z', 'f7530a63c7561bd1036cf4cd4d5939b04ac7a9e919ceefeb4c1a3586eb907d82', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/security-review","name":"security-review","description":{"zh":"安全审查技能提供全面安全检查清单和模式，用于确保您的应用程序安全","ja":"セキュリティレビュースキルは、包括的なセキュリティチェックリストとパターンを提供して、アプリケーションの安全性を確保","ko":"보안 리뷰 스킬은 포괄적인 보안 체크리스트 및 패턴을 제공하여 애플리케이션의 보안을 확인","es":"El skill security-review es un agente de IA para desarrolladores que proporciona checklist de seguridad exhaustivos al trabajar con autenticación, APIs, input de usuario o datos sensibles. Integrado con Claude Code y MCP para flujos de desarrollo seguros.","fr":"Le skill security-review est un agent IA pour développeurs fournissant des checklists de sécurité complets pour l''authentification, les APIs, les entrées utilisateur ou les données sensibles. Intégré avec Claude Code et MCP pour des flux de développement sécurisés.","de":"Der security-review Skill ist ein KI Agent für Entwickler, der umfassende Sicherheits-Checklists für Authentifizierung, APIs, Benutzereingaben oder sensible Daten bereitstellt. Integriert mit Claude Code und MCP für sichere Entwicklungs-Workflows.","pt":"Agente de IA especializado em revisões de segurança para desenvolvimento. Fornece checklists abrangentes e padrões de segurança para autenticação, APIs, pagamentos e manipulação de dados sensíveis. Ideal para desenvolvedores que trabalham com Node.js, Python e React.","ru":"Специализированный ИИ агент для проверки безопасности в разработке. Предоставляет комплексные контрольные списки и шаблоны безопасности для аутентификации, API, платежей и обработки конфиденциальных данных. Идеально для разработчиков на Node.js, Python и React.","ar":"وكيل ذكاء اصطناعي متخصص في مراجعات الأمان للتطوير. يقدم قوائم مراجعة شاملة وأنماط أمان للمصادقة وواجهات برمجة التطبيقات والمدفوعات ومعالجة البيانات الحساسة. مثالي للمطورين الذين يعملون بـ Node.js وPython وReact.","en":"Use this skill when adding authentication, handling user input, working with secrets, creating API endpoints, or implementing payment/sensitive features. Provides comprehensive security checklist and patterns."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":55024,"forks":6781,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:07:39Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"security-review","description":"Use this skill when adding authentication, handling user input, working with secrets, creating API endpoints, or implementing payment/sensitive features. Provides comprehensive security checklist and patterns.","bodyPreview":"# Security Review Skill\n\nThis skill ensures all code follows security best practices and identifies potential vulnerabilities.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Implementing authentication or authorization\n- Handling user input or file uploads\n- Creating new API endpoints\n- Working with secrets or credentials\n- Implementing payment features\n- Storing or transmitting sensitive data\n- Integrating third-party APIs\n\n## Security Checklist\n\n### 1. Secrets Management\n\n#### ❌ NEVER Do This\n```typescript\nconst api","body":"# Security Review Skill\n\nThis skill ensures all code follows security best practices and identifies potential vulnerabilities.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Implementing authentication or authorization\n- Handling user input or file uploads\n- Creating new API endpoints\n- Working with secrets or credentials\n- Implementing payment features\n- Storing or transmitting sensitive data\n- Integrating third-party APIs\n\n## Security Checklist\n\n### 1. Secrets Management\n\n#### ❌ NEVER Do This\n```typescript\nconst apiKey = \"sk-proj-xxxxx\"  // Hardcoded secret\nconst dbPassword = \"password123\" // In source code\n```\n\n#### ✅ ALWAYS Do This\n```typescript\nconst apiKey = process.env.OPENAI_API_KEY\nconst dbUrl = process.env.DATABASE_URL\n\n// Verify secrets exist\nif (!apiKey) {\n  throw new Error(''OPENAI_API_KEY not configured'')\n}\n```\n\n#### Verification Steps\n- [ ] No hardcoded API keys, tokens, or passwords\n- [ ] All secrets in environment variables\n- [ ] `.env.local` in .gitignore\n- [ ] No secrets in git history\n- [ ] Production secrets in hosting platform (Vercel, Railway)\n\n### 2. Input Validation\n\n#### Always Validate User Input\n```typescript\nimport { z } from ''zod''\n\n// Define validation schema\nconst CreateUserSchema = z.object({\n  email: z.string().email(),\n  name: z.string().min(1).max(100),\n  age: z.number().int().min(0).max(150)\n})\n\n// Validate before processing\nexport async function createUser(input: unknown) {\n  try {\n    const validated = CreateUserSchema.parse(input)\n    return await db.users.create(validated)\n  } catch (error) {\n    if (error instanceof z.ZodError) {\n      return { success: false, errors: error.errors }\n    }\n    throw error\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### File Upload Validation\n```typescript\nfunction validateFileUpload(file: File) {\n  // Size check (5MB max)\n  const maxSize = 5 * 1024 * 1024\n  if (file.size > maxSize) {\n    throw new Error(''File too large (max 5MB)'')\n  }\n\n  // Type check\n  const allowedTypes = [''image/jpeg'', ''image/png'', ''image/gif'']\n  if (!allowedTypes.includes(file.type)) {\n    throw new Error(''Invalid file type'')\n  }\n\n  // Extension check\n  const allowedExtensions = [''.jpg'', ''.jpeg'', ''.png'', ''.gif'']\n  const extension = file.name.toLowerCase().match(/\\.[^.]+$/)?.[0]\n  if (!extension || !allowedExtensions.includes(extension)) {\n    throw new Error(''Invalid file extension'')\n  }\n\n  return true\n}\n```\n\n#### Verification Steps\n- [ ] All user inputs validated with schemas\n- [ ] File uploads restricted (size, type, extension)\n- [ ] No direct use of user input in queries\n- [ ] Whitelist validation (not blacklist)\n- [ ] Error messages don''t leak sensitive info\n\n### 3. SQL Injection Prevention\n\n#### ❌ NEVER Concatenate SQL\n```typescript\n// DANGEROUS - SQL Injection vulnerability\nconst query = `SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ''${userEmail}''`\nawait db.query(query)\n```\n\n#### ✅ ALWAYS Use Parameterized Queries\n```typescript\n// Safe - parameterized query\nconst { data } = await supabase\n  .from(''users'')\n  .select(''*'')\n  .eq(''email'', userEmail)\n\n// Or with raw SQL\nawait db.query(\n  ''SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = $1'',\n  [userEmail]\n)\n```\n\n#### Verification Steps\n- [ ] All database queries use parameterized queries\n- [ ] No string concatenation in SQL\n- [ ] ORM/query builder used correctly\n- [ ] Supabase queries properly sanitized\n\n### 4. Authentication & Authorization\n\n#### JWT Token Handling\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: localStorage (vulnerable to XSS)\nlocalStorage.setItem(''token'', token)\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: httpOnly cookies\nres.setHeader(''Set-Cookie'',\n  `token=${token}; HttpOnly; Secure; SameSite=Strict; Max-Age=3600`)\n```\n\n#### Authorization Checks\n```typescript\nexport async function deleteUser(userId: string, requesterId: string) {\n  // ALWAYS verify authorization first\n  const requester = await db.users.findUnique({\n    where: { id: requesterId }\n  })\n\n  if (requester.role !== ''admin'') {\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      { error: ''Unauthorized'' },\n      { status: 403 }\n    )\n  }\n\n  // Proceed with deletion\n  await db.users.delete({ where: { id: userId } })\n}\n```\n\n#### Row Level Security (Supabase)\n```sql\n-- Enable RLS on all tables\nALTER TABLE users ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;\n\n-- Users can only view their own data\nCREATE POLICY \"Users view own data\"\n  ON users FOR SELECT\n  USING (auth.uid() = id);\n\n-- Users can only update their own data\nCREATE POLICY \"Users update own data\"\n  ON users FOR UPDATE\n  USING (auth.uid() = id);\n```\n\n#### Verification Steps\n- [ ] Tokens stored in httpOnly cookies (not localStorage)\n- [ ] Authorization checks before sensitive operations\n- [ ] Row Level Security enabled in Supabase\n- [ ] Role-based access control implemented\n- [ ] Session management secure\n\n### 5. XSS Prevention\n\n#### Sanitize HTML\n```typescript\nimport DOMPurify from ''isomorphic-dompurify''\n\n// ALWAYS sanitize user-provided HTML\nfunction renderUserContent(html: string) {\n  const clean = DOMPurify.sanitize(html, {\n    ALLOWED_TAGS: [''b'', ''i'', ''em'', ''strong'', ''p''],\n    ALLOWED_ATTR: []\n  })\n  return <div dangerouslySetInnerHTML={{ __html: clean }} />\n}\n```\n\n#### Content Security Policy\n```typescript\n// next.config.js\nconst securityHeaders = [\n  {\n    key: ''Content-Security-Policy'',\n    value: `\n      default-src ''self'';\n      script-src ''self'' ''unsafe-eval'' ''unsafe-inline'';\n      style-src ''self'' ''unsafe-inline'';\n      img-src ''self'' data: https:;\n      font-src ''self'';\n      connect-src ''self'' https://api.example.com;\n    `.replace(/\\s{2,}/g, '' '').trim()\n  }\n]\n```\n\n#### Verification Steps\n- [ ] User-provided HTML sanitized\n- [ ] CSP headers configured\n- [ ] No unvalidated dynamic content rendering\n- [ ] React''s built-in XSS protection used\n\n### 6. CSRF Protection\n\n#### CSRF Tokens\n```typescript\nimport { csrf } from ''@/lib/csrf''\n\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n  const token = request.headers.get(''X-CSRF-Token'')\n\n  if (!csrf.verify(token)) {\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      { error: ''Invalid CSRF token'' },\n      { status: 403 }\n    )\n  }\n\n  // Process request\n}\n```\n\n#### SameSite Cookies\n```typescript\nres.setHeader(''Set-Cookie'',\n  `session=${sessionId}; HttpOnly; Secure; SameSite=Strict`)\n```\n\n#### Verification Steps\n- [ ] CSRF tokens on state-changing operations\n- [ ] SameSite=Strict on all cookies\n- [ ] Double-submit cookie pattern implemented\n\n### 7. Rate Limiting\n\n#### API Rate Limiting\n```typescript\nimport rateLimit from ''express-rate-limit''\n\nconst limiter = rateLimit({\n  windowMs: 15 * 60 * 1000, // 15 minutes\n  max: 100, // 100 requests per window\n  message: ''Too many requests''\n})\n\n// Apply to routes\napp.use(''/api/'', limiter)\n```\n\n#### Expensive Operations\n```typescript\n// Aggressive rate limiting for searches\nconst searchLimiter = rateLimit({\n  windowMs: 60 * 1000, // 1 minute\n  max: 10, // 10 requests per minute\n  message: ''Too many search requests''\n})\n\napp.use(''/api/search'', searchLimiter)\n```\n\n#### Verification Steps\n- [ ] Rate limiting on all API endpoints\n- [ ] Stricter limits on expensive operations\n- [ ] IP-based rate limiting\n- [ ] User-based rate limiting (authenticated)\n\n### 8. Sensitive Data Exposure\n\n#### Logging\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: Logging sensitive data\nconsole.log(''User login:'', { email, password })\nconsole.log(''Payment:'', { cardNumber, cvv })\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Redact sensitive data\nconsole.log(''User login:'', { email, userId })\nconsole.log(''Payment:'', { last4: card.last4, userId })\n```\n\n#### Error Messages\n```typescript\n// ❌ WRONG: Exposing internal details\ncatch (error) {\n  return NextResponse.json(\n    { error: error.message, stack: error.stack },\n    { status: 500 }\n  )\n}\n\n// ✅ CORRECT: Generic error messages\ncatch (error) {\n  console.error(''Internal error:'', error)\n  return NextResponse.json(\n    { error: ''An error occurred. Please try again.'' },\n    { status: 500 }\n  )\n}\n```\n\n#### Verification Steps\n- [ ] No passwords, tokens, or secrets in logs\n- [ ] Error messages generic for users\n- [ ] Detailed errors only in server logs\n- [ ] No stack traces exposed to users\n\n### 9. Blockchain Security (Solana)\n\n#### Wallet Verification\n```typescript\nimport { verify } from ''@solana/web3.js''\n\nasync function verifyWalletOwnership(\n  publicKey: string,\n  signature: string,\n  message: string\n) {\n  try {\n    const isValid = verify(\n      Buffer.from(message),\n      Buffer.from(signature, ''base64''),\n      Buffer.from(publicKey, ''base64'')\n    )\n    return isValid\n  } catch (error) {\n    return false\n  }\n}\n```\n\n#### Transaction Verification\n```typescript\nasync function verifyTransaction(transaction: Transaction) {\n  // Verify recipient\n  if (transaction.to !== expectedRecipient) {\n    throw new Error(''Invalid recipient'')\n  }\n\n  // Verify amount\n  if (transaction.amount > maxAmount) {\n    throw new Error(''Amount exceeds limit'')\n  }\n\n  // Verify user has sufficient balance\n  const balance = await getBalance(transaction.from)\n  if (balance < transaction.amount) {\n    throw new Error(''Insufficient balance'')\n  }\n\n  return true\n}\n```\n\n#### Verification Steps\n- [ ] Wallet signatures verified\n- [ ] Transaction details validated\n- [ ] Balance checks before transactions\n- [ ] No blind transaction signing\n\n### 10. Dependency Security\n\n#### Regular Updates\n```bash\n# Check for vulnerabilities\nnpm audit\n\n# Fix automatically fixable issues\nnpm audit fix\n\n# Update dependencies\nnpm update\n\n# Check for outdated packages\nnpm outdated\n```\n\n#### Lock Files\n```bash\n# ALWAYS commit lock files\ngit add package-lock.json\n\n# Use in CI/CD for reproducible builds\nnpm ci  # Instead of npm install\n```\n\n#### Verification Steps\n- [ ] Dependencies up to date\n- [ ] No known vulnerabilities (npm audit clean)\n- [ ] Lock files committed\n- [ ] Dependabot enabled on GitHub\n- [ ] Regular security updates\n\n## Security Testing\n\n### Automated Security Tests\n```typescript\n// Test authentication\ntest(''requires authentication'', async () => {\n  const response = await fetch(''/api/protected'')\n  expect(response.status).toBe(401)\n})\n\n// Test authorization\ntest(''requires admin role'', async () => {\n  const response = await fetch(''/api/admin'', {\n    headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${userToken}` }\n  })\n  expect(response.status).toBe(403)\n})\n\n// Test input validation\ntest(''rejects invalid input'', async () => {\n  const response = await fetch(''/api/users'', {\n    method: ''POST'',\n    body: JSON.stringify({ email: ''not-an-email'' })\n  })\n  expect(response.status).toBe(400)\n})\n\n// Test rate limiting\ntest(''enforces rate limits'', async () => {\n  const requests = Array(101).fill(null).map(() =>\n    fetch(''/api/endpoint'')\n  )\n\n  const responses = await Promise.all(requests)\n  const tooManyRequests = responses.filter(r => r.status === 429)\n\n  expect(tooManyRequests.length).toBeGreaterThan(0)\n})\n```\n\n## Pre-Deployment Security Checklist\n\nBefore ANY production deployment:\n\n- [ ] **Secrets**: No hardcoded secrets, all in env vars\n- [ ] **Input Validation**: All user inputs validated\n- [ ] **SQL Injection**: All queries parameterized\n- [ ] **XSS**: User content sanitized\n- [ ] **CSRF**: Protection enabled\n- [ ] **Authentication**: Proper token handling\n- [ ] **Authorization**: Role checks in place\n- [ ] **Rate Limiting**: Enabled on all endpoints\n- [ ] **HTTPS**: Enforced in production\n- [ ] **Security Headers**: CSP, X-Frame-Options configured\n- [ ] **Error Handling**: No sensitive data in errors\n- [ ] **Logging**: No sensitive data logged\n- [ ] **Dependencies**: Up to date, no vulnerabilities\n- [ ] **Row Level Security**: Enabled in Supabase\n- [ ] **CORS**: Properly configured\n- [ ] **File Uploads**: Validated (size, type)\n- [ ] **Wallet Signatures**: Verified (if blockchain)\n\n## Resources\n\n- [OWASP Top 10](https://owasp.org/www-project-top-ten/)\n- [Next.js Security](https://nextjs.org/docs/security)\n- [Supabase Security](https://supabase.com/docs/guides/auth)\n- [Web Security Academy](https://portswigger.net/web-security)\n\n---\n\n**Remember**: Security is not optional. One vulnerability can compromise the entire platform. When in doubt, err on the side of caution.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:12:09.280Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能安全审查工具","ja":"AIエージェントによるセキュリティレビュー","ko":"AI 에이전트 보안 리뷰 도구","es":"security-review AI Agent: Checklist Seguridad para Devs","fr":"security-review Agent IA: Checklist Sécurité pour Dévelop...","de":"security-review KI Agent: Sicherheits-Checkliste für Entw...","pt":"Security Review AI Agent: Checklist de Segurança para Devs","ru":"Security Review ИИ Агент: Контрольный список безопасности...","ar":"Security Review وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي: قائمة مراجعة الأما...","en":"security-review"},"description":{"zh":"安全审查技能提供全面安全检查清单和模式，用于确保您的应用程序安全","ja":"セキュリティレビュースキルは、包括的なセキュリティチェックリストとパターンを提供して、アプリケーションの安全性を確保","ko":"보안 리뷰 스킬은 포괄적인 보안 체크리스트 및 패턴을 제공하여 애플리케이션의 보안을 확인","es":"El skill security-review es un agente de IA para desarrolladores que proporciona checklist de seguridad exhaustivos al trabajar con autenticación, APIs, inpu...","fr":"Le skill security-review est un agent IA pour développeurs fournissant des checklists de sécurité complets pour l''authentification, les APIs, les entrées uti...","de":"Der security-review Skill ist ein KI Agent für Entwickler, der umfassende Sicherheits-Checklists für Authentifizierung, APIs, Benutzereingaben oder sensible ...","pt":"Agente de IA especializado em revisões de segurança para desenvolvimento. Fornece checklists abrangentes e padrões de segurança para autenticação, APIs, paga...","ru":"Специализированный ИИ агент для проверки безопасности в разработке. Предоставляет комплексные контрольные списки и шаблоны безопасности для аутентификации, A...","ar":"وكيل ذكاء اصطناعي متخصص في مراجعات الأمان للتطوير. يقدم قوائم مراجعة شاملة وأنماط أمان للمصادقة وواجهات برمجة التطبيقات والمدفوعات ومعالجة البيانات الحساسة. ...","en":"Use this skill when adding authentication, handling user input, working with secrets, creating API endpoints, or implementing payment/sensitive features. Pro..."},"definition":{"en":"Use this skill when adding authentication, handling user input, working with secrets, creating API endpoints, or implementing payment/sensitive features. Provides comprehensive security checklist and patterns."},"features":{"zh":["提供全面安全检查清单","支持用户输入验证","支持API端点创建","支持支付/敏感特性实现","提供安全模式和最佳实践"],"ja":["包括的なセキュリティチェックリストを提供","ユーザー入力の検証をサポート","APIエンドポイントの作成をサポート","支払い/機密特性の実装をサポート","セキュリティパターンとベストプラクティスを提供"],"ko":["포괄적인 보안 체크리스트 제공","사용자 입력 검증 지원","API 엔드포인트 생성 지원","결제/민감한 특성 구현 지원","보안 패턴 및 모범 사례 제공"],"es":["Checklist de seguridad para autenticación y autorización","Validación de input de usuario y prevención de inyecciones","Manejo seguro de secrets y API keys","Patrones para endpoints de API REST/GraphQL","Revisión de implementaciones de pago y datos sensibles","Integración con Claude Code y MCP para flujos de desarrollo"],"fr":["Checklist de sécurité pour authentification et autorisation","Validation des entrées utilisateur et prévention d''injections","Gestion sécurisée des secrets et clés API","Patterns pour endpoints API REST/GraphQL","Audit des implémentations de paiement et données sensibles","Intégration avec Claude Code et MCP pour flux de développement"],"de":["Sicherheits-Checklist für Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Validierung von Benutzereingaben und Injection-Prävention","Sichere Verwaltung von Secrets und API Keys","Patterns für REST/GraphQL API Endpoints","Überprüfung von Zahlungsimplementierungen und sensiblen Daten","Integration mit Claude Code und MCP für Entwicklungs-Workflows"],"pt":["Checklist completo para autenticação e autorização","Padrões de segurança para manipulação de input de usuário","Gestão segura de secrets e variáveis de ambiente","Revisão de endpoints API para vulnerabilidades","Implementação segura de sistemas de pagamento","Integração com MCP e ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Полный контрольный список для аутентификации и авторизации","Шаблоны безопасности для обработки пользовательского ввода","Безопасное управление секретами и переменными окружения","Проверка API endpoints на уязвимости","Безопасная реализация платежных систем","Интеграция с MCP и инструментами разработки"],"ar":["قائمة مراجعة كاملة للمصادقة والتفويض","أنماط أمان لمعالجة مدخلات المستخدم","إدارة آمنة للأسرار ومتغيرات البيئة","مراجعة نقاط نهاية API للثغرات الأمنية","تنفيذ آمن لأنظمة الدفع","تكامل مع MCP وأدوات التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能安全审查","安全检查清单","用户输入验证","API端点创建","支付/敏感特性实现","安全模式","AI智能工具"],"ja":["AIエージェントによるセキュリティレビュー","セキュリティチェックリスト","ユーザー入力検証","APIエンドポイント作成","支払い/機密特性実装","セキュリティパターン","AIエージェント"],"ko":["AI 에이전트 보안 리뷰","보안 체크리스트","사용자 입력 검증","API 엔드포인트 생성","결제/민감한 특성 구현","보안 패턴","AI 에이전트"],"es":["ai agent seguridad desarrolladores","claude code security review","checklist seguridad autenticación","mcp security audit","manejo seguro secrets api","validación input usuario","seguridad endpoints api","patrones seguridad payment"],"fr":["agent ia sécurité développeurs","claude code audit sécurité","checklist sécurité authentification","mcp security review","gestion sécurisée secrets api","validation entrée utilisateur","sécurité endpoints api","patterns sécurité paiement"],"de":["ki agent sicherheit entwickler","claude code security audit","sicherheits-checklist authentifizierung","mcp security review","sichere secrets verwaltung api","benutzereingabe validierung","sicherheit api endpoints","sicherheitsmuster payment"],"pt":["agente ia segurança","checklist segurança desenvolvedor","autenticação segura nodejs","api security review","manipulação dados sensíveis","claude code security","mcp developer tools","segurança pagamentos api"],"ru":["ии агент безопасность","контрольный список безопасности разработчик","безопасная аутентификация nodejs","api security review","обработка конфиденциальных данных","claude code безопасность","mcp инструменты разработки","безопасность платежных систем"],"ar":["وكيل ذكاء اصطناعي أمان","قائمة مراجعة أمان للمطورين","مصادقة آمنة nodejs","مراجعة أمان API","معالجة البيانات الحساسة","claude code أمان","أدوات مطور MCP","أمان أنظمة الدفع"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Secure Coding Agents needing comprehensive security checklists and vulnerability identification.","zh":"适合需要全面安全检查清单和漏洞识别的安全编码代理。","ja":"包括安全チェックリストと脆弱性の特定が必要なセキュアコーディングエージェントに最適です。","ko":"전체적인 보안 체크리스트와 취약점 식별이 필요한 보안 코딩 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Codificación Segura que necesitan listas de verificación de seguridad comprehensivas e identificación de vulnerabilidades.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Codage Sécurisé nécessitant des listes de vérification de sécurité complètes et une identification des vulnérabilités.","de":"Perfekt für sichere Codierungsagenten, die umfassende Sicherheits-Checklisten und Schwachstellenerkennung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Codificação Segura que necessitam de listas de verificação de segurança abrangentes e identificação de vulnerabilidades.","ru":"Идеально для Безопасных Агентов Кодирования, которым необходимы комплексные списки проверки безопасности и выявление уязвимостей.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التأمين لترميز الحاسوب الذين يحتاجون إلى قوائم تحقق شاملة من الأمن وتحديد الثغرات الأمنية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to ensure code security by following best practices, handling user input securely, and working with secrets and credentials safely, utilizing protocols like authentication and authorization, and integrating third-party APIs securely.","zh":"赋予代理确保代码安全的能力，通过遵循最佳实践，安全处理用户输入，与秘密和凭证安全合作，利用诸如身份验证和授权的协议，并安全地集成第三方API。","ja":"エージェントがコードのセキュリティを保証する能力を付与し、ベストプラクティスに従い、ユーザー入力を安全に処理し、シークレットと資格情報を安全に操作し、認証や認可などのプロトコルを利用し、サードパーティのAPIを安全に統合します。","ko":"에이전트가 코드 보안을 보장하는 기능을 부여하여 최선의 관행을 따르고 사용자 입력을 안전하게 처리하고 비밀과 자격 증명을 안전하게 처리하며 인증 및 인가와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하고 제3자 API를 안전하게 통합합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a garantizar la seguridad del código siguiendo las mejores prácticas, manipulando la entrada del usuario de manera segura y trabajando con secretos y credenciales de forma segura, utilizando protocolos como autenticación y autorización, e integrando APIs de terceros de forma segura.","fr":"Permet aux agents de garantir la sécurité du code en suivant les meilleures pratiques, en traitant les entrées utilisateur de manière sécurisée et en travaillant avec des secrets et des informations d''identification de manière sécurisée, en utilisant des protocoles tels que l''authentification et l''autorisation, et en intégrant des API tierces de manière sécurisée.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Codesicherheit durch Befolgen der besten Praktiken, sichere Handhabung der Benutzereingaben und sichere Arbeit mit Geheimnissen und Anmeldeinformationen sicherzustellen, indem Protokolle wie Authentifizierung und Autorisierung verwendet und Drittanbieter-APIs sicher integriert werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a garantir a segurança do código seguindo as melhores práticas, lidando com a entrada do usuário de forma segura e trabalhando com segredos e credenciais de forma segura, utilizando protocolos como autenticação e autorização, e integrando APIs de terceiros de forma segura.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить безопасность кода, следуя лучшим практикам, обрабатывая пользовательский ввод безопасно и работая с секретами и учетными данными безопасно, используя протоколы, такие как аутентификация и авторизация, и интегрируя безопасно API третьих сторон.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من ضمان أمان الشفرة عن طريق اتباع أفضل الممارسات، وتعامل مع إدخال المستخدم بطريقة آمنة، والعمل مع الأسرار والتصريحات بأمان، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل المصادقة والتفويض، وتكامل واجهات برمجة التطبيقات الخارجية بأمان."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing secure authentication and authorization","Validating user input and file uploads","Creating secure API endpoints"],"zh":["实现安全的身份验证和授权","验证用户输入和文件上传","创建安全的API端点"],"ja":["セキュアな認証と認可の実装","ユーザー入力とファイルアップロードの検証","セキュアなAPIエンドポイントの作成"],"ko":["안전한 인증 및 인가 구현","사용자 입력 및 파일 업로드 검증","안전한 API 엔드포인트 생성"],"es":["Implementación de autenticación y autorización seguras","Validación de la entrada del usuario y carga de archivos","Creación de puntos finales de API seguros"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre d''une authentification et d''une autorisation sécurisées","Validation des entrées utilisateur et des téléchargements de fichiers","Création de points de terminaison d''API sécurisés"],"de":["Implementierung sicherer Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Validierung der Benutzereingaben und Dateiuploads","Erstellung sicherer API-Endpunkte"],"pt":["Implementação de autenticação e autorização seguras","Validação de entrada do usuário e uploads de arquivos","Criação de pontos finais de API seguros"],"ru":["Реализация безопасной аутентификации и авторизации","Проверка ввода пользователя и загрузка файлов","Создание безопасных конечных точек API"],"ar":["تنفيذ المصادقة والتفويض الآمنين","التحقق من إدخال المستخدم ورفع الملفات","إنشاء نقاط نهاية API آمنة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of security best practices","May require additional configuration for specific use cases"],"zh":["需要了解安全最佳实践","可能需要为特定用例进行额外配置"],"ja":["セキュリティのベストプラクティスに関する知識が必要","特定のユースケースでは追加の設定が必要になる場合がある"],"ko":["보안 최선의 관행을 이해해야 함","특정 사용 사례에 대해 추가 구성이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de las mejores prácticas de seguridad","Puede requerir configuración adicional para casos de uso específicos"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en matière de meilleures pratiques de sécurité","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour des cas d''utilisation spécifiques"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der besten Sicherheitspraktiken","Kann für spezifische Anwendungsfälle zusätzliche Konfiguration erfordern"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento das melhores práticas de segurança","Pode exigir configuração adicional para casos de uso específicos"],"ru":["Требует знания лучших практик безопасности","Может потребовать дополнительной настройки для конкретных случаев использования"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة أفضل الممارسات الأمنية","يمكن أن يتطلب تكوينًا إضافيًا لحالات استخدام محددة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"f7530a63c7561bd1036cf4cd4d5939b04ac7a9e919ceefeb4c1a3586eb907d82","repoEtag":"W/\"1d66934774ad40d3d916abf4c33c3e340ab032f8212b35e12a94daa7359886c9\"","qualityScore":92}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/springboot-verification', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'springboot-verification', 55024, 6781, 92, '2026-03-01T05:07:39Z', '2026-03-01T05:12:10.335Z', '4895b880d86d5703f167f88ca376a55195b40c3b459ec228f5ec8f27bd1a704a', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/springboot-verification","name":"springboot-verification","description":{"zh":"Spring Boot 项目验证循环，包括构建、静态分析、测试、安全扫描和差异审查","ja":"Spring Boot プロジェクトの検証ループ：ビルド、静的分析、テスト、セキュリティ スキャン、差分レビュー","ko":"스프링 부트 프로젝트驗證 루프: 빌드, 정적 분석, 테스트, 보안 스캔, 차이审查","es":"Nuestra herramienta de verificación de Spring Boot realiza un ciclo de verificación que incluye compilación, análisis estático, pruebas con cobertura y escaneos de seguridad","fr":"Notre outil de vérification Spring Boot effectue une boucle de vérification qui comprend la construction, l''analyse statique, les tests avec couverture et les analyses de sécurité","de":"Unser Spring-Boot-Überprüfungstool führt einen Überprüfungszyklus durch, der Kompilierung, statische Analyse, Tests mit Abdeckung und Sicherheitsprüfungen umfasst","pt":"Verifique projetos Spring Boot automaticamente antes de PRs ou deploy, com build, análise estática, testes e varreduras de segurança","ru":"Автоматически проверяйте проекты Spring Boot перед PR или deploy, с помощью сборки, статического анализа, тестов и сканирования безопасности","ar":"تحقق من مشاريع Spring Boot آليا قبل طلبات السحب أو النشر، مع بناء و تحليل ثابت و اختبارات و فحص أمني","en":"Verification loop for Spring Boot projects: build, static analysis, tests with coverage, security scans, and diff review before release or PR."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":55024,"forks":6781,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:07:39Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"springboot-verification","description":"Verification loop for Spring Boot projects: build, static analysis, tests with coverage, security scans, and diff review before release or PR.","bodyPreview":"# Spring Boot Verification Loop\n\nRun before PRs, after major changes, and pre-deploy.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Before opening a pull request for a Spring Boot service\n- After major refactoring or dependency upgrades\n- Pre-deployment verification for staging or production\n- Running full build → lint → test → security scan pipeline\n- Validating test coverage meets thresholds\n\n## Phase 1: Build\n\n```bash\nmvn -T 4 clean verify -DskipTests\n# or\n./gradlew clean assemble -x test\n```\n\nIf build fails, stop","body":"# Spring Boot Verification Loop\n\nRun before PRs, after major changes, and pre-deploy.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Before opening a pull request for a Spring Boot service\n- After major refactoring or dependency upgrades\n- Pre-deployment verification for staging or production\n- Running full build → lint → test → security scan pipeline\n- Validating test coverage meets thresholds\n\n## Phase 1: Build\n\n```bash\nmvn -T 4 clean verify -DskipTests\n# or\n./gradlew clean assemble -x test\n```\n\nIf build fails, stop and fix.\n\n## Phase 2: Static Analysis\n\nMaven (common plugins):\n```bash\nmvn -T 4 spotbugs:check pmd:check checkstyle:check\n```\n\nGradle (if configured):\n```bash\n./gradlew checkstyleMain pmdMain spotbugsMain\n```\n\n## Phase 3: Tests + Coverage\n\n```bash\nmvn -T 4 test\nmvn jacoco:report   # verify 80%+ coverage\n# or\n./gradlew test jacocoTestReport\n```\n\nReport:\n- Total tests, passed/failed\n- Coverage % (lines/branches)\n\n### Unit Tests\n\nTest service logic in isolation with mocked dependencies:\n\n```java\n@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)\nclass UserServiceTest {\n\n  @Mock private UserRepository userRepository;\n  @InjectMocks private UserService userService;\n\n  @Test\n  void createUser_validInput_returnsUser() {\n    var dto = new CreateUserDto(\"Alice\", \"alice@example.com\");\n    var expected = new User(1L, \"Alice\", \"alice@example.com\");\n    when(userRepository.save(any(User.class))).thenReturn(expected);\n\n    var result = userService.create(dto);\n\n    assertThat(result.name()).isEqualTo(\"Alice\");\n    verify(userRepository).save(any(User.class));\n  }\n\n  @Test\n  void createUser_duplicateEmail_throwsException() {\n    var dto = new CreateUserDto(\"Alice\", \"existing@example.com\");\n    when(userRepository.existsByEmail(dto.email())).thenReturn(true);\n\n    assertThatThrownBy(() -> userService.create(dto))\n        .isInstanceOf(DuplicateEmailException.class);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Integration Tests with Testcontainers\n\nTest against a real database instead of H2:\n\n```java\n@SpringBootTest\n@Testcontainers\nclass UserRepositoryIntegrationTest {\n\n  @Container\n  static PostgreSQLContainer<?> postgres = new PostgreSQLContainer<>(\"postgres:16-alpine\")\n      .withDatabaseName(\"testdb\");\n\n  @DynamicPropertySource\n  static void configureProperties(DynamicPropertyRegistry registry) {\n    registry.add(\"spring.datasource.url\", postgres::getJdbcUrl);\n    registry.add(\"spring.datasource.username\", postgres::getUsername);\n    registry.add(\"spring.datasource.password\", postgres::getPassword);\n  }\n\n  @Autowired private UserRepository userRepository;\n\n  @Test\n  void findByEmail_existingUser_returnsUser() {\n    userRepository.save(new User(\"Alice\", \"alice@example.com\"));\n\n    var found = userRepository.findByEmail(\"alice@example.com\");\n\n    assertThat(found).isPresent();\n    assertThat(found.get().getName()).isEqualTo(\"Alice\");\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### API Tests with MockMvc\n\nTest controller layer with full Spring context:\n\n```java\n@WebMvcTest(UserController.class)\nclass UserControllerTest {\n\n  @Autowired private MockMvc mockMvc;\n  @MockBean private UserService userService;\n\n  @Test\n  void createUser_validInput_returns201() throws Exception {\n    var user = new UserDto(1L, \"Alice\", \"alice@example.com\");\n    when(userService.create(any())).thenReturn(user);\n\n    mockMvc.perform(post(\"/api/users\")\n            .contentType(MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON)\n            .content(\"\"\"\n                {\"name\": \"Alice\", \"email\": \"alice@example.com\"}\n                \"\"\"))\n        .andExpect(status().isCreated())\n        .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.name\").value(\"Alice\"));\n  }\n\n  @Test\n  void createUser_invalidEmail_returns400() throws Exception {\n    mockMvc.perform(post(\"/api/users\")\n            .contentType(MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON)\n            .content(\"\"\"\n                {\"name\": \"Alice\", \"email\": \"not-an-email\"}\n                \"\"\"))\n        .andExpect(status().isBadRequest());\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Phase 4: Security Scan\n\n```bash\n# Dependency CVEs\nmvn org.owasp:dependency-check-maven:check\n# or\n./gradlew dependencyCheckAnalyze\n\n# Secrets in source\ngrep -rn \"password\\s*=\\s*\\\"\" src/ --include=\"*.java\" --include=\"*.yml\" --include=\"*.properties\"\ngrep -rn \"sk-\\|api_key\\|secret\" src/ --include=\"*.java\" --include=\"*.yml\"\n\n# Secrets (git history)\ngit secrets --scan  # if configured\n```\n\n### Common Security Findings\n\n```\n# Check for System.out.println (use logger instead)\ngrep -rn \"System\\.out\\.print\" src/main/ --include=\"*.java\"\n\n# Check for raw exception messages in responses\ngrep -rn \"e\\.getMessage()\" src/main/ --include=\"*.java\"\n\n# Check for wildcard CORS\ngrep -rn \"allowedOrigins.*\\*\" src/main/ --include=\"*.java\"\n```\n\n## Phase 5: Lint/Format (optional gate)\n\n```bash\nmvn spotless:apply   # if using Spotless plugin\n./gradlew spotlessApply\n```\n\n## Phase 6: Diff Review\n\n```bash\ngit diff --stat\ngit diff\n```\n\nChecklist:\n- No debugging logs left (`System.out`, `log.debug` without guards)\n- Meaningful errors and HTTP statuses\n- Transactions and validation present where needed\n- Config changes documented\n\n## Output Template\n\n```\nVERIFICATION REPORT\n===================\nBuild:     [PASS/FAIL]\nStatic:    [PASS/FAIL] (spotbugs/pmd/checkstyle)\nTests:     [PASS/FAIL] (X/Y passed, Z% coverage)\nSecurity:  [PASS/FAIL] (CVE findings: N)\nDiff:      [X files changed]\n\nOverall:   [READY / NOT READY]\n\nIssues to Fix:\n1. ...\n2. ...\n```\n\n## Continuous Mode\n\n- Re-run phases on significant changes or every 30–60 minutes in long sessions\n- Keep a short loop: `mvn -T 4 test` + spotbugs for quick feedback\n\n**Remember**: Fast feedback beats late surprises. Keep the gate strict—treat warnings as defects in production systems.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:12:10.335Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"Spring Boot 项目验证 - AI智能工具","ja":"Spring Boot プロジェクトの検証 - AIエージェント","ko":"스프링 부트 프로젝트驗證 - AI 에이전트","es":"Herramientas de verificación de Spring Boot con Agentes d...","fr":"Outils de vérification Spring Boot avec Agents IA","de":"Spring Boot-Überprüfungstools mit KI-Agents","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Verificação Spring Boot","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Цикл Верификации Spring Boot","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: حلقة التحقق من Spring Boot","en":"springboot-verification"},"description":{"zh":"Spring Boot 项目验证循环，包括构建、静态分析、测试、安全扫描和差异审查","ja":"Spring Boot プロジェクトの検証ループ：ビルド、静的分析、テスト、セキュリティ スキャン、差分レビュー","ko":"스프링 부트 프로젝트驗證 루프: 빌드, 정적 분석, 테스트, 보안 스캔, 차이审查","es":"Nuestra herramienta de verificación de Spring Boot realiza un ciclo de verificación que incluye compilación, análisis estático, pruebas con cobertura y escan...","fr":"Notre outil de vérification Spring Boot effectue une boucle de vérification qui comprend la construction, l''analyse statique, les tests avec couverture et le...","de":"Unser Spring-Boot-Überprüfungstool führt einen Überprüfungszyklus durch, der Kompilierung, statische Analyse, Tests mit Abdeckung und Sicherheitsprüfungen um...","pt":"Verifique projetos Spring Boot automaticamente antes de PRs ou deploy, com build, análise estática, testes e varreduras de segurança","ru":"Автоматически проверяйте проекты Spring Boot перед PR или deploy, с помощью сборки, статического анализа, тестов и сканирования безопасности","ar":"تحقق من مشاريع Spring Boot آليا قبل طلبات السحب أو النشر، مع بناء و تحليل ثابت و اختبارات و فحص أمني","en":"Verification loop for Spring Boot projects: build, static analysis, tests with coverage, security scans, and diff review before release or PR."},"definition":{"en":"Verification loop for Spring Boot projects: build, static analysis, tests with coverage, security scans, and diff review before release or PR."},"features":{"zh":["自动化构建和测试","静态分析和安全扫描","差异审查和代码覆盖率验证","支持 Maven 和 Gradle","可自定义的验证流程"],"ja":["自動化ビルドとテスト","静的分析とセキュリティ スキャン","差分レビューとコード カバレッジの検証","Maven と Gradle のサポート","カスタマイズ可能な検証プロセス"],"ko":["자동화 빌드와 테스트","정적 분석과 보안 스캔","차이审查와 코드 커버리지 검증","Maven 과 Gradle 지원","사용자 정의 가능한 검증 프로세스"],"es":["Compilación y verificación de proyectos Spring Boot","Análisis estático de código","Pruebas con cobertura y informes de resultados","Escaneos de seguridad y análisis de vulnerabilidades","Revisión de diferencias y validación de cambios"],"fr":["Construction et vérification de projets Spring Boot","Analyse statique de code","Tests avec couverture et rapports de résultats","Analyses de sécurité et analyse de vulnérabilités","Révision de différences et validation de modifications"],"de":["Kompilierung und Überprüfung von Spring-Boot-Projekten","Statische Code-Analyse","Tests mit Abdeckung und Ergebnisberichte","Sicherheitsprüfungen und Schwachstellenanalyse","Überprüfung von Änderungen und Validierung von Unterschieden"],"pt":["Verificação de build automatizada","Análise estática de código","Testes de unidade e integração","Varreduras de segurança","Revisão de diferenças antes do deploy"],"ru":["Автоматизированная сборка","Статический анализ кода","Модульные и интеграционные тесты","Сканирование безопасности","Проверка различий перед deploy"],"ar":["بناء آلي","تحليل ثابت للكود","اختبارات الوحدة و التكامل","فحص الأمن","مراجعة الاختلافات قبل النشر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Spring Boot","AI智能工具","项目验证","自动化构建","静态分析","安全扫描","代码覆盖率","Maven","Gradle"],"ja":["Spring Boot","AIエージェント","プロジェクトの検証","自動化ビルド","静的分析","セキュリティ スキャン","コード カバレッジ","Maven","Gradle"],"ko":["스프링 부트","AI 에이전트","프로젝트驗證","자동화 빌드","정적 분석","보안 스캔","코드 커버리지","Maven","Gradle"],"es":["Agentes de IA para Spring Boot","Herramientas de verificación de código","Análisis estático de código","Pruebas de software","Escaneos de seguridad","Desarrollo de software","Spring Boot","Verificación de proyectos"],"fr":["Agents IA pour Spring Boot","Outils de vérification de code","Analyse statique de code","Tests de logiciel","Analyses de sécurité","Développement de logiciel","Spring Boot","Vérification de projets"],"de":["KI-Agents für Spring Boot","Überprüfungstools für Code","Statische Code-Analyse","Software-Tests","Sicherheitsprüfungen","Software-Entwicklung","Spring Boot","Überprüfung von Projekten"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","verificação de spring boot","desenvolvimento de software","testes automatizados","segurança de código","análise estática"],"ru":["ии агенты","верификация spring boot","разработка программного обеспечения","автоматизированное тестирование","безопасность кода","статический анализ"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","حلقة التحقق من Spring Boot","تطوير البرمجيات","اختبارات آلية","أمن الكود","تحليل ثابت"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Java-based AI Agents needing comprehensive verification and validation of Spring Boot projects","zh":"适合需要对 Spring Boot 项目进行全面验证和验证的 Java 基础 AI Agent","ja":"Spring Boot プロジェクトの包括的な検証と検証が必要な Java ベースの AI エージェントに最適","ko":"Spring Boot 프로젝트에 대한 포괄적인 검증 및 검증이 필요한 Java 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de IA basados en Java que necesitan una verificación y validación exhaustivas de proyectos Spring Boot","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''IA basés sur Java nécessitant une vérification et une validation complètes de projets Spring Boot","de":"Perfekt für Java-basierte KI-Agents, die eine umfassende Überprüfung und Validierung von Spring-Boot-Projekten benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA baseados em Java que precisam de verificação e validação abrangentes de projetos Spring Boot","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ на основе Java, требующих комплексной проверки и верификации проектов Spring Boot","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين القائمين على Java الذين يحتاجون إلى التحقق والتحقق الشامل لمشاريع Spring Boot"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform thorough verification loops for Spring Boot services, including build, static analysis, tests with coverage, security scans, and diff review using Maven or Gradle, ensuring high-quality code before release or PR","zh":"赋予代理执行 Spring Boot 服务的彻底验证循环的能力，包括使用 Maven 或 Gradle 进行构建、静态分析、测试覆盖、安全扫描和差异审查，以确保在发布或 PR 之前代码质量较高","ja":"Maven または Gradle を使用してビルド、静的分析、テストカバレッジ、セキュリティスキャン、および差分レビューを行うことで、Spring Boot サービスの包括的な検証ループの実行をエージェントに可能にし、リリースまたは PR の前に高品質のコードを確保する","ko":"Maven 또는 Gradle을 사용하여 빌드, 정적 분석, 테스트 커버리지, 보안 스캔 및 차이점 검토를 통해 Spring Boot 서비스에 대한 철저한 검증 루프를 에이전트가 수행하도록하여 릴리스 또는 PR 이전에 높은 품질의 코드를 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar bucles de verificación exhaustivos para servicios Spring Boot, incluyendo compilación, análisis estático, pruebas con cobertura, análisis de seguridad y revisión de diferencias utilizando Maven o Gradle, garantizando un código de alta calidad antes de la publicación o la solicitud de extracción","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des boucles de vérification complètes pour les services Spring Boot, notamment la construction, l''analyse statique, les tests avec couverture, les analyses de sécurité et l''examen des différences en utilisant Maven ou Gradle, garantissant un code de haute qualité avant la publication ou la demande d''extraction","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, umfassende Überprüfungsschleifen für Spring-Boot-Dienste durchzuführen, einschließlich Build, statischer Analyse, Tests mit Abdeckung, Sicherheitsprüfungen und Diff-Überprüfung unter Verwendung von Maven oder Gradle, um einen hochwertigen Code vor der Veröffentlichung oder dem Pull-Request sicherzustellen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a realizar loops de verificação abrangentes para serviços Spring Boot, incluindo compilação, análise estática, testes com cobertura, verificações de segurança e revisão de diff usando Maven ou Gradle, garantindo um código de alta qualidade antes do lançamento ou PR","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность выполнять полные циклы проверки для сервисов Spring Boot, включая сборку, статический анализ, тесты с покрытием, сканирование безопасности и проверку diff с помощью Maven или Gradle, обеспечивая высокое качество кода до выпуска или PR","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من أداء حلقات التحقق الشاملة لخدمات Spring Boot، بما في ذلك البناء والتحليل الساكن والاختبارات مع تغطية وفحوصات أمنية ومراجعة diff باستخدام Maven أو Gradle، مما يضمن رمزًا عالي الجودة قبل الإصدار أو PR"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pre-deployment verification for Spring Boot applications","Validating test coverage meets thresholds for robust testing","Running full build, lint, test, and security scan pipelines for comprehensive project analysis"],"zh":["为 Spring Boot 应用程序自动化预部署验证","验证测试覆盖率是否达到强大的测试阈值","运行完整的构建、lint、测试和安全扫描管道以进行全面项目分析"],"ja":["Spring Boot アプリケーションの事前デプロイ検証の自動化","ロバストなテストのためのテストカバレッジのしきい値を満たすことを検証する","包括的なプロジェクト分析のために、ビルド、lint、テスト、セキュリティスキャンのパイプラインを実行する"],"ko":["Spring Boot 애플리케이션에 대한 사전 배포 검증 자동화","강인한 테스트를 위한 테스트 커버리지 임계값을 충족하는지 확인","전체 프로젝트 분석을 위한 빌드, 린트, 테스트 및 보안 스캔 파이프라인 실행"],"es":["Automatizar la verificación previa a la implementación para aplicaciones Spring Boot","Validar que la cobertura de las pruebas cumple con los umbrales para pruebas robustas","Ejecutar tuberías de análisis de proyectos completas, incluyendo build, lint, pruebas y análisis de seguridad para un análisis de proyecto integral"],"fr":["Automatiser la vérification préalable au déploiement pour les applications Spring Boot","Valider que la couverture des tests répond aux seuils pour des tests robustes","Exécuter des pipelines d''analyse de projets complets, notamment la construction, le lint, les tests et l''analyse de sécurité pour une analyse de projet complète"],"de":["Automatisieren der Überprüfung vor der Bereitstellung für Spring-Boot-Anwendungen","Überprüfen, ob die Testabdeckung die Schwellenwerte für robuste Tests erfüllt","Ausführen von umfassenden Build-, Lint-, Test- und Sicherheitsprüfungspipelines für eine umfassende Projektanalyse"],"pt":["Automatizar a verificação prévia ao deploy para aplicações Spring Boot","Validar a cobertura de testes atende aos limiares para testes robustos","Executar pipelines de compilação completa, lint, teste e verificação de segurança para análise abrangente do projeto"],"ru":["Автоматизировать предварительную проверку перед развертыванием для приложений Spring Boot","Проверять, что покрытие тестирования соответствует пороговым значениям для надежного тестирования","Выполнять полные конвейеры сборки, lint, тестирования и сканирования безопасности для комплексного анализа проекта"],"ar":["تحويل التحقق السابق للتوصيل تلقائيًا للتطبيقات Spring Boot","التحقق من أن تغطية الاختبار ت达到 العتبات للاختبار المتين","تشغيل خطوط أنابيب البناء الكامل وlint والاختبار وفحوصات الأمان لتحليل شامل للمشروع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Maven or Gradle build tools","Limited to Spring Boot projects","Needs access to project source code for static analysis and testing"],"zh":["需要 Maven 或 Gradle 构建工具","仅限 Spring Boot 项目","需要访问项目源代码以进行静态分析和测试"],"ja":["Maven または Gradle のビルドツールが必要","Spring Boot プロジェクトのみ","静的分析およびテストのためにプロジェクトソースコードへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["Maven 또는 Gradle 빌드 도구가 필요","Spring Boot 프로젝트만 해당","정적 분석 및 테스트를 위해 프로젝트 소스 코드에 대한 액세스가 필요"],"es":["Requiere herramientas de compilación Maven o Gradle","Limitado a proyectos Spring Boot","Necesita acceso al código fuente del proyecto para análisis estático y pruebas"],"fr":["Nécessite des outils de construction Maven ou Gradle","Limité aux projets Spring Boot","Nécessite un accès au code source du projet pour l''analyse statique et les tests"],"de":["Benötigt Maven- oder Gradle-Build-Tools","Begrenzt auf Spring-Boot-Projekte","Benötigt Zugriff auf den Quellcode des Projekts für statische Analyse und Tests"],"pt":["Requer ferramentas de compilação Maven ou Gradle","Limitado a projetos Spring Boot","Necessita acesso ao código fonte do projeto para análise estática e teste"],"ru":["Требует инструментов сборки Maven или Gradle","Ограничен проектами Spring Boot","Требует доступа к исходному коду проекта для статического анализа и тестирования"],"ar":["يتطلب أدوات بناء Maven أو Gradle","محدود بمشاريع Spring Boot","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى mã nguồn للمشروع للتحليل الساكن والاختبار"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4895b880d86d5703f167f88ca376a55195b40c3b459ec228f5ec8f27bd1a704a","repoEtag":"W/\"1d66934774ad40d3d916abf4c33c3e340ab032f8212b35e12a94daa7359886c9\"","qualityScore":92}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('getsentry/skills/create-pr', 'official', 'getsentry', 'skills', 'getsentry/skills', 'create-pr', 338, 8, 92, '2026-02-28T20:28:32Z', '2026-03-01T05:13:11.843Z', '16debbe3ad560428652e3a257c5843ae6742e2f05d05d3df1d13ba5569481027', '{"id":"getsentry/skills/create-pr","name":"create-pr","description":{"zh":"create-pr AI工具自动化Pull Request，遵循Sentry规范，简化开发流程","ja":"create-pr AIエージェントはプルリクエストを自動化し、Sentry規約に従って開発プロセスを簡素化する","ko":"create-pr AI 에이전트는 풀 리퀘스트를 자동화하고 Sentry 규약을 따르며 개발 프로세스를 간소화합니다","es":"La habilidad create-pr es una herramienta de AI que ayuda a crear solicitudes de extracción siguiendo las convenciones de Sentry","fr":"La compétence create-pr est un outil d''IA qui aide à créer des demandes d''extraction en suivant les conventions de Sentry","de":"Die Fähigkeit create-pr ist ein KI-Tool, das hilft, Pull-Requests nach den Sentry-Konventionen zu erstellen","pt":"A ferramenta create-pr da nossa plataforma de IA ajuda a criar PRs com convenções Sentry, melhorando a eficiência e organização do seu fluxo de trabalho","ru":"ИИ Агент create-pr нашей платформы помогает создать PR с конвенциями Sentry, улучшая эффективность и организацию вашего рабочего процесса","ar":"أداة create-pr منصة الذكاء الاصطناعي تساعد في إنشاء طلبات سحب مع اتفاقيات Sentry، مما يحسن كفاءة وتنظيم تدفق العمل","en":"ALWAYS use this skill when creating pull requests — never create a PR directly without it. Follows Sentry conventions for PR titles, descriptions, and issue references. Trigger on any create PR, open PR, submit PR, make PR, push and create PR, or prepare changes for review task."},"owner":"getsentry","repo":"skills","repoPath":"getsentry/skills","stars":338,"forks":8,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T20:28:32Z","topics":["tag-production"],"skillMd":{"name":"create-pr","description":"ALWAYS use this skill when creating pull requests — never create a PR directly without it. Follows Sentry conventions for PR titles, descriptions, and issue references. Trigger on any create PR, open PR, submit PR, make PR, push and create PR, or prepare changes for review task.","bodyPreview":"# Create Pull Request\n\nCreate pull requests following Sentry''s engineering practices.\n\n**Requires**: GitHub CLI (`gh`) authenticated and available.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore creating a PR, ensure all changes are committed. If there are uncommitted changes, run the `sentry-skills:commit` skill first to commit them properly.\n\n```bash\n# Check for uncommitted changes\ngit status --porcelain\n```\n\nIf the output shows any uncommitted changes (modified, added, or untracked files that should be included),","body":"# Create Pull Request\n\nCreate pull requests following Sentry''s engineering practices.\n\n**Requires**: GitHub CLI (`gh`) authenticated and available.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\nBefore creating a PR, ensure all changes are committed. If there are uncommitted changes, run the `sentry-skills:commit` skill first to commit them properly.\n\n```bash\n# Check for uncommitted changes\ngit status --porcelain\n```\n\nIf the output shows any uncommitted changes (modified, added, or untracked files that should be included), invoke the `sentry-skills:commit` skill before proceeding.\n\n## Process\n\n### Step 1: Verify Branch State\n\n```bash\n# Detect the default branch — note the output for use in subsequent commands\ngh repo view --json defaultBranchRef --jq ''.defaultBranchRef.name''\n```\n\n```bash\n# Check current branch and status (substitute the detected branch name above for BASE)\ngit status\ngit log BASE..HEAD --oneline\n```\n\nEnsure:\n- All changes are committed\n- Branch is up to date with remote\n- Changes are rebased on the base branch if needed\n\n### Step 2: Analyze Changes\n\nReview what will be included in the PR:\n\n```bash\n# See all commits that will be in the PR (substitute detected branch name for BASE)\ngit log BASE..HEAD\n\n# See the full diff\ngit diff BASE...HEAD\n```\n\nUnderstand the scope and purpose of all changes before writing the description.\n\n### Step 3: Write the PR Description\n\nUse this structure for PR descriptions (ignoring any repository PR templates):\n\n```markdown\n<brief description of what the PR does>\n\n<why these changes are being made - the motivation>\n\n<alternative approaches considered, if any>\n\n<any additional context reviewers need>\n```\n\n**Do NOT include:**\n- \"Test plan\" sections\n- Checkbox lists of testing steps\n- Redundant summaries of the diff\n\n**Do include:**\n- Clear explanation of what and why\n- Links to relevant issues or tickets\n- Context that isn''t obvious from the code\n- Notes on specific areas that need careful review\n\n### Step 4: Create the PR\n\n```bash\ngh pr create --draft --title \"<type>(<scope>): <description>\" --body \"$(cat <<''EOF''\n<description body here>\nEOF\n)\"\n```\n\n**Title format** follows commit conventions:\n- `feat(scope): Add new feature`\n- `fix(scope): Fix the bug`\n- `ref: Refactor something`\n\n## PR Description Examples\n\n### Feature PR\n\n```markdown\nAdd Slack thread replies for alert notifications\n\nWhen an alert is updated or resolved, we now post a reply to the original\nSlack thread instead of creating a new message. This keeps related\nnotifications grouped and reduces channel noise.\n\nPreviously considered posting edits to the original message, but threading\nbetter preserves the timeline of events and works when the original message\nis older than Slack''s edit window.\n\nRefs SENTRY-1234\n```\n\n### Bug Fix PR\n\n```markdown\nHandle null response in user API endpoint\n\nThe user endpoint could return null for soft-deleted accounts, causing\ndashboard crashes when accessing user properties. This adds a null check\nand returns a proper 404 response.\n\nFound while investigating SENTRY-5678.\n\nFixes SENTRY-5678\n```\n\n### Refactor PR\n\n```markdown\nExtract validation logic to shared module\n\nMoves duplicate validation code from the alerts, issues, and projects\nendpoints into a shared validator class. No behavior change.\n\nThis prepares for adding new validation rules in SENTRY-9999 without\nduplicating logic across endpoints.\n```\n\n## Issue References\n\nReference issues in the PR body:\n\n| Syntax | Effect |\n|--------|--------|\n| `Fixes #1234` | Closes GitHub issue on merge |\n| `Fixes SENTRY-1234` | Closes Sentry issue |\n| `Refs GH-1234` | Links without closing |\n| `Refs LINEAR-ABC-123` | Links Linear issue |\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- **One PR per feature/fix** - Don''t bundle unrelated changes\n- **Keep PRs reviewable** - Smaller PRs get faster, better reviews\n- **Explain the why** - Code shows what; description explains why\n- **Mark WIP early** - Use draft PRs for early feedback\n\n## Editing Existing PRs\n\nIf you need to update a PR after creation, use `gh api` instead of `gh pr edit`:\n\n```bash\n# Update PR description\ngh api -X PATCH repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/PR_NUMBER -f body=\"$(cat <<''EOF''\nUpdated description here\nEOF\n)\"\n\n# Update PR title\ngh api -X PATCH repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/PR_NUMBER -f title=''new: Title here''\n\n# Update both\ngh api -X PATCH repos/{owner}/{repo}/pulls/PR_NUMBER \\\n  -f title=''new: Title'' \\\n  -f body=''New description''\n```\n\nNote: `gh pr edit` is currently broken due to GitHub''s Projects (classic) deprecation.\n\n## References\n\n- [Sentry Code Review Guidelines](https://develop.sentry.dev/engineering-practices/code-review/)\n- [Sentry Commit Messages](https://develop.sentry.dev/engineering-practices/commit-messages/)\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:13:11.843Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI工具create-pr：自动化Pull Request","ja":"AIエージェントcreate-pr：プルリクエストを自動化","ko":"AI 에이전트create-pr：풀 리퀘스트 자동화","es":"Herramientas de AI: create-pr para solicitudes de extracción","fr":"Outils d''IA : create-pr pour les demandes d''extraction","de":"KI-Tools: create-pr für Pull-Requests","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Crie PR com Convenções Sentry","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Создайте PR с Конвенциями Sentry","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: انشئ طلب سحب مع اتفاقيات Sentry","en":"create-pr"},"description":{"zh":"create-pr AI工具自动化Pull Request，遵循Sentry规范，简化开发流程","ja":"create-pr AIエージェントはプルリクエストを自動化し、Sentry規約に従って開発プロセスを簡素化する","ko":"create-pr AI 에이전트는 풀 리퀘스트를 자동화하고 Sentry 규약을 따르며 개발 프로세스를 간소화합니다","es":"La habilidad create-pr es una herramienta de AI que ayuda a crear solicitudes de extracción siguiendo las convenciones de Sentry","fr":"La compétence create-pr est un outil d''IA qui aide à créer des demandes d''extraction en suivant les conventions de Sentry","de":"Die Fähigkeit create-pr ist ein KI-Tool, das hilft, Pull-Requests nach den Sentry-Konventionen zu erstellen","pt":"A ferramenta create-pr da nossa plataforma de IA ajuda a criar PRs com convenções Sentry, melhorando a eficiência e organização do seu fluxo de trabalho","ru":"ИИ Агент create-pr нашей платформы помогает создать PR с конвенциями Sentry, улучшая эффективность и организацию вашего рабочего процесса","ar":"أداة create-pr منصة الذكاء الاصطناعي تساعد في إنشاء طلبات سحب مع اتفاقيات Sentry، مما يحسن كفاءة وتنظيم تدفق العمل","en":"ALWAYS use this skill when creating pull requests — never create a PR directly without it. Follows Sentry conventions for PR titles, descriptions, and issue ..."},"definition":{"en":"ALWAYS use this skill when creating pull requests — never create a PR directly without it. Follows Sentry conventions for PR titles, descriptions, and issue references. Trigger on any create PR, open PR, submit PR, make PR, push and create PR, or prepare changes for review task."},"features":{"zh":["自动化Pull Request","遵循Sentry规范","简化开发流程","支持多种触发事件","提高开发效率"],"ja":["プルリクエストの自動化","Sentry規約の遵守","開発プロセスの簡素化","複数のトリガーイベントのサポート","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["풀 리퀘스트 자동화","Sentry 규약 준수","개발 프로세스 간소화","다중 트리거 이벤트 지원","개발 효율성 향상"],"es":["Sigue las convenciones de Sentry para títulos y descripciones","Automatiza la creación de solicitudes de extracción","Se integra con GitHub para crear PR","Soporta la creación de PR para código y cambios","Permite la personalización de títulos y descripciones"],"fr":["Suit les conventions de Sentry pour les titres et les descriptions","Automatise la création de demandes d''extraction","S''intègre avec GitHub pour créer des PR","Prend en charge la création de PR pour le code et les modifications","Permet la personnalisation des titres et des descriptions"],"de":["Befolgt die Sentry-Konventionen für Titel und Beschreibungen","Automatisiert die Erstellung von Pull-Requests","Integriert sich mit GitHub für die Erstellung von PR","Unterstützt die Erstellung von PR für Code und Änderungen","Ermöglicht die Anpassung von Titeln und Beschreibungen"],"pt":["Criação de PRs com convenções Sentry","Melhoria da eficiência do fluxo de trabalho","Padronização de títulos e descrições de PR","Referências a issues e melhorias de código"],"ru":["Создание PR с конвенциями Sentry","Улучшение эффективности рабочего процесса","Стандартизация названий и описаний PR","Ссылки на issues и улучшения кода"],"ar":["إنشاء طلبات سحب مع اتفاقيات Sentry","تحسين كفاءة تدفق العمل","معايير أسماء ووصف طلبات السحب","مراجع إلى قضايا وتحسينات الكود"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用create-pr","什么是AI工具","create-pr替代品","create-pr vs Git","create-pr安装","create-pr设置指南","自动化Pull Request","Sentry规范"],"ja":["create-prの使い方","AIエージェントとは","create-prの代替","create-pr vs Git","create-prのインストール","create-prの設定ガイド","プルリクエストの自動化","Sentry規約"],"ko":["create-pr 사용법","AI 에이전트란","create-pr 대안","create-pr vs Git","create-pr 설치","create-pr 설정 가이드","풀 리퀘스트 자동화","Sentry 규약"],"es":["herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","create-pr","solicitudes de extracción","Sentry","GitHub","cómo crear una solicitud de extracción","mejores prácticas para solicitudes de extracción","alternativas a create-pr"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour les développeurs","create-pr","demandes d''extraction","Sentry","GitHub","comment créer une demande d''extraction","meilleures pratiques pour les demandes d''extraction","alternatives à create-pr"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","create-pr","Pull-Requests","Sentry","GitHub","wie man einen Pull-Request erstellt","beste Praktiken für Pull-Requests","Alternativen zu create-pr"],"pt":["como usar create-pr","o que é create-pr","create-pr vs github","instalar create-pr","guia de configuração create-pr","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","criar pr com convenções sentry"],"ru":["как использовать create-pr","что такое create-pr","create-pr vs github","установить create-pr","руководство по настройке create-pr","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков","создать pr с конвенциями sentry"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام create-pr","ما هي create-pr","create-pr vs github","تثبيت create-pr","دليل إعداد create-pr","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","إنشاء طلب سحب مع اتفاقيات sentry"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for GitHub-integrated AI Agents requiring standardized pull request creation and management following Sentry conventions.","zh":"适用于集成 GitHub 的 AI Agent，需要标准化的拉取请求创建和管理以遵循 Sentry 约定。","ja":"GitHub と統合された AI エージェントが、Sentry の規約に従った標準化されたプルリクエストの作成と管理を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"GitHub와 통합된 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, Sentry 규약을 따라 표준화된 풀 리퀘스트 생성 및 관리가 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de inteligencia artificial integrados con GitHub que requieren la creación y administración de solicitudes de extracción estandarizadas siguiendo las convenciones de Sentry.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''intelligence artificielle intégrés à GitHub nécessitant la création et la gestion de demandes d''extraction standardisées suivant les conventions de Sentry.","de":"Ideal für GitHub-integrierte KI-Agents, die die standardisierte Erstellung und Verwaltung von Pull-Requests gemäß den Sentry-Konventionen erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA integrados ao GitHub que requerem criação e gerenciamento de solicitações de pull padronizadas seguindo as convenções do Sentry.","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, интегрированных с GitHub, требующих стандартизированного создания и управления запросами на получение согласия в соответствии с конвенциями Sentry.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المتكامل مع GitHub الذي يتطلب إنشاء طلبات السحب ومعالجتها بالتنسيق وفقًا لاتفاقيات Sentry."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create pull requests with properly formatted titles, descriptions, and issue references using GitHub CLI, streamlining code review and collaboration through protocols like git and gh.","zh":"赋予代理创建带有正确格式化标题、描述和问题引用的拉取请求的能力，使用 GitHub CLI，通过 git 和 gh 等协议简化代码审查和协作。","ja":"GitHub CLI を使用して、正しくフォーマットされたタイトル、説明、問題参照を持つプルリクエストを作成するエージェントの能力を付与し、git や gh などのプロトコルを介してコードレビューとコラボレーションを簡素化します。","ko":"GitHub CLI를 사용하여 올바르게 형식화된 제목, 설명 및 문제 참조를 가진 풀 리퀘스트를 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하고, git 및 gh와 같은 프로토콜을 통해 코드 리뷰 및 협력을 간소화합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes crear solicitudes de extracción con títulos, descripciones y referencias de problemas adecuadamente formateados utilizando GitHub CLI, lo que simplifica la revisión y colaboración de código a través de protocolos como git y gh.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des demandes d''extraction avec des titres, des descriptions et des références de problèmes correctement formatés en utilisant GitHub CLI, ce qui simplifie la révision et la collaboration de code via des protocoles comme git et gh.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, Pull-Requests mit ordnungsgemäß formatierten Titeln, Beschreibungen und Problemverweisen unter Verwendung von GitHub CLI zu erstellen, wodurch die Code-Überprüfung und -Zusammenarbeit durch Protokolle wie git und gh gestreamt wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar solicitações de pull com títulos, descrições e referências de problemas formatados corretamente usando o GitHub CLI, simplificando a revisão de código e a colaboração por meio de protocolos como git e gh.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать запросы на получение согласия с правильно отформатированными заголовками, описаниями и ссылками на проблемы с помощью GitHub CLI, упрощая обзор кода и сотрудничество через протоколы như git и gh.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية إنشاء طلبات السحب بأitles ووصف وم 参考ات مشكلة تم تنسيقها بشكل صحيح باستخدام GitHub CLI، وتبسيط استعراض الكود والتعاون من خلال بروتوكولات مثل git وgh."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pull request creation for code updates","Standardizing PR descriptions for easier review","Triggering PR creation upon committing changes"],"zh":["自动创建代码更新的拉取请求","标准化 PR 描述以便于审查","提交更改时触发 PR 创建"],"ja":["コード更新のプルリクエストの自動作成","PR の説明を標準化してレビューを容易にする","変更をコミットしたときに PR 作成をトリガーする"],"ko":["코드 업데이트에 대한 풀 리퀘스트 자동 생성","PR 설명을 표준화하여 리뷰를 쉽게 하기","변경 사항을 커밋할 때 PR 생성 트리거"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de solicitudes de extracción para actualizaciones de código","Establecer un estándar para las descripciones de PR para una revisión más sencilla","Disparar la creación de PR al confirmar cambios"],"fr":["Automatiser la création de demandes d''extraction pour les mises à jour de code","Standardiser les descriptions de PR pour une révision plus facile","Déclencher la création de PR lors de la validation de changements"],"de":["Automatisieren der Erstellung von Pull-Requests für Code-Updates","Standardisieren von PR-Beschreibungen für eine einfachere Überprüfung","Auslösen der Pull-Request-Erstellung beim Commit von Änderungen"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de solicitações de pull para atualizações de código","Padronizar descrições de PR para revisão mais fácil","Disparar a criação de PR ao commitar alterações"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание запросов на получение согласия для обновлений кода","Стандартизировать описания PR для более легкого обзора","Создавать PR при фиксации изменений"],"ar":["التحكم الآلي في إنشاء طلبات السحب لتحديثات الكود","تقييس وصفات PR من أجل استعراض أسهل","تشغيل إنشاء PR عند الالتزام بالتغييرات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI authenticated and available","Needs all changes to be committed before creating a PR"],"zh":["需要 GitHub CLI 认证和可用性","需要在创建 PR 之前提交所有更改"],"ja":["GitHub CLI の認証と可用性が必要","PR を作成する前にすべての変更をコミットする必要がある"],"ko":["GitHub CLI 인증 및 가용성이 필요함","PR를 생성하기 전에 모든 변경 사항을 커밋해야 함"],"es":["Requiere que GitHub CLI esté autenticado y disponible","Necesita que todos los cambios estén confirmados antes de crear una PR"],"fr":["Nécessite que GitHub CLI soit authentifié et disponible","Nécessite que tous les changements soient validés avant de créer une PR"],"de":["Erfordert, dass GitHub CLI authentifiziert und verfügbar ist","Benötigt, dass alle Änderungen committet werden, bevor ein PR erstellt wird"],"pt":["Requer GitHub CLI autenticado e disponível","Precisa que todas as alterações sejam commitadas antes de criar um PR"],"ru":["Требует аутентифицированного и доступного GitHub CLI","Требует, чтобы все изменения были зафиксированы перед созданием PR"],"ar":["يتطلب GitHub CLI مصادق عليه ومتاح","يحتاج إلى جميع التغييرات التي تم الالتزام بها قبل إنشاء PR"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"16debbe3ad560428652e3a257c5843ae6742e2f05d05d3df1d13ba5569481027","repoEtag":"W/\"79d96e7212c5e1c533c45b60c7fb7cd467d00b5536301bf6acbcd2c41bbcbfc8\"","qualityScore":92}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('getsentry/skills/django-perf-review', 'official', 'getsentry', 'skills', 'getsentry/skills', 'django-perf-review', 338, 8, 92, '2026-02-28T20:28:32Z', '2026-03-01T05:13:12.639Z', 'd45298cb3c2b06777a28a2cadbcbb4eacc1e987ade230f4f94947ad927c92033', '{"id":"getsentry/skills/django-perf-review","name":"django-perf-review","description":{"zh":"Django性能代码审查AI工具，用于优化Django性能和查找N+1查询","ja":"Djangoパフォーマンスを最適化するためのAIエージェント。Django ORMの問題やデータベースパフォーマンスの低下を解決する","ko":"Django 성능을 최적화하고 N+1 쿼리를 찾는 AI 에이전트. Django ORM 문제와 데이터베이스 성능 문제를 해결","es":"La herramienta de revisión de rendimiento de Django analiza y optimiza el código para mejorar el rendimiento","fr":"L''outil d''analyse de performances Django analyse et optimise le code pour améliorer les performances","de":"Das Django-Leistungsüberprüfungstool analysiert und optimiert den Code, um die Leistung zu verbessern","pt":"A ferramenta django-perf-review é utilizada para revisar o desempenho do Django, encontrar consultas N+1 e otimizar a ORM.","ru":"Инструмент django-perf-review используется для обзора производительности Django, нахождения запросов N+1 и оптимизации ORM.","ar":"تُستخدم أداة django-perf-review لمراجعة أداء Django، العثور على استفسارات N+1 وتحسين أداء ORM.","en":"Django performance code review. Use when asked to review Django performance, find N+1 queries, optimize Django, check queryset performance, database performance, Django ORM issues, or audit Django code for performance problems."},"owner":"getsentry","repo":"skills","repoPath":"getsentry/skills","stars":338,"forks":8,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T20:28:32Z","topics":["tag-production"],"skillMd":{"name":"django-perf-review","description":"Django performance code review. Use when asked to review Django performance, find N+1 queries, optimize Django, check queryset performance, database performance, Django ORM issues, or audit Django code for performance problems.","bodyPreview":"# Django Performance Review\n\nReview Django code for **validated** performance issues. Research the codebase to confirm issues before reporting. Report only what you can prove.\n\n## Review Approach\n\n1. **Research first** - Trace data flow, check for existing optimizations, verify data volume\n2. **Validate before reporting** - Pattern matching is not validation\n3. **Zero findings is acceptable** - Don''t manufacture issues to appear thorough\n4. **Severity must match impact** - If you catch yourself","body":"# Django Performance Review\n\nReview Django code for **validated** performance issues. Research the codebase to confirm issues before reporting. Report only what you can prove.\n\n## Review Approach\n\n1. **Research first** - Trace data flow, check for existing optimizations, verify data volume\n2. **Validate before reporting** - Pattern matching is not validation\n3. **Zero findings is acceptable** - Don''t manufacture issues to appear thorough\n4. **Severity must match impact** - If you catch yourself writing \"minor\" in a CRITICAL finding, it''s not critical. Downgrade or skip it.\n\n## Impact Categories\n\nIssues are organized by impact. Focus on CRITICAL and HIGH - these cause real problems at scale.\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact |\n|----------|----------|--------|\n| 1 | N+1 Queries | **CRITICAL** - Multiplies with data, causes timeouts |\n| 2 | Unbounded Querysets | **CRITICAL** - Memory exhaustion, OOM kills |\n| 3 | Missing Indexes | **HIGH** - Full table scans on large tables |\n| 4 | Write Loops | **HIGH** - Lock contention, slow requests |\n| 5 | Inefficient Patterns | **LOW** - Rarely worth reporting |\n\n---\n\n## Priority 1: N+1 Queries (CRITICAL)\n\n**Impact:** Each N+1 adds `O(n)` database round trips. 100 rows = 100 extra queries. 10,000 rows = timeout.\n\n### Rule: Prefetch related data accessed in loops\n\nValidate by tracing: View → Queryset → Template/Serializer → Loop access\n\n```python\n# PROBLEM: N+1 - each iteration queries profile\ndef user_list(request):\n    users = User.objects.all()\n    return render(request, ''users.html'', {''users'': users})\n\n# Template:\n# {% for user in users %}\n#     {{ user.profile.bio }}  ← triggers query per user\n# {% endfor %}\n\n# SOLUTION: Prefetch in view\ndef user_list(request):\n    users = User.objects.select_related(''profile'')\n    return render(request, ''users.html'', {''users'': users})\n```\n\n### Rule: Prefetch in serializers, not just views\n\nDRF serializers accessing related fields cause N+1 if queryset isn''t optimized.\n\n```python\n# PROBLEM: SerializerMethodField queries per object\nclass UserSerializer(serializers.ModelSerializer):\n    order_count = serializers.SerializerMethodField()\n\n    def get_order_count(self, obj):\n        return obj.orders.count()  # ← query per user\n\n# SOLUTION: Annotate in viewset, access in serializer\nclass UserViewSet(viewsets.ModelViewSet):\n    def get_queryset(self):\n        return User.objects.annotate(order_count=Count(''orders''))\n\nclass UserSerializer(serializers.ModelSerializer):\n    order_count = serializers.IntegerField(read_only=True)\n```\n\n### Rule: Model properties that query are dangerous in loops\n\n```python\n# PROBLEM: Property triggers query when accessed\nclass User(models.Model):\n    @property\n    def recent_orders(self):\n        return self.orders.filter(created__gte=last_week)[:5]\n\n# Used in template loop = N+1\n\n# SOLUTION: Use Prefetch with custom queryset, or annotate\n```\n\n### Validation Checklist for N+1\n- [ ] Traced data flow from view to template/serializer\n- [ ] Confirmed related field is accessed inside a loop\n- [ ] Searched codebase for existing select_related/prefetch_related\n- [ ] Verified table has significant row count (1000+)\n- [ ] Confirmed this is a hot path (not admin, not rare action)\n\n---\n\n## Priority 2: Unbounded Querysets (CRITICAL)\n\n**Impact:** Loading entire tables exhausts memory. Large tables cause OOM kills and worker restarts.\n\n### Rule: Always paginate list endpoints\n\n```python\n# PROBLEM: No pagination - loads all rows\nclass UserListView(ListView):\n    model = User\n    template_name = ''users.html''\n\n# SOLUTION: Add pagination\nclass UserListView(ListView):\n    model = User\n    template_name = ''users.html''\n    paginate_by = 25\n```\n\n### Rule: Use iterator() for large batch processing\n\n```python\n# PROBLEM: Loads all objects into memory at once\nfor user in User.objects.all():\n    process(user)\n\n# SOLUTION: Stream with iterator()\nfor user in User.objects.iterator(chunk_size=1000):\n    process(user)\n```\n\n### Rule: Never call list() on unbounded querysets\n\n```python\n# PROBLEM: Forces full evaluation into memory\nall_users = list(User.objects.all())\n\n# SOLUTION: Keep as queryset, slice if needed\nusers = User.objects.all()[:100]\n```\n\n### Validation Checklist for Unbounded Querysets\n- [ ] Table is large (10k+ rows) or will grow unbounded\n- [ ] No pagination class, paginate_by, or slicing\n- [ ] This runs on user-facing request (not background job with chunking)\n\n---\n\n## Priority 3: Missing Indexes (HIGH)\n\n**Impact:** Full table scans. Negligible on small tables, catastrophic on large ones.\n\n### Rule: Index fields used in WHERE clauses on large tables\n\n```python\n# PROBLEM: Filtering on unindexed field\n# User.objects.filter(email=email)  # full scan if no index\n\nclass User(models.Model):\n    email = models.EmailField()  # ← no db_index\n\n# SOLUTION: Add index\nclass User(models.Model):\n    email = models.EmailField(db_index=True)\n```\n\n### Rule: Index fields used in ORDER BY on large tables\n\n```python\n# PROBLEM: Sorting requires full scan without index\nOrder.objects.order_by(''-created'')\n\n# SOLUTION: Index the sort field\nclass Order(models.Model):\n    created = models.DateTimeField(db_index=True)\n```\n\n### Rule: Use composite indexes for common query patterns\n\n```python\nclass Order(models.Model):\n    user = models.ForeignKey(User)\n    status = models.CharField(max_length=20)\n    created = models.DateTimeField()\n\n    class Meta:\n        indexes = [\n            models.Index(fields=[''user'', ''status'']),  # for filter(user=x, status=y)\n            models.Index(fields=[''status'', ''-created'']),  # for filter(status=x).order_by(''-created'')\n        ]\n```\n\n### Validation Checklist for Missing Indexes\n- [ ] Table has 10k+ rows\n- [ ] Field is used in filter() or order_by() on hot path\n- [ ] Checked model - no db_index=True or Meta.indexes entry\n- [ ] Not a foreign key (already indexed automatically)\n\n---\n\n## Priority 4: Write Loops (HIGH)\n\n**Impact:** N database writes instead of 1. Lock contention. Slow requests.\n\n### Rule: Use bulk_create instead of create() in loops\n\n```python\n# PROBLEM: N inserts, N round trips\nfor item in items:\n    Model.objects.create(name=item[''name''])\n\n# SOLUTION: Single bulk insert\nModel.objects.bulk_create([\n    Model(name=item[''name'']) for item in items\n])\n```\n\n### Rule: Use update() or bulk_update instead of save() in loops\n\n```python\n# PROBLEM: N updates\nfor obj in queryset:\n    obj.status = ''done''\n    obj.save()\n\n# SOLUTION A: Single UPDATE statement (same value for all)\nqueryset.update(status=''done'')\n\n# SOLUTION B: bulk_update (different values)\nfor obj in objects:\n    obj.status = compute_status(obj)\nModel.objects.bulk_update(objects, [''status''], batch_size=500)\n```\n\n### Rule: Use delete() on queryset, not in loops\n\n```python\n# PROBLEM: N deletes\nfor obj in queryset:\n    obj.delete()\n\n# SOLUTION: Single DELETE\nqueryset.delete()\n```\n\n### Validation Checklist for Write Loops\n- [ ] Loop iterates over 100+ items (or unbounded)\n- [ ] Each iteration calls create(), save(), or delete()\n- [ ] This runs on user-facing request (not one-time migration script)\n\n---\n\n## Priority 5: Inefficient Patterns (LOW)\n\n**Rarely worth reporting.** Include only as minor notes if you''re already reporting real issues.\n\n### Pattern: count() vs exists()\n\n```python\n# Slightly suboptimal\nif queryset.count() > 0:\n    do_thing()\n\n# Marginally better\nif queryset.exists():\n    do_thing()\n```\n\n**Usually skip** - difference is <1ms in most cases.\n\n### Pattern: len(queryset) vs count()\n\n```python\n# Fetches all rows to count\nif len(queryset) > 0:  # bad if queryset not yet evaluated\n\n# Single COUNT query\nif queryset.count() > 0:\n```\n\n**Only flag** if queryset is large and not already evaluated.\n\n### Pattern: get() in small loops\n\n```python\n# N queries, but if N is small (< 20), often fine\nfor id in ids:\n    obj = Model.objects.get(id=id)\n```\n\n**Only flag** if loop is large or this is in a very hot path.\n\n---\n\n## Validation Requirements\n\nBefore reporting ANY issue:\n\n1. **Trace the data flow** - Follow queryset from creation to consumption\n2. **Search for existing optimizations** - Grep for select_related, prefetch_related, pagination\n3. **Verify data volume** - Check if table is actually large\n4. **Confirm hot path** - Trace call sites, verify this runs frequently\n5. **Rule out mitigations** - Check for caching, rate limiting\n\n**If you cannot validate all steps, do not report.**\n\n---\n\n## Output Format\n\n```markdown\n## Django Performance Review: [File/Component Name]\n\n### Summary\nValidated issues: X (Y Critical, Z High)\n\n### Findings\n\n#### [PERF-001] N+1 Query in UserListView (CRITICAL)\n**Location:** `views.py:45`\n\n**Issue:** Related field `profile` accessed in template loop without prefetch.\n\n**Validation:**\n- Traced: UserListView → users queryset → user_list.html → `{{ user.profile.bio }}` in loop\n- Searched codebase: no select_related(''profile'') found\n- User table: 50k+ rows (verified in admin)\n- Hot path: linked from homepage navigation\n\n**Evidence:**\n```python\ndef get_queryset(self):\n    return User.objects.filter(active=True)  # no select_related\n```\n\n**Fix:**\n```python\ndef get_queryset(self):\n    return User.objects.filter(active=True).select_related(''profile'')\n```\n```\n\nIf no issues found: \"No performance issues identified after reviewing [files] and validating [what you checked].\"\n\n**Before submitting, sanity check each finding:**\n- Does the severity match the actual impact? (\"Minor inefficiency\" ≠ CRITICAL)\n- Is this a real performance issue or just a style preference?\n- Would fixing this measurably improve performance?\n\nIf the answer to any is \"no\" - remove the finding.\n\n---\n\n## What NOT to Report\n\n- Test files\n- Admin-only views\n- Management commands\n- Migration files\n- One-time scripts\n- Code behind disabled feature flags\n- Tables with <1000 rows that won''t grow\n- Patterns in cold paths (rarely executed code)\n- Micro-optimizations (exists vs count, only/defer without evidence)\n\n### False Positives to Avoid\n\n**Queryset variable assignment is not an issue:**\n```python\n# This is FINE - no performance difference\nprojects_qs = Project.objects.filter(org=org)\nprojects = list(projects_qs)\n\n# vs this - identical performance\nprojects = list(Project.objects.filter(org=org))\n```\nQuerysets are lazy. Assigning to a variable doesn''t execute anything.\n\n**Single query patterns are not N+1:**\n```python\n# This is ONE query, not N+1\nprojects = list(Project.objects.filter(org=org))\n```\nN+1 requires a loop that triggers additional queries. A single `list()` call is fine.\n\n**Missing select_related on single object fetch is not N+1:**\n```python\n# This is 2 queries, not N+1 - report as LOW at most\nstate = AutofixState.objects.filter(pr_id=pr_id).first()\nproject_id = state.request.project_id  # second query\n```\nN+1 requires a loop. A single object doing 2 queries instead of 1 can be reported as LOW if relevant, but never as CRITICAL/HIGH.\n\n**Style preferences are not performance issues:**\nIf your only suggestion is \"combine these two lines\" or \"rename this variable\" - that''s style, not performance. Don''t report it.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:13:12.639Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI工具：Django性能优化","ja":"AIエージェント：Djangoパフォーマンスレビュー","ko":"AI 에이전트: Django 성능 리뷰","es":"Herramientas de revisión de rendimiento de Django","fr":"Outils d''analyse de performances Django","de":"Django Leistungsüberprüfungstools","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: django-perf-review para Otimização de ...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: django-perf-review для Оптимизации Производите...","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: django-perf-review لتعزيز الأداء","en":"django-perf-review"},"description":{"zh":"Django性能代码审查AI工具，用于优化Django性能和查找N+1查询","ja":"Djangoパフォーマンスを最適化するためのAIエージェント。Django ORMの問題やデータベースパフォーマンスの低下を解決する","ko":"Django 성능을 최적화하고 N+1 쿼리를 찾는 AI 에이전트. Django ORM 문제와 데이터베이스 성능 문제를 해결","es":"La herramienta de revisión de rendimiento de Django analiza y optimiza el código para mejorar el rendimiento","fr":"L''outil d''analyse de performances Django analyse et optimise le code pour améliorer les performances","de":"Das Django-Leistungsüberprüfungstool analysiert und optimiert den Code, um die Leistung zu verbessern","pt":"A ferramenta django-perf-review é utilizada para revisar o desempenho do Django, encontrar consultas N+1 e otimizar a ORM.","ru":"Инструмент django-perf-review используется для обзора производительности Django, нахождения запросов N+1 и оптимизации ORM.","ar":"تُستخدم أداة django-perf-review لمراجعة أداء Django، العثور على استفسارات N+1 وتحسين أداء ORM.","en":"Django performance code review. Use when asked to review Django performance, find N+1 queries, optimize Django, check queryset performance, database performa..."},"definition":{"en":"Django performance code review. Use when asked to review Django performance, find N+1 queries, optimize Django, check queryset performance, database performance, Django ORM issues, or audit Django code for performance problems."},"features":{"zh":["优化Djan