pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Python especializados em otimização de desempenho de codebase Django e auditoria de consultas de banco de dados.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов анализа Python, специализирующихся на оптимизации производительности кодовой базы Django и аудите запросов к базе данных.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تحليل Python المتخصصين في تحسين أداء قاعدة كود Django ومراجعة استعلامات قاعدة البيانات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to conduct validated Django performance reviews by tracing data flows, identifying N+1 queries, and optimizing queryset performance while maintaining research-first validation principles to avoid false positives.","zh":"通过追踪数据流、识别 N+1 查询和优化 queryset 性能，使代理能够进行经过验证的 Django 性能审查，同时坚持研究优先的验证原则以避免误报。","ja":"データフローの追跡、N+1 クエリの特定、queryset パフォーマンスの最適化を通じて、エージェントが検証済みの Django パフォーマンスレビューを実施できるようにし、研究第一の検証原則を維持して誤検出を回避します。","ko":"데이터 흐름 추적, N+1 쿼리 식별, 쿼리셋 성능 최적화를 통해 에이전트가 검증된 Django 성능 검토를 수행할 수 있도록 하며, 연구 중심의 검증 원칙을 유지하여 오탐지를 방지합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar revisiones de rendimiento de Django validadas trazando flujos de datos, identificando consultas N+1 y optimizando el rendimiento de queryset mientras mantiene principios de validación de investigación para evitar falsos positivos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réaliser des examens de performances Django validés en traçant les flux de données, en identifiant les requêtes N+1 et en optimisant les performances de queryset tout en maintenant des principes de validation de recherche pour éviter les faux positifs.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, validierte Django-Leistungsprüfungen durchzuführen, indem sie Datenflüsse verfolgen, N+1-Abfragen identifizieren und die Leistung von QuerySets optimieren, während sie forschungsbasierte Validierungsgrundsätze beibehalten, um falsche Positivergebnisse zu vermeiden.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a conduzir revisões de desempenho Django validadas através do rastreamento de fluxos de dados, identificação de consultas N+1 e otimização do desempenho do queryset, mantendo os princípios de validação de pesquisa primeiro para evitar falsos positivos.","ru":"Позволяет агентам проводить проверенные обзоры производительности Django путем отслеживания потоков данных, выявления запросов N+1 и оптимизации производительности queryset, при этом соблюдая принципы первоначальной исследовательской проверки для избежания ложных срабатываний.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من إجراء مراجعات أداء Django المعتمدة من خلال تتبع تدفقات البيانات، وتحديد استعلامات N+1، وتحسين أداء مجموعة الاستعلامات مع الحفاظ على مبادئ التحقق القائمة على البحث أولاً لتجنب الإيجابيات الكاذبة."},"useCases":{"en":["Identifying N+1 query patterns in Django ORM","Optimizing database performance through queryset analysis","Auditing Django code for proven performance bottlenecks","Validating existing performance optimizations in codebase"],"zh":["识别 Django ORM 中的 N+1 查询模式","通过 queryset 分析优化数据库性能","审计 Django 代码以查找已证实的性能瓶颈","验证代码库中现有的性能优化"],"ja":["Django ORM における N+1 クエリパターンの特定","queryset 分析によるデータベースパフォーマンスの最適化","実証済みのパフォーマンスボトルネックに対する Django コードの監査","コードベース内の既存のパフォーマンス最適化の検証"],"ko":["Django ORM에서 N+1 쿼리 패턴 식별","쿼리셋 분석을 통한 데이터베이스 성능 최적화","입증된 성능 병목 현상에 대한 Django 코드 감사","코드베이스 내 기존 성능 최적화 검증"],"es":["Identificar patrones de consultas N+1 en Django ORM","Optimizar el rendimiento de la base de datos a través del análisis de queryset","Auditar el código de Django para identificar cuellos de botella de rendimiento comprobados","Validar las optimizaciones de rendimiento existentes en la base de código"],"fr":["Identifier les modèles de requêtes N+1 dans Django ORM","Optimiser les performances de la base de données via l''analyse de queryset","Auditer le code Django pour identifier les goulots d''étranglement de performances prouvés","Valider les optimisations de performances existantes dans la base de code"],"de":["Identifizierung von N+1-Abfragemustern in Django-ORM","Optimierung der Datenbankleistung durch QuerySet-Analyse","Prüfung des Django-Codes auf nachgewiesene Leistungsengpässe","Validierung bestehender Leistungsoptimierungen im Code"],"pt":["Identificação de padrões de consulta N+1 no Django ORM","Otimização do desempenho do banco de dados através da análise de queryset","Auditoria de código Django para gargalos de desempenho comprovados","Validação de otimizações de desempenho existentes na codebase"],"ru":["Выявление шаблонов запросов N+1 в Django ORM","Оптимизация производительности базы данных через анализ queryset","Аудит кода Django на предмет подтвержденных узких мест производительности","Проверка существующих оптимизаций производительности в кодовой базе"],"ar":["تحديد أنماط استعلام N+1 في Django ORM","تحسين أداء قاعدة البيانات من خلال تحليل مجموعة الاستعلامات","مراجعة كود Django للبحث عن اختناقات أداء مثبتة","التحقق من تحسينات الأداء الحالية في قاعدة الكود"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires full codebase access for proper tracing","Django-specific framework only","Demands actual data volume verification for accurate assessment","Cannot manufacture issues - zero findings possible"],"zh":["需要完整的代码库访问权限才能进行正确的追踪","仅限 Django 特定框架","需要实际数据量验证以进行准确评估","无法制造问题 - 可能存在零发现"],"ja":["適切な追跡にはコードベースへの完全なアクセスが必要","Django 固有のフレームワークのみ対応","正確な評価には実際のデータ量検証が必須","問題を捏造できず - 所見がゼロの場合あり"],"ko":["적절한 추적을 위한 전체 코드베이스 접근 권한 필요","Django 전용 프레임워크만 해당","정확한 평가를 위한 실제 데이터 양 검증 필요","문제를 조작할 수 없음 - 발견 결과가 없을 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere acceso completo a la base de código para un seguimiento adecuado","Marco de trabajo específico de Django","Exige verificación del volumen de datos real para una evaluación precisa","No puede fabricar problemas: resultados de cero hallazgos posibles"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès complet à la base de code pour un suivi approprié","Framework spécifique à Django","Exige une vérification du volume de données réel pour une évaluation précise","Ne peut pas fabriquer des problèmes: résultats de zéro découverte possible"],"de":["Benötigt vollen Zugriff auf die Codebasis für eine ordnungsgemäße Nachverfolgung","Django-spezifisches Framework","Erfordert Überprüfung des tatsächlichen Datenvolumens für eine genaue Bewertung","Kann keine Probleme herbeiführen: Null-Ergebnisse möglich"],"pt":["Requer acesso completo à codebase para um rastreamento adequado","Específico apenas para o framework Django","Exige verificação do volume real de dados para uma avaliação precisa","Não pode fabricar problemas - zero descobertas é possível"],"ru":["Требует полного доступа к кодовой базе для правильного отслеживания","Только для фреймворка Django","Требует проверки реального объема данных для точной оценки","Не может создавать проблемы - возможны нулевые находки"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول الكامل إلى قاعدة الكود لإجراء التتبع السليم","مخصص لإطار عمل Django فقط","يتطلب التحقق من حجم البيانات الفعلي لإجراء تقييم دقيق","لا يمكن تصنيع المشكلات - من الممكن عدم العثور على أي شيء"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d45298cb3c2b06777a28a2cadbcbb4eacc1e987ade230f4f94947ad927c92033","repoEtag":"W/\"79d96e7212c5e1c533c45b60c7fb7cd467d00b5536301bf6acbcd2c41bbcbfc8\"","qualityScore":92}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('cloudflare/skills/sandbox-sdk', 'official', 'cloudflare', 'skills', 'cloudflare/skills', 'sandbox-sdk', 387, 38, 92, '2026-02-28T23:20:41Z', '2026-03-01T05:14:26.444Z', '9471b02867ec7ce8408663a85b140643486b04c00e055e44709b2e55e8316bfa', '{"id":"cloudflare/skills/sandbox-sdk","name":"sandbox-sdk","description":{"zh":"sandbox-sdk是一个用于构建安全、隔离的代码执行环境的工具，适用于AI代码执行、代码解释器、CI/CD系统等","ja":"sandbox-sdkは、AIエージェントのためのセキュアなコード実行環境を構築するためのツールです","ko":"sandbox-sdk는 AI 에이전트용 안전한 코드 실행 환경을 구축하는 도구입니다","es":"Sandbox SDK es una herramienta para construir aplicaciones aisladas y seguras para la ejecución de código. Permite crear entornos de desarrollo interactivos y seguros con Cloudflare Workers","fr":"Sandbox SDK est un outil pour construire des applications isolées et sécurisées pour l''exécution de code. Il permet de créer des environnements de développement interactifs et sécurisés avec Cloudflare Workers","de":"Sandbox SDK ist ein Tool zum Erstellen von isolierten und sicheren Anwendungen für die Code-Ausführung. Es ermöglicht die Erstellung von interaktiven und sicheren Entwicklungsumgebungen mit Cloudflare Workers","pt":"O Sandbox SDK permite a criação de ambientes de execução de código seguros e isolados para aplicações em nuvem.","ru":"Sandbox SDK позволяет создавать безопасные и изолированные среды для выполнения кода в облачных приложениях.","ar":"يسمح لك Sandbox SDK بإنشاء بيئات تنفيذ كود آمنة ومعزولة لتطبيقات السحابة.","en":"Build sandboxed applications for secure code execution. Load when building AI code execution, code interpreters, CI/CD systems, interactive dev environments, or executing untrusted code. Covers Sandbox SDK lifecycle, commands, files, code interpreter, and preview URLs."},"owner":"cloudflare","repo":"skills","repoPath":"cloudflare/skills","stars":387,"forks":38,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T23:20:41Z","topics":["agents","cloudflare","skills","workers"],"skillMd":{"name":"sandbox-sdk","description":"Build sandboxed applications for secure code execution. Load when building AI code execution, code interpreters, CI/CD systems, interactive dev environments, or executing untrusted code. Covers Sandbox SDK lifecycle, commands, files, code interpreter, and preview URLs.","bodyPreview":"# Cloudflare Sandbox SDK\n\nBuild secure, isolated code execution environments on Cloudflare Workers.\n\n## FIRST: Verify Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install @cloudflare/sandbox\ndocker info  # Must succeed - Docker required for local dev\n```\n\n## Retrieval-Led Development\n\n**IMPORTANT: Prefer retrieval from docs and examples over pre-training for Sandbox SDK tasks.**\n\n| Resource | URL |\n|----------|-----|\n| Docs | https://developers.cloudflare.com/sandbox/ |\n| API Reference | https://developers.cloudfl","body":"# Cloudflare Sandbox SDK\n\nBuild secure, isolated code execution environments on Cloudflare Workers.\n\n## FIRST: Verify Installation\n\n```bash\nnpm install @cloudflare/sandbox\ndocker info  # Must succeed - Docker required for local dev\n```\n\n## Retrieval-Led Development\n\n**IMPORTANT: Prefer retrieval from docs and examples over pre-training for Sandbox SDK tasks.**\n\n| Resource | URL |\n|----------|-----|\n| Docs | https://developers.cloudflare.com/sandbox/ |\n| API Reference | https://developers.cloudflare.com/sandbox/api/ |\n| Examples | https://github.com/cloudflare/sandbox-sdk/tree/main/examples |\n| Get Started | https://developers.cloudflare.com/sandbox/get-started/ |\n\nWhen implementing features, fetch the relevant doc page or example first.\n\n## Required Configuration\n\n**wrangler.jsonc** (exact - do not modify structure):\n\n```jsonc\n{\n  \"containers\": [{\n    \"class_name\": \"Sandbox\",\n    \"image\": \"./Dockerfile\",\n    \"instance_type\": \"lite\",\n    \"max_instances\": 1\n  }],\n  \"durable_objects\": {\n    \"bindings\": [{ \"class_name\": \"Sandbox\", \"name\": \"Sandbox\" }]\n  },\n  \"migrations\": [{ \"new_sqlite_classes\": [\"Sandbox\"], \"tag\": \"v1\" }]\n}\n```\n\n**Worker entry** - must re-export Sandbox class:\n\n```typescript\nimport { getSandbox } from ''@cloudflare/sandbox'';\nexport { Sandbox } from ''@cloudflare/sandbox'';  // Required export\n```\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Task | Method |\n|------|--------|\n| Get sandbox | `getSandbox(env.Sandbox, ''user-123'')` |\n| Run command | `await sandbox.exec(''python script.py'')` |\n| Run code (interpreter) | `await sandbox.runCode(code, { language: ''python'' })` |\n| Write file | `await sandbox.writeFile(''/workspace/app.py'', content)` |\n| Read file | `await sandbox.readFile(''/workspace/app.py'')` |\n| Create directory | `await sandbox.mkdir(''/workspace/src'', { recursive: true })` |\n| List files | `await sandbox.listFiles(''/workspace'')` |\n| Expose port | `await sandbox.exposePort(8080)` |\n| Destroy | `await sandbox.destroy()` |\n\n## Core Patterns\n\n### Execute Commands\n\n```typescript\nconst sandbox = getSandbox(env.Sandbox, ''user-123'');\nconst result = await sandbox.exec(''python --version'');\n// result: { stdout, stderr, exitCode, success }\n```\n\n### Code Interpreter (Recommended for AI)\n\nUse `runCode()` for executing LLM-generated code with rich outputs:\n\n```typescript\nconst ctx = await sandbox.createCodeContext({ language: ''python'' });\n\nawait sandbox.runCode(''import pandas as pd; data = [1,2,3]'', { context: ctx });\nconst result = await sandbox.runCode(''sum(data)'', { context: ctx });\n// result.results[0].text = \"6\"\n```\n\n**Languages**: `python`, `javascript`, `typescript`\n\nState persists within context. Create explicit contexts for production.\n\n### File Operations\n\n```typescript\nawait sandbox.mkdir(''/workspace/project'', { recursive: true });\nawait sandbox.writeFile(''/workspace/project/main.py'', code);\nconst file = await sandbox.readFile(''/workspace/project/main.py'');\nconst files = await sandbox.listFiles(''/workspace/project'');\n```\n\n## When to Use What\n\n| Need | Use | Why |\n|------|-----|-----|\n| Shell commands, scripts | `exec()` | Direct control, streaming |\n| LLM-generated code | `runCode()` | Rich outputs, state persistence |\n| Build/test pipelines | `exec()` | Exit codes, stderr capture |\n| Data analysis | `runCode()` | Charts, tables, pandas |\n\n## Extending the Dockerfile\n\nBase image (`docker.io/cloudflare/sandbox:0.7.0`) includes Python 3.11, Node.js 20, and common tools.\n\nAdd dependencies by extending the Dockerfile:\n\n```dockerfile\nFROM docker.io/cloudflare/sandbox:0.7.0\n\n# Python packages\nRUN pip install requests beautifulsoup4\n\n# Node packages (global)\nRUN npm install -g typescript\n\n# System packages\nRUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y ffmpeg && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*\n\nEXPOSE 8080  # Required for local dev port exposure\n```\n\nKeep images lean - affects cold start time.\n\n## Preview URLs (Port Exposure)\n\nExpose HTTP services running in sandboxes:\n\n```typescript\nconst { url } = await sandbox.exposePort(8080);\n// Returns preview URL for the service\n```\n\n**Production requirement**: Preview URLs need a custom domain with wildcard DNS (`*.yourdomain.com`). The `.workers.dev` domain does not support preview URL subdomains.\n\nSee: https://developers.cloudflare.com/sandbox/guides/expose-services/\n\n## OpenAI Agents SDK Integration\n\nThe SDK provides helpers for OpenAI Agents at `@cloudflare/sandbox/openai`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { Shell, Editor } from ''@cloudflare/sandbox/openai'';\n```\n\nSee `examples/openai-agents` for complete integration pattern.\n\n## Sandbox Lifecycle\n\n- `getSandbox()` returns immediately - container starts lazily on first operation\n- Containers sleep after 10 minutes of inactivity (configurable via `sleepAfter`)\n- Use `destroy()` to immediately free resources\n- Same `sandboxId` always returns same sandbox instance\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n- **Don''t use internal clients** (`CommandClient`, `FileClient`) - use `sandbox.*` methods\n- **Don''t skip the Sandbox export** - Worker won''t deploy without `export { Sandbox }`\n- **Don''t hardcode sandbox IDs for multi-user** - use user/session identifiers\n- **Don''t forget cleanup** - call `destroy()` for temporary sandboxes\n\n## Detailed References\n\n- **[references/api-quick-ref.md](references/api-quick-ref.md)** - Full API with options and return types\n- **[references/examples.md](references/examples.md)** - Example index with use cases\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:14:26.444Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理 sandbox-sdk","ja":"AIエージェント sandbox-sdk","ko":"AI 에이전트 sandbox-sdk","es":"Herramientas de Agente de Inteligencia Artificial: Sandbo...","fr":"Outils d''Agents d''Intelligence Artificielle: Sandbox SDK","de":"KI-Agents-Tools: Sandbox SDK","pt":"Ferramentas de AI: Sandbox SDK para Execução de Código Se...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Sandbox SDK для Безопасного Выполнения Код","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: Sandbox SDK لتنفيذ الكود الآمن","en":"sandbox-sdk"},"description":{"zh":"sandbox-sdk是一个用于构建安全、隔离的代码执行环境的工具，适用于AI代码执行、代码解释器、CI/CD系统等","ja":"sandbox-sdkは、AIエージェントのためのセキュアなコード実行環境を構築するためのツールです","ko":"sandbox-sdk는 AI 에이전트용 안전한 코드 실행 환경을 구축하는 도구입니다","es":"Sandbox SDK es una herramienta para construir aplicaciones aisladas y seguras para la ejecución de código. Permite crear entornos de desarrollo interactivos ...","fr":"Sandbox SDK est un outil pour construire des applications isolées et sécurisées pour l''exécution de code. Il permet de créer des environnements de développem...","de":"Sandbox SDK ist ein Tool zum Erstellen von isolierten und sicheren Anwendungen für die Code-Ausführung. Es ermöglicht die Erstellung von interaktiven und sic...","pt":"O Sandbox SDK permite a criação de ambientes de execução de código seguros e isolados para aplicações em nuvem.","ru":"Sandbox SDK позволяет создавать безопасные и изолированные среды для выполнения кода в облачных приложениях.","ar":"يسمح لك Sandbox SDK بإنشاء بيئات تنفيذ كود آمنة ومعزولة لتطبيقات السحابة.","en":"Build sandboxed applications for secure code execution. Load when building AI code execution, code interpreters, CI/CD systems, interactive dev environments,..."},"definition":{"en":"Build sandboxed applications for secure code execution. Load when building AI code execution, code interpreters, CI/CD systems, interactive dev environments, or executing untrusted code. Covers Sandbox SDK lifecycle, commands, files, code interpreter, and preview URLs."},"features":{"zh":["构建安全的代码执行环境","支持AI代码执行、代码解释器、CI/CD系统等","使用Cloudflare Workers构建隔离的代码执行环境","支持Docker和npm安装","提供详细的文档和API参考"],"ja":["セキュアなコード実行環境を構築","AIエージェントのためのコード実行、コード解釈器、CI/CDシステム等をサポート","Cloudflare Workersを使用して隔離されたコード実行環境を構築","Dockerとnpmのインストールをサポート","詳細なドキュメントとAPIリファレンスを提供"],"ko":["안전한 코드 실행 환경을 구축","AI 에이전트용 코드 실행, 코드 인터프리터, CI/CD 시스템 등 지원","Cloudflare Workers를 사용하여 격리된 코드 실행 환경을 구축","Docker와 npm 설치 지원","詳細한 문서와 API 참조 제공"],"es":["Crea entornos de ejecución de código seguro con Cloudflare Workers","Permite la ejecución de código de confianza y no de confianza","Soporte para desarrollo interactivo y depuración","Integración con Docker para desarrollo local","Documentación y referencia de API disponible"],"fr":["Crée des environnements d''exécution de code sécurisés avec Cloudflare Workers","Permet l''exécution de code de confiance et non de confiance","Prise en charge du développement interactif et de la débogage","Intégration avec Docker pour le développement local","Documentation et référence d''API disponible"],"de":["Erstelle sichere Code-Ausführungsumgebungen mit Cloudflare Workers","Ermöglicht die Ausführung von vertrauenswürdigem und nicht vertrauenswürdigem Code","Unterstützung für interaktive Entwicklung und Debugging","Integration mit Docker für lokale Entwicklung","Dokumentation und API-Referenz verfügbar"],"pt":["Criação de ambientes de execução de código isolados","Integração com Cloudflare Workers","Suporte a Docker para desenvolvimento local","Recursos de segurança avançados","Documentação e exemplos abrangentes"],"ru":["Создание изолированных сред для выполнения кода","Интеграция с Cloudflare Workers","Поддержка Docker для локального разработки","Расширенные функции безопасности","Полная документация и примеры"],"ar":["إنشاء بيئات تنفيذ كود معزولة","التكامل مع Cloudflare Workers","دعم Docker للتنمية المحلية","ميزات أمان متقدمة","وثائق وامثلة شاملة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","sandbox-sdk","代码执行环境","Cloudflare Workers","Docker","npm","AI代码执行","代码解释器","CI/CD系统"],"ja":["AIエージェント","sandbox-sdk","コード実行環境","Cloudflare Workers","Docker","npm","AIコード実行","コード解釈器","CI/CDシステム"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","sandbox-sdk","코드 실행 환경","Cloudflare Workers","Docker","npm","AI 코드 실행","코드 인터프리터","CI/CD 시스템"],"es":["Herramientas de Agente de Inteligencia Artificial","Sandbox SDK","Cloudflare Workers","Desarrollo de aplicaciones seguras","Ejecución de código seguro","Docker","Desarrollo interactivo"],"fr":["Outils d''Agents d''Intelligence Artificielle","Sandbox SDK","Cloudflare Workers","Développement d''applications sécurisées","Exécution de code sécurisé","Docker","Développement interactif"],"de":["KI-Agents-Tools","Sandbox SDK","Cloudflare Workers","Entwicklung von sicheren Anwendungen","Sichere Code-Ausführung","Docker","Interaktive Entwicklung"],"pt":["Sandbox SDK","execução de código seguro","ambientes isolados","Cloudflare Workers","Docker","desenvolvimento de aplicações em nuvem","ferramentas de AI","segurança de código"],"ru":["Sandbox SDK","безопасное выполнение кода","изолированные среды","Cloudflare Workers","Docker","разработка облачных приложений","инструменты ИИ","безопасность кода"],"ar":["Sandbox SDK","تنفيذ كود آمن","بيئات معزولة","Cloudflare Workers","Docker","تنمية تطبيقات السحابة","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","أمان الكود"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Secure Execution Agents requiring isolated code environments on Cloudflare Workers.","zh":"适用于需要在 Cloudflare Workers 上隔离代码环境的安全执行代理。","ja":"Cloudflare Workers 上で分離されたコード環境を必要とするセキュアな実行エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Cloudflare Workers에서 분리된 코드 환경을 필요로 하는 보안 실행 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Ejecución Segura que requieren entornos de código aislados en Cloudflare Workers.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''exécution sécurisés nécessitant des environnements de code isolés sur Cloudflare Workers.","de":"Ideal für sichere Ausführungsagenten, die isolierte Codeumgebungen auf Cloudflare Workers erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Execução Segura que exigem ambientes de código isolados no Cloudflare Workers.","ru":"Идеально для Безопасных Агентов Выполнения, требующих изолированных кодовых сред на Cloudflare Workers.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التنفيذيين الآمنين الذين يتطلبون بيئات تعليم معزولة على Cloudflare Workers."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build secure, sandboxed applications for code execution using the Cloudflare Sandbox SDK, leveraging Docker for local development and facilitating the creation of secure code execution environments with features like preview URLs and code interpreters.","zh":"使代理能够使用 Cloudflare Sandbox SDK 构建安全的沙盒应用程序，以进行代码执行，利用 Docker 进行本地开发，并通过预览 URL 和代码解释器等功能实现安全的代码执行环境。","ja":"エージェントが Cloudflare Sandbox SDK を使用してセキュアなサンドボックス アプリケーションを構築することを可能にし、コードの実行に Docker を使用してローカル開発を行い、プレビュー URL やコード インタープリターなどの機能を使用してセキュアなコード実行環境を作成します。","ko":"에이전트가 Cloudflare Sandbox SDK를 사용하여 보안 샌드박스 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있도록 하여 코드 실행에 대한 Docker를 사용하여 로컬 개발을 수행하며, 미리 보기 URL 및 코드 인터프리터와 같은 기능을 통해 보안 코드 실행 환경을 생성합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones seguras y aisladas para la ejecución de código utilizando el SDK de Cloudflare Sandbox, aprovechando Docker para el desarrollo local y facilitando la creación de entornos de ejecución de código seguros con características como URLs de vista previa y intérpretes de código.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications sécurisées et sandboxées pour l''exécution de code en utilisant le SDK Cloudflare Sandbox, en exploitant Docker pour le développement local et en facilitant la création d''environnements d''exécution de code sécurisés avec des fonctionnalités comme les URLs de prévisualisation et les interpréteurs de code.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, sichere, sandboxte Anwendungen für Code-Ausführung zu erstellen, indem sie das Cloudflare Sandbox SDK verwenden, Docker für lokale Entwicklung nutzen und die Erstellung sicherer Code-Ausführungsumgebungen mit Funktionen wie Vorschau-URLs und Code-Interpretern erleichtern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicações seguras e sandboxed para execução de código usando o Cloudflare Sandbox SDK, aproveitando o Docker para desenvolvimento local e facilitando a criação de ambientes de execução de código seguro com recursos como URLs de visualização e interpretadores de código.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать безопасные, sandboxed-приложения для выполнения кода с помощью Cloudflare Sandbox SDK, используя Docker для локальной разработки и облегчая создание безопасных сред выполнения кода с функциями, такими как предпросмотр URL и интерпретаторы кода.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من بناء تطبيقات آمنة ومحجوزة لتنفيذ الشفرة باستخدام Cloudflare Sandbox SDK، واستخدام Docker للتنمية المحلية، وتسهيل إنشاء بيئات تنفيذ الشفرة الآمنة مع ميزات مثل معاينة URL ومفسر الشفرة."},"useCases":{"en":["Building sandboxed applications for secure code execution","Creating isolated environments for executing untrusted code","Developing interactive development environments with secure code execution"],"zh":["构建沙盒应用程序以进行安全代码执行","创建隔离环境以执行不受信任的代码","开发安全代码执行的交互式开发环境"],"ja":["セキュアなコード実行のためのサンドボックス アプリケーションの構築","信頼できないコードを実行するための分離環境の作成","セキュアなコード実行のためのインタラクティブな開発環境の開発"],"ko":["보안 코드 실행을 위한 샌드박스 애플리케이션 구축","신뢰할 수 없는 코드를 실행하기 위한 격리 환경 생성","보안 코드 실행을 위한 상호 작용 개발 환경 개발"],"es":["Creación de aplicaciones aisladas para la ejecución de código seguro","Creación de entornos aislados para la ejecución de código no confiable","Desarrollo de entornos de desarrollo interactivos con ejecución de código segura"],"fr":["Création d''applications sandboxées pour l''exécution de code sécurisé","Création d''environnements isolés pour l''exécution de code non fiable","Développement d''environnements de développement interactifs avec exécution de code sécurisée"],"de":["Erstellung von sandboxten Anwendungen für sichere Code-Ausführung","Erstellung von isolierten Umgebungen für die Ausführung von nicht vertrauenswürdigem Code","Entwicklung interaktiver Entwicklungsumgebungen mit sicherer Code-Ausführung"],"pt":["Construção de aplicações sandboxed para execução de código seguro","Criação de ambientes isolados para execução de código não confiável","Desenvolvimento de ambientes de desenvolvimento interativos com execução de código seguro"],"ru":["Создание sandboxed-приложений для безопасного выполнения кода","Создание изолированных сред для выполнения ненадежного кода","Разработка интерактивных сред разработки с безопасным выполнением кода"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات محجوزة لتنفيذ الشفرة الآمنة","إنشاء بيئات معزولة لتنفيذ الشفرة غير الموثوقة","تطوير بيئات التطوير التفاعلية مع تنفيذ الشفرة الآمن"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Docker for local development","Specific to Cloudflare Workers","Needs npm installation of @cloudflare/sandbox"],"zh":["需要 Docker 进行本地开发","特定于 Cloudflare Workers","需要使用 npm 安装 @cloudflare/sandbox"],"ja":["ローカル開発には Docker が必要","Cloudflare Workers に特有","@cloudflare/sandbox を npm でインストールする必要がある"],"ko":["로컬 개발을 위해 Docker가 필요합니다.","Cloudflare Workers에 특정","@cloudflare/sandbox를 npm으로 설치해야 함"],"es":["Requiere Docker para el desarrollo local","Específico para Cloudflare Workers","Necesita la instalación de npm de @cloudflare/sandbox"],"fr":["Nécessite Docker pour le développement local","Spécifique à Cloudflare Workers","Nécessite l''installation de npm de @cloudflare/sandbox"],"de":["Benötigt Docker für lokale Entwicklung","Spezifisch für Cloudflare Workers","Benötigt die npm-Installation von @cloudflare/sandbox"],"pt":["Exige Docker para desenvolvimento local","Específico para Cloudflare Workers","Necessita instalação do npm @cloudflare/sandbox"],"ru":["Требует Docker для локальной разработки","Спецефичен для Cloudflare Workers","Требует установки npm @cloudflare/sandbox"],"ar":["يتطلب Docker للتنمية المحلية","محدد ل Cloudflare Workers","يحتاج إلى تثبيت npm @cloudflare/sandbox"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9471b02867ec7ce8408663a85b140643486b04c00e055e44709b2e55e8316bfa","repoEtag":"W/\"2050ff8b3c3e00d31ab6816727c74e0ab9c1b238360cd17bc6966651ab9c7ea4\"","qualityScore":92}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('n8n-io/n8n/loom-transcript', 'official', 'n8n-io', 'n8n', 'n8n-io/n8n', 'loom-transcript', 176919, 55278, 92, '2026-03-01T05:12:14Z', '2026-03-01T05:14:58.666Z', 'f9a0e0f8348bf0c2cf509916c84a3a00ab06f91b3230015620f11e3a530ecdca', '{"id":"n8n-io/n8n/loom-transcript","name":"loom-transcript","description":{"zh":"Loom Transcript Fetcher是一个AI智能代理，用于获取Loom视频的完整转录。它使用Loom的GraphQL API来解析Loom URL并提取视频ID","ja":"Loom Transcript Fetcherは、Loomビデオの完全なトランスクリプトを取得するためのAIエージェントです。LoomのGraphQL APIを使用してLoom URLを解析し、ビデオIDを抽出します","ko":"Loom 전사 가져오기는 Loom 비디오의 완전한 전사를 가져오는 AI 에이전트입니다. Loom의 GraphQL API를 사용하여 Loom URL을 해석하고 비디오 ID를 추출합니다","es":"El Loom Transcript Fetcher es una herramienta de Inteligencia Artificial que extrae la transcripción de un video de Loom","fr":"L''outil Loom Transcript Fetcher est un outil d''Intelligence Artificielle qui extrait la transcription d''une vidéo Loom","de":"Der Loom-Transkript-Fetcher ist ein KI-Tool, das die Transkription eines Loom-Videos extrahiert","pt":"A ferramenta de transcrição Loom é uma solução de automação que usa a API do Loom para fornecer transcrições de vídeo.","ru":"ИИ Агент для Loom - это решение для автоматизации, которое использует API Loom для предоставления транскрипций видео.","ar":"أداة نقل نص فيديو لوم هي حل تلقائي يستخدم واجهة برمجة تطبيقات لوم لتقديم نسخة مكتوبة من الفيديوهات.","en":"Fetch and display the full transcript from a Loom video URL. Use when the user wants to get or read a Loom transcript."},"owner":"n8n-io","repo":"n8n","repoPath":"n8n-io/n8n","stars":176919,"forks":55278,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:12:14Z","topics":["ai","apis","automation","cli","data-flow","development","integration-framework","integrations","ipaas","low-code","low-code-platform","mcp","mcp-client","mcp-server","n8n","no-code","self-hosted","typescript","workflow","workflow-automation"],"skillMd":{"name":"loom-transcript","description":"Fetch and display the full transcript from a Loom video URL. Use when the user wants to get or read a Loom transcript.","bodyPreview":"# Loom Transcript Fetcher\n\nFetch the transcript from a Loom video using Loom''s GraphQL API.\n\n## Instructions\n\nGiven the Loom URL: $ARGUMENTS\n\n### 1. Extract the Video ID\n\nParse the Loom URL to extract the 32-character hex video ID. Supported URL formats:\n- `https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>`\n- `https://www.loom.com/embed/<video-id>`\n- `https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>?sid=<session-id>`\n\nThe video ID is the 32-character hex string after `/share/` or `/embed/`.\n\n### 2. Fetch Video Metadat","body":"# Loom Transcript Fetcher\n\nFetch the transcript from a Loom video using Loom''s GraphQL API.\n\n## Instructions\n\nGiven the Loom URL: $ARGUMENTS\n\n### 1. Extract the Video ID\n\nParse the Loom URL to extract the 32-character hex video ID. Supported URL formats:\n- `https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>`\n- `https://www.loom.com/embed/<video-id>`\n- `https://www.loom.com/share/<video-id>?sid=<session-id>`\n\nThe video ID is the 32-character hex string after `/share/` or `/embed/`.\n\n### 2. Fetch Video Metadata\n\nUse the `WebFetch` tool to POST to `https://www.loom.com/graphql` to get the video title and details.\n\nUse this curl command via Bash:\n\n```bash\ncurl -s ''https://www.loom.com/graphql'' \\\n  -H ''Content-Type: application/json'' \\\n  -H ''Accept: application/json'' \\\n  -H ''x-loom-request-source: loom_web_45a5bd4'' \\\n  -H ''apollographql-client-name: web'' \\\n  -H ''apollographql-client-version: 45a5bd4'' \\\n  -d ''{\n    \"operationName\": \"GetVideoSSR\",\n    \"variables\": {\"id\": \"<VIDEO_ID>\", \"password\": null},\n    \"query\": \"query GetVideoSSR($id: ID!, $password: String) { getVideo(id: $id, password: $password) { ... on RegularUserVideo { id name description createdAt owner { display_name } } } }\"\n  }''\n```\n\n### 3. Fetch the Transcript URLs\n\nUse curl via Bash to call the GraphQL API:\n\n```bash\ncurl -s ''https://www.loom.com/graphql'' \\\n  -H ''Content-Type: application/json'' \\\n  -H ''Accept: application/json'' \\\n  -H ''x-loom-request-source: loom_web_45a5bd4'' \\\n  -H ''apollographql-client-name: web'' \\\n  -H ''apollographql-client-version: 45a5bd4'' \\\n  -d ''{\n    \"operationName\": \"FetchVideoTranscript\",\n    \"variables\": {\"videoId\": \"<VIDEO_ID>\", \"password\": null},\n    \"query\": \"query FetchVideoTranscript($videoId: ID!, $password: String) { fetchVideoTranscript(videoId: $videoId, password: $password) { ... on VideoTranscriptDetails { id video_id source_url captions_source_url } ... on GenericError { message } } }\"\n  }''\n```\n\nReplace `<VIDEO_ID>` with the actual video ID extracted in step 1.\n\nThe response contains:\n- `source_url` — JSON transcript URL\n- `captions_source_url` — VTT (WebVTT) captions URL\n\n### 4. Download and Parse the Transcript\n\nFetch **both** URLs returned from step 3 (if available):\n\n1. **VTT captions** (`captions_source_url`): Download with `curl -sL \"<url>\"`. This is a WebVTT file with timestamps and text.\n2. **JSON transcript** (`source_url`): Download with `curl -sL \"<url>\"`. This is a JSON file with transcript segments.\n\nPrefer the VTT captions as the primary source since they include proper timestamps. Fall back to the JSON transcript if VTT is unavailable.\n\n### 5. Present the Transcript\n\nFormat and present the full transcript to the user:\n\n**Video:** [Title from metadata]\n**Author:** [Owner name]\n**Date:** [Created date]\n\n---\n\n**0:00** - First transcript segment text...\n\n**0:14** - Second transcript segment text...\n\n(continue for all segments)\n\n---\n\n## Error Handling\n\n- If the GraphQL response contains a `GenericError`, report the error message to the user.\n- If both `source_url` and `captions_source_url` are null/missing, tell the user that no transcript is available for this video.\n- If the video URL is invalid or the ID cannot be extracted, ask the user for a valid Loom URL.\n\n## Notes\n\n- No authentication or cookies are required — Loom''s transcript API is publicly accessible.\n- Only English transcripts are available through this API.\n- Transcripts are auto-generated and may contain minor errors."},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:14:58.666Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理 - Loom Transcript Fetcher","ja":"AIエージェント - Loom トラン스크リプト フェッチャー","ko":"AI 에이전트 - Loom 전사 가져오기","es":"Herramientas de Inteligencia Artificial: Loom Transcript ...","fr":"Outils d''Intelligence Artificielle: Loom Transcript Fetcher","de":"KI-Tools: Loom-Transkript-Fetcher","pt":"Ferramenta de Transcrição Loom: Ferramenta de AI para Des...","ru":"ИИ Агент для Loom: Расширение для автоматизации транскрипции","ar":"أداة نقل نص فيديو لوم: أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لل مطورين","en":"loom-transcript"},"description":{"zh":"Loom Transcript Fetcher是一个AI智能代理，用于获取Loom视频的完整转录。它使用Loom的GraphQL API来解析Loom URL并提取视频ID","ja":"Loom Transcript Fetcherは、Loomビデオの完全なトランスクリプトを取得するためのAIエージェントです。LoomのGraphQL APIを使用してLoom URLを解析し、ビデオIDを抽出します","ko":"Loom 전사 가져오기는 Loom 비디오의 완전한 전사를 가져오는 AI 에이전트입니다. Loom의 GraphQL API를 사용하여 Loom URL을 해석하고 비디오 ID를 추출합니다","es":"El Loom Transcript Fetcher es una herramienta de Inteligencia Artificial que extrae la transcripción de un video de Loom","fr":"L''outil Loom Transcript Fetcher est un outil d''Intelligence Artificielle qui extrait la transcription d''une vidéo Loom","de":"Der Loom-Transkript-Fetcher ist ein KI-Tool, das die Transkription eines Loom-Videos extrahiert","pt":"A ferramenta de transcrição Loom é uma solução de automação que usa a API do Loom para fornecer transcrições de vídeo.","ru":"ИИ Агент для Loom - это решение для автоматизации, которое использует API Loom для предоставления транскрипций видео.","ar":"أداة نقل نص فيديو لوم هي حل تلقائي يستخدم واجهة برمجة تطبيقات لوم لتقديم نسخة مكتوبة من الفيديوهات.","en":"Fetch and display the full transcript from a Loom video URL. Use when the user wants to get or read a Loom transcript."},"definition":{"en":"Fetch and display the full transcript from a Loom video URL. Use when the user wants to get or read a Loom transcript."},"features":{"zh":["使用Loom的GraphQL API获取视频转录","支持多种Loom URL格式","解析Loom URL以提取视频ID","使用TypeScript和CLI进行开发","集成到低代码平台和工作流自动化中"],"ja":["LoomのGraphQL APIを使用してビデオのトランスクリプトを取得","複数のLoom URL形式をサポート","Loom URLを解析してビデオIDを抽出","TypeScriptとCLIを使用して開発","低コードプラットフォームとワークフロー自動化に統合"],"ko":["Loom의 GraphQL API를 사용하여 비디오의 전사를 가져옵니다","複数의 Loom URL 형식을 지원합니다","Loom URL을 해석하여 비디오 ID를 추출합니다","TypeScript와 CLI를 사용하여 개발합니다","低코드 플랫폼과 워크플로 자동화에 통합합니다"],"es":["Extracción de la transcripción de un video de Loom","Uso de la API de GraphQL de Loom","Compatibilidad con múltiples formatos de URL","Implementación en TypeScript","Integración con plataformas de automatización de flujo de trabajo"],"fr":["Extraction de la transcription d''une vidéo Loom","Utilisation de l''API GraphQL de Loom","Compatibilité avec plusieurs formats d''URL","Implémentation en TypeScript","Intégration avec des plateformes d''automatisation de flux de travail"],"de":["Extraktion der Transkription eines Loom-Videos","Verwendung der Loom-GraphQL-API","Kompatibilität mit mehreren URL-Formaten","Implementierung in TypeScript","Integration mit Workflow-Automatisierungsplattformen"],"pt":["Extração de ID de vídeo a partir de URL do Loom","Uso da API do Loom para obter metadados de vídeo","Suporte a vários formatos de URL do Loom","Integração com plataformas de automação de fluxo de trabalho","Código aberto e personalizável"],"ru":["Извлечение идентификатора видео из URL Loom","Использование API Loom для получения метаданных видео","Поддержка нескольких форматов URL Loom","Интеграция с платформами автоматизации рабочего процесса","Открытый исходный код и настраиваемый"],"ar":["استخراج معرف الفيديو من عنوان URL لوم","استخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات لوم للحصول على بيانات الفيديو","دعم عدة صيغ لعنوان 