,"代码质量","可维护性","代码审查"],"ja":["AIエージェント","コーディングスタンダード","ベストプラクティス","TypeScript","JavaScript","React","Node.js","コード品質","メンテナンス性","コードレビュー"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","코딩 표준","모범 사례","TypeScript","JavaScript","React","Node.js","코드 품질","유지 보수성","코드 리뷰"],"es":["AI Agentes","Herramientas de código","Estándares de codificación","TypeScript","JavaScript","React","Node.js","Desarrollo de software"],"fr":["Agents IA","Outils de codage","Normes de codage","TypeScript","JavaScript","React","Node.js","Développement de logiciels"],"de":["KI-Agents","Codierungs-Tools","Codierungsstandards","TypeScript","JavaScript","React","Node.js","Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","padrões de codificação","desenvolvimento de software","qualidade de código","manutenção de código","TypeScript","JavaScript","React","Node.js"],"ru":["ИИ агенты для разработчиков","стандарты кодирования","разработка программного обеспечения","качество кода","поддержка кода","TypeScript","JavaScript","React","Node.js"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","معايير البرمجة","تطوير البرمجيات","جودة الشفرة","صيانة الشفرة","TypeScript","JavaScript","React","Node.js"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing enforcement of universal coding standards and best practices for TypeScript, JavaScript, React, and Node.js development.","zh":"非常适合需要执行通用编码标准和TypeScript、JavaScript、React和Node.js开发最佳实践的代码审查代理。","ja":"TypeScript、JavaScript、React、Node.js開発のユニバーサルなコーディング規範とベストプラクティスを適用する必要があるコードレビュー代理者に最適です。","ko":"TypeScript, JavaScript, React 및 Node.js 개발을 위한 범용 코딩 표준 및 모범 사례를 적용해야 하는 코드 리뷰 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para los agentes de revisión de código que necesitan aplicar normas y prácticas de codificación universales para TypeScript, JavaScript, React y desarrollo de Node.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de revue de code nécessitant l''application de normes et de pratiques de codage universelles pour TypeScript, JavaScript, React et le développement Node.js.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die die Einhaltung universeller Codierungsstandards und Best Practices für TypeScript, JavaScript, React und Node.js-Entwicklung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de aplicação de padrões de codificação universais e melhores práticas para TypeScript, JavaScript, React e desenvolvimento Node.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов код-ревью, которым необходимо обеспечить соблюдение универсальных стандартов кодирования и лучших практик для TypeScript, JavaScript, React и разработки Node.js.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات مراجعة الكود التي تحتاج إلى تنفيذ معايير برمجة عالمية وأفضل الممارسات لتنمية TypeScript و JavaScript و React و Node.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce naming, formatting, or structural consistency, set up linting, formatting, or type-checking rules, and refactor existing code to follow conventions, ensuring readability and maintainability across all projects using TypeScript, JavaScript, React, and Node.js.","zh":"赋予代理人执行命名、格式化或结构一致性，设置linting、格式化或类型检查规则，并重构现有代码以遵循约定，确保使用TypeScript、JavaScript、React和Node.js的所有项目的可读性和可维护性。","ja":"エージェントが命名、フォーマット、または構造の一貫性を適用し、linting、フォーマット、または型チェックのルールを設定し、既存のコードを規約に従ってリファクタリングすることを可能にし、TypeScript、JavaScript、React、Node.jsを使用するすべてのプロジェクトの可読性と保守性を確保する。","ko":"에이전트가命명, 형식화 또는 구조적 일관성을 적용하고 린팅, 형식화 또는 유형 확인 규칙을 설정하며 기존 코드를 규칙에 따라 리팩터링하여 TypeScript, JavaScript, React 및 Node.js를 사용하는 모든 프로젝트의 가독성 및 유지보수성을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar la coherencia de la nomenclatura, el formato o la estructura, configurar reglas de linting, formato o comprobación de tipos y refactorizar el código existente para seguir convenciones, garantizando la legibilidad y mantenibilidad en todos los proyectos que utilizan TypeScript, JavaScript, React y Node.js.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer la cohérence de la nomenclature, du format ou de la structure, de configurer des règles de linting, de format ou de vérification de types et de refactoriser le code existant pour suivre les conventions, garantissant la lisibilité et la maintenabilité de tous les projets utilisant TypeScript, JavaScript, React et Node.js.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Namens-, Format- oder Strukturkonsistenz durchzusetzen, Linting-, Format- oder Typprüfungsregeln einzurichten und bestehenden Code zu refaktorisieren, um Konventionen zu folgen, und so die Lesbarkeit und Wartbarkeit in allen Projekten sicherzustellen, die TypeScript, JavaScript, React und Node.js verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor a consistência de nomenclatura, formatação ou estrutural, configurar regras de linting, formatação ou verificação de tipo e reestruturar o código existente para seguir convenções, garantindo legibilidade e manutenibilidade em todos os projetos que usam TypeScript, JavaScript, React e Node.js.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить соблюдение последовательности именования, форматирования или структуры, настроить правила линтинга, форматирования или проверки типов и рефакторить существующий код для соблюдения конвенций, обеспечивая читаемость и поддерживаемость во всех проектах, использующих TypeScript, JavaScript, React и Node.js.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على فرض الاتساق في تسمية أو تنسيق أو هيكل، وضبط قواعد linting أو تنسيق أو فحص النوع، وإعادة هيكلة الكود الحالي ليتوافق مع الاتفاقيات، مما يضمن القراءة والصيانة في جميع المشاريع التي تستخدم TypeScript و JavaScript و React و Node.js."},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing coding standards for new contributors","Refactoring existing code to improve readability and maintainability","Setting up linting and formatting rules for TypeScript and JavaScript projects","Reviewing code quality and consistency across React and Node.js applications"],"zh":["执行新的贡献者编码标准","重构现有代码以提高可读性和可维护性","设置TypeScript和JavaScript项目的linting和格式化规则","审查React和Node.js应用程序中的代码质量和一致性"],"ja":["新しいコントリビューターのコーディング規範を適用する","既存のコードをリファクタリングして可読性と保守性を向上させる","TypeScriptとJavaScriptプロジェクトのlintingとフォーマットのルールを設定する","ReactとNode.jsアプリケーションにおけるコードの品質と一貫性をレビューする"],"ko":["새로운 기여자의 코딩 표준 적용","기존 코드 리팩터링을 통해 가독성 및 유지보수성 향상","TypeScript 및 JavaScript 프로젝트의 린팅 및 형식화 규칙 설정","React 및 Node.js 애플리케이션의 코드 품질 및 일관성 검토"],"es":["Aplicar normas de codificación para nuevos contribuyentes","Refactorizar el código existente para mejorar la legibilidad y la mantenibilidad","Configurar reglas de linting y formato para proyectos de TypeScript y JavaScript","Revisar la calidad y la coherencia del código en aplicaciones de React y Node.js"],"fr":["Appliquer des normes de codage pour les nouveaux contributeurs","Refactoriser le code existant pour améliorer la lisibilité et la maintenabilité","Configurer des règles de linting et de format pour les projets TypeScript et JavaScript","Réviser la qualité et la cohérence du code dans les applications React et Node.js"],"de":["Codierungsstandards für neue Mitwirkende durchsetzen","Bestehenden Code refaktorisieren, um Lesbarkeit und Wartbarkeit zu verbessern","Linting- und Formatregeln für TypeScript- und JavaScript-Projekte einrichten","Codequalität und -konsistenz in React- und Node.js-Anwendungen überprüfen"],"pt":["Aplicar padrões de codificação para novos contribuintes","Reestruturar código existente para melhorar a legibilidade e manutenibilidade","Configurar regras de linting e formatação para projetos TypeScript e JavaScript","Revisar a qualidade e consistência do código em aplicações React e Node.js"],"ru":["Применение стандартов кодирования для новых участников","Рефакторинг существующего кода для улучшения читаемости и поддерживаемости","Настройка правил линтинга и форматирования для проектов TypeScript и JavaScript","Проверка качества и последовательности кода в приложениях React и Node.js"],"ar":["تطبيق معايير البرمجة للمساهمين الجدد","إعادة هيكلة الكود الحالي لتحسين القراءة والصيانة","ضبط قواعد linting وتنسيق للمشاريع التي تستخدم TypeScript و JavaScript","مراجعة جودة وانتظام الكود في تطبيقات React و Node.js"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of TypeScript, JavaScript, React, and Node.js ecosystems","Limited to enforcing universal coding standards and best practices"],"zh":["需要TypeScript、JavaScript、React和Node.js生态系统的知识","仅限于执行通用编码标准和最佳实践"],"ja":["TypeScript、JavaScript、React、Node.jsのエコシステムに関する知識が必要","ユニバーサルなコーディング規範とベストプラクティスを適用することのみに限定される"],"ko":["TypeScript, JavaScript, React 및 Node.js 생태계에 대한 지식이 필요합니다.","범용 코딩 표준 및 모범 사례의 적용에만 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de los ecosistemas de TypeScript, JavaScript, React y Node.js","Limitado a la aplicación de normas y prácticas de codificación universales"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance des écosystèmes TypeScript, JavaScript, React et Node.js","Limité à l''application de normes et de pratiques de codage universelles"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der TypeScript-, JavaScript-, React- und Node.js-Ökosysteme","Begrenzt auf die Durchsetzung universeller Codierungsstandards und Best Practices"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento dos ecossistemas TypeScript, JavaScript, React e Node.js","Limitado à aplicação de padrões de codificação universais e melhores práticas"],"ru":["Требует знания экосистем TypeScript, JavaScript, React и Node.js","Ограничен обеспечением универсальных стандартов кодирования и лучших практик"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة ببيئات TypeScript و JavaScript و React و Node.js","محدود بالامتثال لمعايير البرمجة العالمية وأفضل الممارسات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"be0b5f2063e9b4b1c6514889b0dc408316f7b0c7892832d10b69ec28e1389b7c","repoEtag":"W/\"1d66934774ad40d3d916abf4c33c3e340ab032f8212b35e12a94daa7359886c9\"","qualityScore":89}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/cost-aware-llm-pipeline', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'cost-aware-llm-pipeline', 55024, 6781, 89, '2026-03-01T05:07:39Z', '2026-03-01T05:10:11.759Z', '09eb41fdfa081cd09d3843449275d80ae1c56938a459061d4d3faac3b13012cd', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/cost-aware-llm-pipeline","name":"cost-aware-llm-pipeline","description":{"zh":"成本优化模式，用于优化LLM API的成本而不牺牲质量","ja":"AIエージェントのコストを最適化するためのパターン","ko":"LLM API 비용을 최적화하는 패턴","es":"El pipeline de LLM de costo consciente combina enrutamiento de modelos, seguimiento de presupuesto, lógica de reintento y caché de solicitudes para optimizar costos","fr":"Le pipeline LLM à conscience de coût combine le routage de modèles, le suivi budgétaire, la logique de réessai et la mise en cache des requêtes pour optimiser les coûts","de":"Die kostenbewusste LLM-Pipeline kombiniert Modell-Routing, Budget-Tracking, Wiederholungslogik und Anfrage-Caching, um Kosten zu optimieren","pt":"O pipeline de LLM otimizado por custo combina roteamento de modelo, rastreamento de orçamento, lógica de reintento e cache de prompt para controlar custos de API de LLM","ru":"Пайплайн LLM с оптимизацией стоимости объединяет маршрутизацию модели, отслеживание бюджета, логику повторных попыток и кэширование подсказки для контроля затрат на API LLM","ar":"ترب#line LLM الموجهة للتكلفة يدمج маршруطة النموذج وتحديد الميزانية و منطق إعادة المحاولة وذاكرة التخزين المؤقت للتحفيز للسيطرة على تكاليف واجهة برمجة تطبيقات LLM","en":"Cost optimization patterns for LLM API usage — model routing by task complexity, budget tracking, retry logic, and prompt caching."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":55024,"forks":6781,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:07:39Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"cost-aware-llm-pipeline","description":"Cost optimization patterns for LLM API usage — model routing by task complexity, budget tracking, retry logic, and prompt caching.","bodyPreview":"# Cost-Aware LLM Pipeline\n\nPatterns for controlling LLM API costs while maintaining quality. Combines model routing, budget tracking, retry logic, and prompt caching into a composable pipeline.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Building applications that call LLM APIs (Claude, GPT, etc.)\n- Processing batches of items with varying complexity\n- Need to stay within a budget for API spend\n- Optimizing cost without sacrificing quality on complex tasks\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Model Routing by Task Complexity","body":"# Cost-Aware LLM Pipeline\n\nPatterns for controlling LLM API costs while maintaining quality. Combines model routing, budget tracking, retry logic, and prompt caching into a composable pipeline.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Building applications that call LLM APIs (Claude, GPT, etc.)\n- Processing batches of items with varying complexity\n- Need to stay within a budget for API spend\n- Optimizing cost without sacrificing quality on complex tasks\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### 1. Model Routing by Task Complexity\n\nAutomatically select cheaper models for simple tasks, reserving expensive models for complex ones.\n\n```python\nMODEL_SONNET = \"claude-sonnet-4-6\"\nMODEL_HAIKU = \"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\"\n\n_SONNET_TEXT_THRESHOLD = 10_000  # chars\n_SONNET_ITEM_THRESHOLD = 30     # items\n\ndef select_model(\n    text_length: int,\n    item_count: int,\n    force_model: str | None = None,\n) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Select model based on task complexity.\"\"\"\n    if force_model is not None:\n        return force_model\n    if text_length >= _SONNET_TEXT_THRESHOLD or item_count >= _SONNET_ITEM_THRESHOLD:\n        return MODEL_SONNET  # Complex task\n    return MODEL_HAIKU  # Simple task (3-4x cheaper)\n```\n\n### 2. Immutable Cost Tracking\n\nTrack cumulative spend with frozen dataclasses. Each API call returns a new tracker — never mutates state.\n\n```python\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True, slots=True)\nclass CostRecord:\n    model: str\n    input_tokens: int\n    output_tokens: int\n    cost_usd: float\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True, slots=True)\nclass CostTracker:\n    budget_limit: float = 1.00\n    records: tuple[CostRecord, ...] = ()\n\n    def add(self, record: CostRecord) -> \"CostTracker\":\n        \"\"\"Return new tracker with added record (never mutates self).\"\"\"\n        return CostTracker(\n            budget_limit=self.budget_limit,\n            records=(*self.records, record),\n        )\n\n    @property\n    def total_cost(self) -> float:\n        return sum(r.cost_usd for r in self.records)\n\n    @property\n    def over_budget(self) -> bool:\n        return self.total_cost > self.budget_limit\n```\n\n### 3. Narrow Retry Logic\n\nRetry only on transient errors. Fail fast on authentication or bad request errors.\n\n```python\nfrom anthropic import (\n    APIConnectionError,\n    InternalServerError,\n    RateLimitError,\n)\n\n_RETRYABLE_ERRORS = (APIConnectionError, RateLimitError, InternalServerError)\n_MAX_RETRIES = 3\n\ndef call_with_retry(func, *, max_retries: int = _MAX_RETRIES):\n    \"\"\"Retry only on transient errors, fail fast on others.\"\"\"\n    for attempt in range(max_retries):\n        try:\n            return func()\n        except _RETRYABLE_ERRORS:\n            if attempt == max_retries - 1:\n                raise\n            time.sleep(2 ** attempt)  # Exponential backoff\n    # AuthenticationError, BadRequestError etc. → raise immediately\n```\n\n### 4. Prompt Caching\n\nCache long system prompts to avoid resending them on every request.\n\n```python\nmessages = [\n    {\n        \"role\": \"user\",\n        \"content\": [\n            {\n                \"type\": \"text\",\n                \"text\": system_prompt,\n                \"cache_control\": {\"type\": \"ephemeral\"},  # Cache this\n            },\n            {\n                \"type\": \"text\",\n                \"text\": user_input,  # Variable part\n            },\n        ],\n    }\n]\n```\n\n## Composition\n\nCombine all four techniques in a single pipeline function:\n\n```python\ndef process(text: str, config: Config, tracker: CostTracker) -> tuple[Result, CostTracker]:\n    # 1. Route model\n    model = select_model(len(text), estimated_items, config.force_model)\n\n    # 2. Check budget\n    if tracker.over_budget:\n        raise BudgetExceededError(tracker.total_cost, tracker.budget_limit)\n\n    # 3. Call with retry + caching\n    response = call_with_retry(lambda: client.messages.create(\n        model=model,\n        messages=build_cached_messages(system_prompt, text),\n    ))\n\n    # 4. Track cost (immutable)\n    record = CostRecord(model=model, input_tokens=..., output_tokens=..., cost_usd=...)\n    tracker = tracker.add(record)\n\n    return parse_result(response), tracker\n```\n\n## Pricing Reference (2025-2026)\n\n| Model | Input ($/1M tokens) | Output ($/1M tokens) | Relative Cost |\n|-------|---------------------|----------------------|---------------|\n| Haiku 4.5 | $0.80 | $4.00 | 1x |\n| Sonnet 4.6 | $3.00 | $15.00 | ~4x |\n| Opus 4.5 | $15.00 | $75.00 | ~19x |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- **Start with the cheapest model** and only route to expensive models when complexity thresholds are met\n- **Set explicit budget limits** before processing batches — fail early rather than overspend\n- **Log model selection decisions** so you can tune thresholds based on real data\n- **Use prompt caching** for system prompts over 1024 tokens — saves both cost and latency\n- **Never retry on authentication or validation errors** — only transient failures (network, rate limit, server error)\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n- Using the most expensive model for all requests regardless of complexity\n- Retrying on all errors (wastes budget on permanent failures)\n- Mutating cost tracking state (makes debugging and auditing difficult)\n- Hardcoding model names throughout the codebase (use constants or config)\n- Ignoring prompt caching for repetitive system prompts\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Any application calling Claude, OpenAI, or similar LLM APIs\n- Batch processing pipelines where cost adds up quickly\n- Multi-model architectures that need intelligent routing\n- Production systems that need budget guardrails\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:10:11.759Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"智能AI代理成本优化","ja":"AIエージェントのコスト最適化","ko":"AI 에이전트 비용 최적화","es":"Técnicas de optimización de costos para Agentes de IA","fr":"Outil d''optimisation de coûts pour les Agents d''IA","de":"Kostenoptimierung für KI-Agents","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Pipeline de LLM Otimizado por Custo","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Pipeline LLM с Оптимизацией Стоимости","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: труб#line LLM الموجهة للتكلفة","en":"cost-aware-llm-pipeline"},"description":{"zh":"成本优化模式，用于优化LLM API的成本而不牺牲质量","ja":"AIエージェントのコストを最適化するためのパターン","ko":"LLM API 비용을 최적화하는 패턴","es":"El pipeline de LLM de costo consciente combina enrutamiento de modelos, seguimiento de presupuesto, lógica de reintento y caché de solicitudes para optimizar...","fr":"Le pipeline LLM à conscience de coût combine le routage de modèles, le suivi budgétaire, la logique de réessai et la mise en cache des requêtes pour optimise...","de":"Die kostenbewusste LLM-Pipeline kombiniert Modell-Routing, Budget-Tracking, Wiederholungslogik und Anfrage-Caching, um Kosten zu optimieren","pt":"O pipeline de LLM otimizado por custo combina roteamento de modelo, rastreamento de orçamento, lógica de reintento e cache de prompt para controlar custos de...","ru":"Пайплайн LLM с оптимизацией стоимости объединяет маршрутизацию модели, отслеживание бюджета, логику повторных попыток и кэширование подсказки для контроля за...","ar":"ترب#line LLM الموجهة للتكلفة يدمج маршруطة النموذج وتحديد الميزانية و منطق إعادة المحاولة وذاكرة التخزين المؤقت للتحفيز للسيطرة على تكاليف واجهة برمجة تطبيقا...","en":"Cost optimization patterns for LLM API usage — model routing by task complexity, budget tracking, retry logic, and prompt caching."},"definition":{"en":"Cost optimization patterns for LLM API usage — model routing by task complexity, budget tracking, retry logic, and prompt caching."},"features":{"zh":["模型路由","预算跟踪","重试逻辑","提示缓存"],"ja":["モデルルーティング","予算追跡","再試行ロジック","プロンプトキャッシング"],"ko":["모델 라우팅","예산 추적","재시도 로직","프롬프트 캐싱"],"es":["Enrutamiento de modelos por complejidad de tarea","Seguimiento de presupuesto para controlar costos","Lógica de reintento para manejar errores","Caché de solicitudes para reducir la carga de trabajo","Integración con APIs de LLM como Claude y GPT"],"fr":["Routage de modèles par complexité de tâche","Suivi budgétaire pour contrôler les coûts","Logique de réessai pour gérer les erreurs","Mise en cache des requêtes pour réduire la charge de travail","Intégration avec les API LLM comme Claude et GPT"],"de":["Modell-Routing nach Aufgabenkomplexität","Budget-Tracking zur Kostenkontrolle","Wiederholungslogik zur Fehlerbehandlung","Anfrage-Caching zur Arbeitslastreduzierung","Integration mit LLM-APIs wie Claude und GPT"],"pt":["Roteamento de modelo por complexidade de tarefa","Rastreamento de orçamento para controle de custos","Lógica de reintento para garantir a qualidade","Cache de prompt para otimizar o desempenho","Integração com APIs de LLM como Claude e GPT"],"ru":["Маршрутизация модели по сложности задачи","Отслеживание бюджета для контроля затрат","Логика повторных попыток для обеспечения качества","Кэширование подсказки для оптимизации производительности","Интеграция с API LLM, такими как Claude и GPT"],"ar":["مرشح маршروطة النموذج حسب تعقيد المهمة","تحديد الميزانية للسيطرة على التكاليف","منطق إعادة المحاولة لضمان الجودة","ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت للتحفيز لتحسين الأداء","التكامل مع واجهات برمجة تطبيقات LLM مثل Claude و GPT"]},"keywords":{"zh":["智能AI代理","LLM API","成本优化","模型路由","预算跟踪","重试逻辑","提示缓存"],"ja":["AIエージェント","LLM API","コスト最適化","モデルルーティング","予算追跡","再試行ロジック","プロンプトキャッシング"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","LLM API","비용 최적화","모델 라우팅","예산 추적","재시도 로직","프롬프트 캐싱"],"es":["Agentes de IA","Optimización de costos","LLM","APIs de LLM","Enrutamiento de modelos","Seguimiento de presupuesto","Desarrollo de aplicaciones","Técnicas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Agents d''IA","Optimisation de coûts","LLM","API LLM","Routage de modèles","Suivi budgétaire","Développement d''applications","Techniques de développement"],"de":["KI-Agents","Kostenoptimierung","LLM","LLM-APIs","Modell-Routing","Budget-Tracking","Anwendungsentwicklung","Entwicklungstechniken"],"pt":["Ferramentas de IA","Pipeline de LLM","Otimização de custo","API de LLM","Desenvolvimento de software","Tecnologia de IA","Otimização de desempenho","Controle de custos"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","Пайплайн LLM","Оптимизация стоимости","API LLM","Разработка программного обеспечения","Технология ИИ","Оптимизация производительности","Контроль затрат"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ترب#line LLM","تحسين التكلفة","واجهة برمجة تطبيقات LLM","تطوير البرمجيات","تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي","تحسين الأداء","مراقبة التكاليف"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for AI Agents like Claude, AutoGPT, and LangChain requiring optimized LLM API usage with cost control","zh":"适用于Claude、AutoGPT和LangChain等AI代理，需要优化LLM API使用并控制成本","ja":"Claude、AutoGPT、LangChainなどのAIエージェントに適しており、最適化されたLLM APIの使用とコスト制御を必要とする","ko":"Claude, AutoGPT, LangChain 등의 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 최적화된 LLM API 사용 및 비용 제어가 필요한 경우에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA como Claude, AutoGPT y LangChain que requieren un uso optimizado de la API de LLM con control de costos","fr":"Idéal pour les agents IA comme Claude, AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant une utilisation optimisée de l''API LLM avec contrôle des coûts","de":"Ideal für KI-Agents wie Claude, AutoGPT und LangChain, die eine optimierte LLM-API-Nutzung mit Kostenkontrolle erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA como Claude, AutoGPT e LangChain que exigem uso otimizado da API LLM com controle de custos","ru":"Идеально для агентов ИИ, таких как Claude, AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих оптимизированного использования API LLM с контролем затрат","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي مثل Claude و AutoGPT و LangChain الذي يتطلب استخدام API LLM محسّنًا مع التحكم في التكلفة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize LLM API costs through model routing by task complexity, budget tracking, retry logic, and prompt caching, ensuring quality without exceeding budgets, utilizing libraries and protocols for efficient API interactions","zh":"通过任务复杂性路由、预算跟踪、重试逻辑和提示缓存，确保在不超过预算的情况下实现质量，利用库和协议进行高效的API交互","ja":"タスクの複雑性によるルーティング、予算の追跡、リトライロジック、プロンプトのキャッシュを通じて、予算を超えない状態で品質を確保し、ライブラリやプロトコルを利用して効率的なAPIのやりとりを実現する","ko":"작업 복잡성에 따른 라우팅, 예산 추적, 재시도 로직 및 프롬프트 캐싱을 통해 예산을 초과하지 않는 상태에서 품질을 보장하며, 라이브러리 및 프로토콜을 활용하여 효율적인 API 상호 작용을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a optimizar los costos de la API de LLM a través de la enrutamiento de modelos por complejidad de tarea, seguimiento de presupuesto, lógica de reintento y almacenamiento en caché de solicitudes, garantizando la calidad sin exceder los presupuestos, utilizando bibliotecas y protocolos para interactuar con la API de manera eficiente","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les coûts de l''API LLM via l''enrutement de modèles en fonction de la complexité des tâches, le suivi du budget, la logique de réessai et la mise en cache des requêtes, garantissant la qualité sans dépasser les budgets, en utilisant des bibliothèques et des protocoles pour des interactions API efficaces","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, LLM-API-Kosten durch Modell-Routing nach Aufgabenkomplexität, Budget-Verfolgung, Wiederholungslogik und Prompt-Caching zu optimieren, Qualität ohne Budgetüberschreitung sicherzustellen, indem Bibliotheken und Protokolle für effiziente API-Interaktionen verwendet werden","pt":"Permite que os agentes otimizem os custos da API LLM por meio do roteamento de modelos por complexidade de tarefa, rastreamento de orçamento, lógica de repetição e cache de prompts, garantindo a qualidade sem exceder os orçamentos, utilizando bibliotecas e protocolos para interações de API eficientes","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью оптимизировать затраты на API LLM посредством маршрутизации моделей по сложности задач, отслеживания бюджета, логике повторных запросов и кэширования запросов, обеспечивая качество без превышения бюджетов, используя библиотеки и протоколы для эффективного взаимодействия с API","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تحسين تكاليف API LLM من خلال маршруطة النماذج حسب تعقيد المهمة وتتبع الميزانية و منطق إعادة المحاولة وتخزين مؤقت للتحفيز، مع ضمان الجودة دون تجاوز الميزانيات، باستخدام المكتبات والبروتوكولات لتفاعلات API فعالة"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating cost optimization for batches of items with varying complexity","Generating budget-friendly model routing strategies","Implementing retry logic for failed LLM API requests"],"zh":["批量项目的成本优化自动化，项目复杂性各异","生成预算友好的模型路由策略","为失败的LLM API请求实现重试逻辑"],"ja":["複数のアイテムのバッチ処理のコスト最適化の自動化、アイテムの複雑性が異なる場合","予算に優しいモデルルーティング戦略の生成","失敗したLLM APIリクエストのリトライロジックの実装"],"ko":["다양한 복잡성을 가진 항목의 일괄 처리 비용 최적화 자동화","예산 친화적인 모델 라우팅 전략 생성","실패한 LLM API 요청에 대한 재시도 로직 구현"],"es":["Automatización de la optimización de costos para lotes de elementos con complejidad variable","Generación de estrategias de enrutamiento de modelos económicas","Implementación de lógica de reintento para solicitudes de API de LLM fallidas"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''optimisation des coûts pour des lots d''éléments avec complexité variable","Génération de stratégies d''enrutement de modèles économiques","Mise en œuvre de la logique de réessai pour les requêtes d''API LLM ayant échoué"],"de":["Automatisierung der Kostenoptimierung für Chargen von Elementen mit variabler Komplexität","Erzeugung budgetfreundlicher Modell-Routing-Strategien","Implementierung von Wiederholungslogik für fehlgeschlagene LLM-API-Anfragen"],"pt":["Automatizar a otimização de custos para lotes de itens com complexidade variável","Gerar estratégias de roteamento de modelo amigáveis ao orçamento","Implementar lógica de repetição para solicitações de API LLM com falha"],"ru":["Автоматизировать оптимизацию затрат для партий элементов с переменной сложностью","Генерировать стратегии маршрутизации моделей, дружественные к бюджету","Реализовать логику повторных запросов для неудачных запросов к API LLM"],"ar":["أتمتة تحسين التكاليف ل dáv batches من العناصر ذات التعقيد المتغير","إنتاج استراتيجيات маршруطة النموذج الصديقة للميزانية","تنفيذ منطق إعادة المحاولة لطلبات API LLM الفاشلة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires LLM API access","Dependent on task complexity analysis","Budget tracking necessitates access to financial data"],"zh":["需要LLM API访问","依赖于任务复杂性分析","预算跟踪需要访问财务数据"],"ja":["LLM APIへのアクセスが必要","タスクの複雑性分析に依存している","予算の追跡には財務データへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["LLM API 액세스가 필요","작업 복잡성 분석에 의존","예산 추적에는 재무 데이터 액세스가 필요"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de LLM","Dependiente del análisis de complejidad de tarea","El seguimiento del presupuesto requiere acceso a datos financieros"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API LLM","Dépend de l''analyse de la complexité des tâches","Le suivi du budget nécessite un accès aux données financières"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die LLM-API","Abhängig von der Analyse der Aufgabenkomplexität","Budget-Verfolgung erfordert Zugriff auf Finanzdaten"],"pt":["Exige acesso à API LLM","Depende da análise da complexidade da tarefa","O rastreamento de orçamento exige acesso a dados financeiros"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API LLM","Зависит от анализа сложности задач","Отслеживание бюджета требует доступа к финансовым данным"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى API LLM","يعتمد على تحليل تعقيد المهمة","تتبع الميزانية يتطلب الوصول إلى البيانات المالية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"09eb41fdfa081cd09d3843449275d80ae1c56938a459061d4d3faac3b13012cd","repoEtag":"W/\"1d66934774ad40d3d916abf4c33c3e340ab032f8212b35e12a94daa7359886c9\"","qualityScore":89}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/django-security', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'django-security', 55024, 6781, 89, '2026-03-01T05:07:39Z', '2026-03-01T05:10:12.848Z', 'd5d174690a16dca99798693f47b5df17478bfc5ff0f91684caf56dc1e9bef8b5', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/django-security","name":"django-security","description":{"zh":"Django安全最佳实践，用于保护您的应用免受常见漏洞。包括身份验证、授权、CSRF保护、SQL注入防护和XSS防护","ja":"Djangoセキュリティベストプラクティスを使用して、アプリを一般的な脆弱性から保護します。認証、認可、CSRF保護、SQLインジェクション防止、XSS防止が含まれます","ko":"Django 보안 최적화를 사용하여 애플리케이션을 일반적인 취약점으로부터 보호합니다. 인증, 권한 부여, CSRF 보호, SQL 인젝션 방지, XSS 방지가 포함됩니다","es":"Conoce las mejores prácticas de seguridad para Django y cómo utilizar herramientas de Agentes de IA para proteger tus aplicaciones","fr":"Découvrez les meilleures pratiques de sécurité pour Django et comment utiliser les outils d''Agents d''IA pour sécuriser vos applications","de":"Erfahren Sie die besten Sicherheitspraktiken für Django und wie Sie KI-Agenten-Tools verwenden, um Ihre Anwendungen zu schützen","pt":"Melhores práticas de segurança para aplicações Django, incluindo autenticação, autorização e proteção contra vulnerabilidades","ru":"Лучшие практики безопасности для приложений Django, включая аутентификацию, авторизацию и защиту от уязвимостей","ar":"أفضل الممارسات الأمنية لتطبيقات ديانجو، بما في ذلك المصادقة والتفويض والحماية من الثغرات","en":"Django security best practices, authentication, authorization, CSRF protection, SQL injection prevention, XSS prevention, and secure deployment configurations."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":55024,"forks":6781,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:07:39Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"django-security","description":"Django security best practices, authentication, authorization, CSRF protection, SQL injection prevention, XSS prevention, and secure deployment configurations.","bodyPreview":"# Django Security Best Practices\n\nComprehensive security guidelines for Django applications to protect against common vulnerabilities.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Setting up Django authentication and authorization\n- Implementing user permissions and roles\n- Configuring production security settings\n- Reviewing Django application for security issues\n- Deploying Django applications to production\n\n## Core Security Settings\n\n### Production Settings Configuration\n\n```python\n# settings/production.py\nimport","body":"# Django Security Best Practices\n\nComprehensive security guidelines for Django applications to protect against common vulnerabilities.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Setting up Django authentication and authorization\n- Implementing user permissions and roles\n- Configuring production security settings\n- Reviewing Django application for security issues\n- Deploying Django applications to production\n\n## Core Security Settings\n\n### Production Settings Configuration\n\n```python\n# settings/production.py\nimport os\n\nDEBUG = False  # CRITICAL: Never use True in production\n\nALLOWED_HOSTS = os.environ.get(''ALLOWED_HOSTS'', '''').split('','')\n\n# Security headers\nSECURE_SSL_REDIRECT = True\nSESSION_COOKIE_SECURE = True\nCSRF_COOKIE_SECURE = True\nSECURE_HSTS_SECONDS = 31536000  # 1 year\nSECURE_HSTS_INCLUDE_SUBDOMAINS = True\nSECURE_HSTS_PRELOAD = True\nSECURE_CONTENT_TYPE_NOSNIFF = True\nSECURE_BROWSER_XSS_FILTER = True\nX_FRAME_OPTIONS = ''DENY''\n\n# HTTPS and Cookies\nSESSION_COOKIE_HTTPONLY = True\nCSRF_COOKIE_HTTPONLY = True\nSESSION_COOKIE_SAMESITE = ''Lax''\nCSRF_COOKIE_SAMESITE = ''Lax''\n\n# Secret key (must be set via environment variable)\nSECRET_KEY = os.environ.get(''DJANGO_SECRET_KEY'')\nif not SECRET_KEY:\n    raise ImproperlyConfigured(''DJANGO_SECRET_KEY environment variable is required'')\n\n# Password validation\nAUTH_PASSWORD_VALIDATORS = [\n    {\n        ''NAME'': ''django.contrib.auth.password_validation.UserAttributeSimilarityValidator'',\n    },\n    {\n        ''NAME'': ''django.contrib.auth.password_validation.MinimumLengthValidator'',\n        ''OPTIONS'': {\n            ''min_length'': 12,\n        }\n    },\n    {\n        ''NAME'': ''django.contrib.auth.password_validation.CommonPasswordValidator'',\n    },\n    {\n        ''NAME'': ''django.contrib.auth.password_validation.NumericPasswordValidator'',\n    },\n]\n```\n\n## Authentication\n\n### Custom User Model\n\n```python\n# apps/users/models.py\nfrom django.contrib.auth.models import AbstractUser\nfrom django.db import models\n\nclass User(AbstractUser):\n    \"\"\"Custom user model for better security.\"\"\"\n\n    email = models.EmailField(unique=True)\n    phone = models.CharField(max_length=20, blank=True)\n\n    USERNAME_FIELD = ''email''  # Use email as username\n    REQUIRED_FIELDS = [''username'']\n\n    class Meta:\n        db_table = ''users''\n        verbose_name = ''User''\n        verbose_name_plural = ''Users''\n\n    def __str__(self):\n        return self.email\n\n# settings/base.py\nAUTH_USER_MODEL = ''users.User''\n```\n\n### Password Hashing\n\n```python\n# Django uses PBKDF2 by default. For stronger security:\nPASSWORD_HASHERS = [\n    ''django.contrib.auth.hashers.Argon2PasswordHasher'',\n    ''django.contrib.auth.hashers.PBKDF2PasswordHasher'',\n    ''django.contrib.auth.hashers.PBKDF2SHA1PasswordHasher'',\n    ''django.contrib.auth.hashers.BCryptSHA256PasswordHasher'',\n]\n```\n\n### Session Management\n\n```python\n# Session configuration\nSESSION_ENGINE = ''django.contrib.sessions.backends.cache''  # Or ''db''\nSESSION_CACHE_ALIAS = ''default''\nSESSION_COOKIE_AGE = 3600 * 24 * 7  # 1 week\nSESSION_SAVE_EVERY_REQUEST = False\nSESSION_EXPIRE_AT_BROWSER_CLOSE = False  # Better UX, but less secure\n```\n\n## Authorization\n\n### Permissions\n\n```python\n# models.py\nfrom django.db import models\nfrom django.contrib.auth.models import Permission\n\nclass Post(models.Model):\n    title = models.CharField(max_length=200)\n    content = models.TextField()\n    author = models.ForeignKey(User, on_delete=models.CASCADE)\n\n    class Meta:\n        permissions = [\n            (''can_publish'', ''Can publish posts''),\n            (''can_edit_others'', ''Can edit posts of others''),\n        ]\n\n    def user_can_edit(self, user):\n        \"\"\"Check if user can edit this post.\"\"\"\n        return self.author == user or user.has_perm(''app.can_edit_others'')\n\n# views.py\nfrom django.contrib.auth.mixins import LoginRequiredMixin, PermissionRequiredMixin\nfrom django.views.generic import UpdateView\n\nclass PostUpdateView(LoginRequiredMixin, PermissionRequiredMixin, UpdateView):\n    model = Post\n    permission_required = ''app.can_edit_others''\n    raise_exception = True  # Return 403 instead of redirect\n\n    def get_queryset(self):\n        \"\"\"Only allow users to edit their own posts.\"\"\"\n        return Post.objects.filter(author=self.request.user)\n```\n\n### Custom Permissions\n\n```python\n# permissions.py\nfrom rest_framework import permissions\n\nclass IsOwnerOrReadOnly(permissions.BasePermission):\n    \"\"\"Allow only owners to edit objects.\"\"\"\n\n    def has_object_permission(self, request, view, obj):\n        # Read permissions allowed for any request\n        if request.method in permissions.SAFE_METHODS:\n            return True\n\n        # Write permissions only for owner\n        return obj.author == request.user\n\nclass IsAdminOrReadOnly(permissions.BasePermission):\n    \"\"\"Allow admins to do anything, others read-only.\"\"\"\n\n    def has_permission(self, request, view):\n        if request.method in permissions.SAFE_METHODS:\n            return True\n        return request.user and request.user.is_staff\n\nclass IsVerifiedUser(permissions.BasePermission):\n    \"\"\"Allow only verified users.\"\"\"\n\n    def has_permission(self, request, view):\n        return request.user and request.user.is_authenticated and request.user.is_verified\n```\n\n### Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)\n\n```python\n# models.py\nfrom django.contrib.auth.models import AbstractUser, Group\n\nclass User(AbstractUser):\n    ROLE_CHOICES = [\n        (''admin'', ''Administrator''),\n        (''moderator'', ''Moderator''),\n        (''user'', ''Regular User''),\n    ]\n    role = models.CharField(max_length=20, choices=ROLE_CHOICES, default=''user'')\n\n    def is_admin(self):\n        return self.role == ''admin'' or self.is_superuser\n\n    def is_moderator(self):\n        return self.role in [''admin'', ''moderator'']\n\n# Mixins\nclass AdminRequiredMixin:\n    \"\"\"Mixin to require admin role.\"\"\"\n\n    def dispatch(self, request, *args, **kwargs):\n        if not request.user.is_authenticated or not request.user.is_admin():\n            from django.core.exceptions import PermissionDenied\n            raise PermissionDenied\n        return super().dispatch(request, *args, **kwargs)\n```\n\n## SQL Injection Prevention\n\n### Django ORM Protection\n\n```python\n# GOOD: Django ORM automatically escapes parameters\ndef get_user(username):\n    return User.objects.get(username=username)  # Safe\n\n# GOOD: Using parameters with raw()\ndef search_users(query):\n    return User.objects.raw(''SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = %s'', [query])\n\n# BAD: Never directly interpolate user input\ndef get_user_bad(username):\n    return User.objects.raw(f''SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = {username}'')  # VULNERABLE!\n\n# GOOD: Using filter with proper escaping\ndef get_users_by_email(email):\n    return User.objects.filter(email__iexact=email)  # Safe\n\n# GOOD: Using Q objects for complex queries\nfrom django.db.models import Q\ndef search_users_complex(query):\n    return User.objects.filter(\n        Q(username__icontains=query) |\n        Q(email__icontains=query)\n    )  # Safe\n```\n\n### Extra Security with raw()\n\n```python\n# If you must use raw SQL, always use parameters\nUser.objects.raw(\n    ''SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = %s AND status = %s'',\n    [user_input_email, status]\n)\n```\n\n## XSS Prevention\n\n### Template Escaping\n\n```django\n{# Django auto-escapes variables by default - SAFE #}\n{{ user_input }}  {# Escaped HTML #}\n\n{# Explicitly mark safe only for trusted content #}\n{{ trusted_html|safe }}  {# Not escaped #}\n\n{# Use template filters for safe HTML #}\n{{ user_input|escape }}  {# Same as default #}\n{{ user_input|striptags }}  {# Remove all HTML tags #}\n\n{# JavaScript escaping #}\n<script>\n    var username = {{ username|escapejs }};\n</script>\n```\n\n### Safe String Handling\n\n```python\nfrom django.utils.safestring import mark_safe\nfrom django.utils.html import escape\n\n# BAD: Never mark user input as safe without escaping\ndef render_bad(user_input):\n    return mark_safe(user_input)  # VULNERABLE!\n\n# GOOD: Escape first, then mark safe\ndef render_good(user_input):\n    return mark_safe(escape(user_input))\n\n# GOOD: Use format_html for HTML with variables\nfrom django.utils.html import format_html\n\ndef greet_user(username):\n    return format_html(''<span class=\"user\">{}</span>'', escape(username))\n```\n\n### HTTP Headers\n\n```python\n# settings.py\nSECURE_CONTENT_TYPE_NOSNIFF = True  # Prevent MIME sniffing\nSECURE_BROWSER_XSS_FILTER = True  # Enable XSS filter\nX_FRAME_OPTIONS = ''DENY''  # Prevent clickjacking\n\n# Custom middleware\nfrom django.conf import settings\n\nclass SecurityHeaderMiddleware:\n    def __init__(self, get_response):\n        self.get_response = get_response\n\n    def __call__(self, request):\n        response = self.get_response(request)\n        response[''X-Content-Type-Options''] = ''nosniff''\n        response[''X-Frame-Options''] = ''DENY''\n        response[''X-XSS-Protection''] = ''1; mode=block''\n        response[''Content-Security-Policy''] = \"default-src ''self''\"\n        return response\n```\n\n## CSRF Protection\n\n### Default CSRF Protection\n\n```python\n# settings.py - CSRF is enabled by default\nCSRF_COOKIE_SECURE = True  # Only send over HTTPS\nCSRF_COOKIE_HTTPONLY = True  # Prevent JavaScript access\nCSRF_COOKIE_SAMESITE = ''Lax''  # Prevent CSRF in some cases\nCSRF_TRUSTED_ORIGINS = [''https://example.com'']  # Trusted domains\n\n# Template usage\n<form method=\"post\">\n    {% csrf_token %}\n    {{ form.as_p }}\n    <button type=\"submit\">Submit</button>\n</form>\n\n# AJAX requests\nfunction getCookie(name) {\n    let cookieValue = null;\n    if (document.cookie && document.cookie !== '''') {\n        const cookies = document.cookie.split('';'');\n        for (let i = 0; i < cookies.length; i++) {\n            const cookie = cookies[i].trim();\n            if (cookie.substring(0, name.length + 1) === (name + ''='')) {\n                cookieValue = decodeURIComponent(cookie.substring(name.length + 1));\n                break;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    return cookieValue;\n}\n\nfetch(''/api/endpoint/'', {\n    method: ''POST'',\n    headers: {\n        ''X-CSRFToken'': getCookie(''csrftoken''),\n        ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'',\n    },\n    body: JSON.stringify(data)\n});\n```\n\n### Exempting Views (Use Carefully)\n\n```python\nfrom django.views.decorators.csrf import csrf_exempt\n\n@csrf_exempt  # Only use when absolutely necessary!\ndef webhook_view(request):\n    # Webhook from external service\n    pass\n```\n\n## File Upload Security\n\n### File Validation\n\n```python\nimport os\nfrom django.core.exceptions import ValidationError\n\ndef validate_file_extension(value):\n    \"\"\"Validate file extension.\"\"\"\n    ext = os.path.splitext(value.name)[1]\n    valid_extensions = [''.jpg'', ''.jpeg'', ''.png'', ''.gif'', ''.pdf'']\n    if not ext.lower() in valid_extensions:\n        raise ValidationError(''Unsupported file extension.'')\n\ndef validate_file_size(value):\n    \"\"\"Validate file size (max 5MB).\"\"\"\n    filesize = value.size\n    if filesize > 5 * 1024 * 1024:\n        raise ValidationError(''File too large. Max size is 5MB.'')\n\n# models.py\nclass Document(models.Model):\n    file = models.FileField(\n        upload_to=''documents/'',\n        validators=[validate_file_extension, validate_file_size]\n    )\n```\n\n### Secure File Storage\n\n```python\n# settings.py\nMEDIA_ROOT = ''/var/www/media/''\nMEDIA_URL = ''/media/''\n\n# Use a separate domain for media in production\nMEDIA_DOMAIN = ''https://media.example.com''\n\n# Don''t serve user uploads directly\n# Use whitenoise or a CDN for static files\n# Use a separate server or S3 for media files\n```\n\n## API Security\n\n### Rate Limiting\n\n```python\n# settings.py\nREST_FRAMEWORK = {\n    ''DEFAULT_THROTTLE_CLASSES'': [\n        ''rest_framework.throttling.AnonRateThrottle'',\n        ''rest_framework.throttling.UserRateThrottle''\n    ],\n    ''DEFAULT_THROTTLE_RATES'': {\n        ''anon'': ''100/day'',\n        ''user'': ''1000/day'',\n        ''upload'': ''10/hour'',\n    }\n}\n\n# Custom throttle\nfrom rest_framework.throttling import UserRateThrottle\n\nclass BurstRateThrottle(UserRateThrottle):\n    scope = ''burst''\n    rate = ''60/min''\n\nclass SustainedRateThrottle(UserRateThrottle):\n    scope = ''sustained''\n    rate = ''1000/day''\n```\n\n### Authentication for APIs\n\n```python\n# settings.py\nREST_FRAMEWORK = {\n    ''DEFAULT_AUTHENTICATION_CLASSES'': [\n        ''rest_framework.authentication.TokenAuthentication'',\n        ''rest_framework.authentication.SessionAuthentication'',\n        ''rest_framework_simplejwt.authentication.JWTAuthentication'',\n    ],\n    ''DEFAULT_PERMISSION_CLASSES'': [\n        ''rest_framework.permissions.IsAuthenticated'',\n    ],\n}\n\n# views.py\nfrom rest_framework.decorators import api_view, permission_classes\nfrom rest_framework.permissions import IsAuthenticated\n\n@api_view([''GET'', ''POST''])\n@permission_classes([IsAuthenticated])\ndef protected_view(request):\n    return Response({''message'': ''You are authenticated''})\n```\n\n## Security Headers\n\n### Content Security Policy\n\n```python\n# settings.py\nCSP_DEFAULT_SRC = \"''self''\"\nCSP_SCRIPT_SRC = \"''self'' https://cdn.example.com\"\nCSP_STYLE_SRC = \"''self'' ''unsafe-inline''\"\nCSP_IMG_SRC = \"''self'' data: https:\"\nCSP_CONNECT_SRC = \"''self'' https://api.example.com\"\n\n# Middleware\nclass CSPMiddleware:\n    def __init__(self, get_response):\n        self.get_response = get_response\n\n    def __call__(self, request):\n        response = self.get_response(request)\n        response[''Content-Security-Policy''] = (\n            f\"default-src {CSP_DEFAULT_SRC}; \"\n            f\"script-src {CSP_SCRIPT_SRC}; \"\n            f\"style-src {CSP_STYLE_SRC}; \"\n            f\"img-src {CSP_IMG_SRC}; \"\n            f\"connect-src {CSP_CONNECT_SRC}\"\n        )\n        return response\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n\n### Managing Secrets\n\n```python\n# Use python-decouple or django-environ\nimport environ\n\nenv = environ.Env(\n    # set casting, default value\n    DEBUG=(bool, False)\n)\n\n# reading .env file\nenviron.Env.read_env()\n\nSECRET_KEY = env(''DJANGO_SECRET_KEY'')\nDATABASE_URL = env(''DATABASE_URL'')\nALLOWED_HOSTS = env.list(''ALLOWED_HOSTS'')\n\n# .env file (never commit this)\nDEBUG=False\nSECRET_KEY=your-secret-key-here\nDATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@localhost:5432/dbname\nALLOWED_HOSTS=example.com,www.example.com\n```\n\n## Logging Security Events\n\n```python\n# settings.py\nLOGGING = {\n    ''version'': 1,\n    ''disable_existing_loggers'': False,\n    ''handlers'': {\n        ''file'': {\n            ''level'': ''WARNING'',\n            ''class'': ''logging.FileHandler'',\n            ''filename'': ''/var/log/django/security.log'',\n        },\n        ''console'': {\n            ''level'': ''INFO'',\n            ''class'': ''logging.StreamHandler'',\n        },\n    },\n    ''loggers'': {\n        ''django.security'': {\n            ''handlers'': [''file'', ''console''],\n            ''level'': ''WARNING'',\n            ''propagate'': True,\n        },\n        ''django.request'': {\n            ''handlers'': [''file''],\n            ''level'': ''ERROR'',\n            ''propagate'': False,\n        },\n    },\n}\n```\n\n## Quick Security Checklist\n\n| Check | Description |\n|-------|-------------|\n| `DEBUG = False` | Never run with DEBUG in production |\n| HTTPS only | Force SSL, secure cookies |\n| Strong secrets | Use environment variables for SECRET_KEY |\n| Password validation | Enable all password validators |\n| CSRF protection | Enabled by default, don''t disable |\n| XSS prevention | Django auto-escapes, don''t use `&#124;safe` with user input |\n| SQL injection | Use ORM, never concatenate strings in queries |\n| File uploads | Validate file type and size |\n| Rate limiting | Throttle API endpoints |\n| Security headers | CSP, X-Frame-Options, HSTS |\n| Logging | Log security events |\n| Updates | Keep Django and dependencies updated |\n\nRemember: Security is a process, not a product. Regularly review and update your security practices.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:10:12.848Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"Django 安全最佳实践 - AI智能工具","ja":"Django セキュリティベストプラクティス - AIエージェント","ko":"Django 보안 최적화 - AI 에이전트","es":"Herramientas de seguridad Django con Agentes de IA","fr":"Outils de sécurité Django avec Agents d''IA","de":"Django-Sicherheitstools mit KI-Agenten","pt":"Melhores Práticas de Segurança Django com Ferramentas de IA","ru":"Найти ИИ Агенты для Безопасности Django","ar":"أفضل ممارسات أمن ديانجو مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"django-security"},"description":{"zh":"Django安全最佳实践，用于保护您的应用免受常见漏洞。包括身份验证、授权、CSRF保护、SQL注入防护和XSS防护","ja":"Djangoセキュリティベストプラクティスを使用して、アプリを一般的な脆弱性から保護します。認証、認可、CSRF保護、SQLインジェクション防止、XSS防止が含まれます","ko":"Django 보안 최적화를 사용하여 애플리케이션을 일반적인 취약점으로부터 보호합니다. 인증, 권한 부여, CSRF 보호, SQL 인젝션 방지, XSS 방지가 포함됩니다","es":"Conoce las mejores prácticas de seguridad para Django y cómo utilizar herramientas de Agentes de IA para proteger tus aplicaciones","fr":"Découvrez les meilleures pratiques de sécurité pour Django et comment utiliser les outils d''Agents d''IA pour sécuriser vos applications","de":"Erfahren Sie die besten Sicherheitspraktiken für Django und wie Sie KI-Agenten-Tools verwenden, um Ihre Anwendungen zu schützen","pt":"Melhores práticas de segurança para aplicações Django, incluindo autenticação, autorização e proteção contra vulnerabilidades","ru":"Лучшие практики безопасности для приложений Django, включая аутентификацию, авторизацию и защиту от уязвимостей","ar":"أفضل الممارسات الأمنية لتطبيقات ديانجو، بما في ذلك المصادقة والتفويض والحماية من الثغرات","en":"Django security best practices, authentication, authorization, CSRF protection, SQL injection prevention, XSS prevention, and secure deployment configurations."},"definition":{"en":"Django security best practices, authentication, authorization, CSRF protection, SQL injection prevention, XSS prevention, and secure deployment configurations."},"features":{"zh":["身份验证和授权","CSRF保护","SQL注入防护","XSS防护","生产安全设置配置"],"ja":["認証と認可","CSRF保護","SQLインジェクション防止","XSS防止","生産性の高いセキュリティ設定の構成"],"ko":["인증 및 권한 부여","CSRF 보호","SQL 인젝션 방지","XSS 방지","생산성 높은 보안 설정 구성"],"es":["Autenticación y autorización de Django","Protección contra CSRF y SQL injection","Prevención de XSS y configuraciones de seguridad de producción","Revisión de aplicaciones Django para problemas de seguridad","Implementación de permisos y roles de usuario"],"fr":["Authentification et autorisation de Django","Protection contre les attaques CSRF et les injections SQL","Prévention des XSS et configurations de sécurité de production","Révision des applications Django pour les problèmes de sécurité","Mise en œuvre des permissions et des rôles d''utilisateur"],"de":["Django-Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Schutz vor CSRF- und SQL-Injection-Angriffen","Verhinderung von XSS und Produktions-Sicherheitseinstellungen","Überprüfung von Django-Anwendungen auf Sicherheitsprobleme","Implementierung von Benutzerberechtigungen und -rollen"],"pt":["Autenticação e autorização","Proteção contra CSRF e injeção SQL","Prevenção de XSS e configurações de segurança","Implementação de permissões e papéis de usuário","Configuração de produção e revisão de segurança"],"ru":["Аутентификация и авторизация","Защита от CSRF и внедрения SQL","Предотвращение XSS и настройки безопасности","Реализация разрешений и ролей пользователей","Настройка производства и проверка безопасности"],"ar":["المصادقة والتفويض","حماية ضد CSRF والحقن SQL","منع XSS وتكوين أمان","تنفيذ صلاحيات وأدوار المستخدم","تكوين الإنتاج والمراجعة الأمنية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Django安全","AI智能工具","身份验证","授权","CSRF保护","SQL注入防护","XSS防护"],"ja":["Djangoセキュリティ","AIエージェント","認証","認可","CSRF保護","SQLインジェクション防止","XSS防止"],"ko":["Django 보안","AI 에이전트","인증","권한 부여","CSRF 보호","SQL 인젝션 방지","XSS 방지"],"es":["seguridad Django","Agentes de IA","herramientas de desarrollo","autenticación y autorización","protección contra vulnerabilidades","despliegue seguro de aplicaciones"],"fr":["sécurité Django","Agents d''IA","outils de développement","authentification et autorisation","protection contre les vulnérabilités","déploiement sécurisé d''applications"],"de":["Django-Sicherheit","KI-Agenten","Entwicklungstools","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Schutz vor Schwachstellen","sichere Bereitstellung von Anwendungen"],"pt":["Django security","Ferramentas de IA","Desenvolvimento de aplicações","Segurança de aplicações","Autenticação e autorização","Proteção contra vulnerabilidades"],"ru":["Безопасность Django","ИИ Агенты","Разработка приложений","Безопасность приложений","Аутентификация и авторизация","Защита от уязвимостей"],"ar":["أمن ديانجو","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير التطبيقات","أمان التطبيقات","المصادقة والتفويض","حماية من الثغرات"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Backend Security Agents specializing in Django application hardening and vulnerability prevention.","zh":"非常适合专门从事Django应用程序加固和漏洞防御的后端安全代理。","ja":"Djangoアプリケーションの強化と脆弱性防止に特化したバックエンドセキュリティエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Django 애플리케이션의 강화 및 취약점 방지에 전문적인 백엔드 보안 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Seguridad de Backend que se especializan en endurecimiento de aplicaciones Django y prevención de vulnerabilidades.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Sécurité Backend spécialisés dans le durcissement des applications Django et la prévention des vulnérabilités.","de":"Perfekt für Backend-Sicherheitsagenten, die sich auf die Verhärtung von Django-Anwendungen und die Verhinderung von Schwachstellen spezialisieren.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Segurança de Backend especializados em endurecimento de aplicações Django e prevenção de vulnerabilidades.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов безопасности бэкенда, специализирующихся на укреплении приложений Django и предотвращении уязвимостей.","ar":"مثالي لعميل أمن الخلفية الذين يختصون في تقوية تطبيقات Django ومنع الثغرات الأمنية."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement comprehensive Django security configurations including CSRF protection, SQL injection prevention, XSS safeguards, and production deployment hardening. Provides specific guidance on authentication systems, authorization protocols, and secure settings management for Django environments.","zh":"赋予代理实现全面的Django安全配置，包括CSRF保护、SQL注入防止、XSS防护和生产环境加固。为Django环境中的身份验证系统、授权协议和安全设置管理提供具体的指导。","ja":"エージェントがCSRF保護、SQLインジェクション防止、XSS対策、および生産環境の強化を含む包括的なDjangoセキュリティ設定を実装できるようにします。Django環境の認証システム、認可プロトコル、およびセキュアな設定管理について具体的なガイダンスを提供します。","ko":"에이전트가 CSRF 보호, SQL 인젝션 방지, XSS 방어 및 프로덕션 환경 강화 등을 포함한 종합적인 Django 보안 구성 구현을 가능하게 합니다. Django 환경의 인증 시스템, 승인 프로토콜 및 보안 설정 관리에 대한 구체적인 지침을 제공합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar configuraciones de seguridad de Django integrales, incluyendo protección contra CSRF, prevención de inyección SQL, salvaguardias XSS y endurecimiento de la implementación de producción. Proporciona orientación específica sobre sistemas de autenticación, protocolos de autorización y gestión de configuraciones seguras para entornos de Django.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des configurations de sécurité Django complètes, y compris la protection contre les attaques CSRF, la prévention des injections SQL, les sauvegardes XSS et le durcissement du déploiement de production. Fournit des conseils spécifiques sur les systèmes d''authentification, les protocoles d''autorisation et la gestion des paramètres de sécurité pour les environnements Django.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Django-Sicherheitskonfigurationen zu implementieren, einschließlich CSRF-Schutz, SQL-Injektionsverhinderung, XSS-Sicherheitsmaßnahmen und Produktionshärte. Bietet spezifische Anleitung zu Authentifizierungssystemen, Autorisierungsprotokollen und sicherer Konfigurationsverwaltung für Django-Umgebungen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar configurações de segurança Django abrangentes, incluindo proteção contra CSRF, prevenção de injeção de SQL, salvaguardas contra XSS e endurecimento de implantação em produção. Fornece orientação específica sobre sistemas de autenticação, protocolos de autorização e gerenciamento de configurações seguras para ambientes Django.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать комплексные конфигурации безопасности Django, включая защиту от CSRF, предотвращение внедрения SQL, защиту от XSS и укрепление развертывания в производственной среде. Предоставляет конкретные рекомендации по системам аутентификации, протоколам авторизации и безопасному управлению настройками для сред Django.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من تنفيذ إعدادات أمن شاملة لتطبيقات Django، بما في ذلك حماية CSRF و منع الحقن SQL و حماية XSS و تقوية التثبيت في بيئة الإنتاج. يقدم إرشادات محددة حول أنظمة التحقق و بروتوكولات التصريح وإدارة الإعدادات الآمنة لتطبيقات Django."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing Django authentication systems","Configuring production security settings","Preventing SQL injection vulnerabilities","Deploying hardened Django applications","Reviewing Django apps for security compliance"],"zh":["实现Django身份验证系统","配置生产安全设置","防止SQL注入漏洞","部署加固的Django应用程序","审查Django应用程序的安全合规性"],"ja":["Django認証システムの実装","生産環境のセキュリティ設定の構成","SQLインジェクション脆弱性の防止","強化されたDjangoアプリケーションのデプロイ","Djangoアプリケーションのセキュリティコンプライアンスのレビュー"],"ko":["Django 인증 시스템 구현","프로덕션 보안 설정 구성","SQL 인젝션 취약점 방지","강화된 Django 애플리케이션 배포","Django 애플리케이션의 보안 컴플라이언스 검토"],"es":["Implementación de sistemas de autenticación Django","Configuración de la seguridad de producción","Prevención de vulnerabilidades de inyección SQL","Implementación de aplicaciones Django endurecidas","Revisión de aplicaciones Django para cumplimiento de seguridad"],"fr":["Mise en œuvre des systèmes d''authentification Django","Configuration des paramètres de sécurité de production","Prévention des vulnérabilités d''injection SQL","Déploiement d''applications Django durcies","Révision des applications Django pour le respect de la sécurité"],"de":["Implementierung von Django-Authentifizierungssystemen","Konfiguration der Produktionssicherheit","Verhinderung von SQL-Injektions-Schwachstellen","Bereitstellung gehärteter Django-Anwendungen","Überprüfung von Django-Apps auf Sicherheitskonformität"],"pt":["Implementação de sistemas de autenticação Django","Configuração de configurações de segurança de produção","Prevenção de vulnerabilidades de injeção de SQL","Implantação de aplicações Django endurecidas","Revisão de aplicativos Django para conformidade de segurança"],"ru":["Реализация систем аутентификации Django","Настройка параметров безопасности производственной среды","Предотвращение уязвимостей внедрения SQL","Развертывание укрепленных приложений Django","Проверка приложений Django на соответствие требованиям безопасности"],"ar":["تنفيذ أنظمة التحقق من Django","تكوين إعدادات أمن ا