eywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","后端开发模式","REST API","GraphQL API","数据库优化","服务器端最佳实践","Node.js","Express","Next.js"],"ja":["AIエージェント","バックエンド開発パターン","REST API","GraphQL API","データベース最適化","サーバーサイドのベストプラクティス","Node.js","Express","Next.js"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","백엔드 개발 패턴","REST API","GraphQL API","데이터베이스 최적화","서버사이드의 베스트 프랙티스","Node.js","Express","Next.js"],"es":["patrones de backend","AI Agentes","Node.js","Express","Next.js","diseño de API","optimización de bases de datos","desarrollo de servidor"],"fr":["modèles de backend","Outils IA","Node.js","Express","Next.js","conception d''API","optimisation de bases de données","développement de serveur"],"de":["Backend-Muster","AI-Tools","Node.js","Express","Next.js","API-Entwurf","Datenbankoptimierung","Server-Entwicklung"],"pt":["desenvolvimento backend","padrões de arquitetura","design de API","otimização de banco de dados","Node.js","Express","Next.js","ferramentas de IA"],"ru":["backend-разработка","шаблоны архитектуры","дизайн API","оптимизация базы данных","Node.js","Express","Next.js","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["تطوير الخلفية","نماذج هندسة","تصميم واجهة برمجة التطبيقات","تحسين قاعدة البيانات","Node.js","Express","Next.js","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Node.js Agents requiring scalable backend architecture patterns and optimized API designs.","zh":"适合需要可扩展的后端架构模式和优化的API设计的Node.js代理。","ja":"Node.jsエージェントがスケーラブルなバックエンドアーキテクチャパターンと最適化されたAPIデザインを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"Node.js 에이전트가 확장 가능한 백엔드 아키텍처 패턴과 최적화된 API 디자인을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Node.js que requieren patrones de arquitectura de backend escalables y diseños de API optimizados.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Node.js nécessitant des modèles d''architecture de backend évolutifs et des conceptions d''API optimisées.","de":"Ideal für Node.js-Agents, die skalierbare Backend-Architekturmuster und optimierte API-Entwürfe erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Node.js que exigem padrões de arquitetura de backend escaláveis e projetos de API otimizados.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Node.js, требующих масштабируемых шаблонов архитектуры бэкэнда и оптимизированного дизайна API.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء Node.js الذين يتطلبون أنماطًا قابلة للتحجيم للهيكل الخلفي وتصميمات API محسنة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to design efficient REST and GraphQL API endpoints, leveraging Express and Next.js for optimized server-side performance, and implementing best practices for database optimization, caching, and error handling using Redis and HTTP cache headers.","zh":"赋予代理设计高效的REST和GraphQL API端点的能力，利用Express和Next.js实现优化的服务器端性能，并使用Redis和HTTP缓存头实现数据库优化、缓存和错误处理的最佳实践。","ja":"エージェントが効率的なRESTおよびGraphQL APIエンドポイントを設計する能力を提供します。ExpressとNext.jsを使用して最適化されたサーバーサイドパフォーマンスを実現し、RedisとHTTPキャッシュヘッダーを使用してデータベースの最適化、キャッシング、エラーハンドリングのベストプラクティスを実装します。","ko":"에이전트가 효율적인 REST 및 GraphQL API 엔드포인트를 설계할 수 있는 능력을 제공하며, Express 및 Next.js를 사용하여 최적화된 서버 측 성능을 달성하고, Redis 및 HTTP 캐시 헤더를 사용하여 데이터베이스 최적화, 캐싱 및 오류 처리의 모범 사례를 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a diseñar puntos finales de API REST y GraphQL eficientes, aprovechando Express y Next.js para un rendimiento optimizado del lado del servidor, e implementando las mejores prácticas para la optimización de bases de datos, el almacenamiento en caché y el manejo de errores utilizando Redis y encabezados de caché HTTP.","fr":"Permet aux agents de concevoir des points de terminaison d''API REST et GraphQL efficaces, en exploitant Express et Next.js pour des performances optimisées côté serveur, et en mettant en œuvre les meilleures pratiques pour l''optimisation des bases de données, le cache et la gestion des erreurs en utilisant Redis et les en-têtes de cache HTTP.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, effiziente REST- und GraphQL-API-Endpunkte zu entwerfen, indem sie Express und Next.js für optimierte Serverleistung nutzen und bewährte Verfahren für die Datenbankoptimierung, das Caching und die Fehlerbehandlung mit Redis und HTTP-Cache-Headern implementieren.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a projetar pontos de extremidade de API REST e GraphQL eficientes, aproveitando o Express e o Next.js para desempenho otimizado no lado do servidor e implementando as melhores práticas para otimização de banco de dados, cache e tratamento de erros usando Redis e cabeçalhos de cache HTTP.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проектировать эффективные точки REST и GraphQL API, используя Express и Next.js для оптимизированной производительности на стороне сервера, и реализуя лучшие практики для оптимизации базы данных, кэширования и обработки ошибок с помощью Redis и заголовков кэша HTTP.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تصميم نهايات نقطة REST وGraphQL الفعالة، واستخدام Express وNext.js لأداء الخادم المحسّن، وتنفيذ أفضل الممارسات لتحسين قاعدة البيانات والแคش ومعالجة الأخطاء باستخدام Redis ورؤوس كैश HTTP."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing scalable API routes for high-traffic applications","Implementing repository and service layers for data access and manipulation","Optimizing database queries using indexing, connection pooling, and N+1 query prevention"],"zh":["为高流量应用程序设计可扩展的API路由","实现存储库和服务层以访问和操作数据","使用索引、连接池和N+1查询防止优化数据库查询"],"ja":["高トラフィックアプリケーション用のスケーラブルなAPIルートを設計する","データへのアクセスと操作のためのリポジトリとサービス層を実装する","インデックス、接続プール、N+1クエリ防止を使用してデータベースクエリを最適化する"],"ko":["고부하 애플리케이션을 위한 확장 가능한 API 루트 설계","데이터 액세스 및 조작을 위한 저장소 및 서비스 계층 구현","인덱싱, 연결 풀링 및 N+1 쿼리 방지를 사용하여 데이터베이스 쿼리 최적화"],"es":["Diseñar rutas de API escalables para aplicaciones de alto tráfico","Implementar capas de repositorio y servicio para el acceso y la manipulación de datos","Optimizar consultas de base de datos utilizando indexación, agrupación de conexiones y prevención de consultas N+1"],"fr":["Concevoir des routes d''API évolutives pour les applications à trafic élevé","Mettre en œuvre des couches de référentiel et de service pour l''accès et la manipulation des données","Optimiser les requêtes de base de données en utilisant l''indexation, le regroupement de connexions et la prévention des requêtes N+1"],"de":["Entwerfen von skalierbaren API-Routen für Anwendungen mit hohem Datenverkehr","Implementieren von Repository- und Dienstschichten für den Datenzugriff und die Datemanipulation","Optimieren von Datenbankabfragen unter Verwendung von Indexierung, Verbindungspooling und Vermeidung von N+1-Abfragen"],"pt":["Projetar rotas de API escaláveis para aplicações de alto tráfego","Implementar camadas de repositório e serviço para acesso e manipulação de dados","Otimizar consultas de banco de dados usando indexação, pooling de conexões e prevenção de consultas N+1"],"ru":["Проектировать масштабируемые маршруты API для приложений с высоким трафиком","Реализовывать слои репозитория и сервиса для доступа и манипулирования данными","Оптимизировать запросы к базе данных с помощью индексации, пулинга соединений и предотвращения запросов N+1"],"ar":["تصميم مسارات API قابلة للتحجيم لتطبيقات حركة المرور الكبيرة","تنفيذ طبقات المستودع والخدمة للوصول إلى البيانات وتنويعها","تحسين استفسارات قاعدة البيانات باستخدام الفهارس وجمع الاتصالات ومنع استفسارات N+1"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Node.js environment","Specific to Express and Next.js frameworks","Database optimization limited to Node.js compatible databases"],"zh":["需要Node.js环境","特定于Express和Next.js框架","数据库优化仅限于Node.js兼容数据库"],"ja":["Node.js環境が必要","ExpressとNext.jsフレームワークに特有","データベースの最適化はNode.jsと互換性のあるデータベースに限られる"],"ko":["Node.js 환경이 필요합니다.","Express 및 Next.js 프레임워크에 특정합니다.","데이터베이스 최적화는 Node.js와 호환되는 데이터베이스에만 제한됩니다."],"es":["Requiere entorno de Node.js","Específico para los frameworks Express y Next.js","La optimización de la base de datos está limitada a bases de datos compatibles con Node.js"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Node.js","Spécifique aux frameworks Express et Next.js","L''optimisation de la base de données est limitée aux bases de données compatibles Node.js"],"de":["Benötigt Node.js-Umgebung","Spezifisch für die Frameworks Express und Next.js","Die Datenbankoptimierung ist auf Node.js-kompatible Datenbanken beschränkt"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Node.js","Específico para os frameworks Express e Next.js","Otimização de banco de dados limitada a bancos de dados compatíveis com Node.js"],"ru":["Требует среды Node.js","Конкретно для фреймворков Express и Next.js","Оптимизация базы данных ограничена базами данных, совместимыми с Node.js"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Node.js","محدد للعاملين Express وNext.js","تحسين قاعدة البيانات مقيد بقواعد البيانات المتوافقة مع Node.js"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"681c33b4e125860295ca2639083cba524c77261e81efd67a3ce30b75593e7512","repoEtag":"W/\"1d66934774ad40d3d916abf4c33c3e340ab032f8212b35e12a94daa7359886c9\"","qualityScore":86}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/content-hash-cache-pattern', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'content-hash-cache-pattern', 55024, 6781, 86, '2026-03-01T05:07:39Z', '2026-03-01T05:10:01.460Z', 'cdef26f0fc59be4320d3b8acc75a1084c06d7f8b58d635de51cd98e1d4343dbc', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/content-hash-cache-pattern","name":"content-hash-cache-pattern","description":{"zh":"内容哈希缓存模式是一种使用SHA-256哈希值缓存文件处理结果的技术，适用于PDF解析、文本提取、图像分析等场景","ja":"コンテンツハッシュキャッシュパターンは、SHA-256ハッシュ値を使用してファイル処理結果をキャッシュする技術であり、PDF解析、テキスト抽出、画像分析などに適しています","ko":"콘텐츠 해시 캐시 패턴은 SHA-256 해시 값을 사용하여 파일 처리 결과를 캐시하는 기술로, PDF 파싱, 텍스트 추출, 이미지 분석 등에 적합합니다","es":"El patrón de caché de hash de contenido utiliza hashes SHA-256 para cachear resultados de procesamiento de archivos, mejorando la eficiencia en pipelines de procesamiento de archivos","fr":"Le modèle de cache de hachage de contenu utilise des hashes SHA-256 pour mettre en cache les résultats du traitement de fichiers, améliorant l''efficacité dans les pipelines de traitement de fichiers","de":"Das Inhalts-Hash-Cache-Muster verwendet SHA-256-Hashes, um Dateiverarbeitungsergebnisse zu cachen, wodurch die Effizienz in Dateiverarbeitungspipelines verbessert wird","pt":"O padrão de cache de hash de conteúdo é uma técnica para armazenar resultados de processamento de arquivos caros usando hashes de conteúdo SHA-256","ru":"Паттерн кэша хэша содержимого - это техника для хранения результатов дорогостоящей обработки файлов с использованием хэшей содержимого SHA-256","ar":"نمط ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت للخوارزمية هو تقنية لتخزين نتائج معالجة الملفات المكلفة باستخدام خوارزمية التجزئة SHA-256","en":"Cache expensive file processing results using SHA-256 content hashes — path-independent, auto-invalidating, with service layer separation."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":55024,"forks":6781,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:07:39Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"content-hash-cache-pattern","description":"Cache expensive file processing results using SHA-256 content hashes — path-independent, auto-invalidating, with service layer separation.","bodyPreview":"# Content-Hash File Cache Pattern\n\nCache expensive file processing results (PDF parsing, text extraction, image analysis) using SHA-256 content hashes as cache keys. Unlike path-based caching, this approach survives file moves/renames and auto-invalidates when content changes.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Building file processing pipelines (PDF, images, text extraction)\n- Processing cost is high and same files are processed repeatedly\n- Need a `--cache/--no-cache` CLI option\n- Want to add caching to","body":"# Content-Hash File Cache Pattern\n\nCache expensive file processing results (PDF parsing, text extraction, image analysis) using SHA-256 content hashes as cache keys. Unlike path-based caching, this approach survives file moves/renames and auto-invalidates when content changes.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Building file processing pipelines (PDF, images, text extraction)\n- Processing cost is high and same files are processed repeatedly\n- Need a `--cache/--no-cache` CLI option\n- Want to add caching to existing pure functions without modifying them\n\n## Core Pattern\n\n### 1. Content-Hash Based Cache Key\n\nUse file content (not path) as the cache key:\n\n```python\nimport hashlib\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\n_HASH_CHUNK_SIZE = 65536  # 64KB chunks for large files\n\ndef compute_file_hash(path: Path) -> str:\n    \"\"\"SHA-256 of file contents (chunked for large files).\"\"\"\n    if not path.is_file():\n        raise FileNotFoundError(f\"File not found: {path}\")\n    sha256 = hashlib.sha256()\n    with open(path, \"rb\") as f:\n        while True:\n            chunk = f.read(_HASH_CHUNK_SIZE)\n            if not chunk:\n                break\n            sha256.update(chunk)\n    return sha256.hexdigest()\n```\n\n**Why content hash?** File rename/move = cache hit. Content change = automatic invalidation. No index file needed.\n\n### 2. Frozen Dataclass for Cache Entry\n\n```python\nfrom dataclasses import dataclass\n\n@dataclass(frozen=True, slots=True)\nclass CacheEntry:\n    file_hash: str\n    source_path: str\n    document: ExtractedDocument  # The cached result\n```\n\n### 3. File-Based Cache Storage\n\nEach cache entry is stored as `{hash}.json` — O(1) lookup by hash, no index file required.\n\n```python\nimport json\nfrom typing import Any\n\ndef write_cache(cache_dir: Path, entry: CacheEntry) -> None:\n    cache_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n    cache_file = cache_dir / f\"{entry.file_hash}.json\"\n    data = serialize_entry(entry)\n    cache_file.write_text(json.dumps(data, ensure_ascii=False), encoding=\"utf-8\")\n\ndef read_cache(cache_dir: Path, file_hash: str) -> CacheEntry | None:\n    cache_file = cache_dir / f\"{file_hash}.json\"\n    if not cache_file.is_file():\n        return None\n    try:\n        raw = cache_file.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\")\n        data = json.loads(raw)\n        return deserialize_entry(data)\n    except (json.JSONDecodeError, ValueError, KeyError):\n        return None  # Treat corruption as cache miss\n```\n\n### 4. Service Layer Wrapper (SRP)\n\nKeep the processing function pure. Add caching as a separate service layer.\n\n```python\ndef extract_with_cache(\n    file_path: Path,\n    *,\n    cache_enabled: bool = True,\n    cache_dir: Path = Path(\".cache\"),\n) -> ExtractedDocument:\n    \"\"\"Service layer: cache check -> extraction -> cache write.\"\"\"\n    if not cache_enabled:\n        return extract_text(file_path)  # Pure function, no cache knowledge\n\n    file_hash = compute_file_hash(file_path)\n\n    # Check cache\n    cached = read_cache(cache_dir, file_hash)\n    if cached is not None:\n        logger.info(\"Cache hit: %s (hash=%s)\", file_path.name, file_hash[:12])\n        return cached.document\n\n    # Cache miss -> extract -> store\n    logger.info(\"Cache miss: %s (hash=%s)\", file_path.name, file_hash[:12])\n    doc = extract_text(file_path)\n    entry = CacheEntry(file_hash=file_hash, source_path=str(file_path), document=doc)\n    write_cache(cache_dir, entry)\n    return doc\n```\n\n## Key Design Decisions\n\n| Decision | Rationale |\n|----------|-----------|\n| SHA-256 content hash | Path-independent, auto-invalidates on content change |\n| `{hash}.json` file naming | O(1) lookup, no index file needed |\n| Service layer wrapper | SRP: extraction stays pure, cache is a separate concern |\n| Manual JSON serialization | Full control over frozen dataclass serialization |\n| Corruption returns `None` | Graceful degradation, re-processes on next run |\n| `cache_dir.mkdir(parents=True)` | Lazy directory creation on first write |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- **Hash content, not paths** — paths change, content identity doesn''t\n- **Chunk large files** when hashing — avoid loading entire files into memory\n- **Keep processing functions pure** — they should know nothing about caching\n- **Log cache hit/miss** with truncated hashes for debugging\n- **Handle corruption gracefully** — treat invalid cache entries as misses, never crash\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n```python\n# BAD: Path-based caching (breaks on file move/rename)\ncache = {\"/path/to/file.pdf\": result}\n\n# BAD: Adding cache logic inside the processing function (SRP violation)\ndef extract_text(path, *, cache_enabled=False, cache_dir=None):\n    if cache_enabled:  # Now this function has two responsibilities\n        ...\n\n# BAD: Using dataclasses.asdict() with nested frozen dataclasses\n# (can cause issues with complex nested types)\ndata = dataclasses.asdict(entry)  # Use manual serialization instead\n```\n\n## When to Use\n\n- File processing pipelines (PDF parsing, OCR, text extraction, image analysis)\n- CLI tools that benefit from `--cache/--no-cache` options\n- Batch processing where the same files appear across runs\n- Adding caching to existing pure functions without modifying them\n\n## When NOT to Use\n\n- Data that must always be fresh (real-time feeds)\n- Cache entries that would be extremely large (consider streaming instead)\n- Results that depend on parameters beyond file content (e.g., different extraction configs)\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:10:01.460Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理内容哈希缓存模式","ja":"AIエージェントコンテンツハッシュキャッシュパターン","ko":"AI 에이전트 콘텐츠 해시 캐시 패턴","es":"Patrón de caché de hash de contenido para Agentes de IA","fr":"Modèle de cache de hachage de contenu pour Outils d''IA","de":"Inhalts-Hash-Cache-Muster für KI-Agents","pt":"Padrão de Cache de Hash de Conteúdo para Ferramentas de IA","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Паттерн Кэша Хэша Содержимого","ar":"نمط ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت للخوارزمية للوكلاء الذكيين","en":"content-hash-cache-pattern"},"description":{"zh":"内容哈希缓存模式是一种使用SHA-256哈希值缓存文件处理结果的技术，适用于PDF解析、文本提取、图像分析等场景","ja":"コンテンツハッシュキャッシュパターンは、SHA-256ハッシュ値を使用してファイル処理結果をキャッシュする技術であり、PDF解析、テキスト抽出、画像分析などに適しています","ko":"콘텐츠 해시 캐시 패턴은 SHA-256 해시 값을 사용하여 파일 처리 결과를 캐시하는 기술로, PDF 파싱, 텍스트 추출, 이미지 분석 등에 적합합니다","es":"El patrón de caché de hash de contenido utiliza hashes SHA-256 para cachear resultados de procesamiento de archivos, mejorando la eficiencia en pipelines de ...","fr":"Le modèle de cache de hachage de contenu utilise des hashes SHA-256 pour mettre en cache les résultats du traitement de fichiers, améliorant l''efficacité dan...","de":"Das Inhalts-Hash-Cache-Muster verwendet SHA-256-Hashes, um Dateiverarbeitungsergebnisse zu cachen, wodurch die Effizienz in Dateiverarbeitungspipelines verbe...","pt":"O padrão de cache de hash de conteúdo é uma técnica para armazenar resultados de processamento de arquivos caros usando hashes de conteúdo SHA-256","ru":"Паттерн кэша хэша содержимого - это техника для хранения результатов дорогостоящей обработки файлов с использованием хэшей содержимого SHA-256","ar":"نمط ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت للخوارزمية هو تقنية لتخزين نتائج معالجة الملفات المكلفة باستخدام خوارزمية التجزئة SHA-256","en":"Cache expensive file processing results using SHA-256 content hashes — path-independent, auto-invalidating, with service layer separation."},"definition":{"en":"Cache expensive file processing results using SHA-256 content hashes — path-independent, auto-invalidating, with service layer separation."},"features":{"zh":["使用SHA-256哈希值作为缓存键","自动失效缓存当文件内容改变","支持文件移动和重命名","提高开发效率，减少重复计算"],"ja":["SHA-256ハッシュ値をキャッシュキーとして使用","ファイル内容が変更されたときに自動的にキャッシュを失効","ファイルの移動と名前変更をサポート","開発効率を向上させ、重複計算を減らす"],"ko":["SHA-256 해시 값을 캐시 키로 사용","파일 내용이 변경될 때 자동으로 캐시를失效","파일 이동과 이름 변경을 지원","개발 효율성을 높이고重複 계산을減少"],"es":["Utiliza hashes SHA-256 como claves de caché","Supervivencia a movimientos y renombramientos de archivos","Invalidación automática al cambiar el contenido","Separación de la capa de servicio","Ideal para pipelines de procesamiento de archivos costosos"],"fr":["Utilise des hashes SHA-256 comme clés de cache","Survie aux déplacements et renommages de fichiers","Invalidation automatique lors du changement de contenu","Séparation de la couche de service","Idéal pour les pipelines de traitement de fichiers coûteux"],"de":["Verwendet SHA-256-Hashes als Cache-Schlüssel","Überlebt Dateiverschiebungen und -umbenennungen","Automatische Invalidierung bei Inhaltsänderung","Trennung der Service-Schicht","Ideal für teure Dateiverarbeitungspipelines"],"pt":["Usa hashes de conteúdo SHA-256 como chaves de cache","Armazena resultados de processamento de arquivos caros","Permite a ativação e desativação do cache via CLI","Separação de camadas de serviço","Auto-invalidação quando o conteúdo muda"],"ru":["Использует хэши содержимого SHA-256 в качестве ключей кэша","Хранит результаты дорогостоящей обработки файлов","Позволяет включать и выключать кэш через CLI","Разделение слоев сервиса","Авто-аннулирование при изменении содержимого"],"ar":["يستخدم خوارزمية التجزئة SHA-256 كرمز للمفتاح","يخزن نتائج معالجة الملفات المكلفة","يسمح بتشغيل وإيقاف ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت عبر واجهة سطر الأوامر","فصل طبقات الخدمة","الإبطال التلقائي عند تغيير المحتوى"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","内容哈希缓存模式","SHA-256哈希值","文件处理结果缓存","开发效率优化","重复计算减少"],"ja":["AIエージェント","コンテンツハッシュキャッシュパターン","SHA-256ハッシュ値","ファイル処理結果キャッシュ","開発効率向上","重複計算削減"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","콘텐츠 해시 캐시 패턴","SHA-256 해시 값","파일 처리 결과 캐시","개발 효율성 향상","重複 계산 감소"],"es":["Agentes de IA","patrón de caché de hash de contenido","procesamiento de archivos","hashes SHA-256","eficiencia","pipelines de procesamiento de archivos"],"fr":["Outils d''IA","modèle de cache de hachage de contenu","traitement de fichiers","hashes SHA-256","efficacité","pipelines de traitement de fichiers"],"de":["KI-Agents","Inhalts-Hash-Cache-Muster","Dateiverarbeitung","SHA-256-Hashes","Effizienz","Dateiverarbeitungspipelines"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","padrão de cache de hash de conteúdo","processamento de arquivos","caching","CLI","desenvolvimento de software","produtividade"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","паттерн кэша хэша содержимого","обработка файлов","кэширование","CLI","разработка программного обеспечения","производительность"],"ar":["الوكلاء الذكيين","نمط ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت للخوارزمية","معالجة الملفات","ذاكرة التخزين المؤقت","واجهة سطر الأوامر","تطوير البرمجيات","الإنتاجية"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for File Processing Agents needing efficient caching of expensive operations like PDF parsing and image analysis","zh":"非常适合需要高效缓存昂贵操作（如PDF解析和图像分析）文件处理代理","ja":"高価な操作（PDF解析や画像分析など）を効率的にキャッシュする必要があるファイル処理エージェントに最適","ko":"비용이 많이 드는 작업(예: PDF 파싱 및 이미지 분석) 효율적인 캐싱이 필요한 파일 처리 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Procesamiento de Archivos que necesitan una caché eficiente de operaciones costosas como el análisis de PDF y el análisis de imágenes","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Traitement de Fichiers nécessitant une mise en cache efficace d''opérations coûteuses comme l''analyse de PDF et l''analyse d''images","de":"Perfekt für Dateiverarbeitungsagenten, die eine effiziente Zwischenspeicherung teurer Operationen wie PDF-Parsing und Bildanalyse benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Processamento de Arquivos que necessitam de cache eficiente de operações caras como parsing de PDF e análise de imagens","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов обработки файлов, требующих эффективного кэширования дорогостоящих операций, таких как парсинг PDF и анализ изображений","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء معالجة الملفات التي تحتاج إلى ذاكرة مؤقتة فعالة للعمليات المكلفة مثل تحليل PDF وتحليل الصور"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to cache expensive file processing results using SHA-256 content hashes, providing path-independent and auto-invalidating caching with service layer separation, supporting protocols like file moves/renames and content changes","zh":"使代理能够使用SHA-256内容哈希缓存昂贵的文件处理结果，提供与路径无关且自动失效的缓存，并支持服务层分离，支持诸如文件移动/重命名和内容更改等协议","ja":"SHA-256コンテンツハッシュを使用して、高価なファイル処理結果をキャッシュできるようにエージェントをEmpowerし、パスに依存しない自動失効キャッシュを提供し、サービス層の分離をサポートし、ファイルの移動/名前変更やコンテンツの変更などのプロトコルをサポートする","ko":"에이전트가 SHA-256 컨텐츠 해시를 사용하여 비용이 많이 드는 파일 처리 결과를 캐시할 수 있도록 하여, 경로 독립적이고 자동으로 만료되는 캐싱을 제공하고, 서비스 계층 분리를 지원하며, 파일 이동/이름 변경 및 컨텐츠 변경 등과 같은 프로토콜을 지원","es":"Habilita a los agentes a cachear resultados de procesamiento de archivos costosos utilizando hashes de contenido SHA-256, proporcionando una caché independiente de la ruta y autoinvalidante con separación de capas de servicio, que admite protocolos como movimientos/renombramientos de archivos y cambios de contenido","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en cache les résultats du traitement de fichiers coûteux en utilisant des hashes de contenu SHA-256, fournissant une mise en cache indépendante du chemin et autoinvalidante avec une séparation des couches de service, prenant en charge des protocoles tels que les déplacements/renommages de fichiers et les modifications de contenu","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Ergebnisse von teuren Dateiverarbeitungsvorgängen mit SHA-256-Inhalts-Hashes zu zwischenspeichern, wodurch eine pfadunabhängige und autoinvalidierende Zwischenspeicherung mit Dienstschichttrennung bereitgestellt wird, die Protokolle wie Dateiumbenennungen und Inhaltsänderungen unterstützt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a armazenar em cache os resultados do processamento de arquivos caros usando hashes de conteúdo SHA-256, fornecendo cache independente de caminho e auto-invalidação com separação de camada de serviço, suportando protocolos como mover/renomear arquivos e alterações de conteúdo","ru":"Позволяет агентам кэшировать результаты дорогостоящей обработки файлов с помощью хэшей содержимого SHA-256, обеспечивая независимое от пути и автоматически инвалидирующее кэширование с разделением слоя сервиса, поддерживая протоколы, такие как перемещение/переименование файлов и изменения содержимого","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تخزين نتائج معالجة الملفات المكلفة في ذاكرة مؤقتة باستخدام خوارزمية SHA-256 للتشفير، مع توفير ذاكرة مؤقتة مستقلة عن المسار وتلقائية إلغاء الصلاحية مع فصل طبقة الخدمة، ودعم بروتوكولات مثل نقل/إعادة تسمية الملفات وتغييرات المحتوى"},"useCases":{"en":["Caching PDF parsing results for repeated document analysis","Automating image analysis caching for computer vision pipelines","Optimizing text extraction workflows with content-hash-based caching"],"zh":["为重复文档分析缓存PDF解析结果","为计算机视觉管道自动化图像分析缓存","使用内容哈希缓存优化文本提取工作流"],"ja":["繰り返し文書分析のためのPDF解析結果のキャッシュ","コンピュータビジョンパイプラインのための画像分析キャッシュの自動化","コンテンツハッシュを使用したテキスト抽出ワークフローの最適化"],"ko":["반복 문서 분석을 위한 PDF 파싱 결과 캐싱","컴퓨터 비전 파이프라인을 위한 이미지 분석 캐싱 자동화","컨텐츠 해시를 사용한 텍스트 추출 워크플로우 최적화"],"es":["Almacenar en caché los resultados del análisis de PDF para el análisis repetido de documentos","Automatizar la caché del análisis de imágenes para tuberías de visión artificial","Optimizar flujos de trabajo de extracción de texto con caché basada en hash de contenido"],"fr":["Mettre en cache les résultats de l''analyse de PDF pour l''analyse répétée de documents","Automatiser la mise en cache de l''analyse d''images pour les pipelines de vision par ordinateur","Optimiser les flux de travail d''extraction de texte avec une mise en cache basée sur le hash de contenu"],"de":["Zwischenspeichern der Ergebnisse der PDF-Analyse für die wiederholte Dokumentenanalyse","Automatisieren der Bildanalyse-Zwischenspeicherung für Computer-Vision-Pipelines","Optimieren von Textextraktions-Workflows mit inhalts-hash-basierter Zwischenspeicherung"],"pt":["Armazenar em cache os resultados do parsing de PDF para análise de documentos repetida","Automatizar o cache da análise de imagens para pipelines de visão computacional","Otimizar fluxos de trabalho de extração de texto com cache baseado em hash de conteúdo"],"ru":["Кэширование результатов парсинга PDF для повторного анализа документов","Автоматизация кэширования анализа изображений для конвейеров компьютерного зрения","Оптимизация потоков работы по извлечению текста на основе кэширования хэшей содержимого"],"ar":["تخزين نتائج تحليل PDF في ذاكرة مؤقتة لتحليل المستندات المتكرر","تأتمتة ذاكرة مؤقتة تحليل الصور لأنابيب رؤية الكمبيوتر","تحسين سير عمل استخراج النص باستخدام ذاكرة مؤقتة قائمة على خوارزمية التشفير"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires SHA-256 hashing library","Limited to file processing pipelines","Needs service layer separation for effective caching"],"zh":["需要SHA-256哈希库","仅限文件处理管道","需要服务层分离以实现有效缓存"],"ja":["SHA-256ハッシュライブラリが必要","ファイル処理パイプラインのみ","効果的なキャッシュにはサービス層の分離が必要"],"ko":["SHA-256 해시 라이브러리가 필요","파일 처리 파이프라인만 해당","효과적인 캐싱을 위해서는 서비스 계층 분리가 필요"],"es":["Requiere una biblioteca de hashing SHA-256","Limitado a tuberías de procesamiento de archivos","Necesita una separación de capas de servicio para una caché eficaz"],"fr":["Nécessite une bibliothèque de hachage SHA-256","Limité aux pipelines de traitement de fichiers","Nécessite une séparation des couches de service pour une mise en cache efficace"],"de":["Benötigt eine SHA-256-Hashing-Bibliothek","Begrenzt auf Dateiverarbeitungspipelines","Benötigt eine Dienstschichttrennung für eine effektive Zwischenspeicherung"],"pt":["Requer biblioteca de hashing SHA-256","Limitado a pipelines de processamento de arquivos","Necessita de separação de camada de serviço para cache eficaz"],"ru":["Требуется библиотека хэширования SHA-256","Ограничен конвейерами обработки файлов","Требуется разделение слоя сервиса для эффективного кэширования"],"ar":["يتطلب مكتبة تشفير SHA-256","محدود بمحطات معالجة الملفات","يحتاج إلى فصل طبقة الخدمة لتخزين مؤقت فعال"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"cdef26f0fc59be4320d3b8acc75a1084c06d7f8b58d635de51cd98e1d4343dbc","repoEtag":"W/\"1d66934774ad40d3d916abf4c33c3e340ab032f8212b35e12a94daa7359886c9\"","qualityScore":86}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/django-tdd', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'django-tdd', 55024, 6781, 86, '2026-03-01T05:07:39Z', '2026-03-01T05:10:12.925Z', '99ef0936053afecf9f1ebbca687cd4232f4baa5f491878d5157c70344f237cd6', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/django-tdd","name":"django-tdd","description":{"zh":"Django TDD 测试使用 pytest-django、factory_boy 和 Django REST Framework 实现测试驱动开发","ja":"Django TDD テストは、pytest-django、factory_boy、Django REST Framework を使用したテスト駆動開発","ko":"Django TDD 테스트는 pytest-django, factory_boy 및 Django REST Framework를 사용한 테스트 주도 개발","es":"Desarrolla aplicaciones de Django con confianza utilizando TDD y herramientas de pruebas como pytest-django y factory_boy","fr":"Développez des applications Django avec confiance en utilisant TDD et des outils de test tels que pytest-django et factory_boy","de":"Entwickeln Sie Django-Anwendungen mit Vertrauen, indem Sie TDD und Testtools wie pytest-django und factory_boy verwenden","pt":"Django TDD com pytest-django, TDD e factory_boy para desenvolver aplicações robustas e confiáveis","ru":"Django TDD с pytest-django, TDD и factory_boy для разработки прочных и надежных приложений","ar":"Django TDD مع pytest-django و TDD و factory_boy لتطوير تطبيقات قوية وموثوقة","en":"Django testing strategies with pytest-django, TDD methodology, factory_boy, mocking, coverage, and testing Django REST Framework APIs."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":55024,"forks":6781,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:07:39Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"django-tdd","description":"Django testing strategies with pytest-django, TDD methodology, factory_boy, mocking, coverage, and testing Django REST Framework APIs.","bodyPreview":"# Django Testing with TDD\n\nTest-driven development for Django applications using pytest, factory_boy, and Django REST Framework.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Writing new Django applications\n- Implementing Django REST Framework APIs\n- Testing Django models, views, and serializers\n- Setting up testing infrastructure for Django projects\n\n## TDD Workflow for Django\n\n### Red-Green-Refactor Cycle\n\n```python\n# Step 1: RED - Write failing test\ndef test_user_creation():\n    user = User.objects.create_user(ema","body":"# Django Testing with TDD\n\nTest-driven development for Django applications using pytest, factory_boy, and Django REST Framework.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Writing new Django applications\n- Implementing Django REST Framework APIs\n- Testing Django models, views, and serializers\n- Setting up testing infrastructure for Django projects\n\n## TDD Workflow for Django\n\n### Red-Green-Refactor Cycle\n\n```python\n# Step 1: RED - Write failing test\ndef test_user_creation():\n    user = User.objects.create_user(email=''test@example.com'', password=''testpass123'')\n    assert user.email == ''test@example.com''\n    assert user.check_password(''testpass123'')\n    assert not user.is_staff\n\n# Step 2: GREEN - Make test pass\n# Create User model or factory\n\n# Step 3: REFACTOR - Improve while keeping tests green\n```\n\n## Setup\n\n### pytest Configuration\n\n```ini\n# pytest.ini\n[pytest]\nDJANGO_SETTINGS_MODULE = config.settings.test\ntestpaths = tests\npython_files = test_*.py\npython_classes = Test*\npython_functions = test_*\naddopts =\n    --reuse-db\n    --nomigrations\n    --cov=apps\n    --cov-report=html\n    --cov-report=term-missing\n    --strict-markers\nmarkers =\n    slow: marks tests as slow\n    integration: marks tests as integration tests\n```\n\n### Test Settings\n\n```python\n# config/settings/test.py\nfrom .base import *\n\nDEBUG = True\nDATABASES = {\n    ''default'': {\n        ''ENGINE'': ''django.db.backends.sqlite3'',\n        ''NAME'': '':memory:'',\n    }\n}\n\n# Disable migrations for speed\nclass DisableMigrations:\n    def __contains__(self, item):\n        return True\n\n    def __getitem__(self, item):\n        return None\n\nMIGRATION_MODULES = DisableMigrations()\n\n# Faster password hashing\nPASSWORD_HASHERS = [\n    ''django.contrib.auth.hashers.MD5PasswordHasher'',\n]\n\n# Email backend\nEMAIL_BACKEND = ''django.core.mail.backends.console.EmailBackend''\n\n# Celery always eager\nCELERY_TASK_ALWAYS_EAGER = True\nCELERY_TASK_EAGER_PROPAGATES = True\n```\n\n### conftest.py\n\n```python\n# tests/conftest.py\nimport pytest\nfrom django.utils import timezone\nfrom django.contrib.auth import get_user_model\n\nUser = get_user_model()\n\n@pytest.fixture(autouse=True)\ndef timezone_settings(settings):\n    \"\"\"Ensure consistent timezone.\"\"\"\n    settings.TIME_ZONE = ''UTC''\n\n@pytest.fixture\ndef user(db):\n    \"\"\"Create a test user.\"\"\"\n    return User.objects.create_user(\n        email=''test@example.com'',\n        password=''testpass123'',\n        username=''testuser''\n    )\n\n@pytest.fixture\ndef admin_user(db):\n    \"\"\"Create an admin user.\"\"\"\n    return User.objects.create_superuser(\n        email=''admin@example.com'',\n        password=''adminpass123'',\n        username=''admin''\n    )\n\n@pytest.fixture\ndef authenticated_client(client, user):\n    \"\"\"Return authenticated client.\"\"\"\n    client.force_login(user)\n    return client\n\n@pytest.fixture\ndef api_client():\n    \"\"\"Return DRF API client.\"\"\"\n    from rest_framework.test import APIClient\n    return APIClient()\n\n@pytest.fixture\ndef authenticated_api_client(api_client, user):\n    \"\"\"Return authenticated API client.\"\"\"\n    api_client.force_authenticate(user=user)\n    return api_client\n```\n\n## Factory Boy\n\n### Factory Setup\n\n```python\n# tests/factories.py\nimport factory\nfrom factory import fuzzy\nfrom datetime import datetime, timedelta\nfrom django.contrib.auth import get_user_model\nfrom apps.products.models import Product, Category\n\nUser = get_user_model()\n\nclass UserFactory(factory.django.DjangoModelFactory):\n    \"\"\"Factory for User model.\"\"\"\n\n    class Meta:\n        model = User\n\n    email = factory.Sequence(lambda n: f\"user{n}@example.com\")\n    username = factory.Sequence(lambda n: f\"user{n}\")\n    password = factory.PostGenerationMethodCall(''set_password'', ''testpass123'')\n    first_name = factory.Faker(''first_name'')\n    last_name = factory.Faker(''last_name'')\n    is_active = True\n\nclass CategoryFactory(factory.django.DjangoModelFactory):\n    \"\"\"Factory for Category model.\"\"\"\n\n    class Meta:\n        model = Category\n\n    name = factory.Faker(''word'')\n    slug = factory.LazyAttribute(lambda obj: obj.name.lower())\n    description = factory.Faker(''text'')\n\nclass ProductFactory(factory.django.DjangoModelFactory):\n    \"\"\"Factory for Product model.\"\"\"\n\n    class Meta:\n        model = Product\n\n    name = factory.Faker(''sentence'', nb_words=3)\n    slug = factory.LazyAttribute(lambda obj: obj.name.lower().replace('' '', ''-''))\n    description = factory.Faker(''text'')\n    price = fuzzy.FuzzyDecimal(10.00, 1000.00, 2)\n    stock = fuzzy.FuzzyInteger(0, 100)\n    is_active = True\n    category = factory.SubFactory(CategoryFactory)\n    created_by = factory.SubFactory(UserFactory)\n\n    @factory.post_generation\n    def tags(self, create, extracted, **kwargs):\n        \"\"\"Add tags to product.\"\"\"\n        if not create:\n            return\n        if extracted:\n            for tag in extracted:\n                self.tags.add(tag)\n```\n\n### Using Factories\n\n```python\n# tests/test_models.py\nimport pytest\nfrom tests.factories import ProductFactory, UserFactory\n\ndef test_product_creation():\n    \"\"\"Test product creation using factory.\"\"\"\n    product = ProductFactory(price=100.00, stock=50)\n    assert product.price == 100.00\n    assert product.stock == 50\n    assert product.is_active is True\n\ndef test_product_with_tags():\n    \"\"\"Test product with tags.\"\"\"\n    tags = [TagFactory(name=''electronics''), TagFactory(name=''new'')]\n    product = ProductFactory(tags=tags)\n    assert product.tags.count() == 2\n\ndef test_multiple_products():\n    \"\"\"Test creating multiple products.\"\"\"\n    products = ProductFactory.create_batch(10)\n    assert len(products) == 10\n```\n\n## Model Testing\n\n### Model Tests\n\n```python\n# tests/test_models.py\nimport pytest\nfrom django.core.exceptions import ValidationError\nfrom tests.factories import UserFactory, ProductFactory\n\nclass TestUserModel:\n    \"\"\"Test User model.\"\"\"\n\n    def test_create_user(self, db):\n        \"\"\"Test creating a regular user.\"\"\"\n        user = UserFactory(email=''test@example.com'')\n        assert user.email == ''test@example.com''\n        assert user.check_password(''testpass123'')\n        assert not user.is_staff\n        assert not user.is_superuser\n\n    def test_create_superuser(self, db):\n        \"\"\"Test creating a superuser.\"\"\"\n        user = UserFactory(\n            email=''admin@example.com'',\n            is_staff=True,\n            is_superuser=True\n        )\n        assert user.is_staff\n        assert user.is_superuser\n\n    def test_user_str(self, db):\n        \"\"\"Test user string representation.\"\"\"\n        user = UserFactory(email=''test@example.com'')\n        assert str(user) == ''test@example.com''\n\nclass TestProductModel:\n    \"\"\"Test Product model.\"\"\"\n\n    def test_product_creation(self, db):\n        \"\"\"Test creating a product.\"\"\"\n        product = ProductFactory()\n        assert product.id is not None\n        assert product.is_active is True\n        assert product.created_at is not None\n\n    def test_product_slug_generation(self, db):\n        \"\"\"Test automatic slug generation.\"\"\"\n        product = ProductFactory(name=''Test Product'')\n        assert product.slug == ''test-product''\n\n    def test_product_price_validation(self, db):\n        \"\"\"Test price cannot be negative.\"\"\"\n        product = ProductFactory(price=-10)\n        with pytest.raises(ValidationError):\n            product.full_clean()\n\n    def test_product_manager_active(self, db):\n        \"\"\"Test active manager method.\"\"\"\n        ProductFactory.create_batch(5, is_active=True)\n        ProductFactory.create_batch(3, is_active=False)\n\n        active_count = Product.objects.active().count()\n        assert active_count == 5\n\n    def test_product_stock_management(self, db):\n        \"\"\"Test stock management.\"\"\"\n        product = ProductFactory(stock=10)\n        product.reduce_stock(5)\n        product.refresh_from_db()\n        assert product.stock == 5\n\n        with pytest.raises(ValueError):\n            product.reduce_stock(10)  # Not enough stock\n```\n\n## View Testing\n\n### Django View Testing\n\n```python\n# tests/test_views.py\nimport pytest\nfrom django.urls import reverse\nfrom tests.factories import ProductFactory, UserFactory\n\nclass TestProductViews:\n    \"\"\"Test product views.\"\"\"\n\n    def test_product_list(self, client, db):\n        \"\"\"Test product list view.\"\"\"\n        ProductFactory.create_batch(10)\n\n        response = client.get(reverse(''products:list''))\n\n        assert response.status_code == 200\n        assert len(response.context[''products'']) == 10\n\n    def test_product_detail(self, client, db):\n        \"\"\"Test product detail view.\"\"\"\n        product = ProductFactory()\n\n        response = client.get(reverse(''products:detail'', kwargs={''slug'': product.slug}))\n\n        assert response.status_code == 200\n        assert response.context[''product''] == product\n\n    def test_product_create_requires_login(self, client, db):\n        \"\"\"Test product creation requires authentication.\"\"\"\n        response = client.get(reverse(''products:create''))\n\n        assert response.status_code == 302\n        assert response.url.startswith(''/accounts/login/'')\n\n    def test_product_create_authenticated(self, authenticated_client, db):\n        \"\"\"Test product creation as authenticated user.\"\"\"\n        response = authenticated_client.get(reverse(''products:create''))\n\n        assert response.status_code == 200\n\n    def test_product_create_post(self, authenticated_client, db, category):\n        \"\"\"Test creating a product via POST.\"\"\"\n        data = {\n            ''name'': ''Test Product'',\n            ''description'': ''A test product'',\n            ''price'': ''99.99'',\n            ''stock'': 10,\n            ''category'': category.id,\n        }\n\n        response = authenticated_client.post(reverse(''products:create''), data)\n\n        assert response.status_code == 302\n        assert Product.objects.filter(name=''Test Product'').exists()\n```\n\n## DRF API Testing\n\n### Serializer Testing\n\n```python\n# tests/test_serializers.py\nimport pytest\nfrom rest_framework.exceptions import ValidationError\nfrom apps.products.serializers import ProductSerializer\nfrom tests.factories import ProductFactory\n\nclass TestProductSerializer:\n    \"\"\"Test ProductSerializer.\"\"\"\n\n    def test_serialize_product(self, db):\n        \"\"\"Test serializing a product.\"\"\"\n        product = ProductFactory()\n        serializer = ProductSerializer(product)\n\n        data = serializer.data\n\n        assert data[''id''] == product.id\n        assert data[''name''] == product.name\n        assert data[''price''] == str(product.price)\n\n    def test_deserialize_product(self, db):\n        \"\"\"Test deserializing product data.\"\"\"\n        data = {\n            ''name'': ''Test Product'',\n            ''description'': ''Test description'',\n            ''price'': ''99.99'',\n            ''stock'': 10,\n            ''category'': 1,\n        }\n\n        serializer = ProductSerializer(data=data)\n\n        assert serializer.is_valid()\n        product = serializer.save()\n\n        assert product.name == ''Test Product''\n        assert float(product.price) == 99.99\n\n    def test_price_validation(self, db):\n        \"\"\"Test price validation.\"\"\"\n        data = {\n            ''name'': ''Test Product'',\n            ''price'': ''-10.00'',\n            ''stock'': 10,\n        }\n\n        serializer = ProductSerializer(data=data)\n\n        assert not serializer.is_valid()\n        assert ''price'' in serializer.errors\n\n    def test_stock_validation(self, db):\n        \"\"\"Test stock cannot be negative.\"\"\"\n        data = {\n            ''name'': ''Test Product'',\n            ''price'': ''99.99'',\n            ''stock'': -5,\n        }\n\n        serializer = ProductSerializer(data=data)\n\n        assert not serializer.is_valid()\n        assert ''stock'' in serializer.errors\n```\n\n### API ViewSet Testing\n\n```python\n# tests/test_api.py\nimport pytest\nfrom rest_framework.test import APIClient\nfrom rest_framework import status\nfrom django.urls import reverse\nfrom tests.factories import ProductFactory, UserFactory\n\nclass TestProductAPI:\n    \"\"\"Test Product API endpoints.\"\"\"\n\n    @pytest.fixture\n    def api_client(self):\n        \"\"\"Return API client.\"\"\"\n        return APIClient()\n\n    def test_list_products(self, api_client, db):\n        \"\"\"Test listing products.\"\"\"\n        ProductFactory.create_batch(10)\n\n        url = reverse(''api:product-list'')\n        response = api_client.get(url)\n\n        assert response.status_code == status.HTTP_200_OK\n        assert response.data[''count''] == 10\n\n    def test_retrieve_product(self, api_client, db):\n        \"\"\"Test retrieving a product.\"\"\"\n        product = ProductFactory()\n\n        url = reverse(''api:product-detail'', kwargs={''pk'': product.id})\n        response = api_client.get(url)\n\n        assert response.status_code == status.HTTP_200_OK\n        assert response.data[''id''] == product.id\n\n    def test_create_product_unauthorized(self, api_client, db):\n        \"\"\"Test creating product without authentication.\"\"\"\n        url = reverse(''api:product-list'')\n        data = {''name'': ''Test Product'', ''price'': ''99.99''}\n\n        response = api_client.post(url, data)\n\n        assert response.status_code == status.HTTP_401_UNAUTHORIZED\n\n    def test_create_product_authorized(self, authenticated_api_client, db):\n        \"\"\"Test creating product as authenticated user.\"\"\"\n        url = reverse(''api:product-list'')\n        data = {\n            ''name'': ''Test Product'',\n            ''description'': ''Test'',\n            ''price'': ''99.99'',\n            ''stock'': 10,\n        }\n\n        response = authenticated_api_client.post(url, data)\n\n        assert response.status_code == status.HTTP_201_CREATED\n        assert response.data[''name''] == ''Test Product''\n\n    def test_update_product(self, authenticated_api_client, db):\n        \"\"\"Test updating a product.\"\"\"\n        product = ProductFactory(created_by=authenticated_api_client.user)\n\n        url = reverse(''api:product-detail'', kwargs={''pk'': product.id})\n        data = {''name'': ''Updated Product''}\n\n        response = authenticated_api_client.patch(url, data)\n\n        assert response.status_code == status.HTTP_200_OK\n        assert response.data[''name''] == ''Updated Product''\n\n    def test_delete_product(self, authenticated_api_client, db):\n        \"\"\"Test deleting a product.\"\"\"\n        product = ProductFactory(created_by=authenticated_api_client.user)\n\n        url = reverse(''api:product-detail'', kwargs={''pk'': product.id})\n        response = authenticated_api_client.delete(url)\n\n        assert response.status_code == status.HTTP_204_NO_CONTENT\n\n    def test_filter_products_by_price(self, api_client, db):\n        \"\"\"Test filtering products by price.\"\"\"\n        ProductFactory(price=50)\n        ProductFactory(price=150)\n\n        url = reverse(''api:product-list'')\n        response = api_client.get(url, {''price_min'': 100})\n\n        assert response.status_code == status.HTTP_200_OK\n        assert response.data[''count''] == 1\n\n    def test_search_products(self, api_client, db):\n        \"\"\"Test searching products.\"\"\"\n        ProductFactory(name=''Apple iPhone'')\n        ProductFactory(name=''Samsung Galaxy'')\n\n        url = reverse(''api:product-list'')\n        response = api_client.get(url, {''search'': ''Apple''})\n\n        assert response.status_code == status.HTTP_200_OK\n        assert response.data[''count''] == 1\n```\n\n## Mocking and Patching\n\n### Mocking External Services\n\n```python\n# tests/test_views.py\nfrom unittest.mock import patch, Mock\nimport pytest\n\nclass TestPaymentView:\n    \"\"\"Test payment view with mocked payment gateway.\"\"\"\n\n    @patch(''apps.payments.services.stripe'')\n    def test_successful_payment(self, mock_stripe, client, user, product):\n        \"\"\"Test successful payment with mocked Stripe.\"\"\"\n        # Configure mock\n        mock_stripe.Charge.create.return_value = {\n            ''id'': ''ch_123'',\n            ''status'': ''succeeded'',\n            ''amount'': 9999,\n        }\n\n        client.force_login(user)\n        response = client.post(reverse(''payments:process''), {\n            ''product_id'': product.id,\n            ''token'': ''tok_visa'',\n        })\n\n        assert response.status_code == 302\n        mock_stripe.Charge.create.assert_called_once()\n\n    @patch(''apps.payments.services.stripe'')\n    def test_failed_payment(self, mock_stripe, client, user, product):\n        \"\"\"Test failed payment.\"\"\"\n        mock_stripe.Charge.create.side_effect = Exception(''Card declined'')\n\n        client.force_login(user)\n        response = client.post(reverse(''payments:process''), {\n            ''product_id'': product.id,\n            ''token'': ''tok_visa'',\n        })\n\n        assert response.status_code == 302\n        assert ''error'' in response.url\n```\n\n### Mocking Email Sending\n\n```python\n# tests/test_email.py\nfrom django.core import mail\nfrom django.test import override_settings\n\n@override_settings(EMAIL_BACKEND=''django.core.mail.backends.locmem.EmailBackend'')\ndef test_order_confirmation_email(db, order):\n    \"\"\"Test order confirmation email.\"\"\"\n    order.send_confirmation_email()\n\n    assert len(mail.outbox) == 1\n    assert order.user.email in mail.outbox[0].to\n    assert ''Order Confirmation'' in mail.outbox[0].subject\n```\n\n## Integration Testing\n\n### Full Flow Testing\n\n```python\n# tests/test_integration.py\nimport pytest\nfrom django.urls import reverse\nfrom tests.factories import UserFactory, ProductFactory\n\nclass TestCheckoutFlow:\n    \"\"\"Test complete checkout flow.\"\"\"\n\n    def test_guest_to_purchase_flow(self, client, db):\n        \"\"\"Test complete flow from guest to purchase.\"\"\"\n        # Step 1: Register\n        response = client.post(reverse(''users:register''), {\n            ''email'': ''test@example.com'',\n            ''password'': ''testpass123'',\n            ''password_confirm'': ''testpass123'',\n        })\n        assert response.status_code == 302\n\n        # Step 2: Login\n        response = client.post(reverse(''users:login''), {\n            ''email'': ''test@example.com'',\n            ''password'': ''testpass123'',\n        })\n        assert response.status_code == 302\n\n        # Step 3: Browse products\n        product = ProductFactory(price=100)\n        response = client.get(reverse(''products:detail'', kwargs={''slug'': product.slug}))\n        assert response.status_code == 200\n\n        # Step 4: Add to cart\n        response = client.post(reverse(''cart:add''), {\n            ''product_id'': product.id,\n            ''quantity'': 1,\n        })\n        assert response.status_code == 302\n\n        # Step 5: Checkout\n        response = client.get(reverse(''checkout:review''))\n        assert response.status_code == 200\n        assert product.name in response.content.decode()\n\n        # Step 6: Complete purchase\n        with patch(''apps.checkout.services.process_payment'') as mock_payment:\n            mock_payment.return_value = True\n            response = client.post(reverse(''checkout:complete''))\n\n        assert response.status_code == 302\n        assert Order.objects.filter(user__email=''test@example.com'').exists()\n```\n\n## Testing Best Practices\n\n### DO\n\n- **Use factories**: Instead of manual object creation\n- **One assertion per test**: Keep tests focused\n- **Descriptive test names**: `test_user_cannot_delete_others_post`\n- **Test edge cases**: Empty inputs, None values, boundary conditions\n- **Mock external services**: Don''t depend on external APIs\n- **Use fixtures**: Eliminate duplication\n- **Test permissions**: Ensure authorization works\n- **Keep tests fast**: Use `--reuse-db` and `--nomigrations`\n\n### DON''T\n\n- **Don''t test Django internals**: Trust Django to work\n- **Don''t test third-party code**: Trust libraries to work\n- **Don''t ignore failing tests**: All tests must pass\n- **Don''t make tests dependent**: Tests should run in any order\n- **Don''t over-mock**: Mock only external dependencies\n- **Don''t test private methods**: Test public interface\n- **Don''t use production database**: Always use test database\n\n## Coverage\n\n### Coverage Configuration\n\n```bash\n# Run tests with coverage\npytest --cov=apps --cov-report=html --cov-report=term-missing\n\n# Generate HTML report\nopen htmlcov/index.html\n```\n\n### Coverage Goals\n\n| Component | Target Coverage |\n|-----------|-----------------|\n| Models | 90%+ |\n| Serializers | 85%+ |\n| Views | 80%+ |\n| Services | 90%+ |\n| Utilities | 80%+ |\n| Overall | 80%+ |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Pattern | Usage |\n|---------|-------|\n| `@pytest.mark.django_db` | Enable database access |\n| `client` | Django test client |\n| `api_client` | DRF API client |\n| `factory.create_batch(n)` | Create multiple objects |\n| `patch(''module.function'')` | Mock external dependencies |\n| `override_settings` | Temporarily change settings |\n| `force_authenticate()` | Bypass authentication in tests |\n| `assertRedirects` | Check for redirects |\n| `assertTemplateUsed` | Verify template usage |\n| `mail.outbox` | Check sent emails |\n\nRemember: Tests are documentation. Good tests explain how your code should work. Keep them simple, readable, and maintainable.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:10:12.925Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"Django TDD 测试 - AI智能代理","ja":"Django TDD テスト - AIエージェント","ko":"Django TDD 테스트 - AI 에이전트","es":"Herramientas de Pruebas de Django con TDD y Agentes de IA","fr":"Outils de Test Django avec TDD et Agents IA","de":"Django-Testtools mit TDD und KI-Agents","pt":"Ferramentas de IA para Django TDD","ru":"ИИ Агенты для Django TDD","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي ل Django TDD","en":"django-tdd"},"description":{"zh":"Django TDD 测试使用 pytest-django、factory_boy 和 Django REST Framework 实现测试驱动开发","ja":"Django TDD テストは、pytest-django、factory_boy、Django REST Framework を使用したテスト駆動開発","ko":"Django TDD 테스트는 pytest-django, factory_boy 및 Django REST Framework를 사용한 테스트 주도 개발","es":"Desarrolla aplicaciones de Django con confianza utilizando TDD y herramientas de pruebas como pytest-django y factory_boy","fr":"Développez des applications Django avec confiance en utilisant TDD et des outils de test tels que pytest-django et factory_boy","de":"Entwickeln Sie Django-Anwendungen mit Vertrauen, indem Sie TDD und Testtools wie pytest-django und factory_boy verwenden","pt":"Django TDD com pytest-django, TDD e factory_boy para desenvolver aplicações robustas e confiáveis","ru":"Django TDD с pytest-django, TDD и factory_boy для разработки прочных и наде