t-django","factory_boy","Django REST Framework","AIエージェント","テスト駆動開発"],"ko":["Django TDD","pytest-django","factory_boy","Django REST Framework","AI 에이전트","테스트 주도 개발"],"es":["Django TDD","Pruebas de Django","pytest-django","factory_boy","Django REST Framework","Agentes de IA","Herramientas de desarrollo de Django","Desarrollo de aplicaciones de Django"],"fr":["Django TDD","Tests Django","pytest-django","factory_boy","Django REST Framework","Agents IA","Outils de développement Django","Développement d''applications Django"],"de":["Django TDD","Django-Tests","pytest-django","factory_boy","Django REST Framework","KI-Agents","Django-Entwicklungstools","Django-Anwendungsentwicklung"],"pt":["Django TDD","pytest-django","TDD","factory_boy","testes de cobertura","Django REST Framework","desenvolvimento de aplicações","testes de API"],"ru":["Django TDD","pytest-django","TDD","factory_boy","тестирование покрытия","Django REST Framework","разработка приложений","тестирование API"],"ar":["Django TDD","pytest-django","TDD","factory_boy","اختبارات تغطية","Django REST Framework","تطوير التطبيقات","اختبارات واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Web Development Agents needing advanced test-driven development capabilities for Django applications","zh":"适用于需要高级测试驱动开发功能的Python Web开发代理，特别适用于Django应用","ja":"Python Web開発エージェントがDjangoアプリケーションに高度なテスト駆動開発機能を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"파이썬 웹 개발 에이전트가 장고 응용 프로그램에 고급 테스트 주도 개발 기능을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo web de Python que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo dirigido por pruebas avanzadas para aplicaciones de Django","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement web Python ayant besoin de capacités de développement piloté par les tests avancées pour les applications Django","de":"Perfekt für Python-Web-Development-Agents, die erweiterte Testgetriebene-Entwicklungs-Fähigkeiten für Django-Anwendungen benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Web Python que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de desenvolvimento orientado a testes para aplicações Django","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов веб-разработки Python, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности разработки, основанной на тестировании, для приложений Django","ar":"مثالي لعميل desenvolvimento ويب بايثون الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتطوير قائم على اختبار للتطبيقات ديجانغو"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement robust testing strategies using pytest-django, factory_boy, and mocking, ensuring comprehensive coverage of Django REST Framework APIs and models","zh":"赋予代理实现使用pytest-django、factory_boy和模拟实现强大的测试策略，确保对Django REST Framework API和模型的全面覆盖","ja":"pytest-django、factory_boy、モッキングを使用して強力なテスト戦略を実装するエージェントを可能にし、Django REST Framework APIとモデルの包括的なカバーを確保する","ko":"pytest-django, factory_boy 및 모의를 사용하여 강력한 테스트 전략을 구현할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 하여 Django REST Framework API 및 모델의 완벽한 커버리지를 보장","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar estrategias de prueba robustas utilizando pytest-django, factory_boy y mocking, asegurando una cobertura integral de las APIs y modelos de Django REST Framework","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des stratégies de test robustes en utilisant pytest-django, factory_boy et mocking, assurant une couverture complète des API et des modèles de Django REST Framework","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, robuste Teststrategien mit pytest-django, factory_boy und mocking umzusetzen, um eine umfassende Abdeckung der APIs und Modelle von Django REST Framework sicherzustellen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar estratégias de teste robustas usando pytest-django, factory_boy e mocking, garantindo cobertura abrangente das APIs e modelos do Django REST Framework","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать надежные стратегии тестирования с использованием pytest-django, factory_boy и mocking, обеспечивая полное покрытие API и моделей Django REST Framework","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على تنفيذ استراتيجيات اختبار قوية باستخدام pytest-django و factory_boy و mocking، مما يضمن تغطية شاملة ل واجهات برمجة التطبيقات و نماذج إطار Django REST"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating tests for Django models and views","Debugging Django REST Framework APIs","Setting up testing infrastructure for Django projects"],"zh":["为Django模型和视图自动化测试","调试Django REST Framework API","为Django项目设置测试基础设施"],"ja":["Djangoモデルの自動テスト","Django REST Framework APIのデバッグ","Djangoプロジェクトのテストインフラストラクチャの設定"],"ko":["장고 모델 및 뷰의 자동 테스트","장고 REST Framework API의 디버깅","장고 프로젝트의 테스트 인프라 구성"],"es":["Automatización de pruebas para modelos y vistas de Django","Depuración de APIs de Django REST Framework","Configuración de la infraestructura de pruebas para proyectos de Django"],"fr":["Automatisation des tests pour les modèles et les vues de Django","Débogage des API de Django REST Framework","Configuration de l''infrastructure de test pour les projets Django"],"de":["Automatisierung von Tests für Django-Modelle und -Ansichten","Fehlerbehebung von Django REST Framework-APIs","Einrichtung der Testinfrastruktur für Django-Projekte"],"pt":["Automatizar testes para modelos e visualizações Django","Depurar APIs do Django REST Framework","Configurar infraestrutura de teste para projetos Django"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тесты для моделей и представлений Django","Отладить API Django REST Framework","Настроить инфраструктуру тестирования для проектов Django"],"ar":["أتمتة الاختبارات ل نماذج و عارضات ديجانغو","تصحيح أخطاء واجهات برمجة التطبيقات ديجانغو REST","تهيئة بنية اختبار لمشاريع ديجانغو"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Django and pytest-django installation","Python 3.x compatibility required"],"zh":["需要Django和pytest-django安装","需要Python 3.x兼容性"],"ja":["Djangoとpytest-djangoのインストールが必要","Python 3.xの互換性が必要"],"ko":["장고 및 pytest-django 설치 필요","파이썬 3.x 호환성 필요"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Django y pytest-django","Se requiere compatibilidad con Python 3.x"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Django et de pytest-django","Compatibilité Python 3.x requise"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von Django und pytest-django","Python 3.x-Kompatibilität erforderlich"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Django e pytest-django","Compatibilidade com Python 3.x necessária"],"ru":["Требуется установка Django и pytest-django","Требуется совместимость с Python 3.x"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت ديجانغو و pytest-django","متطلبات متوافقة مع بايثون 3.x"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"99ef0936053afecf9f1ebbca687cd4232f4baa5f491878d5157c70344f237cd6","repoEtag":"W/\"1d66934774ad40d3d916abf4c33c3e340ab032f8212b35e12a94daa7359886c9\"","qualityScore":86}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/springboot-security', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'springboot-security', 55024, 6781, 86, '2026-03-01T05:07:39Z', '2026-03-01T05:12:10.235Z', '7bfabd0a87dd3abda4af572e913a84bd2470a876490799d3bf024e22a6870885', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/springboot-security","name":"springboot-security","description":{"zh":"Spring Boot安全最佳实践，包括authn、authz、验证、CSRF、秘密、头部、速率限制和依赖安全","ja":"Spring Bootセキュリティベストプラクティス，包括認証、認可、検証、CSRF、シークレット、ヘッダー、レート制限、依存関係のセキュリティ","ko":"Spring Boot 보안 최고의 실践，包括 인증、인가、검증、CSRF、비밀、헤더、속도 제한 및 종속 보안","es":"Spring Boot Security es una colección de mejores prácticas para la autenticación, autorización y validación de datos en aplicaciones Java Spring Boot","fr":"Spring Boot Security est un ensemble de meilleures pratiques pour l''authentification, l''autorisation et la validation des données dans les applications Java Spring Boot","de":"Spring Boot Security ist eine Sammlung von bewährten Methoden für die Authentifizierung, Autorisierung und Datenvalidierung in Java-Spring-Boot-Anwendungen","pt":"O Spring Boot Security oferece recursos para autenticação, autorização e segurança em serviços Java","ru":"Spring Boot Security предоставляет функции для аутентификации, авторизации и безопасности в сервисах Java","ar":"يوفر سبرينغ بوت للأمان ميزات للمصادقة والتفويض والأمان في خدمات جافا","en":"Spring Security best practices for authn/authz, validation, CSRF, secrets, headers, rate limiting, and dependency security in Java Spring Boot services."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":55024,"forks":6781,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:07:39Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"springboot-security","description":"Spring Security best practices for authn/authz, validation, CSRF, secrets, headers, rate limiting, and dependency security in Java Spring Boot services.","bodyPreview":"# Spring Boot Security Review\n\nUse when adding auth, handling input, creating endpoints, or dealing with secrets.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Adding authentication (JWT, OAuth2, session-based)\n- Implementing authorization (@PreAuthorize, role-based access)\n- Validating user input (Bean Validation, custom validators)\n- Configuring CORS, CSRF, or security headers\n- Managing secrets (Vault, environment variables)\n- Adding rate limiting or brute-force protection\n- Scanning dependencies for CVEs\n\n## Auth","body":"# Spring Boot Security Review\n\nUse when adding auth, handling input, creating endpoints, or dealing with secrets.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Adding authentication (JWT, OAuth2, session-based)\n- Implementing authorization (@PreAuthorize, role-based access)\n- Validating user input (Bean Validation, custom validators)\n- Configuring CORS, CSRF, or security headers\n- Managing secrets (Vault, environment variables)\n- Adding rate limiting or brute-force protection\n- Scanning dependencies for CVEs\n\n## Authentication\n\n- Prefer stateless JWT or opaque tokens with revocation list\n- Use `httpOnly`, `Secure`, `SameSite=Strict` cookies for sessions\n- Validate tokens with `OncePerRequestFilter` or resource server\n\n```java\n@Component\npublic class JwtAuthFilter extends OncePerRequestFilter {\n  private final JwtService jwtService;\n\n  public JwtAuthFilter(JwtService jwtService) {\n    this.jwtService = jwtService;\n  }\n\n  @Override\n  protected void doFilterInternal(HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response,\n      FilterChain chain) throws ServletException, IOException {\n    String header = request.getHeader(HttpHeaders.AUTHORIZATION);\n    if (header != null && header.startsWith(\"Bearer \")) {\n      String token = header.substring(7);\n      Authentication auth = jwtService.authenticate(token);\n      SecurityContextHolder.getContext().setAuthentication(auth);\n    }\n    chain.doFilter(request, response);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Authorization\n\n- Enable method security: `@EnableMethodSecurity`\n- Use `@PreAuthorize(\"hasRole(''ADMIN'')\")` or `@PreAuthorize(\"@authz.canEdit(#id)\")`\n- Deny by default; expose only required scopes\n\n```java\n@RestController\n@RequestMapping(\"/api/admin\")\npublic class AdminController {\n\n  @PreAuthorize(\"hasRole(''ADMIN'')\")\n  @GetMapping(\"/users\")\n  public List<UserDto> listUsers() {\n    return userService.findAll();\n  }\n\n  @PreAuthorize(\"@authz.isOwner(#id, authentication)\")\n  @DeleteMapping(\"/users/{id}\")\n  public ResponseEntity<Void> deleteUser(@PathVariable Long id) {\n    userService.delete(id);\n    return ResponseEntity.noContent().build();\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Input Validation\n\n- Use Bean Validation with `@Valid` on controllers\n- Apply constraints on DTOs: `@NotBlank`, `@Email`, `@Size`, custom validators\n- Sanitize any HTML with a whitelist before rendering\n\n```java\n// BAD: No validation\n@PostMapping(\"/users\")\npublic User createUser(@RequestBody UserDto dto) {\n  return userService.create(dto);\n}\n\n// GOOD: Validated DTO\npublic record CreateUserDto(\n    @NotBlank @Size(max = 100) String name,\n    @NotBlank @Email String email,\n    @NotNull @Min(0) @Max(150) Integer age\n) {}\n\n@PostMapping(\"/users\")\npublic ResponseEntity<UserDto> createUser(@Valid @RequestBody CreateUserDto dto) {\n  return ResponseEntity.status(HttpStatus.CREATED)\n      .body(userService.create(dto));\n}\n```\n\n## SQL Injection Prevention\n\n- Use Spring Data repositories or parameterized queries\n- For native queries, use `:param` bindings; never concatenate strings\n\n```java\n// BAD: String concatenation in native query\n@Query(value = \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = ''\" + name + \"''\", nativeQuery = true)\n\n// GOOD: Parameterized native query\n@Query(value = \"SELECT * FROM users WHERE name = :name\", nativeQuery = true)\nList<User> findByName(@Param(\"name\") String name);\n\n// GOOD: Spring Data derived query (auto-parameterized)\nList<User> findByEmailAndActiveTrue(String email);\n```\n\n## Password Encoding\n\n- Always hash passwords with BCrypt or Argon2 — never store plaintext\n- Use `PasswordEncoder` bean, not manual hashing\n\n```java\n@Bean\npublic PasswordEncoder passwordEncoder() {\n  return new BCryptPasswordEncoder(12); // cost factor 12\n}\n\n// In service\npublic User register(CreateUserDto dto) {\n  String hashedPassword = passwordEncoder.encode(dto.password());\n  return userRepository.save(new User(dto.email(), hashedPassword));\n}\n```\n\n## CSRF Protection\n\n- For browser session apps, keep CSRF enabled; include token in forms/headers\n- For pure APIs with Bearer tokens, disable CSRF and rely on stateless auth\n\n```java\nhttp\n  .csrf(csrf -> csrf.disable())\n  .sessionManagement(sm -> sm.sessionCreationPolicy(SessionCreationPolicy.STATELESS));\n```\n\n## Secrets Management\n\n- No secrets in source; load from env or vault\n- Keep `application.yml` free of credentials; use placeholders\n- Rotate tokens and DB credentials regularly\n\n```yaml\n# BAD: Hardcoded in application.yml\nspring:\n  datasource:\n    password: mySecretPassword123\n\n# GOOD: Environment variable placeholder\nspring:\n  datasource:\n    password: ${DB_PASSWORD}\n\n# GOOD: Spring Cloud Vault integration\nspring:\n  cloud:\n    vault:\n      uri: https://vault.example.com\n      token: ${VAULT_TOKEN}\n```\n\n## Security Headers\n\n```java\nhttp\n  .headers(headers -> headers\n    .contentSecurityPolicy(csp -> csp\n      .policyDirectives(\"default-src ''self''\"))\n    .frameOptions(HeadersConfigurer.FrameOptionsConfig::sameOrigin)\n    .xssProtection(Customizer.withDefaults())\n    .referrerPolicy(rp -> rp.policy(ReferrerPolicyHeaderWriter.ReferrerPolicy.NO_REFERRER)));\n```\n\n## CORS Configuration\n\n- Configure CORS at the security filter level, not per-controller\n- Restrict allowed origins — never use `*` in production\n\n```java\n@Bean\npublic CorsConfigurationSource corsConfigurationSource() {\n  CorsConfiguration config = new CorsConfiguration();\n  config.setAllowedOrigins(List.of(\"https://app.example.com\"));\n  config.setAllowedMethods(List.of(\"GET\", \"POST\", \"PUT\", \"DELETE\"));\n  config.setAllowedHeaders(List.of(\"Authorization\", \"Content-Type\"));\n  config.setAllowCredentials(true);\n  config.setMaxAge(3600L);\n\n  UrlBasedCorsConfigurationSource source = new UrlBasedCorsConfigurationSource();\n  source.registerCorsConfiguration(\"/api/**\", config);\n  return source;\n}\n\n// In SecurityFilterChain:\nhttp.cors(cors -> cors.configurationSource(corsConfigurationSource()));\n```\n\n## Rate Limiting\n\n- Apply Bucket4j or gateway-level limits on expensive endpoints\n- Log and alert on bursts; return 429 with retry hints\n\n```java\n// Using Bucket4j for per-endpoint rate limiting\n@Component\npublic class RateLimitFilter extends OncePerRequestFilter {\n  private final Map<String, Bucket> buckets = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();\n\n  private Bucket createBucket() {\n    return Bucket.builder()\n        .addLimit(Bandwidth.classic(100, Refill.intervally(100, Duration.ofMinutes(1))))\n        .build();\n  }\n\n  @Override\n  protected void doFilterInternal(HttpServletRequest request, HttpServletResponse response,\n      FilterChain chain) throws ServletException, IOException {\n    String clientIp = request.getRemoteAddr();\n    Bucket bucket = buckets.computeIfAbsent(clientIp, k -> createBucket());\n\n    if (bucket.tryConsume(1)) {\n      chain.doFilter(request, response);\n    } else {\n      response.setStatus(HttpStatus.TOO_MANY_REQUESTS.value());\n      response.getWriter().write(\"{\\\"error\\\": \\\"Rate limit exceeded\\\"}\");\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Dependency Security\n\n- Run OWASP Dependency Check / Snyk in CI\n- Keep Spring Boot and Spring Security on supported versions\n- Fail builds on known CVEs\n\n## Logging and PII\n\n- Never log secrets, tokens, passwords, or full PAN data\n- Redact sensitive fields; use structured JSON logging\n\n## File Uploads\n\n- Validate size, content type, and extension\n- Store outside web root; scan if required\n\n## Checklist Before Release\n\n- [ ] Auth tokens validated and expired correctly\n- [ ] Authorization guards on every sensitive path\n- [ ] All inputs validated and sanitized\n- [ ] No string-concatenated SQL\n- [ ] CSRF posture correct for app type\n- [ ] Secrets externalized; none committed\n- [ ] Security headers configured\n- [ ] Rate limiting on APIs\n- [ ] Dependencies scanned and up to date\n- [ ] Logs free of sensitive data\n\n**Remember**: Deny by default, validate inputs, least privilege, and secure-by-configuration first.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:12:10.235Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理Spring Boot安全最佳实践","ja":"AIエージェントのためのSpring Bootセキュリティベストプラクティス","ko":"AI 에이전트를 위한 Spring Boot 보안 최고의 실践","es":"Herramientas de seguridad de Spring Boot para desarrollad...","fr":"Outils de sécurité Spring Boot pour les développeurs","de":"Spring Boot Sicherheitstools für Entwickler","pt":"Ferramentas de Segurança Spring Boot com Agentes de IA","ru":"ИИ Агенты для Spring Boot Security","ar":"أدوات الأمان سبرينغ بوت مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"springboot-security"},"description":{"zh":"Spring Boot安全最佳实践，包括authn、authz、验证、CSRF、秘密、头部、速率限制和依赖安全","ja":"Spring Bootセキュリティベストプラクティス，包括認証、認可、検証、CSRF、シークレット、ヘッダー、レート制限、依存関係のセキュリティ","ko":"Spring Boot 보안 최고의 실践，包括 인증、인가、검증、CSRF、비밀、헤더、속도 제한 및 종속 보안","es":"Spring Boot Security es una colección de mejores prácticas para la autenticación, autorización y validación de datos en aplicaciones Java Spring Boot","fr":"Spring Boot Security est un ensemble de meilleures pratiques pour l''authentification, l''autorisation et la validation des données dans les applications Java ...","de":"Spring Boot Security ist eine Sammlung von bewährten Methoden für die Authentifizierung, Autorisierung und Datenvalidierung in Java-Spring-Boot-Anwendungen","pt":"O Spring Boot Security oferece recursos para autenticação, autorização e segurança em serviços Java","ru":"Spring Boot Security предоставляет функции для аутентификации, авторизации и безопасности в сервисах Java","ar":"يوفر سبرينغ بوت للأمان ميزات للمصادقة والتفويض والأمان في خدمات جافا","en":"Spring Security best practices for authn/authz, validation, CSRF, secrets, headers, rate limiting, and dependency security in Java Spring Boot services."},"definition":{"en":"Spring Security best practices for authn/authz, validation, CSRF, secrets, headers, rate limiting, and dependency security in Java Spring Boot services."},"features":{"zh":["实现authn和authz","验证用户输入","配置CORS和CSRF","管理秘密和头部","添加速率限制和暴力破解保护","扫描依赖项的CVE"],"ja":["認証と認可の実現","ユーザー入力の検証","CORSとCSRFの設定","シークレットとヘッダーの管理","レート制限とブルートフォース保護の追加","依存関係のCVEのスキャン"],"ko":["인증과 인가의 구현","사용자 입력의 검증","CORS와 CSRF의 설정","비밀과 헤더의 관리","속도 제한과暴力破解 보호의 추가","종속関係의 CVE의 스キャн"],"es":["Autenticación y autorización con JWT, OAuth2 y sesiones","Validación de datos con Bean Validation y validadores personalizados","Configuración de CORS, CSRF y encabezados de seguridad","Gestión de secretos con Vault y variables de entorno","Limitación de velocidad y protección contra ataques de fuerza bruta","Análisis de dependencias para vulnerabilidades de seguridad"],"fr":["Authentification et autorisation avec JWT, OAuth2 et sessions","Validation des données avec Bean Validation et validateurs personnalisés","Configuration de CORS, CSRF et en-têtes de sécurité","Gestion des secrets avec Vault et variables d''environnement","Limitation de vitesse et protection contre les attaques de force brute","Analyse des dépendances pour les vulnérabilités de sécurité"],"de":["Authentifizierung und Autorisierung mit JWT, OAuth2 und Sitzungen","Datenvalidierung mit Bean Validation und benutzerdefinierten Validatoren","Konfiguration von CORS, CSRF und Sicherheitsheadern","Verwaltung von Geheimnissen mit Vault und Umgebungsvariablen","Rate Limiting und Schutz vor Brute-Force-Angriffen","Abhängigkeitsanalyse für Sicherheitslücken"],"pt":["Autenticação com JWT, OAuth2 e sessões","Autorização com @PreAuthorize e acesso baseado em papéis","Validação de entrada de usuário com Bean Validation","Configuração de CORS, CSRF e cabeçalhos de segurança","Gerenciamento de segredos com Vault e variáveis de ambiente","Adicionando limitação de taxa e proteção contra força bruta"],"ru":["Аутентификация с помощью JWT, OAuth2 и сессий","Авторизация с помощью @PreAuthorize и ролевого доступа","Валидация пользовательского ввода с помощью Bean Validation","Настройка CORS, CSRF и заголовков безопасности","Управление секретами с помощью Vault и переменных среды","Добавление ограничения скорости и защиты от брутфорса"],"ar":["المصادقة باستخدام JWT و OAuth2 و الدورات","التفويض باستخدام @PreAuthorize و الوصول المبني على الأدوار","التحقق من صحة مدخلات المستخدم باستخدام Bean Validation","تكوين CORS و CSRF و رؤوس الأمان","إدارة الأسرار باستخدام Vault و متغيرات البيئة","إضافة حماية من الإفراط في الطلب"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Spring Boot安全","AI智能代理","authn","authz","验证","CSRF","秘密","头部","速率限制","依赖安全"],"ja":["Spring Bootセキュリティ","AIエージェント","認証","認可","検証","CSRF","シークレット","ヘッダー","レート制限","依存関係のセキュリティ"],"ko":["Spring Boot 보안","AI 에이전트","인증","인가","검증","CSRF","비밀","헤더","속도 제한","종속 보안"],"es":["seguridad de Spring Boot","autenticación y autorización","validación de datos","CORS y CSRF","gestión de secretos","limitación de velocidad","análisis de dependencias","herramientas de seguridad para desarrolladores","mejores prácticas de seguridad"],"fr":["sécurité Spring Boot","authentification et autorisation","validation des données","CORS et CSRF","gestion des secrets","limitation de vitesse","analyse des dépendances","outils de sécurité pour les développeurs","meilleures pratiques de sécurité"],"de":["Spring-Boot-Sicherheit","Authentifizierung und Autorisierung","Datenvalidierung","CORS und CSRF","Geheimnisverwaltung","Rate Limiting","Abhängigkeitsanalyse","Sicherheitstools für Entwickler","Sicherheitsbest-Practices"],"pt":["Spring Boot Security","Autenticação Java","Autorização Spring Boot","Segurança em Serviços Java","Agentes de IA para Segurança","Ferramentas de Desenvolvimento de Segurança","Melhores Práticas de Segurança Spring Boot"],"ru":["Spring Boot Security","Аутентификация Java","Авторизация Spring Boot","Безопасность в сервисах Java","ИИ Агенты для безопасности","Инструменты разработки безопасности","Лучшие практики безопасности Spring Boot"],"ar":["سبرينغ بوت للأمان","المصادقة جافا","التفويض سبرينغ بوت","أمان خدمات جافا","وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي للأمان","أدوات تطوير الأمان","أفضل الممارسات للأمان سبرينغ بوت"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Java-based AI Agents requiring robust security features in Spring Boot applications, such as authentication, authorization, and input validation.","zh":"适用于需要在Spring Boot应用程序中实现强大的安全功能（如身份验证、授权和输入验证）的基于Java的AI代理。","ja":"Spring Bootアプリケーションで強力なセキュリティ機能（例：認証、認可、入力検証）を必要とするJavaベースのAIエージェントに最適です。","ko":"스프링 부트 애플리케이션에서 강력한 보안 기능(예: 인증, 인가, 입력 유효성 검사)을 필요로 하는 자바 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA basados en Java que requieren características de seguridad robustas en aplicaciones Spring Boot, como autenticación, autorización y validación de entrada.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA basés sur Java nécessitant des fonctionnalités de sécurité robustes dans les applications Spring Boot, telles que l''authentification, l''autorisation et la validation des entrées.","de":"Ideal für Java-basierte KI-Agents, die robuste Sicherheitsfunktionen in Spring-Boot-Anwendungen benötigen, wie Authentifizierung, Autorisierung und Eingabevalidierung.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA baseados em Java que exigem recursos de segurança robustos em aplicações Spring Boot, como autenticação, autorização e validação de entrada.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе Java, требующих надежных функций безопасности в приложениях Spring Boot, таких как аутентификация, авторизация и проверка ввода.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المستند إلى جافا الذي يتطلب ميزات أمان قوية في تطبيقات Spring Boot، مثل المصادقة والتحقق والتحقق من المدخلات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement secure authentication mechanisms like JWT and OAuth2, enforce role-based access control using @PreAuthorize, and protect against CSRF and brute-force attacks by configuring security headers and rate limiting, all while ensuring dependency security and secret management through tools like Vault.","zh":"赋予代理实现像JWT和OAuth2这样的安全身份验证机制的能力，使用@PreAuthorize强制基于角色的访问控制，通过配置安全头和速率限制保护免受CSRF和暴力攻击，并通过像Vault这样的工具确保依赖安全和密钥管理。","ja":"JWTやOAuth2のような安全な認証メカニズムの実装を可能にし、@PreAuthorizeを使用したロールベースのアクセス制御の強制、セキュリティヘッダとレート制限の設定によるCSRFとブルートフォース攻撃からの保護、およびVaultのようなツールを使用した依存関係のセキュリティとシークレットマネジメントの確保。","ko":"JWT와 OAuth2와 같은 보안 인증 메커니즘을 구현할 수 있도록 하며, @PreAuthorize를 사용하여 역할 기반의 접근 제어를 강제하고, 보안 헤더와 속도 제한을 구성하여 CSRF와 무작위 대입 공격으로부터 보호하며, Vault와 같은 도구를 사용하여 의존성 보안과 비밀 관리를 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a implementar mecanismos de autenticación seguros como JWT y OAuth2, a aplicar el control de acceso basado en roles mediante @PreAuthorize y a protegerse contra ataques de CSRF y fuerza bruta configurando encabezados de seguridad y limitación de velocidad, todo mientras se garantiza la seguridad de las dependencias y la gestión de secretos a través de herramientas como Vault.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre des mécanismes d''authentification sécurisés comme JWT et OAuth2, d''appliquer le contrôle d''accès basé sur les rôles en utilisant @PreAuthorize et de se protéger contre les attaques de CSRF et de force brute en configurant les en-têtes de sécurité et la limitation de débit, le tout en garantissant la sécurité des dépendances et la gestion des secrets via des outils comme Vault.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, sichere Authentifizierungsmechanismen wie JWT und OAuth2 zu implementieren, rollenbasierten Zugriffsschutz mithilfe von @PreAuthorize durchzusetzen und sich vor CSRF- und Brute-Force-Angriffen zu schützen, indem Sicherheitsheader und Rate Limiting konfiguriert werden, während gleichzeitig die Sicherheit von Abhängigkeiten und die Verwaltung von Geheimnissen durch Tools wie Vault gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar mecanismos de autenticação seguros como JWT e OAuth2, aplicar controle de acesso baseado em funções usando @PreAuthorize e proteger contra ataques de CSRF e força bruta configurando cabeçalhos de segurança e limitação de taxa, garantindo ao mesmo tempo a segurança da dependência e o gerenciamento de segredos por meio de ferramentas como Vault.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовать безопасные механизмы аутентификации, такие как JWT и OAuth2, обеспечить роль-контроль доступа с помощью @PreAuthorize и защитить от атак CSRF и брутфорса, настраивая заголовки безопасности и ограничение скорости, обеспечивая при этом безопасность зависимостей и управление секретами с помощью инструментов, таких как Vault.","ar":"يتمكن العملاء من تنفيذ آليات مصادقة آمنة مثل JWT و OAuth2، وتنفيذ التحكم في الوصول المستند إلى الأدوار باستخدام @PreAuthorize، وحماية ضد هجمات CSRF والقوة الغاشمة من خلال تكوين رؤوس الأمان وتقييد معدل النقل، مع ضمان سلامة التبعية وإدارة الأسرار من خلال أدوات مثل Vault."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing authentication and authorization for Spring Boot services","Configuring CORS and CSRF protection for RESTful APIs","Validating user input using Bean Validation and custom validators","Managing secrets securely using environment variables or Vault","Scanning dependencies for known vulnerabilities and CVEs"],"zh":["为Spring Boot服务实现身份验证和授权","为RESTful API配置CORS和CSRF保护","使用Bean Validation和自定义验证器验证用户输入","使用环境变量或Vault安全管理密钥","扫描依赖项以查找已知漏洞和CVE"],"ja":["Spring Bootサービスで認証と認可を実装する","RESTful APIでCORSとCSRF保護を設定する","Bean Validationとカスタムバリデータを使用してユーザー入力を検証する","環境変数またはVaultを使用してシークレットを安全に管理する","依存関係をスキャンして既知の脆弱性とCVEを検出する"],"ko":["스프링 부트 서비스에서 인증 및 인가를 구현합니다.","RESTful API에서 CORS 및 CSRF 보호를 구성합니다.","빈 유효성 검사와 사용자 지정 유효성 검사기를 사용하여 사용자 입력을 검증합니다.","환경 변수 또는 Vault를 사용하여 비밀을 안전하게 관리합니다.","의존 항목을 스캔하여 알려진 취약점과 CVE를 검색합니다."],"es":["Implementar autenticación y autorización para servicios Spring Boot","Configurar protección CORS y CSRF para APIs RESTful","Validar entrada de usuario mediante Bean Validation y validadores personalizados","Gestionar secretos de forma segura mediante variables de entorno o Vault","Escaneo de dependencias para vulnerabilidades y CVE conocidas"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre l''authentification et l''autorisation pour les services Spring Boot","Configurer la protection CORS et CSRF pour les API RESTful","Valider les entrées utilisateur à l''aide de Bean Validation et de validateurs personnalisés","Gérer les secrets de manière sécurisée à l''aide de variables d''environnement ou de Vault","Analyse des dépendances pour les vulnérabilités et les CVE connues"],"de":["Implementierung von Authentifizierung und Autorisierung für Spring-Boot-Dienste","Konfigurieren von CORS- und CSRF-Schutz für RESTful-APIs","Validierung von Benutzereingaben mithilfe von Bean Validation und benutzerdefinierten Validatoren","Sichere Verwaltung von Geheimnissen mithilfe von Umgebungsvariablen oder Vault","Überprüfung von Abhängigkeiten auf bekannte Schwachstellen und CVE"],"pt":["Implementar autenticação e autorização para serviços Spring Boot","Configurar proteção CORS e CSRF para APIs RESTful","Validar entrada de usuário usando Bean Validation e validadores personalizados","Gerenciar segredos de forma segura usando variáveis de ambiente ou Vault","Digitalizar dependências para vulnerabilidades e CVEs conhecidas"],"ru":["Реализовать аутентификацию и авторизацию для сервисов Spring Boot","Настроить защиту CORS и CSRF для RESTful API","Проверить ввод пользователя с помощью Bean Validation и пользовательских валидаторов","Управлять секретами безопасно с помощью переменных среды или Vault","Сканировать зависимости на наличие известных уязвимостей и CVE"],"ar":["تنفيذ المصادقة والتحقق لخدمات Spring Boot","تكوين حماية CORS والتحقق من الصحة من هجمات CSRF لبروتوكول APIs RESTful","التحقق من مدخلات المستخدم باستخدام Bean Validation والمدققين المخصصين","إدارة الأسرار بطريقة آمنة باستخدام متغيرات البيئة أو Vault","فحص التبعيات للكشف عن الثغرات والCVE المعروفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Java Spring Boot environment","Limited to Spring Security framework","Needs proper configuration for optimal security"],"zh":["需要Java Spring Boot环境","仅限于Spring Security框架","需要适当的配置以实现最佳安全性"],"ja":["Java Spring Boot環境が必要","Spring Securityフレームワークに限定される","最適なセキュリティを実現するために適切な設定が必要"],"ko":["자바 스프링 부트 환경이 필요합니다.","스프링 시큐리티 프레임워크로 제한됩니다.","최적의 보안을 달성하기 위해 적절한 구성이 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere entorno Java Spring Boot","Limitado al marco de seguridad de Spring","Necesita configuración adecuada para una seguridad óptima"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Java Spring Boot","Limité au cadre de sécurité Spring","Nécessite une configuration appropriée pour une sécurité optimale"],"de":["Benötigt eine Java-Spring-Boot-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf das Spring-Sicherheitsframework","Benötigt eine ordnungsgemäße Konfiguration für eine optimale Sicherheit"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Java Spring Boot","Limitado ao framework Spring Security","Necessita de configuração adequada para segurança ótima"],"ru":["Требует среды Java Spring Boot","Ограничен фреймворком Spring Security","Требует правильной настройки для оптимальной безопасности"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Java Spring Boot","محدود بإطار أمان Spring","يحتاج إلى تكوين مناسب لضمان سلامة مثالية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7bfabd0a87dd3abda4af572e913a84bd2470a876490799d3bf024e22a6870885","repoEtag":"W/\"1d66934774ad40d3d916abf4c33c3e340ab032f8212b35e12a94daa7359886c9\"","qualityScore":86}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/springboot-tdd', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'springboot-tdd', 55024, 6781, 86, '2026-03-01T05:07:39Z', '2026-03-01T05:12:10.283Z', '67d3d67c8f9d18109979944c028d8c0e1a219c0366ef96c95befd6fb3a0856d4', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/springboot-tdd","name":"springboot-tdd","description":{"zh":"Spring Boot TDD开发流程，使用JUnit 5、Mockito、MockMvc、Testcontainers和JaCoCo实现高效的测试驱动开发","ja":"Spring Boot TDD開発プロセス、JUnit 5、Mockito、MockMvc、Testcontainers、JaCoCoを使用して効率的なテスト駆動開発を実現","ko":"스프링 부트 TDD 개발 프로세스, JUnit 5, Mockito, MockMvc, Testcontainers, JaCoCo를 사용하여 효율적인 테스트 주도 개발을 구현","es":"Desarrolla aplicaciones Spring Boot con pruebas unitarias y de integración utilizando JUnit 5, Mockito y JaCoCo","fr":"Développez des applications Spring Boot avec des tests unitaires et d''intégration utilisant JUnit 5, Mockito et JaCoCo","de":"Entwickeln Sie Spring-Boot-Anwendungen mit Einheitstests und Integrationstests unter Verwendung von JUnit 5, Mockito und JaCoCo","pt":"O springboot-tdd é uma habilidade de agente de IA que fornece orientação de TDD para serviços Spring Boot com cobertura de 80% ou mais","ru":"Springboot-tdd - это навык ИИ Агента, который предоставляет руководство по TDD для сервисов Spring Boot с покрытием 80% или более","ar":"سبرينج بوت-تي دي دي هو مهارة وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي التي توفر إرشادات التطوير الموجهة بالتحقق لتطبيقات سبرينج بوت مع تغطية 80% أو أكثر","en":"Test-driven development for Spring Boot using JUnit 5, Mockito, MockMvc, Testcontainers, and JaCoCo. Use when adding features, fixing bugs, or refactoring."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":55024,"forks":6781,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:07:39Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"springboot-tdd","description":"Test-driven development for Spring Boot using JUnit 5, Mockito, MockMvc, Testcontainers, and JaCoCo. Use when adding features, fixing bugs, or refactoring.","bodyPreview":"# Spring Boot TDD Workflow\n\nTDD guidance for Spring Boot services with 80%+ coverage (unit + integration).\n\n## When to Use\n\n- New features or endpoints\n- Bug fixes or refactors\n- Adding data access logic or security rules\n\n## Workflow\n\n1) Write tests first (they should fail)\n2) Implement minimal code to pass\n3) Refactor with tests green\n4) Enforce coverage (JaCoCo)\n\n## Unit Tests (JUnit 5 + Mockito)\n\n```java\n@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)\nclass MarketServiceTest {\n  @Mock MarketRepository r","body":"# Spring Boot TDD Workflow\n\nTDD guidance for Spring Boot services with 80%+ coverage (unit + integration).\n\n## When to Use\n\n- New features or endpoints\n- Bug fixes or refactors\n- Adding data access logic or security rules\n\n## Workflow\n\n1) Write tests first (they should fail)\n2) Implement minimal code to pass\n3) Refactor with tests green\n4) Enforce coverage (JaCoCo)\n\n## Unit Tests (JUnit 5 + Mockito)\n\n```java\n@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)\nclass MarketServiceTest {\n  @Mock MarketRepository repo;\n  @InjectMocks MarketService service;\n\n  @Test\n  void createsMarket() {\n    CreateMarketRequest req = new CreateMarketRequest(\"name\", \"desc\", Instant.now(), List.of(\"cat\"));\n    when(repo.save(any())).thenAnswer(inv -> inv.getArgument(0));\n\n    Market result = service.create(req);\n\n    assertThat(result.name()).isEqualTo(\"name\");\n    verify(repo).save(any());\n  }\n}\n```\n\nPatterns:\n- Arrange-Act-Assert\n- Avoid partial mocks; prefer explicit stubbing\n- Use `@ParameterizedTest` for variants\n\n## Web Layer Tests (MockMvc)\n\n```java\n@WebMvcTest(MarketController.class)\nclass MarketControllerTest {\n  @Autowired MockMvc mockMvc;\n  @MockBean MarketService marketService;\n\n  @Test\n  void returnsMarkets() throws Exception {\n    when(marketService.list(any())).thenReturn(Page.empty());\n\n    mockMvc.perform(get(\"/api/markets\"))\n        .andExpect(status().isOk())\n        .andExpect(jsonPath(\"$.content\").isArray());\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Integration Tests (SpringBootTest)\n\n```java\n@SpringBootTest\n@AutoConfigureMockMvc\n@ActiveProfiles(\"test\")\nclass MarketIntegrationTest {\n  @Autowired MockMvc mockMvc;\n\n  @Test\n  void createsMarket() throws Exception {\n    mockMvc.perform(post(\"/api/markets\")\n        .contentType(MediaType.APPLICATION_JSON)\n        .content(\"\"\"\n          {\"name\":\"Test\",\"description\":\"Desc\",\"endDate\":\"2030-01-01T00:00:00Z\",\"categories\":[\"general\"]}\n        \"\"\"))\n      .andExpect(status().isCreated());\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Persistence Tests (DataJpaTest)\n\n```java\n@DataJpaTest\n@AutoConfigureTestDatabase(replace = AutoConfigureTestDatabase.Replace.NONE)\n@Import(TestContainersConfig.class)\nclass MarketRepositoryTest {\n  @Autowired MarketRepository repo;\n\n  @Test\n  void savesAndFinds() {\n    MarketEntity entity = new MarketEntity();\n    entity.setName(\"Test\");\n    repo.save(entity);\n\n    Optional<MarketEntity> found = repo.findByName(\"Test\");\n    assertThat(found).isPresent();\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Testcontainers\n\n- Use reusable containers for Postgres/Redis to mirror production\n- Wire via `@DynamicPropertySource` to inject JDBC URLs into Spring context\n\n## Coverage (JaCoCo)\n\nMaven snippet:\n```xml\n<plugin>\n  <groupId>org.jacoco</groupId>\n  <artifactId>jacoco-maven-plugin</artifactId>\n  <version>0.8.14</version>\n  <executions>\n    <execution>\n      <goals><goal>prepare-agent</goal></goals>\n    </execution>\n    <execution>\n      <id>report</id>\n      <phase>verify</phase>\n      <goals><goal>report</goal></goals>\n    </execution>\n  </executions>\n</plugin>\n```\n\n## Assertions\n\n- Prefer AssertJ (`assertThat`) for readability\n- For JSON responses, use `jsonPath`\n- For exceptions: `assertThatThrownBy(...)`\n\n## Test Data Builders\n\n```java\nclass MarketBuilder {\n  private String name = \"Test\";\n  MarketBuilder withName(String name) { this.name = name; return this; }\n  Market build() { return new Market(null, name, MarketStatus.ACTIVE); }\n}\n```\n\n## CI Commands\n\n- Maven: `mvn -T 4 test` or `mvn verify`\n- Gradle: `./gradlew test jacocoTestReport`\n\n**Remember**: Keep tests fast, isolated, and deterministic. Test behavior, not implementation details.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:12:10.283Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具：Spring Boot TDD开发","ja":"AIエージェント：Spring Boot TDD開発","ko":"AI 에이전트: 스프링 부트 TDD 개발","es":"Herramientas de TDD para Spring Boot con Agentes de IA","fr":"Outils de TDD pour Spring Boot avec Agents d''IA","de":"TDD-Tools für Spring Boot mit KI-Agents","pt":"Ferramentas de TDD para Spring Boot com Agentes de IA","ru":"ИИ Агенты для TDD в Spring Boot","ar":"أدوات التطوير الموجهة بالتحقق لاسبرينج بوت مع وكلاء الذكا...","en":"springboot-tdd"},"description":{"zh":"Spring Boot TDD开发流程，使用JUnit 5、Mockito、MockMvc、Testcontainers和JaCoCo实现高效的测试驱动开发","ja":"Spring Boot TDD開発プロセス、JUnit 5、Mockito、MockMvc、Testcontainers、JaCoCoを使用して効率的なテスト駆動開発を実現","ko":"스프링 부트 TDD 개발 프로세스, JUnit 5, Mockito, MockMvc, Testcontainers, JaCoCo를 사용하여 효율적인 테스트 주도 개발을 구현","es":"Desarrolla aplicaciones Spring Boot con pruebas unitarias y de integración utilizando JUnit 5, Mockito y JaCoCo","fr":"Développez des applications Spring Boot avec des tests unitaires et d''intégration utilisant JUnit 5, Mockito et JaCoCo","de":"Entwickeln Sie Spring-Boot-Anwendungen mit Einheitstests und Integrationstests unter Verwendung von JUnit 5, Mockito und JaCoCo","pt":"O springboot-tdd é uma habilidade de agente de IA que fornece orientação de TDD para serviços Spring Boot com cobertura de 80% ou mais","ru":"Springboot-tdd - это навык ИИ Агента, который предоставляет руководство 