e composants React","de":"KI-Tools: Refaktorierung von React-Komponenten","pt":"Ferramentas de Refatoração de Componentes AI","ru":"ИИ Агенты для Рефакторинга Компонентов","ar":"أدوات إعادة هيكلة المكونات الذكية","en":"component-refactoring"},"description":{"zh":"Dify组件重构AI技能，用于简化高复杂度的React组件，提高代码质量和性能","ja":"DifyコンポーネントリファクタリングAIスキルは、Reactコンポーネントを簡素化し、コードの品質とパフォーマンスを向上させるために使用されます","ko":"Dify 컴포넌트 리팩토링 AI 스킬은 React 컴포넌트를 단순화하고 코드 품질과 성능을 향상시키는 데 사용됩니다","es":"Refactoriza componentes React de alta complejidad en Dify frontend para mejorar el rendimiento y la escalabilidad","fr":"Réfactorez des composants React de haute complexité dans Dify frontend pour améliorer les performances et la scalabilité","de":"Refaktorieren Sie komplexe React-Komponenten in Dify frontend, um die Leistung und Skalierbarkeit zu verbessern","pt":"A skill de refatoração de componentes da Dify ajuda a otimizar componentes React complexos, reduzindo a complexidade e melhorando a performance","ru":"Навык рефакторинга компонентов Dify помогает оптимизировать сложные компоненты React, уменьшая сложность и улучшая производительность","ar":"مهارة إعادة هيكلة المكونات في Dify تساعد على تحسين المكونات React المعقدة، وتقليل التعقيد وتحسين الأداء","en":"Refactor high-complexity React components in Dify frontend. Use when `pnpm analyze-component --json` shows complexity > 50 or lineCount > 300, when the user ..."},"definition":{"en":"Refactor high-complexity React components in Dify frontend. Use when `pnpm analyze-component --json` shows complexity > 50 or lineCount > 300, when the user asks for code splitting, hook extraction, or complexity reduction, or when `pnpm analyze-component` warns to refactor before testing; avoid for simple/well-structured components, third-party wrappers, or when the user explicitly wants testing without refactoring."},"features":{"zh":["简化高复杂度的React组件","提高代码质量和性能","使用pnpm analyze-component进行组件分析","支持代码分割和Hook抽取","减少复杂度和代码行数"],"ja":["Reactコンポーネントを簡素化する","コードの品質とパフォーマンスを向上させる","pnpm analyze-componentを使用したコンポーネント分析","コード分割とHook抽出をサポート","複雑度とコード行数を減らす"],"ko":["React 컴포넌트를 단순화하는 기능","코드 품질과 성능을 향상시키는 기능","pnpm analyze-component를 사용한 컴포넌트 분석","코드 분割과 Hook 추출을 지원","복잡도와 코드 행수를 줄이는 기능"],"es":["Análisis de complejidad de componentes","Refactorización de componentes React","Mejora del rendimiento y la escalabilidad","Integración con Dify frontend","Soporte para comandos CLI"],"fr":["Analyse de la complexité des composants","Réfactoration de composants React","Amélioration des performances et de la scalabilité","Intégration avec Dify frontend","Prise en charge des commandes CLI"],"de":["Komplexitätsanalyse von Komponenten","Refaktorierung von React-Komponenten","Leistungs- und Skalierbarkeitsverbesserung","Integration mit Dify frontend","Unterstützung von CLI-Befehlen"],"pt":["Otimização de componentes React complexos","Redução da complexidade do código","Melhoria da performance da aplicação","Análise de componentes com `pnpm analyze-component`","Refatoração de componentes com `refactor-component`"],"ru":["Оптимизация сложных компонентов React","Уменьшение сложности кода","Улучшение производительности приложения","Анализ компонентов с `pnpm analyze-component`","Рефакторинг компонентов с `refactor-component`"],"ar":["تحسين المكونات React المعقدة","تقليل تعقيد الشفرة","تحسين أداء التطبيق","تحليل المكونات مع `pnpm analyze-component`","إعادة هيكلة المكونات مع `refactor-component`"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能体","Dify组件重构","React组件","代码质量","性能优化","pnpm analyze-component","代码分割","Hook抽取"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Difyコンポーネントリファクタリング","Reactコンポーネント","コード品質","パフォーマンス最適化","pnpm analyze-component","コード分割","Hook抽出"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Dify 컴포넌트 리팩토링","React 컴포넌트","코드 품질","성능 최적화","pnpm analyze-component","코드 분割","Hook 추출"],"es":["herramientas de ia","refactorización de componentes","react","dify frontend","análisis de complejidad","optimización de código"],"fr":["outils d''ia","réfactoration de composants","react","dify frontend","analyse de complexité","optimisation de code"],"de":["ki-tools","refaktorierung von komponenten","react","dify frontend","komplexitätsanalyse","code-optimierung"],"pt":["refatoração de componentes","componentes React","otimização de código","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","Dify","AI","IA"],"ru":["рефакторинг компонентов","компоненты React","оптимизация кода","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","Dify","ИИ","AI"],"ar":["إعادة هيكلة المكونات","مكونات React","تحسين الشفرة","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","Dify","الذكاء الاصطناعي","AI"]}},"owner":"langgenius","repo":"dify","repoPath":"langgenius/dify","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.014Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"component-refactoring","description":"Refactor high-complexity React components in Dify frontend. Use when `pnpm analyze-component --json` shows complexity > 50 or lineCount > 300, when the user asks for code splitting, hook extraction, or complexity reduction, or when `pnpm analyze-component` warns to refactor before testing; avoid for simple/well-structured components, third-party wrappers, or when the user explicitly wants testing without refactoring.","bodyPreview":"# Dify Component Refactoring Skill\n\nRefactor high-complexity React components in the Dify frontend codebase with the patterns and workflow below.\n\n> **Complexity Threshold**: Components with complexity > 50 (measured by `pnpm analyze-component`) should be refactored before testing.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Commands (run from `web/`)\n\nUse paths relative to `web/` (e.g., `app/components/...`).\nUse `refactor-component` for refactoring prompts and `analyze-component` for testing prompts and metrics.","body":"# Dify Component Refactoring Skill\n\nRefactor high-complexity React components in the Dify frontend codebase with the patterns and workflow below.\n\n> **Complexity Threshold**: Components with complexity > 50 (measured by `pnpm analyze-component`) should be refactored before testing.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Commands (run from `web/`)\n\nUse paths relative to `web/` (e.g., `app/components/...`).\nUse `refactor-component` for refactoring prompts and `analyze-component` for testing prompts and metrics.\n\n```bash\ncd web\n\n# Generate refactoring prompt\npnpm refactor-component <path>\n\n# Output refactoring analysis as JSON\npnpm refactor-component <path> --json\n\n# Generate testing prompt (after refactoring)\npnpm analyze-component <path>\n\n# Output testing analysis as JSON\npnpm analyze-component <path> --json\n```\n\n### Complexity Analysis\n\n```bash\n# Analyze component complexity\npnpm analyze-component <path> --json\n\n# Key metrics to check:\n# - complexity: normalized score 0-100 (target < 50)\n# - maxComplexity: highest single function complexity\n# - lineCount: total lines (target < 300)\n```\n\n### Complexity Score Interpretation\n\n| Score | Level | Action |\n|-------|-------|--------|\n| 0-25 | 🟢 Simple | Ready for testing |\n| 26-50 | 🟡 Medium | Consider minor refactoring |\n| 51-75 | 🟠 Complex | **Refactor before testing** |\n| 76-100 | 🔴 Very Complex | **Must refactor** |\n\n## Core Refactoring Patterns\n\n### Pattern 1: Extract Custom Hooks\n\n**When**: Component has complex state management, multiple `useState`/`useEffect`, or business logic mixed with UI.\n\n**Dify Convention**: Place hooks in a `hooks/` subdirectory or alongside the component as `use-<feature>.ts`.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Before: Complex state logic in component\nconst Configuration: FC = () => {\n  const [modelConfig, setModelConfig] = useState<ModelConfig>(...)\n  const [datasetConfigs, setDatasetConfigs] = useState<DatasetConfigs>(...)\n  const [completionParams, setCompletionParams] = useState<FormValue>({})\n  \n  // 50+ lines of state management logic...\n  \n  return <div>...</div>\n}\n\n// ✅ After: Extract to custom hook\n// hooks/use-model-config.ts\nexport const useModelConfig = (appId: string) => {\n  const [modelConfig, setModelConfig] = useState<ModelConfig>(...)\n  const [completionParams, setCompletionParams] = useState<FormValue>({})\n  \n  // Related state management logic here\n  \n  return { modelConfig, setModelConfig, completionParams, setCompletionParams }\n}\n\n// Component becomes cleaner\nconst Configuration: FC = () => {\n  const { modelConfig, setModelConfig } = useModelConfig(appId)\n  return <div>...</div>\n}\n```\n\n**Dify Examples**:\n- `web/app/components/app/configuration/hooks/use-advanced-prompt-config.ts`\n- `web/app/components/app/configuration/debug/hooks.tsx`\n- `web/app/components/workflow/hooks/use-workflow.ts`\n\n### Pattern 2: Extract Sub-Components\n\n**When**: Single component has multiple UI sections, conditional rendering blocks, or repeated patterns.\n\n**Dify Convention**: Place sub-components in subdirectories or as separate files in the same directory.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Before: Monolithic JSX with multiple sections\nconst AppInfo = () => {\n  return (\n    <div>\n      {/* 100 lines of header UI */}\n      {/* 100 lines of operations UI */}\n      {/* 100 lines of modals */}\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n\n// ✅ After: Split into focused components\n// app-info/\n//   ├── index.tsx           (orchestration only)\n//   ├── app-header.tsx      (header UI)\n//   ├── app-operations.tsx  (operations UI)\n//   └── app-modals.tsx      (modal management)\n\nconst AppInfo = () => {\n  const { showModal, setShowModal } = useAppInfoModals()\n  \n  return (\n    <div>\n      <AppHeader appDetail={appDetail} />\n      <AppOperations onAction={handleAction} />\n      <AppModals show={showModal} onClose={() => setShowModal(null)} />\n    </div>\n  )\n}\n```\n\n**Dify Examples**:\n- `web/app/components/app/configuration/` directory structure\n- `web/app/components/workflow/nodes/` per-node organization\n\n### Pattern 3: Simplify Conditional Logic\n\n**When**: Deep nesting (> 3 levels), complex ternaries, or multiple `if/else` chains.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Before: Deeply nested conditionals\nconst Template = useMemo(() => {\n  if (appDetail?.mode === AppModeEnum.CHAT) {\n    switch (locale) {\n      case LanguagesSupported[1]:\n        return <TemplateChatZh />\n      case LanguagesSupported[7]:\n        return <TemplateChatJa />\n      default:\n        return <TemplateChatEn />\n    }\n  }\n  if (appDetail?.mode === AppModeEnum.ADVANCED_CHAT) {\n    // Another 15 lines...\n  }\n  // More conditions...\n}, [appDetail, locale])\n\n// ✅ After: Use lookup tables + early returns\nconst TEMPLATE_MAP = {\n  [AppModeEnum.CHAT]: {\n    [LanguagesSupported[1]]: TemplateChatZh,\n    [LanguagesSupported[7]]: TemplateChatJa,\n    default: TemplateChatEn,\n  },\n  [AppModeEnum.ADVANCED_CHAT]: {\n    [LanguagesSupported[1]]: TemplateAdvancedChatZh,\n    // ...\n  },\n}\n\nconst Template = useMemo(() => {\n  const modeTemplates = TEMPLATE_MAP[appDetail?.mode]\n  if (!modeTemplates) return null\n  \n  const TemplateComponent = modeTemplates[locale] || modeTemplates.default\n  return <TemplateComponent appDetail={appDetail} />\n}, [appDetail, locale])\n```\n\n### Pattern 4: Extract API/Data Logic\n\n**When**: Component directly handles API calls, data transformation, or complex async operations.\n\n**Dify Convention**: Use `@tanstack/react-query` hooks from `web/service/use-*.ts` or create custom data hooks.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Before: API logic in component\nconst MCPServiceCard = () => {\n  const [basicAppConfig, setBasicAppConfig] = useState({})\n  \n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (isBasicApp && appId) {\n      (async () => {\n        const res = await fetchAppDetail({ url: ''/apps'', id: appId })\n        setBasicAppConfig(res?.model_config || {})\n      })()\n    }\n  }, [appId, isBasicApp])\n  \n  // More API-related logic...\n}\n\n// ✅ After: Extract to data hook using React Query\n// use-app-config.ts\nimport { useQuery } from ''@tanstack/react-query''\nimport { get } from ''@/service/base''\n\nconst NAME_SPACE = ''appConfig''\n\nexport const useAppConfig = (appId: string, isBasicApp: boolean) => {\n  return useQuery({\n    enabled: isBasicApp && !!appId,\n    queryKey: [NAME_SPACE, ''detail'', appId],\n    queryFn: () => get<AppDetailResponse>(`/apps/${appId}`),\n    select: data => data?.model_config || {},\n  })\n}\n\n// Component becomes cleaner\nconst MCPServiceCard = () => {\n  const { data: config, isLoading } = useAppConfig(appId, isBasicApp)\n  // UI only\n}\n```\n\n**React Query Best Practices in Dify**:\n- Define `NAME_SPACE` for query key organization\n- Use `enabled` option for conditional fetching\n- Use `select` for data transformation\n- Export invalidation hooks: `useInvalidXxx`\n\n**Dify Examples**:\n- `web/service/use-workflow.ts`\n- `web/service/use-common.ts`\n- `web/service/knowledge/use-dataset.ts`\n- `web/service/knowledge/use-document.ts`\n\n### Pattern 5: Extract Modal/Dialog Management\n\n**When**: Component manages multiple modals with complex open/close states.\n\n**Dify Convention**: Modals should be extracted with their state management.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Before: Multiple modal states in component\nconst AppInfo = () => {\n  const [showEditModal, setShowEditModal] = useState(false)\n  const [showDuplicateModal, setShowDuplicateModal] = useState(false)\n  const [showConfirmDelete, setShowConfirmDelete] = useState(false)\n  const [showSwitchModal, setShowSwitchModal] = useState(false)\n  const [showImportDSLModal, setShowImportDSLModal] = useState(false)\n  // 5+ more modal states...\n}\n\n// ✅ After: Extract to modal management hook\ntype ModalType = ''edit'' | ''duplicate'' | ''delete'' | ''switch'' | ''import'' | null\n\nconst useAppInfoModals = () => {\n  const [activeModal, setActiveModal] = useState<ModalType>(null)\n  \n  const openModal = useCallback((type: ModalType) => setActiveModal(type), [])\n  const closeModal = useCallback(() => setActiveModal(null), [])\n  \n  return {\n    activeModal,\n    openModal,\n    closeModal,\n    isOpen: (type: ModalType) => activeModal === type,\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Pattern 6: Extract Form Logic\n\n**When**: Complex form validation, submission handling, or field transformation.\n\n**Dify Convention**: Use `@tanstack/react-form` patterns from `web/app/components/base/form/`.\n\n```typescript\n// ✅ Use existing form infrastructure\nimport { useAppForm } from ''@/app/components/base/form''\n\nconst ConfigForm = () => {\n  const form = useAppForm({\n    defaultValues: { name: '''', description: '''' },\n    onSubmit: handleSubmit,\n  })\n  \n  return <form.Provider>...</form.Provider>\n}\n```\n\n## Dify-Specific Refactoring Guidelines\n\n### 1. Context Provider Extraction\n\n**When**: Component provides complex context values with multiple states.\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Before: Large context value object\nconst value = {\n  appId, isAPIKeySet, isTrailFinished, mode, modelModeType,\n  promptMode, isAdvancedMode, isAgent, isOpenAI, isFunctionCall,\n  // 50+ more properties...\n}\nreturn <ConfigContext.Provider value={value}>...</ConfigContext.Provider>\n\n// ✅ After: Split into domain-specific contexts\n<ModelConfigProvider value={modelConfigValue}>\n  <DatasetConfigProvider value={datasetConfigValue}>\n    <UIConfigProvider value={uiConfigValue}>\n      {children}\n    </UIConfigProvider>\n  </DatasetConfigProvider>\n</ModelConfigProvider>\n```\n\n**Dify Reference**: `web/context/` directory structure\n\n### 2. Workflow Node Components\n\n**When**: Refactoring workflow node components (`web/app/components/workflow/nodes/`).\n\n**Conventions**:\n- Keep node logic in `use-interactions.ts`\n- Extract panel UI to separate files\n- Use `_base` components for common patterns\n\n```\nnodes/<node-type>/\n  ├── index.tsx              # Node registration\n  ├── node.tsx               # Node visual component\n  ├── panel.tsx              # Configuration panel\n  ├── use-interactions.ts    # Node-specific hooks\n  └── types.ts               # Type definitions\n```\n\n### 3. Configuration Components\n\n**When**: Refactoring app configuration components.\n\n**Conventions**:\n- Separate config sections into subdirectories\n- Use existing patterns from `web/app/components/app/configuration/`\n- Keep feature toggles in dedicated components\n\n### 4. Tool/Plugin Components\n\n**When**: Refactoring tool-related components (`web/app/components/tools/`).\n\n**Conventions**:\n- Follow existing modal patterns\n- Use service hooks from `web/service/use-tools.ts`\n- Keep provider-specific logic isolated\n\n## Refactoring Workflow\n\n### Step 1: Generate Refactoring Prompt\n\n```bash\npnpm refactor-component <path>\n```\n\nThis command will:\n- Analyze component complexity and features\n- Identify specific refactoring actions needed\n- Generate a prompt for AI assistant (auto-copied to clipboard on macOS)\n- Provide detailed requirements based on detected patterns\n\n### Step 2: Analyze Details\n\n```bash\npnpm analyze-component <path> --json\n```\n\nIdentify:\n- Total complexity score\n- Max function complexity\n- Line count\n- Features detected (state, effects, API, etc.)\n\n### Step 3: Plan\n\nCreate a refactoring plan based on detected features:\n\n| Detected Feature | Refactoring Action |\n|------------------|-------------------|\n| `hasState: true` + `hasEffects: true` | Extract custom hook |\n| `hasAPI: true` | Extract data/service hook |\n| `hasEvents: true` (many) | Extract event handlers |\n| `lineCount > 300` | Split into sub-components |\n| `maxComplexity > 50` | Simplify conditional logic |\n\n### Step 4: Execute Incrementally\n\n1. **Extract one piece at a time**\n2. **Run lint, type-check, and tests after each extraction**\n3. **Verify functionality before next step**\n\n```\nFor each extraction:\n  ┌────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │ 1. Extract code                        │\n  │ 2. Run: pnpm lint:fix                  │\n  │ 3. Run: pnpm type-check:tsgo           │\n  │ 4. Run: pnpm test                      │\n  │ 5. Test functionality manually         │\n  │ 6. PASS? → Next extraction             │\n  │    FAIL? → Fix before continuing       │\n  └────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n### Step 5: Verify\n\nAfter refactoring:\n\n```bash\n# Re-run refactor command to verify improvements\npnpm refactor-component <path>\n\n# If complexity < 25 and lines < 200, you''ll see:\n# ✅ COMPONENT IS WELL-STRUCTURED\n\n# For detailed metrics:\npnpm analyze-component <path> --json\n\n# Target metrics:\n# - complexity < 50\n# - lineCount < 300\n# - maxComplexity < 30\n```\n\n## Common Mistakes to Avoid\n\n### ❌ Over-Engineering\n\n```typescript\n// ❌ Too many tiny hooks\nconst useButtonText = () => useState(''Click'')\nconst useButtonDisabled = () => useState(false)\nconst useButtonLoading = () => useState(false)\n\n// ✅ Cohesive hook with related state\nconst useButtonState = () => {\n  const [text, setText] = useState(''Click'')\n  const [disabled, setDisabled] = useState(false)\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(false)\n  return { text, setText, disabled, setDisabled, loading, setLoading }\n}\n```\n\n### ❌ Breaking Existing Patterns\n\n- Follow existing directory structures\n- Maintain naming conventions\n- Preserve export patterns for compatibility\n\n### ❌ Premature Abstraction\n\n- Only extract when there''s clear complexity benefit\n- Don''t create abstractions for single-use code\n- Keep refactored code in the same domain area\n\n## References\n\n### Dify Codebase Examples\n\n- **Hook extraction**: `web/app/components/app/configuration/hooks/`\n- **Component splitting**: `web/app/components/app/configuration/`\n- **Service hooks**: `web/service/use-*.ts`\n- **Workflow patterns**: `web/app/components/workflow/hooks/`\n- **Form patterns**: `web/app/components/base/form/`\n\n### Related Skills\n\n- `frontend-testing` - For testing refactored components\n- `web/docs/test.md` - Testing specification\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:09:42.813Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents specializing in React component optimization and code refinement.","zh":"适合专注于 React 组件优化和代码精炼的前端代理。","ja":"React コンポーネントの最適化とコードの洗練に特化したフロントエンド エージェントに適しています。","ko":"React 컴포넌트 최적화 및 코드 정련에 전문적인 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de frontend especializados en la optimización de componentes de React y refinamiento de código.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de frontend spécialisés dans l''optimisation des composants React et l''affinement du code.","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die sich auf die Optimierung von React-Komponenten und Code-Verfeinerung spezialisieren.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend especializados em otimização de componentes React e refinamento de código.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, специализирующихся на оптимизации компонентов React и усовершенствовании кода.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الأمامية الذين يختصون بتحسين مكونات React وتنقية الشفرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to refactor high-complexity React components using `pnpm analyze-component` and `refactor-component` commands, reducing complexity and improving code maintainability with techniques like code splitting and hook extraction.","zh":"赋予代理重构高复杂度 React 组件的能力，使用 `pnpm analyze-component` 和 `refactor-component` 命令，通过代码分割和钩子提取等技术减少复杂度，提高代码的可维护性。","ja":"エージェントに高い複雑度を持つ React コンポーネントをリファクタリングする能力を付与します。`pnpm analyze-component` および `refactor-component` コマンドを使用して、コード分割やフック抽出などの技術で複雑性を減らし、コードの保守性を向上させます。","ko":"에이전트가 높은 복잡도를 가진 React 컴포넌트를 리팩토링할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. `pnpm analyze-component` 및 `refactor-component` 명령을 사용하여 코드 분할 및 훅 추출 등의 기술로 복잡성을 줄이고 코드의 유지 보수를 개선합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a refactorizar componentes de React de alta complejidad utilizando los comandos `pnpm analyze-component` y `refactor-component`, reduciendo la complejidad y mejorando la mantenibilidad del código con técnicas como la división de código y la extracción de hooks.","fr":"Permet aux agents de réorganiser les composants React à complexité élevée en utilisant les commandes `pnpm analyze-component` et `refactor-component`, en réduisant la complexité et en améliorant la maintenabilité du code avec des techniques comme la division de code et l''extraction de hooks.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, React-Komponenten mit hoher Komplexität mit den Befehlen `pnpm analyze-component` und `refactor-component` umzustrukturieren, die Komplexität zu reduzieren und die Wartbarkeit des Codes mit Techniken wie Code-Splitting und Hook-Extraktion zu verbessern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a reestruturar componentes React de alta complexidade usando os comandos `pnpm analyze-component` e `refactor-component`, reduzindo a complexidade e melhorando a manutenibilidade do código com técnicas como divisão de código e extração de hook.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность перестраивать компоненты React высокой сложности с помощью команд `pnpm analyze-component` и `refactor-component`, снижая сложность и улучшая поддерживаемость кода с помощью таких методов, как разделение кода и извлечение хуков.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من إعادة هيكلة مكونات React المعقدة باستخدام أوامر `pnpm analyze-component` و `refactor-component`، وتقليل التعقيد وتحسين صيانة الشفرة باستخدام تقنيات مثل تقسيم الشفرة واستخراج المحاكي."},"useCases":{"en":["Refactoring complex React components with high line counts or complexity scores","Improving code readability and structure through hook extraction and code splitting","Optimizing component performance by reducing complexity and improving maintainability"],"zh":["重构具有高行数或复杂性评分的复杂 React 组件","通过钩子提取和代码分割提高代码的可读性和结构","通过减少复杂性和提高可维护性来优化组件的性能"],"ja":["行数や複雑性スコアが高い複雑な React コンポーネントのリファクタリング","フック抽出やコード分割によってコードの可読性と構造を改善する","複雑性の削減と保守性の向上によってコンポーネントのパフォーマンスを最適化する"],"ko":[" 높은 줄 수 또는 복잡성 점수를 가진 복잡한 React 컴포넌트를 리팩토링"," 훅 추출 및 코드 분할을 통해 코드의 가독성과 구조를 개선"," 복잡성을 줄이고 유지 보수를 개선하여 컴포넌트의 성능을 최적화"],"es":["Reorganización de componentes de React complejos con recuentos de líneas altos o puntuaciones de complejidad","Mejora de la legibilidad y la estructura del código a través de la extracción de hooks y la división de código","Optimización del rendimiento de los componentes reduciendo la complejidad y mejorando la mantenibilidad"],"fr":["Réorganisation de composants React complexes avec des comptes de lignes élevés ou des scores de complexité","Amélioration de la lisibilité et de la structure du code grâce à l''extraction de hooks et à la division de code","Optimisation des performances des composants en réduisant la complexité et en améliorant la maintenabilité"],"de":["Umstrukturierung komplexer React-Komponenten mit hohen Zeilenanzahlen oder Komplexitätswerten","Verbesserung der Lesbarkeit und Struktur des Codes durch Hook-Extraktion und Code-Splitting","Optimierung der Leistung von Komponenten durch Reduzierung der Komplexität und Verbesserung der Wartbarkeit"],"pt":["Reestruturação de componentes React complexos com contagens de linhas altas ou escores de complexidade","Melhoria da legibilidade e estrutura do código por meio da extração de hook e divisão de código","Otimização do desempenho do componente reduzindo a complexidade e melhorando a manutenibilidade"],"ru":["Перестройка сложных компонентов React с высокими счетчиками строк или показателями сложности","Улучшение читаемости и структуры кода за счет извлечения хуков и разделения кода","Оптимизация производительности компонента за счет снижения сложности и улучшения поддерживаемости"],"ar":["إعادة هيكلة مكونات React المعقدة ذات عدد كبير من الأسطر أو درجات التعقيد","تحسين قراءة الشفرة وهيكلتها من خلال استخراج المحاكي وتقسيم الشفرة","تحسين أداء المكون عن طريق تقليل التعقيد وتحسين صيانة الشفرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Dify frontend codebase access","Limited to React components with complexity > 50 or lineCount > 300","Excludes simple or well-structured components, third-party wrappers, or components explicitly marked for testing without refactoring"],"zh":["需要 Dify 前端代码库访问权限","仅限复杂度 > 50 或行数 > 300 的 React 组件","排除简单或结构良好的组件、第三方包装器或明确标记为不需要重构的组件"],"ja":["Dify フロントエンド コードベースへのアクセスが必要","複雑性 > 50 または行数 > 300 の React コンポーネントに限定","シンプルまたは構造化されているコンポーネント、サードパーティのラッパー、またはリファクタリング不要と明示的にマークされているコンポーネントは除外"],"ko":["Dify 프론트엔드 코드베이스에 대한 액세스가 필요","복잡성 > 50 또는 줄 수 > 300인 React 컴포넌트로 제한","단순하거나 구조화된 컴포넌트, 제3자 래퍼 또는 리팩토링이 필요하지 않음으로 명시적으로 표시된 컴포넌트는 제외"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la base de código de frontend de Dify","Limitado a componentes de React con una complejidad > 50 o un recuento de líneas > 300","Excluye componentes simples o bien estructurados, envolturas de terceros o componentes marcados explícitamente para pruebas sin reorganización"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à la base de code frontend de Dify","Limité aux composants React avec une complexité > 50 ou un nombre de lignes > 300","Exclut les composants simples ou bien structurés, les enveloppes de tiers ou les composants explicitement marqués pour des tests sans réorganisation"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf die Dify-Frontend-Codebasis","Begrenzt auf React-Komponenten mit einer Komplexität > 50 oder einer Zeilenanzahl > 300","Schließt einfache oder gut strukturierte Komponenten, Third-Party-Wrapper oder explizit für Tests ohne Umstrukturierung markierte Komponenten aus"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao código-fonte frontend Dify","Limitado a componentes React com complexidade > 50 ou lineCount > 300","Exclui componentes simples ou bem estruturados, wrappers de terceiros ou componentes explicitamente marcados para teste sem reestruturação"],"ru":["Требует доступа к базе кода frontend Dify","Ограничен компонентами React с сложностью > 50 или lineCount > 300","Исключает простые или хорошо структурированные компоненты, обертки третьих сторон или компоненты, явно помеченные для тестирования без перестройки"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة الأمامية ل Dify","محدود بمكونات React ذات التعقيد > 50 أو lineCount > 300","استبعاد المكونات البسيطة أو المكونات ذات الهيكل الجيد، أو غطاء الأطراف الثالثة، أو المكونات المحددة بشكل صريح للاختبار دون إعادة الهيكلة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"996349b0b799095aeaa7781bc9646d032f054edd85a7c90ea67b49f3334c98ad","qualityScore":85}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('callstackincubator/agent-skills/react-native-best-practices', 'official', 'callstackincubator', 'agent-skills', 'callstackincubator/agent-skills', 'react-native-best-practices', 946, 53, 85, '2026-02-28T18:52:27Z', '2026-03-01T05:12:34.052Z', 'a725ff928e058c1dd9c5dae34fc53e0ea0442e65559158de64ae1e902ab59da8', '{"id":"callstackincubator/agent-skills/react-native-best-practices","name":"react-native-best-practices","description":{"zh":"React Native性能优化指南，涵盖JavaScript/React、Native（iOS/Android）和打包优化","ja":"React Nativeパフォーマンス最適化ガイド、JavaScript/React、ネイティブ（iOS/Android）およびバンドル最適化をカバー","ko":"리액트 네이티브 성능 최적화 가이드, JavaScript/React, 네이티브(ios/Android) 및 번들 최적화를 다룹니다","es":"Guía de optimización de rendimiento para aplicaciones React Native, cubriendo JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android) y optimizaciones de empaquetado","fr":"Guide d''optimisation des performances pour les applications React Native, couvrant JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android) et optimisations de packaging","de":"Leitfaden zur Leistungsoptimierung für React Native-Anwendungen, einschließlich JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android) und Paketoptimierungen","pt":"Guia de otimização de desempenho para aplicativos React Native, cobrindo otimizações de JavaScript/React, Nativo (iOS/Android) e empacotamento","ru":"Руководство по оптимизации производительности для приложений React Native, охватывающее оптимизации JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android) и упаковки","ar":"دليل تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات رياكت نيتيف، يشمل تحسينات جافاسكريبت/رياكت، الأصلي (iOS/Android) وتحزيم","en":"Provides React Native performance optimization guidelines for FPS, TTI, bundle size, memory leaks, re-renders, and animations. Applies to tasks involving Hermes optimization, JS thread blocking, bridge overhead, FlashList, native modules, or debugging jank and frame drops."},"owner":"callstackincubator","repo":"agent-skills","repoPath":"callstackincubator/agent-skills","stars":946,"forks":53,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T18:52:27Z","topics":[],"skillMd":{"name":"react-native-best-practices","description":"Provides React Native performance optimization guidelines for FPS, TTI, bundle size, memory leaks, re-renders, and animations. Applies to tasks involving Hermes optimization, JS thread blocking, bridge overhead, FlashList, native modules, or debugging jank and frame drops.","tags":"react-native, expo, performance, optimization, profiling","bodyPreview":"# React Native Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React Native applications, covering JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android), and bundling optimizations. Based on Callstack''s \"Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\".\n\n## Skill Format\n\nEach reference file follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding:\n\n- **Quick Pattern**: Incorrect/Correct code snippets for immediate pattern matching\n- **Quick Command**: Shell commands for process/measurement sk","body":"# React Native Best Practices\n\n## Overview\n\nPerformance optimization guide for React Native applications, covering JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android), and bundling optimizations. Based on Callstack''s \"Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\".\n\n## Skill Format\n\nEach reference file follows a hybrid format for fast lookup and deep understanding:\n\n- **Quick Pattern**: Incorrect/Correct code snippets for immediate pattern matching\n- **Quick Command**: Shell commands for process/measurement skills\n- **Quick Config**: Configuration snippets for setup-focused skills\n- **Quick Reference**: Summary tables for conceptual skills\n- **Deep Dive**: Full context with When to Use, Prerequisites, Step-by-Step, Common Pitfalls\n\n**Impact ratings**: CRITICAL (fix immediately), HIGH (significant improvement), MEDIUM (worthwhile optimization)\n\n## When to Apply\n\nReference these guidelines when:\n- Debugging slow/janky UI or animations\n- Investigating memory leaks (JS or native)\n- Optimizing app startup time (TTI)\n- Reducing bundle or app size\n- Writing native modules (Turbo Modules)\n- Profiling React Native performance\n- Reviewing React Native code for performance\n\n## Priority-Ordered Guidelines\n\n| Priority | Category | Impact | Prefix |\n|----------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 1 | FPS & Re-renders | CRITICAL | `js-*` |\n| 2 | Bundle Size | CRITICAL | `bundle-*` |\n| 3 | TTI Optimization | HIGH | `native-*`, `bundle-*` |\n| 4 | Native Performance | HIGH | `native-*` |\n| 5 | Memory Management | MEDIUM-HIGH | `js-*`, `native-*` |\n| 6 | Animations | MEDIUM | `js-*` |\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Optimization Workflow\n\nFollow this cycle for any performance issue: **Measure → Optimize → Re-measure → Validate**\n\n1. **Measure**: Capture baseline metrics (FPS, TTI, bundle size) before changes\n2. **Optimize**: Apply the targeted fix from the relevant reference\n3. **Re-measure**: Run the same measurement to get updated metrics\n4. **Validate**: Confirm improvement (e.g., FPS 45→60, TTI 3.2s→1.8s, bundle 2.1MB→1.6MB)\n\nIf metrics did not improve, revert and try the next suggested fix.\n\n### Critical: FPS & Re-renders\n\n**Profile first:**\n```bash\n# Open React Native DevTools\n# Press ''j'' in Metro, or shake device → \"Open DevTools\"\n```\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Replace ScrollView with FlatList/FlashList for lists\n- Use React Compiler for automatic memoization\n- Use atomic state (Jotai/Zustand) to reduce re-renders\n- Use `useDeferredValue` for expensive computations\n\n### Critical: Bundle Size\n\n**Analyze bundle:**\n```bash\nnpx react-native bundle \\\n  --entry-file index.js \\\n  --bundle-output output.js \\\n  --platform ios \\\n  --sourcemap-output output.js.map \\\n  --dev false --minify true\n\nnpx source-map-explorer output.js --no-border-checks\n```\n\n**Verify improvement after optimization:**\n```bash\n# Record baseline size before changes\nls -lh output.js  # e.g., Before: 2.1 MB\n\n# After applying fixes, re-bundle and compare\nnpx react-native bundle --entry-file index.js --bundle-output output.js \\\n  --platform ios --dev false --minify true\nls -lh output.js  # e.g., After: 1.6 MB  (24% reduction)\n```\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Avoid barrel imports (import directly from source)\n- Remove unnecessary Intl polyfills (Hermes has native support)\n- Enable tree shaking (Expo SDK 52+ or Re.Pack)\n- Enable R8 for Android native code shrinking\n\n### High: TTI Optimization\n\n**Measure TTI:**\n- Use `react-native-performance` for markers\n- Only measure cold starts (exclude warm/hot/prewarm)\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Disable JS bundle compression on Android (enables Hermes mmap)\n- Use native navigation (react-native-screens)\n- Preload commonly-used expensive screens before navigating to them\n\n### High: Native Performance\n\n**Profile native:**\n- iOS: Xcode Instruments → Time Profiler\n- Android: Android Studio → CPU Profiler\n\n**Common fixes:**\n- Use background threads for heavy native work\n- Prefer async over sync Turbo Module methods\n- Use C++ for cross-platform performance-critical code\n\n## References\n\nFull documentation with code examples in [references/][references]:\n\n### JavaScript/React (`js-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md][js-lists-flatlist-flashlist] | CRITICAL | Replace ScrollView with virtualized lists |\n| [js-profile-react.md][js-profile-react] | MEDIUM | React DevTools profiling |\n| [js-measure-fps.md][js-measure-fps] | HIGH | FPS monitoring and measurement |\n| [js-memory-leaks.md][js-memory-leaks] | MEDIUM | JS memory leak hunting |\n| [js-atomic-state.md][js-atomic-state] | HIGH | Jotai/Zustand patterns |\n| [js-concurrent-react.md][js-concurrent-react] | HIGH | useDeferredValue, useTransition |\n| [js-react-compiler.md][js-react-compiler] | HIGH | Automatic memoization |\n| [js-animations-reanimated.md][js-animations-reanimated] | MEDIUM | Reanimated worklets |\n| [js-uncontrolled-components.md][js-uncontrolled-components] | HIGH | TextInput optimization |\n\n### Native (`native-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [native-turbo-modules.md][native-turbo-modules] | HIGH | Building fast native modules |\n| [native-sdks-over-polyfills.md][native-sdks-over-polyfills] | HIGH | Native vs JS libraries |\n| [native-measure-tti.md][native-measure-tti] | HIGH | TTI measurement setup |\n| [native-threading-model.md][native-threading-model] | HIGH | Turbo Module threads |\n| [native-profiling.md][native-profiling] | MEDIUM | Xcode/Android Studio profiling |\n| [native-platform-setup.md][native-platform-setup] | MEDIUM | iOS/Android tooling guide |\n| [native-view-flattening.md][native-view-flattening] | MEDIUM | View hierarchy debugging |\n| [native-memory-patterns.md][native-memory-patterns] | MEDIUM | C++/Swift/Kotlin memory |\n| [native-memory-leaks.md][native-memory-leaks] | MEDIUM | Native memory leak hunting |\n| [native-android-16kb-alignment.md][native-android-16kb-alignment] | CRITICAL | Third-party library alignment for Google Play |\n\n### Bundling (`bundle-*`)\n\n| File | Impact | Description |\n|------|--------|-------------|\n| [bundle-barrel-exports.md][bundle-barrel-exports] | CRITICAL | Avoid barrel imports |\n| [bundle-analyze-js.md][bundle-analyze-js] | CRITICAL | JS bundle visualization |\n| [bundle-tree-shaking.md][bundle-tree-shaking] | HIGH | Dead code elimination |\n| [bundle-analyze-app.md][bundle-analyze-app] | HIGH | App size analysis |\n| [bundle-r8-android.md][bundle-r8-android] | HIGH | Android code shrinking |\n| [bundle-hermes-mmap.md][bundle-hermes-mmap] | HIGH | Disable bundle compression |\n| [bundle-native-assets.md][bundle-native-assets] | HIGH | Asset catalog setup |\n| [bundle-library-size.md][bundle-library-size] | MEDIUM | Evaluate dependencies |\n| [bundle-code-splitting.md][bundle-code-splitting] | MEDIUM | Re.Pack code splitting |\n\n\n## Searching References\n\n```bash\n# Find patterns by keyword\ngrep -l \"reanimated\" references/\ngrep -l \"flatlist\" references/\ngrep -l \"memory\" references/\ngrep -l \"profil\" references/\ngrep -l \"tti\" references/\ngrep -l \"bundle\" references/\n```\n\n## Problem → Skill Mapping\n\n| Problem | Start With |\n|---------|------------|\n| App feels slow/janky | [js-measure-fps.md][js-measure-fps] → [js-profile-react.md][js-profile-react] |\n| Too many re-renders | [js-profile-react.md][js-profile-react] → [js-react-compiler.md][js-react-compiler] |\n| Slow startup (TTI) | [native-measure-tti.md][native-measure-tti] → [bundle-analyze-js.md][bundle-analyze-js] |\n| Large app size | [bundle-analyze-app.md][bundle-analyze-app] → [bundle-r8-android.md][bundle-r8-android] |\n| Memory growing | [js-memory-leaks.md][js-memory-leaks] or [native-memory-leaks.md][native-memory-leaks] |\n| Animation drops frames | [js-animations-reanimated.md][js-animations-reanimated] |\n| List scroll jank | [js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md][js-lists-flatlist-flashlist] |\n| TextInput lag | [js-uncontrolled-components.md][js-uncontrolled-components] |\n| Native module slow | [native-turbo-modules.md][native-turbo-modules] → [native-threading-model.md][native-threading-model] |\n| Native library alignment issue | [native-android-16kb-alignment.md][native-android-16kb-alignment] |\n\n[references]: references/\n[js-lists-flatlist-flashlist]: references/js-lists-flatlist-flashlist.md\n[js-profile-react]: references/js-profile-react.md\n[js-measure-fps]: references/js-measure-fps.md\n[js-memory-leaks]: references/js-memory-leaks.md\n[js-atomic-state]: references/js-atomic-state.md\n[js-concurrent-react]: references/js-concurrent-react.md\n[js-react-compiler]: references/js-react-compiler.md\n[js-animations-reanimated]: references/js-animations-reanimated.md\n[js-uncontrolled-components]: references/js-uncontrolled-components.md\n[native-turbo-modules]: references/native-turbo-modules.md\n[native-sdks-over-polyfills]: references/native-sdks-over-polyfills.md\n[native-measure-tti]: references/native-measure-tti.md\n[native-threading-model]: references/native-threading-model.md\n[native-profiling]: references/native-profiling.md\n[native-platform-setup]: references/native-platform-setup.md\n[native-view-flattening]: references/native-view-flattening.md\n[native-memory-patterns]: references/native-memory-patterns.md\n[native-memory-leaks]: references/native-memory-leaks.md\n[native-android-16kb-alignment]: references/native-android-16kb-alignment.md\n[bundle-barrel-exports]: references/bundle-barrel-exports.md\n[bundle-analyze-js]: references/bundle-analyze-js.md\n[bundle-tree-shaking]: references/bundle-tree-shaking.md\n[bundle-analyze-app]: references/bundle-analyze-app.md\n[bundle-r8-android]: references/bundle-r8-android.md\n[bundle-hermes-mmap]: references/bundle-hermes-mmap.md\n[bundle-native-assets]: references/bundle-native-assets.md\n[bundle-library-size]: references/bundle-library-size.md\n[bundle-code-splitting]: references/bundle-code-splitting.md\n\n## Attribution\n\nBased on \"The Ultimate Guide to React Native Optimization\" by Callstack.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:12:34.052Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具：React Native最佳实践","ja":"AIエージェント：React Nativeベストプラクティス","ko":"AI 에이전트: 리액트 네이티브 최적화 가이드","es":"Herramientas de React Native: Mejores prácticas para AI A...","fr":"Outils React Native: Meilleures pratiques pour les AI Agents","de":"React Native-Tools: Best Practices für AI-Agents","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Melhores Práticas React Native","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Лучшие Практики React Native","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: أفضل الممارسات لري액ت نيتيف","en":"react-native-best-practices"},"description":{"zh":"React Native性能优化指南，涵盖JavaScript/React、Native（iOS/Android）和打包优化","ja":"React Nativeパフォーマンス最適化ガイド、JavaScript/React、ネイティブ（iOS/Android）およびバンドル最適化をカバー","ko":"리액트 네이티브 성능 최적화 가이드, JavaScript/React, 네이티브(ios/Android) 및 번들 최적화를 다룹니다","es":"Guía de optimización de rendimiento para aplicaciones React Native, cubriendo JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android) y optimizaciones de empaquetado","fr":"Guide d''optimisation des performances pour les applications React Native, couvrant JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android) et optimisations de packaging","de":"Leitfaden zur Leistungsoptimierung für React Native-Anwendungen, einschließlich JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android) und Paketoptimierungen","pt":"Guia de otimização de desempenho para aplicativos React Native, cobrindo otimizações de JavaScript/React, Nativo (iOS/Android) e empacotamento","ru":"Руководство по оптимизации производительности для приложений React Native, охватывающее оптимизации JavaScript/React, Native (iOS/Android) и упаковки","ar":"دليل تحسين الأداء لتطبيقات رياكت نيتيف، يشمل تحسينات جافاسكريبت/رياكت، الأصلي (iOS/Android) وتحزيم","en":"Provides React Native performance optimization guidelines for FPS, TTI, bundle size, memory leaks, re-renders, and animations. Applies to tasks involving Her..."},"definition":{"en":"Provides React Native performance optimization guidelines for FPS, TTI, bundle size, memory leaks, re-renders, and animations. Applies to tasks involving Hermes optimization, JS thread blocking, bridge overhead, FlashList, native modules, or debugging jank and frame drops."},"features":{"zh":["FPS优化","TTI优化","包大小优化","内存泄漏检测","动画优化"],"ja":["FPS最適化","TTI最適化","バンドルサイズ最適化","メモリーリーク検出","アニメーション最適化"],"ko":["FPS 최적화","TTI 최적화","패키지 크기 최적화","메모리 누수 감지","애니메이션 최적화"],"es":["Optimización de Hermes","Bloqueo de hilos JS","Reduciendo el tamaño del paquete","Evitando fugas de memoria","Mejorando la velocidad de renderizado","Optimización de animaciones"],"fr":["Optimisation de Hermes","Blocage de threads JS","Réduction de la taille du paquet","Évitement des fuites de mémoire","Amélioration de la vitesse de rendu","Optimisation des animations"],"de":["Hermes-Optimierung","JS-Thread-Blockierung","Paketgrößenreduzierung","Vermeidung von Speichellecks","Verbesserung der Rendergeschwindigkeit","Optimierung von Animationen"],"pt":["Otimização de FPS","Redução do TTI","Minimização do tamanho do pacote","Prevenção de vazamentos de memória","Otimização de animações"],"ru":["Оптимизация FPS","Сокращение TTI","Минимизация размера пакета","Предотвращение утечек памяти","Оптимизация анимаций"],"ar":["تحسين إطارًا في الثانية","تقليل وقت إقلاع التطبيق","تقليل حجم الحزمة","منع تسربات الذاكرة","تحسين الرسوم المتحركة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["React Native优化","性能优化","FPS优化","TTI优化","包大小优化","内存泄漏检测"],"ja":["React Native最適化","パフォーマンス最適化","FPS最適化","TTI最適化","バンドルサイズ最適化","メモリーリーク検出"],"ko":["리액트 네이티브 최적화","성능 최적화","FPS 최적화","TTI 최적화","패키지 크기 최적화","메모리 누수 감지"],"es":["React Native","AI Agentes","Optimización de rendimiento","Hermes","JS thread blocking","Tamaño del paquete","Fugas de memoria","Renderizado","Animaciones"],"fr":["React Native","AI Agents","Optimisation des performances","Hermes","Blocage de threads JS","Taille du paquet","Fuites de mémoire","Rendu","Animations"],"de":["React Native","AI-Agents","Leistungsoptimierung","Hermes","JS-Thread-Blockierung","Paketgröße","Speichellecks","Rendern","Animationen"],"pt":["React Native","otimização de desempenho","FPS","TTI","tamanho do pacote","vazamentos de memória","animações","Hermes","JS thread blocking"],"ru":["React Native","оптимизация производительности","FPS","TTI","размер пакета","утечки памяти","анимации","Hermes","JS thread blocking"],"ar":["رياكت نيتيف","تحسين الأداء","إطارًا في الثانية","وقت إقلاع التطبيق","حجم الحزمة","تسربات الذاكرة","الرسوم المتحركة","Hermes","JS thread blocking"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile Development Agents needing advanced React Native performance optimization capabilities.","zh":"适合需要高级 React Native 性能优化能力的移动开发代理。","ja":"React Native の高 度なパフォーマンス最適化機能を必要とするモバイル開発エージェントに適しています。","ko":"고급 React Native 성능 최적화 기능이 필요한 모바일 개발 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo Móvil que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de optimización de rendimiento de React Native.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement mobile ayant besoin de capacités avancées d''optimisation des performances de React Native.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile Development Agents, die erweiterte React Native-Leistungsoptimierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento Móvel que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de otimização de desempenho do React Native.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мобильной разработки, которым требуются продвинутые возможности оптимизации производительности React Native.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذين يحتاجون إلى أداء تطبيقات React Native المتقدم"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to optimize React Native applications for FPS, TTI, and bundle size using Hermes optimization, JS thread blocking, and native modules, while also debugging jank and frame drops with tools like FlashList.","zh":"赋予代理优化 React Native 应用程序以获得更好的 FPS、TTI 和包大小的能力，使用 Hermes 优化、JS 线程阻塞和原生模块，同时使用 FlashList 等工具调试卡顿和帧丢失。","ja":"Hermes 最適化、JS スレッドブロック、ネイティブモジュールを使用して、FPS、TTI、バンドルサイズの最適化された React Native アプリケーションをエージェントが最適化できるようにし、FlashList などのツールを使用してジャンクやフレームドロップをデバッグします。","ko":"Hermes 최적화, JS 스레드 블록, 네이티브 모듈을 사용하여 에이전트가 FPS, TTI, 번들 크기 최적화된 React Native 애플리케이션을 최적화할 수 있도록 하며, FlashList와 같은 도구를 사용하여 자체 디버깅 및 프레임 드롭을 디버깅합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes optimizar aplicaciones React Native para FPS, TTI y tamaño de paquete utilizando la optimización de Hermes, bloqueo de subprocesos JS y módulos nativos, y depurando problemas de jank y caídas de frames con herramientas como FlashList.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''optimiser les applications React Native pour les FPS, TTI et la taille du paquet en utilisant l''optimisation Hermes, le blocage du thread JS et les modules natifs, tout en déboguant les problèmes de jank et de chute de trames avec des outils comme FlashList.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, React Native-Anwendungen für FPS, TTI und Bundle-Größe zu optimieren, indem sie die Hermes-Optimierung, JS-Thread-Blockierung und native Module verwenden und Probleme mit Jank und Frame-Drops mit Tools wie FlashList debuggen.","pt":"Permite que os agentes otimizem aplicativos React Native para FPS, TTI e tamanho do pacote usando otimização Hermes, bloqueio de thread JS e módulos nativos, além de depurar jank e frame drops com ferramentas como FlashList.","ru":"Позволяет агентам оптимизировать приложения React Native для FPS, TTI и размера пакета с помощью оптимизации Hermes, блокировки потока JS и родных модулей, а также отлаживать jank и frame drops с помощью инструментов như FlashList.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من تحسين تطبيقات React Native للحصول على أداء أفضل باستخدام أدوات مثل FlashList"},"useCases":{"en":["Optimizing React Native application performance for better user experience","Debugging and resolving memory leaks and re-renders in React Native apps","Improving JavaScript thread performance and reducing bridge overhead in React Native"],"zh":["优化 React Native 应用程序性能以获得更好的用户体验","调试和解决 React Native 应用程序中的内存泄漏和重新渲染问题","提高 JavaScript 线程性能并减少 React Native 中的桥接开销"],"ja":["ユーザーエクスペリエンスの向上のための React Native アプリケーションのパフォーマンス最適化","React Native アプリケーションのメモリーリークと再描画の問題のデバッグと解決","React Native の JavaScript スレッドのパフォーマンスの向上とブリッジオーバーヘッドの削減"],"ko":["사용자 경험을 개선하기 위한 React Native 애플리케이션 성능 최적화","React Native 애플리케이션의 메모리 누수 및 재 렌더링 문제 디버깅 및 해결","React Native의 JavaScript 스레드 성능 개선 및 브릿지 오버헤드 감소"],"es":["Optimizar el rendimiento de aplicaciones React Native para una mejor experiencia del usuario","Depurar y resolver fugas de memoria y re-renders en aplicaciones React Native","Mejorar el rendimiento del subproceso JavaScript y reducir la sobrecarga del puente en React Native"],"fr":["Optimiser les performances des applications React Native pour une meilleure expérience utilisateur","Déboguer et résoudre les fuites de mémoire et les re-renders dans les applications React Native","Améliorer les performances du thread JavaScript et réduire la surcharge du pont dans React Native"],"de":["Optimieren des Leistungsverhaltens von React Native-Anwendungen für eine bessere Benutzererfahrung","Beheben und Auflösen von Speicherlecks und Neuzeichnungen in React Native-Anwendungen","Verbessern der JavaScript-Thread-Leistung und Reduzieren der Bridge-Overhead in React Native"],"pt":["Otimizar o desempenho de aplicativos React Native para melhorar a experiência do usuário","Depurar e resolver vazamentos de memória e re-renders em aplicativos React Native","Melhorar o desempenho da thread JavaScript e reduzir a sobrecarga do bridge em aplicativos React Native"],"ru":["Оптимизировать производительность приложений React Native для лучшего пользовательского опыта","Отладить и решить проблемы с утечками памяти и повторными рендерами в приложениях React Native","Улучшить производительность потока JavaScript и уменьшить нагрузку на мост в приложениях React Native"],"ar":["تحسين أداء تطبيقات React Native لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","تصحيح أخطاء تسربات الذاكرة وإعادة التصيير في تطبيقات React Native","تحسين أداء خيط JavaScript وتقليل الحمل على الجسر في تطبيقات React Native"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of React Native and JavaScript","Limited to React Native applications only","May require additional setup for native modules and debugging tools"],"zh":["需要 React Native 和 JavaScript 的知识","仅限 React Native 应用程序","可能需要原生模块和调试工具的额外设置"],"ja":["React Native と JavaScript の知識が必要","React Native アプリケーションのみに限定","ネイティブモジュールとデバッグツールの追加設定が必要になる場合あり"],"ko":["React Native 및 JavaScript 지식이 필요","React Native 애플리케이션만 해당","네이티브 모듈 및 디버깅 도구에 대한 추가 설정이 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de React Native y JavaScript","Limitado a aplicaciones React Native únicamente","Puede requerir configuración adicional para módulos nativos y herramientas de depuración"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en React Native et JavaScript","Limité aux applications React Native uniquement","Peut nécessiter une configuration supplémentaire pour les modules natifs et les outils de débogage"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse von React Native und JavaScript","Begrenzt auf React Native-Anwendungen","Kann zusätzliche Einrichtung für native Module und Debugging-Tools erfordern"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de React Native e JavaScript","Limitado a aplicativos React Native apenas","Pode requerer configuração adicional para módulos nativos e ferramentas de depuração"],"ru":["Требует знания React Native и JavaScript","Ограничен приложениями React Native только","Может требовать дополнительной настройки для родных модулей и инструментов отладки"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة React Native وJavaScript","محدود لتطبيقات React Native فقط","قد يتطلب إعدادًا إضافيًا للوحدات الأصلية وأدوات التصحيح"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"a725ff928e058c1dd9c5dae34fc53e0ea0442e65559158de64ae1e902ab59da8","repoEtag":"W/\"f05cd00bf041be7da3d6e387bae3d8dd78096e1bfd236fb0b070a405dd1af1c0\"","qualityScore":85}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('expo/skills/building-native-ui', 'official', 'expo', 'skills', 'expo/skills', 'building-native-ui', 1243, 50, 85, '2026-03-01T02:52:05Z', '2026-03-01T05:13:14.855Z', 'dc9c08d2601ea0f3df25656da2c6bff4f28fbc164901fabf7c8b504f5c833c19', '{"id":"expo/skills/building-native-ui","name":"building-native-ui","description":{"zh":"本指南介绍如何使用Expo Router构建原生UI应用，涵盖基础、样式、组件、导航、动画等","ja":"Expo Routerを使用して美しいアプリを作成するための完全なガイド。基礎、スタイル、コンポーネント、ナビゲーション、アニメーションなどをカバー","ko":"Expo Router를 사용하여 네이티브 UI 애플리케이션을 구축하는ための 완전한 가이드. 기본, 스타일, 컴포넌트, 내비게이션, 애니메이션 등을 다룹니다","es":"Guía completa para crear aplicaciones hermosas con Expo Router, cubriendo fundamentos, estilos, componentes y más","fr":"Guide complet pour créer des applications magnifiques avec Expo Router, couvrant les fondamentaux, les styles, les composants et plus","de":"Umfassender Leitfaden zum Erstellen von schönen Apps mit Expo Router, einschließlich Grundlagen, Stilen, Komponenten und mehr","pt":"Construindo interfaces nativas com Expo Router, um guia completo sobre fundamentos, estilização, componentes e navegação","ru":"Построение родных интерфейсов с Expo Router, полное руководство по основам, стилизации, компонентам и навигации","ar":"بناء واجهات المستخدم الأصلية مع Expo Router، دليل شامل حول الأساسيات، التصميم، المكونات والتنقل","en":"Complete guide for building beautiful apps with Expo Router. Covers fundamentals, styling, components, navigation, animations, patterns, and native tabs."},"owner":"expo","repo":"skills","repoPath":"expo/skills","stars":1243,"forks":50,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T02:52:05Z","topics":[],"skillMd":{"name":"building-native-ui","description":"Complete guide for building beautiful apps with Expo Router. Covers fundamentals, styling, components, navigation, animations, patterns, and native tabs.","version":"1.0.1","bodyPreview":"# Expo UI Guidelines\n\n## References\n\nConsult these resources as needed:\n\n```\nreferences/\n  animations.md          Reanimated: entering, exiting, layout, scroll-driven, gestures\n  controls.md            Native iOS: Switch, Slider, SegmentedControl, DateTimePicker, Picker\n  form-sheet.md          Form sheets in expo-router: configuration, footers and background interaction. \n  gradients.md           CSS gradients via experimental_backgroundImage (New Arch only)\n  icons.md               SF Symbols","body":"# Expo UI Guidelines\n\n## References\n\nConsult these resources as needed:\n\n```\nreferences/\n  animations.md          Reanimated: entering, exiting, layout, scroll-driven, gestures\n  controls.md            Native iOS: Switch, Slider, SegmentedControl, DateTimePicker, Picker\n  form-sheet.md          Form sheets in expo-router: configuration, footers and background interaction. \n  gradients.md           CSS gradients via experimental_backgroundImage (New Arch only)\n  icons.md               SF Symbols via expo-image (sf: source), names, animations, weights\n  media.md               Camera, audio, video, and file saving\n  route-structure.md     Route conventions, dynamic routes, groups, folder organization\n  search.md              Search bar with headers, useSearch hook, filtering patterns\n  storage.md             SQLite, AsyncStorage, SecureStore\n  tabs.md                NativeTabs, migration from JS tabs, iOS 26 features\n  toolbar-and-headers.md Stack headers and toolbar buttons, menus, search (iOS only)\n  visual-effects.md      Blur (expo-blur) and liquid glass (expo-glass-effect)\n  webgpu-three.md        3D graphics, games, GPU visualizations with WebGPU and Three.js\n  zoom-transitions.md    Apple Zoom: fluid zoom transitions with Link.AppleZoom (iOS 18+)\n```\n\n## Running the App\n\n**CRITICAL: Always try Expo Go first before creating custom builds.**\n\nMost Expo apps work in Expo Go without any custom native code. Before running `npx expo run:ios` or `npx expo run:android`:\n\n1. **Start with Expo Go**: Run `npx expo start` and scan the QR code with Expo Go\n2. **Check if features work**: Test your app thoroughly in Expo Go\n3. **Only create custom builds when required** - see below\n\n### When Custom Builds Are Required\n\nYou need `npx expo run:ios/android` or `eas build` ONLY when using:\n\n- **Local Expo modules** (custom native code in `modules/`)\n- **Apple targets** (widgets, app clips, extensions via `@bacons/apple-targets`)\n- **Third-party native modules** not included in Expo Go\n- **Custom native configuration** that can''t be expressed in `app.json`\n\n### When Expo Go Works\n\nExpo Go supports a huge range of features out of the box:\n\n- All `expo-*` packages (camera, location, notifications, etc.)\n- Expo Router navigation\n- Most UI libraries (reanimated, gesture handler, etc.)\n- Push notifications, deep links, and more\n\n**If you''re unsure, try Expo Go first.** Creating custom builds adds complexity, slower iteration, and requires Xcode/Android Studio setup.\n\n## Code Style\n\n- Be cautious of unterminated strings. Ensure nested backticks are escaped; never forget to escape quotes correctly.\n- Always use import statements at the top of the file.\n- Always use kebab-case for file names, e.g. `comment-card.tsx`\n- Always remove old route files when moving or restructuring navigation\n- Never use special characters in file names\n- Configure tsconfig.json with path aliases, and prefer aliases over relative imports for refactors.\n\n## Routes\n\nSee `./references/route-structure.md` for detailed route conventions.\n\n- Routes belong in the `app` directory.\n- Never co-locate components, types, or utilities in the app directory. This is an anti-pattern.\n- Ensure the app always has a route that matches \"/\", it may be inside a group route.\n\n## Library Preferences\n\n- Never use modules removed from React Native such as Picker, WebView, SafeAreaView, or AsyncStorage\n- Never use legacy expo-permissions\n- `expo-audio` not `expo-av`\n- `expo-video` not `expo-av`\n- `expo-image` with `source=\"sf:name\"` for SF Symbols, not `expo-symbols` or `@expo/vector-icons`\n- `react-native-safe-area-context` not react-native SafeAreaView\n- `process.env.EXPO_OS` not `Platform.OS`\n- `React.use` not `React.useContext`\n- `expo-image` Image component instead of intrinsic element `img`\n- `expo-glass-effect` for liquid glass backdrops\n\n## Responsiveness\n\n- Always wrap root component in a scroll view for responsiveness\n- Use `<ScrollView contentInsetAdjustmentBehavior=\"automatic\" />` instead of `<SafeAreaView>` for smarter safe area insets\n- `contentInsetAdjustmentBehavior=\"automatic\"` should be applied to FlatList and SectionList as well\n- Use flexbox instead of Dimensions API\n- ALWAYS prefer `useWindowDimensions` over `Dimensions.get()` to measure screen size\n\n## Behavior\n\n- Use expo-haptics conditionally on iOS to make more delightful experiences\n- Use views with built-in haptics like `<Switch />` from React Native and `@react-native-community/datetimepicker`\n- When a route belongs to a Stack, its first child should almost always be a ScrollView with `contentInsetAdjustmentBehavior=\"automatic\"` set\n- When adding a `ScrollView` to the page it should almost always be the first component inside the route component\n- Prefer `headerSearchBarOptions` in Stack.Screen options to add a search bar\n- Use the `<Text selectable />` prop on text containing data that could be copied\n- Consider formatting large numbers like 1.4M or 38k\n- Never use intrinsic elements like ''img'' or ''div'' unless in a webview or Expo DOM component\n\n# Styling\n\nFollow Apple Human Interface Guidelines.\n\n## General Styling Rules\n\n- Prefer flex gap over margin and padding styles\n- Prefer padding over margin where possible\n- Always account for safe area, either with stack headers, tabs, or ScrollView/FlatList `contentInsetAdjustmentBehavior=\"automatic\"`\n- Ensure both top and bottom safe area insets are accounted for\n- Inline styles not StyleSheet.create unless reusing styles is faster\n- Add entering and exiting animations for state changes\n- Use `{ borderCurve: ''continuous'' }` for rounded corners unless creating a capsule shape\n- ALWAYS use a navigation stack title instead of a custom text element on the page\n- When padding a ScrollView, use `contentContainerStyle` padding and gap instead of padding on the ScrollView itself (reduces clipping)\n- CSS and Tailwind are not supported - use inline styles\n\n## Text Styling\n\n- Add the `selectable` prop to every `<Text/>` element displaying important data or error messages\n- Counters should use `{ fontVariant: ''tabular-nums'' }` for alignment\n\n## Shadows\n\nUse CSS `boxShadow` style prop. NEVER use legacy React Native shadow or elevation styles.\n\n```tsx\n<View style={{ boxShadow: \"0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05)\" }} />\n```\n\n''inset'' shadows are supported.\n\n# Navigation\n\n## Link\n\nUse `<Link href=\"/path\" />` from ''expo-router'' for navigation between routes.\n\n```tsx\nimport { Link } from ''expo-router'';\n\n// Basic link\n<Link href=\"/path\" />\n\n// Wrapping custom components\n<Link href=\"/path\" asChild>\n  <Pressable>...</Pressable>\n</Link>\n```\n\nWhenever possible, include a `<Link.Preview>` to follow iOS conventions. Add context menus and previews frequently to enhance navigation.\n\n## Stack\n\n- ALWAYS use `_layout.tsx` files to define stacks\n- Use Stack from ''expo-router/stack'' for native navigation stacks\n\n### Page Title\n\nSet the page title in Stack.Screen options:\n\n```tsx\n<Stack.Screen options={{ title: \"Home\" }} />\n```\n\n## Context Menus\n\nAdd long press context menus to Link components:\n\n```tsx\nimport { Link } from \"expo-router\";\n\n<Link href=\"/settings\" asChild>\n  <Link.Trigger>\n    <Pressable>\n      <Card />\n    </Pressable>\n  </Link.Trigger>\n  <Link.Menu>\n    <Link.MenuAction\n      title=\"Share\"\n      icon=\"square.and.arrow.up\"\n      onPress={handleSharePress}\n    />\n    <Link.MenuAction\n      title=\"Block\"\n      icon=\"nosign\"\n      destructive\n      onPress={handleBlockPress}\n    />\n    <Link.Menu title=\"More\" icon=\"ellipsis\">\n      <Link.MenuAction title=\"Copy\" icon=\"doc.on.doc\" onPress={() => {}} />\n      <Link.MenuAction\n        title=\"Delete\"\n        icon=\"trash\"\n        destructive\n        onPress={() => {}}\n      />\n    </Link.Menu>\n  </Link.Menu>\n</Link>;\n```\n\n## Link Previews\n\nUse link previews frequently to enhance navigation:\n\n```tsx\n<Link href=\"/settings\">\n  <Link.Trigger>\n    <Pressable>\n      <Card />\n    </Pressable>\n  </Link.Trigger>\n  <Link.Preview />\n</Link>\n```\n\nLink preview can be used with context menus.\n\n## Modal\n\nPresent a screen as a modal:\n\n```tsx\n<Stack.Screen name=\"modal\" options={{ presentation: \"modal\" }} />\n```\n\nPrefer this to building a custom modal component.\n\n## Sheet\n\nPresent a screen as a dynamic form sheet:\n\n```tsx\n<Stack.Screen\n  name=\"sheet\"\n  options={{\n    presentation: \"formSheet\",\n    sheetGrabberVisible: true,\n    sheetAllowedDetents: [0.5, 1.0],\n    contentStyle: { backgroundColor: \"transparent\" },\n  }}\n/>\n```\n\n- Using `contentStyle: { backgroundColor: \"transparent\" }` makes the background liquid glass on iOS 26+.\n\n## Common route structure\n\nA standard app layout with tabs and stacks inside each tab:\n\n```\napp/\n  _layout.tsx — <NativeTabs />\n  (index,search)/\n    _layout.tsx — <Stack />\n    index.tsx — Main list\n    search.tsx — Search view\n```\n\n```tsx\n// app/_layout.tsx\nimport { NativeTabs, Icon, Label } from \"expo-router/unstable-native-tabs\";\nimport { Theme } from \"../components/theme\";\n\nexport default function Layout() {\n  return (\n    <Theme>\n      <NativeTabs>\n        <NativeTabs.Trigger name=\"(index)\">\n          <Icon sf=\"list.dash\" />\n          <Label>Items</Label>\n        </NativeTabs.Trigger>\n        <NativeTabs.Trigger name=\"(search)\" role=\"search\" />\n      </NativeTabs>\n    </Theme>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nCreate a shared group route so both tabs can push common screens:\n\n```tsx\n// app/(index,search)/_layout.tsx\nimport { Stack } from \"expo-router/stack\";\nimport { PlatformColor } from \"react-native\";\n\nexport default function Layout({ segment }) {\n  const screen = segment.match(/\\((.*)\\)/)?.[1]!;\n  const titles: Record<string, string> = { index: \"Items\", search: \"Search\" };\n\n  return (\n    <Stack\n      screenOptions={{\n        headerTransparent: true,\n        headerShadowVisible: false,\n        headerLargeTitleShadowVisible: false,\n        headerLargeStyle: { backgroundColor: \"transparent\" },\n        headerTitleStyle: { color: PlatformColor(\"label\") },\n        headerLargeTitle: true,\n        headerBlurEffect: \"none\",\n        headerBackButtonDisplayMode: \"minimal\",\n      }}\n    >\n      <Stack.Screen name={screen} options={{ title: titles[screen] }} />\n      <Stack.Screen name=\"i/[id]\" options={{ headerLargeTitle: false }} />\n    </Stack>\n  );\n}\n```\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:13:14.855Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI工具：使用Expo Router构建原生UI","ja":"AIエージェント：Expo Routerで美しいアプリを作成","ko":"AI 에이전트: Expo Router로 네이티브 UI 구축","es":"Herramientas de interfaz de usuario nativa con Expo Router","fr":"Outils d''interface utilisateur native avec Expo Router","de":"Native UI-Tools mit Expo Router","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Construindo Interfaces Nativas com Exp...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Построение Родных Интерфейсов с Expo Router","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: بناء واجهات المستخدم الأصلية مع E...","en":"building-native-ui"},"description":{"zh":"本指南介绍如何使用Expo Router构建原生UI应用，涵盖基础、样式、组件、导航、动画等","ja":"Expo Routerを使用して美しいアプリを作成するための完全なガイド。基礎、スタイル、コンポーネント、ナビゲーション、アニメーションなどをカバー","ko":"Expo Router를 사용하여 네이티브 UI 애플리케이션을 구축하는ための 완전한 가이드. 기본, 스타일, 컴포넌트, 내비게이션, 애니메이션 등을 다룹니다","es":"Guía completa para crear aplicaciones hermosas con Expo Router, cubriendo fundamentos, estilos, componentes y más","fr":"Guide complet pour créer des applications magnifiques avec Expo Router, couvrant les fondamentaux, les styles, les composants et plus","de":"Umfassender Leitfaden zum Erstellen von schönen Apps mit Expo Router, einschließlich Grundlagen, Stilen, Komponenten und mehr","pt":"Construindo interfaces nativas com Expo Router, um guia completo sobre fundamentos, estilização, componentes e navegação","ru":"Построение родных интерфейсов с Expo Router, полное руководство по основам, стилизации, компонентам и навигации","ar":"بناء واجهات المستخدم الأصلية مع Expo Router، دليل شامل حول الأساسيات، التصميم، المكونات والتنقل","en":"Complete guide for building beautiful apps with Expo Router. Covers fundamentals, styling, components, navigation, animations, patterns, and native tabs."},"definition":{"en":"Complete guide for building beautiful apps with Expo Router. Covers fundamentals, styling, components, navigation, animations, patterns, and native tabs."},"features":{"zh":["Expo Router基础","样式和组件","导航和动画","原生标签页","Reanimated动画"],"ja":["Expo Routerの基礎","スタイルとコンポーネント","ナビゲーションとアニメーション","ネイティブタブ","Reanimatedアニメーション"],"ko":["Expo Router 기본","스타일과 컴포넌트","내비게이션과 애니메이션","네이티브 탭","Reanimated 애니메이션"],"es":["Fundamentos de Expo Router","Estilos y componentes personalizados","Navegación y animaciones","Patrones y pestañas nativas","Integración con React y react-native-screens"],"fr":["Fondamentaux d''Expo Router","Styles et composants personnalisés","Navigation et animations","Modèles et onglets natifs","Intégration avec React et react-native-screens"],"de":["Grundlagen von Expo Router","Benutzerdefinierte Styles und Komponenten","Navigation und Animationen","Muster und native Reiter","Integration mit React und react-native-screens"],"pt":["Fundamentos de Expo Router","Estilização e componentes","Navegação e animações","Padrões e guias de estilo","Integração com React Native"],"ru":["Основы Expo Router","Стилизация и компоненты","Навигация и анимации","Паттерны и руководства по стилю","Интеграция с React Native"],"ar":["أساسيات Expo Router","التصميم والمكونات","التنقل والحركات","الأنماط والدلائل الإرشادية","التكامل مع React Native"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Expo Router","原生UI","React Native","移动应用开发","UI设计","动画效果"],"ja":["Expo Router","ネイティブUI","React Native","モバイルアプリ開発","UIデザイン","アニメーション効果"],"ko":["Expo Router","네이티브 UI","React Native","모바일 애플리케이션 개발","UI 디자인","애니메이션 효과"],"es":["Expo Router","interfaz de usuario nativa","desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles","React","react-native-screens","estilos y componentes personalizados"],"fr":["Expo Router","interface utilisateur native","développement d''applications mobiles","React","react-native-screens","styles et composants personnalisés"],"de":["Expo Router","native Benutzeroberfläche","Mobile-App-Entwicklung","React","react-native-screens","benutzerdefinierte Styles und Komponenten"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","construir interfaces nativas","expo router","react native","desenvolvimento de aplicativos","estilização e componentes"],"ru":["ии агенты","построение родных интерфейсов","expo router","react native","разработка приложений","стилизация и компоненты"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","بناء واجهات المستخدم الأصلية","expo router","react native","تطوير التطبيقات","التصميم والمكونات"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Mobile App Agents needing native UI capabilities with Expo Router.","zh":"非常适合需要 Expo Router 原生 UI 能力的移动应用代理。","ja":"Expo Router のネイティブ UI 機能が必要なモバイル アプリ エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Expo Router의 네이티브 UI 기능이 필요한 모바일 앱 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Aplicaciones Móviles que necesitan capacidades de interfaz de usuario nativa con Expo Router.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Applications Mobiles ayant besoin de capacités d''interface utilisateur natives avec Expo Router.","de":"Perfekt für Mobile App-Agents, die native Benutzeroberflächenfunktionen mit Expo Router benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Aplicativos Móveis que precisam de capacidades de UI nativas com Expo Router.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов мобильных приложений, которым необходимы родные возможности UI с Expo Router.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تطبيقات الجوال الذين يحتاجون إلى возможности واجهة المستخدم الأصلية مع Expo Router."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to build beautiful apps with native tabs, animations, and styling using Expo UI Guidelines, Reanimated for animations, and CSS gradients via experimental_backgroundImage.","zh":"赋予代理构建美丽的应用程序的能力，使用 Expo UI 指南，Reanimated 进行动画，以及通过 experimental_backgroundImage 使用 CSS 渐变。","ja":"Expo UI ガイドライン、Reanimated を使用したアニメーション、および experimental_backgroundImage を使用した CSS グラデーションを使用して、美しいアプリケーションを構築するためのエージェントをエンパワーメントします。","ko":"Expo UI 가이드라인, Reanimated를 사용한 애니메이션 및 experimental_backgroundImage를 사용한 CSS 그라데이션을 사용하여 아름다운 애플리케이션을 구축할 수 있는 에이전트를 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear hermosas aplicaciones con pestañas nativas, animaciones y estilos utilizando las Directrices de interfaz de usuario de Expo, Reanimated para animaciones y gradientes de CSS a través de experimental_backgroundImage.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications magnifiques avec des onglets natifs, des animations et des styles en utilisant les Directives d''interface utilisateur Expo, Reanimated pour les animations et les dégradés de CSS via experimental_backgroundImage.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, schöne Apps mit nativen Registerkarten, Animationen und Stilen zu erstellen, indem sie die Expo-Benutzeroberflächenrichtlinien, Reanimated für Animationen und CSS-Gradienten über experimental_backgroundImage verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a construir aplicativos bonitos com guias nativas, animações e estilização usando Diretrizes de UI do Expo, Reanimated para animações e gradientes de CSS via experimental_backgroundImage.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать красивые приложения с родными вкладками, анимациями и стилизацией, используя Руководство по UI Expo, Reanimated для анимаций и градиенты CSS через experimental_backgroundImage.","ar":"يمنح العميل بناء تطبيقات جميلة مع ألسقتين الأصلية والرسومات والتنسيق باستخدام إرشادات واجهة المستخدم في Expo ، و Reanimated للرسومات ، و تدرج CSS عبر experimental_backgroundImage."},"useCases":{"en":["Designing native iOS controls like Switch, Slider, and SegmentedControl","Implementing form sheets with custom configuration and footers","Creating scroll-driven animations and gestures with Reanimated"],"zh":["设计类似 Switch、Slider 和 SegmentedControl 的原生 iOS 控件","实现带有自定义配置和页脚的表单表单","使用 Reanimated 创建滚动驱动的动画和手势"],"ja":["Switch、Slider、SegmentedControl などのネイティブ iOS コントロールを設計する","カスタム構成とフッターを持つフォーム シートを実装する","Reanimated を使用してスクロール駆動のアニメーションとジェスチャーを作成する"],"ko":["Switch, Slider, SegmentedControl와 같은 네이티브 iOS 컨트롤을 설계합니다.","사용자 지정 구성 및 푸터가 있는 양식 시트를 구현합니다.","Reanimated를 사용하여 스크롤 구동 애니메이션 및 제스처를 생성합니다."],"es":["Diseñar controles iOS nativos como Switch, Slider y SegmentedControl","Implementar hojas de formulario con configuración personalizada y pies de página","Crear animaciones y gestos impulsados por desplazamiento con Reanimated"],"fr":["Concevoir des contrôles iOS natifs comme Switch, Slider et SegmentedControl","Mettre en œuvre des feuilles de formulaire avec une configuration personnalisée et des pieds de page","Créer des animations et des gestes déclenchés par le défilement avec Reanimated"],"de":["Native iOS-Steuerungselemente wie Switch, Slider und SegmentedControl entwerfen","Formulare mit benutzerdefinierter Konfiguration und Fußzeilen implementieren","Mit Reanimated Scroll-getriebene Animationen und Gesten erstellen"],"pt":["Projetar controles iOS nativos como Switch, Slider e SegmentedControl","Implementar folhas de formulário com configuração personalizada e rodapés","Criar animações e gestos impulsionados por rolagem com Reanimated"],"ru":["Проектировать родные контролы iOS, такие как Switch, Slider и SegmentedControl","Реализовывать формы листов с настраиваемой конфигурацией и подвалами","Создавать анимации и жесты, управляемые прокруткой, с помощью Reanimated"],"ar":["تصميم عناصر تحكم أصلية في iOS مثل Switch و Slider و SegmentedControl","تنفيذ表格 مع تكوين مخصص وأقدام","إنشاء رسومات وحركات مدفوعة بالتمرير مع Reanimated"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Expo Router setup","Limited to native iOS and Expo-compatible platforms","Experimental features like gradients require New Arch"],"zh":["需要 Expo Router 设置","仅限于原生 iOS 和 Expo 兼容平台","渐变等实验性功能需要 New Arch"],"ja":["Expo Router のセットアップが必要","ネイティブ iOS と Expo 互換プラットフォームのみ","グラデーションなどの実験的な機能は New Arch が必要"],"ko":["Expo Router 설정이 필요합니다.","네이티브 iOS 및 Expo 호환 플랫폼만 해당됩니다.","그라데이션과 같은 실험적 기능은 New Arch가 필요합니다."],"es":["Requiere configuración de Expo Router","Limitado a plataformas nativas de iOS y compatibles con Expo","Características experimentales como gradientes requieren New Arch"],"fr":["Nécessite la configuration d''Expo Router","Limité aux plates-formes iOS natives et compatibles avec Expo","Les fonctionnalités expérimentales comme les dégradés nécessitent New Arch"],"de":["Benötigt Expo Router-Setup","Begrenzt auf native iOS- und Expo-kompatible Plattformen","Experimentelle Funktionen wie Gradienten erfordern New Arch"],"pt":["Requer configuração do Expo Router","Limitado a plataformas iOS nativas e compatíveis com Expo","Recursos experimentais, como gradientes, requerem New Arch"],"ru":["Требует настройки Expo Router","Ограничен родными платформами iOS и платформами, совместимыми с Expo","Экспериментальные функции, такие как градиенты, требуют New Arch"],"ar":["يتطلب إعداد Expo Router","محدود بالمنصات الأصلية لنظام iOS والمنصات المتوافقة مع Expo","الميزات التجريبية ، مثل التدرج ، تتطلب New Arch"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"dc9c08d2601ea0f3df25656da2c6bff4f28fbc164901fabf7c8b504f5c833c19","repoEtag":"W/\"74eae87bd9e290dfb1a5ebf14236809a9fecc3d098825762f2b6b3d9526c29eb\"","qualityScore":85}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('n8n-io/n8n/reproduce-bug', 'official', 'n8n-io', 'n8n', 'n8n-io/n8n', 'reproduce-bug', 176919, 55278, 85, '2026-03-01T05:12:14Z', '2026-03-01T05:14:59.461Z', '3bd0e16cdf07eca0de32aac67a10f37578e1027fbac57fd80f1a4e82ff303a40', '{"id":"n8n-io/n8n/reproduce-bug","name":"reproduce-bug","description":{"zh":"重现Bug框架使用AI工具自动化测试和工作流程，支持Linear ticket中的Bug重现","ja":"バグ再現フレームワークはAIエージェントを使用して自動テストとワークフローを実現し、Linear ticket中的バグを再現","ko":"버그 재현 프레임워크는 AI 에이전트를 사용하여 자동 테스트와 워크플ロー 구현 및 Linear ticket中的 버그 재현","es":"Reproduce-bug es un agente de IA que ayuda a los desarrolladores a reproducir errores de forma sistemática y eficiente.","fr":"Reproduce-bug est un outil d''IA qui aide les développeurs à reproduire les bogues de manière systématique et efficace.","de":"Reproduce-bug ist ein KI-Tool, das Entwicklern hilft, Fehler systematisch und effizient zu reproduzieren.","pt":"O recurso reproduce-bug permite a reprodução automatizada de bugs a partir de um ticket Linear, melhorando a eficiência do desenvolvimento","ru":"Функция reproduce-bug позволяет автоматически воссоздать ошибку из тикета Linear, повышая эффективность разработки","ar":"تتيح ميزة reproduce-bug إعادة إنتاج الأخطاء تلقائيًا من تذكرة Linear، وتحسّن كفاءة التطوير","en":"Reproduce a bug from a Linear ticket with a failing test. Expects the full ticket context (title, description, comments) to be provided as input."},"owner":"n8n-io","repo":"n8n","repoPath":"n8n-io/n8n","stars":176919,"forks":55278,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:12:14Z","topics":["ai","apis","automation","cli","data-flow","development","integration-framework","integrations","ipaas","low-code","low-code-platform","mcp","mcp-client","mcp-server","n8n","no-code","self-hosted","typescript","workflow","workflow-automation"],"skillMd":{"name":"reproduce-bug","description":"Reproduce a bug from a Linear ticket with a failing test. Expects the full ticket context (title, description, comments) to be provided as input.","bodyPreview":"# Bug Reproduction Framework\n\nGiven a Linear ticket context ($ARGUMENTS), systematically reproduce the bug\nwith a failing regression test.\n\n## Step 1: Parse Signals\n\nExtract the following from the provided ticket context:\n- **Error message / stack trace** (if provided)\n- **Reproduction steps** (if provided)\n- **Workflow JSON** (if attached)\n- **Affected area** (node, execution engine, editor, API, config, etc.)\n- **Version where it broke / last working version**\n\n\n## Step 2: Route to Test Strate","body":"# Bug Reproduction Framework\n\nGiven a Linear ticket context ($ARGUMENTS), systematically reproduce the bug\nwith a failing regression test.\n\n## Step 1: Parse Signals\n\nExtract the following from the provided ticket context:\n- **Error message / stack trace** (if provided)\n- **Reproduction steps** (if provided)\n- **Workflow JSON** (if attached)\n- **Affected area** (node, execution engine, editor, API, config, etc.)\n- **Version where it broke / last working version**\n\n\n## Step 2: Route to Test Strategy\n\nBased on the affected area, pick the test layer and pattern:\n\n| Area | Test Layer | Pattern | Key Location |\n|------|-----------|---------|--------------|\n| Node operation | Jest unit | NodeTestHarness + nock | `packages/nodes-base/nodes/*/test/` |\n| Node credential | Jest unit | jest-mock-extended | `packages/nodes-base/nodes/*/test/` |\n| Trigger webhook | Jest unit | mock IHookFunctions + jest.mock GenericFunctions | `packages/nodes-base/nodes/*/test/` |\n| Binary data | Jest unit | NodeTestHarness assertBinaryData | `packages/core/nodes-testing/` |\n| Execution engine | Jest integration | WorkflowRunner + DI container | `packages/cli/src/__tests__/` |\n| CLI / API | Jest integration | setupTestServer + supertest | `packages/cli/test/integration/` |\n| Config | Jest unit | GlobalConfig + Container | `packages/@n8n/config/src/__tests__/` |\n| Editor UI | Vitest | Vue Test Utils + Pinia | `packages/frontend/editor-ui/src/**/__tests__/` |\n| E2E / Canvas | Playwright | Test containers + composables | `packages/testing/playwright/` |\n\n## Step 3: Locate Source Files\n\nFind the source code for the affected area:\n1. Search for the node/service/component mentioned in the ticket\n2. Find the GenericFunctions file (common bug location for nodes)\n3. Check for existing test files in the same area\n4. Look at recent git history on affected files (`git log --oneline -10 -- <path>`)\n\n## Step 4: Trace the Code Path\n\nRead the source code and trace the execution path that triggers the bug:\n- Follow the call chain from entry point to the failure\n- Identify the specific line(s) where the bug manifests\n- Note any error handling (or lack thereof) around the bug\n\n## Step 5: Form Hypothesis\n\nState a clear, testable hypothesis:\n- \"When [input/condition], the code does [wrong thing] because [root cause]\"\n- Identify the exact line(s) that need to change\n- Predict what the test output will show\n\n## Step 6: Find Test Patterns\n\nLook for existing tests in the same area:\n1. Check `test/` directories near the affected code\n2. Identify which mock/setup patterns they use\n3. Use the same patterns for consistency\n4. If no tests exist, find the closest similar node/service tests as a template\n\n## Step 7: Write Failing Test\n\nWrite a regression test that:\n- Uses the patterns found in Step 6\n- Targets the specific hypothesis from Step 5\n- Includes a comment referencing the ticket ID\n- Asserts the CORRECT behavior (test will fail on current code)\n- Also includes a \"happy path\" test to prove the setup works\n\n## Step 8: Run and Score\n\nRun the test from the package directory (e.g., `cd packages/nodes-base && pnpm test <file>`).\n\nClassify the result:\n\n| Confidence | Criteria | Output |\n|------------|----------|--------|\n| **CONFIRMED** | Test fails consistently, failure matches hypothesis | Reproduction Report |\n| **LIKELY** | Test fails but failure mode differs slightly | Report + caveat |\n| **UNCONFIRMED** | Cannot trigger the failure | Report: what was tried |\n| **SKIPPED** | Hit a hard bailout trigger | Report: why skipped |\n| **ALREADY_FIXED** | Bug no longer reproduces on current code | Report: when fixed |\n\n## Step 9: Iterate or Bail\n\nIf UNCONFIRMED after first attempt:\n- Revisit hypothesis — re-read the code path\n- Try a different test approach or layer\n- Maximum 3 attempts before declaring UNCONFIRMED\n\n**Hard bailout triggers** (stop immediately):\n- Requires real third-party API credentials\n- Race condition / timing-dependent\n- Requires specific cloud/enterprise infrastructure\n- Requires manual UI interaction that can''t be scripted\n\n## Output: Reproduction Report\n\nPresent findings in this format:\n\n---\n\n**Ticket:** [ID] — [title]\n**Confidence:** [CONFIRMED | LIKELY | UNCONFIRMED | SKIPPED | ALREADY_FIXED]\n\n### Root Cause\n[1-2 sentences explaining the bug mechanism]\n\n### Location\n| File | Lines | Issue |\n|------|-------|-------|\n| `path/to/file.ts` | XX-YY | Description of the problem |\n\n### Failing Test\n`path/to/test/file.test.ts` — X/Y tests fail:\n1. `test name` — [failure description]\n\n### Fix Hint\n[Pseudocode or description of the fix approach]\n\n---\n\n## Important\n\n- **DO NOT fix the bug** — only reproduce it with a failing test\n- **Leave test files in place** as evidence (don''t commit unless asked)\n- **Run tests from the package directory** (e.g., `pushd packages/nodes-base && pnpm test <file> && popd`)\n- **Always redirect build output**: `pnpm build > build.log 2>&1`\n- **DO NOT look at existing fix PRs** — the goal is to reproduce from signals alone\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:14:59.461Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI工具：重现Bug框架","ja":"AIエージェント：バグ再現フレームワーク","ko":"AI 에이전트: 버그 재현 프레임워크","es":"Herramientas de AI: Reproducir errores con reproduce-bug","fr":"Outils d''IA : Reproduire les bogues avec reproduce-bug","de":"KI-Tools: Fehler reproduzieren mit reproduce-bug","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Reproduzir Bug","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Воссоздание ошибки","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: إعادة إنتاج الخطأ","en":"reproduce-bug"},"description":{"zh":"重现Bug框架使用AI工具自动化测试和工作流程，支持Linear ticket中的Bug重现","ja":"バグ再現フレームワークはAIエージェントを使用して自動テストとワークフローを実現し、Linear ticket中的バグを再現","ko":"버그 재현 프레임워크는 AI 에이전트를 사용하여 자동 테스트와 워크플ロー 구현 및 Linear ticket中的 버그 재현","es":"Reproduce-bug es un agente de IA que ayuda a los desarrolladores a reproducir errores de forma sistemática y eficiente.","fr":"Reproduce-bug est un outil d''IA qui aide les développeurs à reproduire les bogues de manière systématique et efficace.","de":"Reproduce-bug ist ein KI-Tool, das Entwicklern hilft, Fehler systematisch und effizient zu reproduzieren.","pt":"O recurso reproduce-bug permite a reprodução automatizada de bugs a partir de um ticket Linear, melhorando a eficiência do desenvolvimento","ru":"Функция reproduce-bug позволяет автоматически воссоздать ошибку из тикета Linear, повышая эффективность разработки","ar":"تتيح ميزة reproduce-bug إعادة إنتاج الأخطاء تلقائيًا من تذكرة Linear، وتحسّن كفاءة التطوير","en":"Reproduce a bug from a Linear ticket with a failing test. Expects the full ticket context (title, description, comments) to be provided as input."},"definition":{"en":"Reproduce a bug from a Linear ticket with a failing test. Expects the full ticket context (title, description, comments) to be provided as input."},"features":{"zh":["自动化测试","工作流程管理","Linear ticket中的Bug重现","支持AI工具","自动化重现Bug","提高测试效率"],"ja":["自動テスト","ワークフロー管理","Linear ticket中的バグ再現","AIエージェントのサポート","自動バグ再現","テスト効率の向上"],"ko":["자동 테스트","워크플ロー 관리","Linear ticket中的 버그 재현","AI 에이전트 지원","자동 버그 재현","테스트 효율 향상"],"es":["Reproducción sistemática de errores","Análisis de contexto de ticket de Linear","Integración con flujos de trabajo de automatización","Soporte para múltiples versiones","Informes detallados de errores"],"fr":["Reproduction systématique des bogues","Analyse du contexte de ticket de Linear","Intégration avec les flux de travail d''automatisation","Prise en charge de plusieurs versions","Rapports détaillés des bogues"],"de":["Systematische Fehlerreproduktion","Analyse des Kontexts von Linear-Tickets","Integration mit Automatisierungs-Workflows","Unterstützung für mehrere Versionen","Detaillierte Fehlerberichte"],"pt":["Reprodução automatizada de bugs","Integração com tickets Linear","Análise de erros e rastreamento de pilha","Suporte a workflows JSON","Identificação de áreas afetadas"],"ru":["Автоматическое воспроизведение ошибок","Интеграция с тикетами Linear","Анализ ошибок и трассировка стека","Поддержка рабочих процессов JSON","Определение затронутых областей"],"ar":["إعادة إنتاج تلقائي للأخطاء","التكامل مع تذاكر Linear","تحليل الأخطاء وتتبع المحتوى","دعم سير العمل JSON","تحديد المناطق المتأثرة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具","重现Bug","自动化测试","工作流程管理","Linear ticket","AIエージェント","自动化重现Bug","测试效率"],"ja":["AIエージェント","バグ再現","自動テスト","ワークフロー管理","Linear ticket","AIツール","自動バグ再現","テスト効率"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","버그 재현","자동 테스트","워크플ロー 관리","Linear ticket","AI 툴","자동 버그 재현","테스트 효율"],"es":["herramientas de AI","reproducción de errores","automatización de flujos de trabajo","integración con Linear","desarrollo de software","pruebas de regresión","análisis de contexto de ticket"],"fr":["outils d''IA","reproduction des bogues","automatisation des flux de travail","intégration avec Linear","développement de logiciels","tests de régression","analyse du contexte de ticket"],"de":["KI-Tools","Fehlerreproduktion","Automatisierung von Workflows","Integration mit Linear","Software-Entwicklung","Rückverfolgungstests","Analyse des Kontexts von Tickets"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","reproduzir bug","automatização de bugs","desenvolvimento de software","tickets linear","análise de erros"],"ru":["ии агенты","воссоздание ошибки","автоматизация ошибок","разработка программного обеспечения","тикеты linear","анализ ошибок"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","إعادة إنتاج الخطأ","التنفيذ التلقائي للأخطاء","تطوير البرمجيات","تذاكر ليينر","تحليل الأخطاء"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Debugging Agents needing systematic bug reproduction from Linear tickets.","zh":"Perfect for Debugging Agents 需要系统性地重现 Linear 票据中的 bug。","ja":"Linear チケットからの系統的なバグの再現が必要な Debugging Agents に最適です。","ko":"Linear 티켓에서 시스템적으로 버그를 재현해야 하는 Debugging Agents 에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de depuración que necesitan reproducción sistemática de errores a partir de tickets lineales.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de débogage nécessitant une reproduction systématique de bogues à partir de tickets linéaires.","de":"Perfekt für Debugging-Agents, die eine systematische Fehlerreproduktion aus linearen Tickets benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Depuração que necessitam de reprodução sistemática de bugs a partir de tickets do Linear.","ru":"Идеально подходит для отладочных агентов, которым требуется систематическое воспроизведение ошибок из тикетов Linear.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء التصحيح الذين يحتاجون إلى إعادة إنتاج منهجية للأخطاء من تذاكر Linear."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to parse Linear ticket contexts and generate failing regression tests automatically. Extracts critical signals including error messages, stack traces, reproduction steps, and workflow JSON to identify affected areas and version compatibility.","zh":"使得代理能够解析 Linear 票据的上下文并自动生成失败的回归测试。提取包括错误消息、堆栈跟踪、重现步骤和工作流 JSON 在内的关键信号，以确定受影响的区域和版本兼容性。","ja":"エージェントが Linear チケットのコンテキストを解析し、自動的に失敗した回帰テストを生成できるようにします。エラーメッセージ、スタックトレース、再現手順、ワークフロー JSON など、重要なシグナルを抽出して影響を受けるエリアやバージョンの互換性を特定します。","ko":"에이전트가 Linear 티켓의 컨텍스트를 분석하고 자동으로 실패한 회귀 테스트를 생성할 수 있도록 합니다. 오류 메시지, 스택 트레이스, 재현 단계 및 워크플로 JSON을 포함한 중요한 신호를 추출하여 영향을 받는 영역 및 버전 호환성을 식별합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a analizar contextos de tickets lineales y generar pruebas de regresión fallidas de forma automática. Extrae señales críticas, incluidos mensajes de error, seguimientos de pila, pasos de reproducción y JSON de flujo de trabajo para identificar áreas afectadas y compatibilidad de versiones.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser les contextes de tickets linéaires et de générer des tests de régression défaillants de manière automatique. Extrait des signaux critiques, notamment des messages d''erreur, des traces de pile, des étapes de reproduction et du JSON de workflow pour identifier les zones affectées et la compatibilité des versions.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Linear-Ticket-Kontexte zu parsen und fehlerhafte Regressions-Tests automatisch zu generieren. Extrahiert kritische Signale, einschließlich Fehlermeldungen, Stack-Traces, Reproduktionsschritten und Workflow-JSON, um betroffene Bereiche und Versionenkompatibilität zu identifizieren.","pt":"Permite que os agentes analisem os contextos dos tickets do Linear e gerem testes de regressão com falha automaticamente. Extrai sinais críticos, incluindo mensagens de erro, stack traces, etapas de reprodução e JSON de fluxo de trabalho para identificar áreas afetadas e compatibilidade de versão.","ru":"Позволяет агентам анализировать контексты тикетов Linear и автоматически генерировать падающие регрессионные тесты. Извлекает критические сигналы, включая сообщения об ошибках, трассировки стека, шаги воспроизведения и JSON рабочего процесса для определения затронутых областей и совместимости версий.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من تحليل سياقات تذاكر Linear وإنشاء اختبارات انحدار فاشلة تلقائيًا. يستخرج إشارات حرجة تشمل رسائل الخطأ، وتتبع المكدس، وخطوات إعادة الإنتاج، وJSON سير العمل لتحديد المناطق المتأثرة والتوافق بين الإصدارات."},"useCases":{"en":["Reproducing bugs from Linear ticket descriptions","Generating failing regression tests","Extracting workflow JSON from attachments","Identifying version compatibility breaks","Systematically parsing error messages and stack traces"],"zh":["从 Linear 票据描述中重现 bug","生成失败的回归测试","从附件中提取工作流 JSON","确定版本兼容性破坏","系统地解析错误消息和堆栈跟踪"],"ja":["Linear チケットの説明からバグを再現する","失敗した回帰テストを生成する","添付ファイルからワークフロー JSON を抽出する","バージョンの互換性の破壊を特定する","エラーメッセージとスタックトレースを体系的に解析する"],"ko":["Linear 티켓 설명에서 버그를 재현하는 것","실패한 회귀 테스트를 생성하는 것","첨부 파일에서 워크플로 JSON을 추출하는 것","버전 호환성 중단을 식별하는 것","오류 메시지와 스택 트레이스를 체계적으로 분석하는 것"],"es":["Reproducir errores a partir de descripciones de tickets lineales","Generar pruebas de regresión fallidas","Extraer JSON de flujo de trabajo de archivos adjuntos","Identificar incompatibilidades de versiones","Analizar sistemáticamente mensajes de error y seguimientos de pila"],"fr":["Reproduire des bogues à partir de descriptions de tickets linéaires","Générer des tests de régression défaillants","Extraire du JSON de workflow à partir de pièces jointes","Identifier des ruptures de compatibilité de version","Analyser systématiquement des messages d''erreur et des traces de pile"],"de":["Fehler aus linearen Ticketbeschreibungen reproduzieren","Fehlerhafte Regressions-Tests generieren","Workflow-JSON aus Anlagen extrahieren","Versioneninkompatibilitäten identifizieren","Fehlermeldungen und Stack-Traces systematisch parsen"],"pt":["Reproduzir bugs a partir de descrições de tickets do Linear","Gerar testes de regressão com falha","Extrair JSON de fluxo de trabalho de anexos","Identificar quebras de compatibilidade de versão","Analisar sistematicamente mensagens de erro e stack traces"],"ru":["Воспроизведение ошибок из описаний тикетов Linear","Генерация падающих регрессионных тестов","Извлечение JSON рабочего процесса из вложений","Выявление нарушений совместимости версий","Систематический анализ сообщений об ошибках и трассировок стека"],"ar":["إعادة إنتاج الأخطاء من أوصاف تذاكر Linear","إنشاء اختبارات انحدار فاشلة","استخراج JSON سير العمل من المرفقات","تحديد انقطاعات توافق الإصدار","تحليل رسائل الخطأ وتتبع المكدس بشكل منهجي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires full Linear ticket context as input","Depends on quality of ticket information provided","Needs access to relevant codebase for test execution"],"zh":["需要完整的 Linear 票据上下文作为输入","依赖于提供的票据信息的质量","需要访问相关代码库以执行测试"],"ja":["入力として完全な Linear チケットのコンテキストが必要","提供されたチケット情報の品質に依存する","テストの実行には関連するコードベースへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["입력으로 완전한 Linear 티켓 컨텍스트가 필요함","제공된 티켓 정보의 품질에 의존함","테스트 실행을 위해 관련 코드베이스에 액세스해야 함"],"es":["Requiere contexto completo de ticket lineal como entrada","Depende de la calidad de la información del ticket proporcionada","Necesita acceso al código base relevante para la ejecución de pruebas"],"fr":["Nécessite un contexte de ticket linéaire complet comme entrée","Dépend de la qualité des informations du ticket fournies","Nécessite un accès au code base pertinent pour l''exécution des tests"],"de":["Benötigt vollständigen Linear-Ticket-Kontext als Eingabe","Hängt von der Qualität der bereitgestellten Ticketinformationen ab","Benötigt Zugriff auf relevanten Codebase für die Testausführung"],"pt":["Requer o contexto completo do ticket do Linear como entrada","Depende da qualidade das informações do ticket fornecidas","Necessita de acesso à base de código relevante para a execução do teste"],"ru":["Требует полного контекста тикета Linear в качестве входных данных","Зависит от качества предоставленной информации в тикете","Требует доступа к соответствующей кодовой базе для выполнения тестов"],"ar":["يتطلب سياق تذكرة Linear الكامل كمدخل","يعتمد على جودة معلومات التذكرة المقدمة","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى قاعدة التعليمات البرمجية ذات الصلة لتنفيذ الاختبار"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3bd0e16cdf07eca0de32aac67a10f37578e1027fbac57fd80f1a4e82ff303a40","repoEtag":"W/\"2bfcea59898d93bb3842b5336c5e1c10d08a62ce151b2223d6a7b4480bfdf16a\"","qualityScore":85}');
