,"de":["Fehlerbehandlung und Statuscodes","Anfrage- und Antwortvalidierung","Rate Limiting und Sicherheit","API-Design mit Node.js und Python","Implementierung von REST-APIs mit React und CLI"],"pt":["Criação de APIs REST","Tratamento de erros e exceções","Validação de solicitações e respostas","Limitação de taxa de requisições","Formatação de respostas em JSON"],"ru":["Создание REST API","Обработка ошибок и исключений","Валидация запросов и ответов","Ограничение скорости запросов","Форматирование ответов в JSON"],"ar":["إنشاء واجهات برمجة التطبيقات REST","معالجة الأخطاء والاستثناءات","تحقق الطلبات والاستجابات","تحديد معدل الطلبات","تنسيق الاستجابات في JSON"]},"keywords":{"es":["cómo desarrollar API","herramientas de IA para desarrolladores","alternativas a API Gateway","API REST vs GraphQL","instalación de Node.js para API","guía de configuración de API con Python","desarrollo de API con React","uso de CLI para API"],"fr":["comment développer des API","outils d''IA pour développeurs","alternatives à API Gateway","API REST vs GraphQL","installation de Node.js pour API","guide de configuration d''API avec Python","développement d''API avec React","utilisation de CLI pour API"],"de":["wie entwickelt man APIs","KI-Tools für Entwickler","Alternativen zu API Gateway","API REST vs GraphQL","Installation von Node.js für API","Konfigurationsanleitung für API mit Python","Entwicklung von APIs mit React","Verwendung von CLI für API"],"pt":["desenvolvimento de api","ferramentas de ia","criação de apis rest","tratamento de erros","validação de solicitações","limitação de taxa de requisições","guias de instalação de api","configuração de api"],"ru":["разработка api","ии агенты","создание rest api","обработка ошибок","валидация запросов","ограничение скорости запросов","руководства по установке api","настройка api"],"ar":["تطوير واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","إنشاء واجهات برمجة التطبيقات REST","معالجة الأخطاء","تحقق الطلبات","تحديد معدل الطلبات","دليل تركيب واجهات برمجة التطبيقات","إعداد واجهات برمجة التطبيقات"]}},"owner":"majiayu000","repo":"claude-skill-registry","repoPath":"majiayu000/claude-skill-registry","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-02-20T04:13:19.579Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"API Development","description":"Build REST APIs with proper error handling, status codes, request validation, response formatting, and rate limiting. Apply when creating API routes, handling errors, validating input, or designing API responses.","version":"1.1.0","bodyPreview":"# API Development\n\nSystematic REST API development with error handling, validation, and consistent response formats.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis Skill enforces:\n- HTTP status codes (appropriate, not overused)\n- RFC 7807 Problem Details for errors\n- Input validation and sanitization\n- Consistent response formatting\n- Request correlation IDs\n- Rate limiting\n- Security-first error messages\n- Centralized error handling\n\nApply when building API routes, handling errors, or designing responses.\n\n## HTTP Status","body":"# API Development\n\nSystematic REST API development with error handling, validation, and consistent response formats.\n\n## Overview\n\nThis Skill enforces:\n- HTTP status codes (appropriate, not overused)\n- RFC 7807 Problem Details for errors\n- Input validation and sanitization\n- Consistent response formatting\n- Request correlation IDs\n- Rate limiting\n- Security-first error messages\n- Centralized error handling\n\nApply when building API routes, handling errors, or designing responses.\n\n## HTTP Status Codes\n\n### Status Code Categories\n\n| Range | Purpose | Common Examples |\n|-------|---------|-----------------|\n| 200-299 | Success | 200 OK, 201 Created, 204 No Content |\n| 300-399 | Redirection | 301 Moved Permanently, 302 Found |\n| 400-499 | Client Errors | 400 Bad Request, 401 Unauthorized, 404 Not Found |\n| 500-599 | Server Errors | 500 Internal Error, 503 Service Unavailable |\n\n### Correct Status Codes\n\n```ts\n// ✅ GOOD: Specific status codes\n200  // GET: Resource retrieved\n201  // POST: Resource created\n204  // DELETE: Resource deleted (no content)\n400  // Bad Request: Validation failed\n401  // Unauthorized: Not authenticated\n403  // Forbidden: Authenticated but no permission\n404  // Not Found: Resource doesn''t exist\n409  // Conflict: Duplicate email\n422  // Unprocessable Entity: Semantic error\n429  // Too Many Requests: Rate limited\n500  // Internal Server Error: Server bug\n\n// ❌ BAD: Vague status codes\n200  // Success response for everything\n500  // Error response for everything\n200  // Returned even when validation failed\n```\n\n## Error Response Format (RFC 7807)\n\n### Problem Details Structure\n\n```ts\n// RFC 7807 Problem Details\ntype ProblemDetails = {\n  type: string;        // URL to error type documentation\n  title: string;       // Short error title\n  status: number;      // HTTP status code\n  detail: string;      // Specific error details\n  instance?: string;   // Request ID for tracking\n  errors?: Record<string, string[]>;  // Field-level errors\n};\n```\n\n### Implementation\n\n```ts\n// lib/errors.ts\nexport class ApiError extends Error {\n  constructor(\n    public status: number,\n    public title: string,\n    public detail: string,\n    public type: string = ''about:blank'',\n    public errors?: Record<string, string[]>\n  ) {\n    super(detail);\n    this.name = ''ApiError'';\n  }\n\n  toJSON() {\n    return {\n      type: this.type,\n      title: this.title,\n      status: this.status,\n      detail: this.detail,\n      instance: this.instance,\n      ...(this.errors && { errors: this.errors })\n    };\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Error Responses\n\n```ts\n// ✅ GOOD: RFC 7807 format\n{\n  \"type\": \"https://api.example.com/errors/validation-failed\",\n  \"title\": \"Validation Failed\",\n  \"status\": 400,\n  \"detail\": \"The request body contains invalid data\",\n  \"instance\": \"req-12345\",\n  \"errors\": {\n    \"email\": [\"Invalid email format\"],\n    \"age\": [\"Must be >= 18\"]\n  }\n}\n\n// ✅ GOOD: Unauthorized (no sensitive details)\n{\n  \"type\": \"https://api.example.com/errors/unauthorized\",\n  \"title\": \"Unauthorized\",\n  \"status\": 401,\n  \"detail\": \"Authentication required\",\n  \"instance\": \"req-12346\"\n}\n\n// ❌ BAD: Leaks internal details\n{\n  \"error\": \"User not found in database\",\n  \"stack\": \"Error: query failed at line 42...\"\n}\n\n// ❌ BAD: Not structured\n{\n  \"message\": \"Something went wrong\"\n}\n```\n\n## Centralized Error Handler\n\n```ts\n// middleware/error-handler.ts\nimport { NextRequest, NextResponse } from ''next/server'';\nimport { ApiError } from ''@/lib/errors'';\n\nexport function errorHandler(error: unknown) {\n  const requestId = crypto.randomUUID();\n\n  // Log error (internal, never exposed)\n  console.error(`[${requestId}] Error:`, error);\n\n  // ApiError (predictable)\n  if (error instanceof ApiError) {\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      {\n        type: error.type,\n        title: error.title,\n        status: error.status,\n        detail: error.detail,\n        instance: requestId,\n        ...(error.errors && { errors: error.errors })\n      },\n      { status: error.status }\n    );\n  }\n\n  // Validation error\n  if (error instanceof ZodError) {\n    return NextResponse.json(\n      {\n        type: ''https://api.example.com/errors/validation-failed'',\n        title: ''Validation Failed'',\n        status: 400,\n        detail: ''The request body contains invalid data'',\n        instance: requestId,\n        errors: error.flatten().fieldErrors\n      },\n      { status: 400 }\n    );\n  }\n\n  // Unknown error (generic message)\n  return NextResponse.json(\n    {\n      type: ''https://api.example.com/errors/internal-server-error'',\n      title: ''Internal Server Error'',\n      status: 500,\n      detail: ''An unexpected error occurred'',\n      instance: requestId\n    },\n    { status: 500 }\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Using Error Handler\n\n```ts\n// app/api/users/route.ts\nimport { errorHandler } from ''@/middleware/error-handler'';\n\nexport async function POST(request: Request) {\n  try {\n    const body = await request.json();\n\n    // Validate\n    const validated = CreateUserSchema.parse(body);\n\n    // Check duplicate\n    const existing = await db.user.findUnique({\n      where: { email: validated.email }\n    });\n\n    if (existing) {\n      throw new ApiError(\n        409,\n        ''Conflict'',\n        ''A user with this email already exists'',\n        ''https://api.example.com/errors/duplicate-email''\n      );\n    }\n\n    // Create\n    const user = await db.user.create({ data: validated });\n\n    return new Response(JSON.stringify(user), {\n      status: 201,\n      headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'' }\n    });\n  } catch (error) {\n    return errorHandler(error);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Input Validation\n\n### Schema Validation\n\n```ts\nimport { z } from ''zod'';\n\nconst CreateUserSchema = z.object({\n  email: z.string().email(''Invalid email format''),\n  name: z.string().min(1, ''Name required'').max(255),\n  age: z.number().int().min(0).max(150),\n  role: z.enum([''admin'', ''user'', ''guest'']).default(''user'')\n});\n\n// Validate request\nconst validated = CreateUserSchema.parse(body);\n```\n\n### Sanitization\n\n```ts\nimport DOMPurify from ''isomorphic-dompurify'';\n\nconst sanitized = {\n  ...validated,\n  name: DOMPurify.sanitize(validated.name)\n};\n```\n\n## Rate Limiting\n\n```ts\nimport rateLimit from ''express-rate-limit'';\n\n// General rate limiter\nconst limiter = rateLimit({\n  windowMs: 15 * 60 * 1000,  // 15 minutes\n  max: 100,                   // 100 requests per window\n  message: ''Too many requests, please try again later'',\n  standardHeaders: true,      // Return rate limit info in headers\n  legacyHeaders: false\n});\n\n// Auth rate limiter (stricter)\nconst authLimiter = rateLimit({\n  windowMs: 15 * 60 * 1000,\n  max: 5,                      // 5 attempts\n  skipSuccessfulRequests: true // Don''t count successful logins\n});\n\napp.post(''/login'', authLimiter, loginHandler);\napp.use(''/api/'', limiter);\n```\n\n## Response Formatting\n\n### Success Response\n\n```ts\n// ✅ GOOD: Consistent response\nexport async function GET(request: Request) {\n  const users = await db.user.findMany();\n\n  return NextResponse.json({\n    status: ''success'',\n    data: users,\n    meta: {\n      count: users.length,\n      timestamp: new Date().toISOString()\n    }\n  });\n}\n\n// ✅ GOOD: Paginated response\nexport async function GET(request: Request) {\n  const page = parseInt(request.nextUrl.searchParams.get(''page'') || ''1'');\n  const limit = parseInt(request.nextUrl.searchParams.get(''limit'') || ''20'');\n  const offset = (page - 1) * limit;\n\n  const [users, total] = await Promise.all([\n    db.user.findMany({ skip: offset, take: limit }),\n    db.user.count()\n  ]);\n\n  return NextResponse.json({\n    status: ''success'',\n    data: users,\n    meta: {\n      pagination: {\n        page,\n        limit,\n        total,\n        pages: Math.ceil(total / limit)\n      }\n    }\n  });\n}\n```\n\n## Request Correlation\n\n```ts\n// middleware/correlation-id.ts\nimport { NextResponse } from ''next/server'';\nimport type { NextRequest } from ''next/server'';\n\nexport function middleware(request: NextRequest) {\n  const correlationId = \n    request.headers.get(''x-correlation-id'') || \n    crypto.randomUUID();\n\n  const response = NextResponse.next();\n  response.headers.set(''x-correlation-id'', correlationId);\n\n  return response;\n}\n\n// Include in logs\nconsole.log(`[${correlationId}] User created:`, user);\n\n// Client can track requests\nfetch(''/api/users'', {\n  headers: { ''x-correlation-id'': myRequestId }\n});\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n```ts\n// ❌ BAD: Leaking stack traces\n{\n  \"error\": \"Cannot read property ''id'' of undefined at getUserData (line 42)\",\n  \"stack\": \"Error: ...\\nat app.js:42...\"\n}\n\n// ❌ BAD: Generic error message\n{\n  \"error\": \"Something went wrong\"\n}\n\n// ❌ BAD: No rate limiting\n// Anyone can hammer API endpoint\n\n// ❌ BAD: Overusing 500\n// Always return 500 for any error\n\n// ❌ BAD: No validation\nconst user = await db.user.create(request.body);\n// Raw user input!\n```\n\n## Verification Before Production\n\n- [ ] HTTP status codes specific and appropriate\n- [ ] Error responses RFC 7807 compliant\n- [ ] No stack traces or sensitive data exposed\n- [ ] Input validated on server side\n- [ ] Input sanitized before storage\n- [ ] Rate limiting configured\n- [ ] Correlation IDs for request tracking\n- [ ] Error messages user-friendly (not technical)\n- [ ] Centralized error handler\n- [ ] Response format consistent\n\n## Integration with Project Standards\n\nEnforces security and usability:\n- S-1: No sensitive data in errors\n- C-10: Input validated\n- AP-8: Validation on server side\n\n## Resources\n\n- RFC 7807 Problem Details: https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7807\n- HTTP Status Codes: https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Status\n- Express Rate Limiting: https://github.com/nfriedly/express-rate-limit\n---\n\n**Last Updated:** January 24, 2026\n**Compatibility:** Claude Opus 4.5, Claude Code v2.x\n**Status:** Production Ready\n\n> **January 2026 Update:** This skill is compatible with Claude Opus 4.5 and Claude Code v2.x. For complex tasks, use the `effort: high` parameter for thorough analysis.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T07:17:18.213Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for API-centric AI Agents like Claude Code and AutoGPT requiring systematic REST API development with robust error handling and validation","zh":"适用于像 Claude Code 和 AutoGPT 这样的 API 为中心的 AI 代理，需要系统化的 REST API 开发，具有强大的错误处理和验证","ja":"Claude Code や AutoGPT などの API セントリックな AI エージェントに適しており、体系的な REST API 開発と堅牢なエラーハンドリングおよび検証が必要","ko":"Claude Code 및 AutoGPT와 같은 API 중심의 AI 에이전트에 적합하며, 체계적인 REST API 개발과 강력한 오류 처리 및 유효성 검증이 필요","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA centrados en API como Claude Code y AutoGPT que requieren un desarrollo de API REST sistemático con control de errores robusto y validación","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA centrés sur l''API comme Claude Code et AutoGPT nécessitant un développement d''API REST systématique avec une gestion d''erreurs robuste et une validation","de":"Ideal für API-zentrierte KI-Agents wie Claude Code und AutoGPT, die ein systematisches REST-API-Entwicklung mit robuster Fehlerbehandlung und Validierung erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA centrados em API, como Claude Code e AutoGPT, que requerem desenvolvimento sistemático de API REST com tratamento robusto de erros e validação","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на API, таких как Claude Code и AutoGPT, требующих системного развития REST API с прочной обработкой ошибок и проверкой","ar":"مثالية لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي المعتمد على واجهة برمجة التطبيقات مثل Claude Code و AutoGPT الذي يتطلب تطوير واجهة برمجة التطبيقات REST منتظم مع معالجة أخطاء قوية و التحقق"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to develop secure and scalable APIs with HTTP status codes, RFC 7807 Problem Details for errors, and consistent response formatting, utilizing request correlation IDs and rate limiting for enhanced security and performance","zh":"赋予代理开发安全且可扩展的 API 的能力，具有 HTTP 状态代码、RFC 7807 问题详细信息用于错误以及一致的响应格式，利用请求关联 ID 和速率限制以增强安全性和性能","ja":"エージェントがセキュアでスケーラブルな API を開発できるようにし、HTTP ステータスコード、RFC 7807 の問題詳細情報をエラーに使用し、一貫したレスポンス形式を提供し、リクエスト相関 ID とレート制限を使用してセキュリティとパフォーマンスを強化","ko":"에이전트가 안전하고 확장 가능한 API를 개발 할 수 있도록하며, HTTP 상태 코드, RFC 7807 문제 세부 정보를 오류에 사용하고 일관된 응답 형식을 제공하며 요청 상관관계 ID 및 속도 제한을 사용하여 보안 및 성능을 강화","es":"Permite a los agentes desarrollar API seguras y escalables con códigos de estado HTTP, detalles de problemas RFC 7807 para errores y formato de respuesta coherente, utilizando IDs de correlación de solicitudes y limitación de velocidad para una mayor seguridad y rendimiento","fr":"Permet aux agents de développer des API sécurisées et escalables avec des codes d''état HTTP, des détails de problèmes RFC 7807 pour les erreurs et un format de réponse cohérent, en utilisant des ID de corrélation de requêtes et une limitation de débit pour une sécurité et des performances améliorées","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, sichere und skalierbare APIs mit HTTP-Statuscodes, RFC 7807-ProblemDetails für Fehler und konsistentem Antwortformat zu entwickeln, unter Verwendung von Anfragekorrelations-IDs und Rate Limiting für erhöhte Sicherheit und Leistung","pt":"Habilita os agentes a desenvolver APIs seguras e escaláveis com códigos de status HTTP, detalhes de problemas da RFC 7807 para erros e formatação de resposta consistente, utilizando IDs de correlação de solicitação e limitação de taxa para segurança e desempenho melhorados","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать безопасные и масштабируемые API с кодами состояния HTTP, деталями проблем RFC 7807 для ошибок и последовательным форматированием ответов, используя идентификаторы корреляции запросов и ограничение скорости для повышения безопасности и производительности","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من تطوير واجهات برمجة التطبيقات آمنة ومرنة مع رموز حالة HTTP و تفاصيل مشاكل RFC 7807 للأخطاء وتنسيق استجابة متسق، باستخدام معرّفات تئام الطلبات وحدود سرعة للتحسين الأمن والاداء"},"useCases":{"en":["Developing RESTful APIs with robust error handling","Implementing input validation and sanitization for secure data exchange","Designing consistent response formats for improved API usability"],"zh":["开发具有强大错误处理的 RESTful API","实现输入验证和清理以进行安全的数据交换","设计一致的响应格式以提高 API 的可用性"],"ja":["堅牢なエラーハンドリングを備えた RESTful API の開発","セキュアなデータ交換のための入力検証とサニタイジングの実装","API の使いやすさを向上させるための一貫したレスポンス形式の設計"],"ko":["강력한 오류 처리를 갖춘 RESTful API 개발","보안 데이터 교환을 위한 입력 유효성 검사 및 정제 구현","API의 사용 편의성을 향상시키기 위한 일관된 응답 형식 설계"],"es":["Desarrollar API RESTful con control de errores robusto","Implementar validación y saneamiento de entrada para un intercambio de datos seguro","Diseñar formatos de respuesta coherentes para una mejor usabilidad de la API"],"fr":["Développer des API RESTful avec une gestion d''erreurs robuste","Mettre en œuvre une validation et un nettoyage des entrées pour un échange de données sécurisé","Concevoir des formats de réponse cohérents pour une meilleure utilisabilité de l''API"],"de":["Entwicklung von RESTful-APIs mit robuster Fehlerbehandlung","Implementierung von Eingabevalidierung und -säuberung für einen sicheren Datenaustausch","Entwurf von konsistenten Antwortformaten für eine verbesserte API-Benutzerfreundlichkeit"],"pt":["Desenvolver APIs RESTful com tratamento robusto de erros","Implementar validação e sanitização de entrada para troca de dados segura","Projetar formatos de resposta consistentes para melhor usabilidade da API"],"ru":["Разработка RESTful API с прочной обработкой ошибок","Реализация проверки и очистки входных данных для безопасного обмена данными","Проектирование последовательных форматов ответов для улучшения удобства использования API"],"ar":["تطوير واجهات برمجة التطبيقات REST مع معالجة أخطاء قوية","تنفيذ التحقق والتنقية للبيانات الواردة لتبادل بيانات آمن","تصميم تنسيقات استجابة متسقة لتحسين سهولة استخدام واجهة برمجة التطبيقات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires understanding of HTTP status codes and RFC 7807","May require additional security measures for sensitive data"],"zh":["需要了解 HTTP 状态代码和 RFC 7807","可能需要对敏感数据进行额外的安全措施"],"ja":["HTTP ステータスコードと RFC 7807 の理解が必要","機密データには追加のセキュリティ対策が必要となる場合がある"],"ko":["HTTP 상태 코드 및 RFC 7807를 이해해야함","민감한 데이터에는 추가 보안 조치가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere comprensión de códigos de estado HTTP y RFC 7807","Puede requerir medidas de seguridad adicionales para datos sensibles"],"fr":["Nécessite une compréhension des codes d''état HTTP et de la RFC 7807","Peut nécessiter des mesures de sécurité supplémentaires pour les données sensibles"],"de":["Erfordert Verständnis von HTTP-Statuscodes und RFC 7807","Kann zusätzliche Sicherheitsmaßnahmen für sensible Daten erfordern"],"pt":["Requer entendimento dos códigos de status HTTP e da RFC 7807","Pode requerer medidas de segurança adicionais para dados sensíveis"],"ru":["Требует понимания кодов состояния HTTP и RFC 7807","Может требовать дополнительных мер безопасности для чувствительных данных"],"ar":["يتطلب فهم رموز حالة HTTP وRFC 7807","يمكن أن يتطلب إجراءات أمنية إضافية للبيانات الحساسة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e1489fbfe053bd90b44f2f7bebdc22b3c262c6d553777679a5321ad9f0705e80","qualityScore":85}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/verification-loop', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'verification-loop', 55024, 6781, 84, '2026-03-01T05:07:39Z', '2026-03-01T05:12:12.109Z', '01a9ae310ad4426bb05660dda6cefdeaac9513417585c09c8bb1b94738649a78', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/verification-loop","name":"verification-loop","description":{"zh":"Verification Loop是一种综合的代码验证系统，用于确保Claude Code会话的质量","ja":"Verification Loopは、Claude Codeセッションの品質を確保するための包括的なコード検証システムです","ko":"Verification Loop는 Claude Code 세션의 품질을 보장하기 위한 종합적인 코드 검증 시스템입니다","es":"El sistema de verificación de código de Claude Code es una herramienta integral para Agentes de IA que garantiza la calidad del código","fr":"Le système de vérification de code de Claude Code est un outil complet pour les Agents d''IA qui garantit la qualité du code","de":"Das Code-Überprüfungssystem von Claude Code ist ein umfassendes Tool für KI-Agents, das die Codequalität gewährleistet","pt":"O skill de verificação de loop é uma ferramenta de desenvolvedor para Claude Code que ajuda a garantir a qualidade do código","ru":"Система верификации - это инструмент для разработчиков для Claude Code, который помогает обеспечить качество кода","ar":"مهارة التحقق من الدورة هي أداة مطور ل Claude Code تساعد على ضمان جودة الكود","en":"A comprehensive verification system for Claude Code sessions."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":55024,"forks":6781,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:07:39Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"verification-loop","description":"A comprehensive verification system for Claude Code sessions.","bodyPreview":"# Verification Loop Skill\n\nA comprehensive verification system for Claude Code sessions.\n\n## When to Use\n\nInvoke this skill:\n- After completing a feature or significant code change\n- Before creating a PR\n- When you want to ensure quality gates pass\n- After refactoring\n\n## Verification Phases\n\n### Phase 1: Build Verification\n```bash\n# Check if project builds\nnpm run build 2>&1 | tail -20\n# OR\npnpm build 2>&1 | tail -20\n```\n\nIf build fails, STOP and fix before continuing.\n\n### Phase 2: Type Check","body":"# Verification Loop Skill\n\nA comprehensive verification system for Claude Code sessions.\n\n## When to Use\n\nInvoke this skill:\n- After completing a feature or significant code change\n- Before creating a PR\n- When you want to ensure quality gates pass\n- After refactoring\n\n## Verification Phases\n\n### Phase 1: Build Verification\n```bash\n# Check if project builds\nnpm run build 2>&1 | tail -20\n# OR\npnpm build 2>&1 | tail -20\n```\n\nIf build fails, STOP and fix before continuing.\n\n### Phase 2: Type Check\n```bash\n# TypeScript projects\nnpx tsc --noEmit 2>&1 | head -30\n\n# Python projects\npyright . 2>&1 | head -30\n```\n\nReport all type errors. Fix critical ones before continuing.\n\n### Phase 3: Lint Check\n```bash\n# JavaScript/TypeScript\nnpm run lint 2>&1 | head -30\n\n# Python\nruff check . 2>&1 | head -30\n```\n\n### Phase 4: Test Suite\n```bash\n# Run tests with coverage\nnpm run test -- --coverage 2>&1 | tail -50\n\n# Check coverage threshold\n# Target: 80% minimum\n```\n\nReport:\n- Total tests: X\n- Passed: X\n- Failed: X\n- Coverage: X%\n\n### Phase 5: Security Scan\n```bash\n# Check for secrets\ngrep -rn \"sk-\" --include=\"*.ts\" --include=\"*.js\" . 2>/dev/null | head -10\ngrep -rn \"api_key\" --include=\"*.ts\" --include=\"*.js\" . 2>/dev/null | head -10\n\n# Check for console.log\ngrep -rn \"console.log\" --include=\"*.ts\" --include=\"*.tsx\" src/ 2>/dev/null | head -10\n```\n\n### Phase 6: Diff Review\n```bash\n# Show what changed\ngit diff --stat\ngit diff HEAD~1 --name-only\n```\n\nReview each changed file for:\n- Unintended changes\n- Missing error handling\n- Potential edge cases\n\n## Output Format\n\nAfter running all phases, produce a verification report:\n\n```\nVERIFICATION REPORT\n==================\n\nBuild:     [PASS/FAIL]\nTypes:     [PASS/FAIL] (X errors)\nLint:      [PASS/FAIL] (X warnings)\nTests:     [PASS/FAIL] (X/Y passed, Z% coverage)\nSecurity:  [PASS/FAIL] (X issues)\nDiff:      [X files changed]\n\nOverall:   [READY/NOT READY] for PR\n\nIssues to Fix:\n1. ...\n2. ...\n```\n\n## Continuous Mode\n\nFor long sessions, run verification every 15 minutes or after major changes:\n\n```markdown\nSet a mental checkpoint:\n- After completing each function\n- After finishing a component\n- Before moving to next task\n\nRun: /verify\n```\n\n## Integration with Hooks\n\nThis skill complements PostToolUse hooks but provides deeper verification.\nHooks catch issues immediately; this skill provides comprehensive review.\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:12:12.109Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI工具：Verification Loop","ja":"AIエージェント：バージフィケーションループ","ko":"AI 에이전트: 확인 루프","es":"Herramientas de verificación de código para Agentes de IA","fr":"Outils de vérification de code pour les Agents d''IA","de":"Code-Überprüfungstools für KI-Agents","pt":"Verificação de Loop de Agente de IA para Claude Code","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Система верификации для Claude Code","ar":"دورة التحقق من وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي ل Claude Code","en":"verification-loop"},"description":{"zh":"Verification Loop是一种综合的代码验证系统，用于确保Claude Code会话的质量","ja":"Verification Loopは、Claude Codeセッションの品質を確保するための包括的なコード検証システムです","ko":"Verification Loop는 Claude Code 세션의 품질을 보장하기 위한 종합적인 코드 검증 시스템입니다","es":"El sistema de verificación de código de Claude Code es una herramienta integral para Agentes de IA que garantiza la calidad del código","fr":"Le système de vérification de code de Claude Code est un outil complet pour les Agents d''IA qui garantit la qualité du code","de":"Das Code-Überprüfungssystem von Claude Code ist ein umfassendes Tool für KI-Agents, das die Codequalität gewährleistet","pt":"O skill de verificação de loop é uma ferramenta de desenvolvedor para Claude Code que ajuda a garantir a qualidade do código","ru":"Система верификации - это инструмент для разработчиков для Claude Code, который помогает обеспечить качество кода","ar":"مهارة التحقق من الدورة هي أداة مطور ل Claude Code تساعد على ضمان جودة الكود","en":"A comprehensive verification system for Claude Code sessions."},"definition":{"en":"A comprehensive verification system for Claude Code sessions."},"features":{"zh":["自动化代码验证","多阶段验证过程","支持npm和pnpm构建","类型检查和错误报告"],"ja":["自動化コード検証","マルチステージ検証プロセス","npmとpnpmのビルドをサポート","タイプチェックとエラーレポート"],"ko":["自动화 코드 검증","다단계 검증 과정","npm과 pnpm 빌드를 지원","타입 체크 및 오류 보고"],"es":["Verificación de compilación","Verificación de tipos","Integración con Claude Code","Soporte para Agentes de IA","Mejora de la productividad","Garantía de la calidad del código"],"fr":["Vérification de la compilation","Vérification des types","Intégration avec Claude Code","Prise en charge des Agents d''IA","Amélioration de la productivité","Garantie de la qualité du code"],"de":["Überprüfung der Kompilierung","Überprüfung der Typen","Integration mit Claude Code","Unterstützung für KI-Agents","Verbesserung der Produktivität","Gewährleistung der Codequalität"],"pt":["Verificação de compilação do projeto","Verificação de tipos","Integração com Claude Code","Garantia de qualidade do código","Ferramenta de desenvolvedor para melhorar a produtividade"],"ru":["Проверка сборки проекта","Проверка типов","Интеграция с Claude Code","Обеспечение качества кода","Инструмент для разработчиков для повышения производительности"],"ar":["التحقق من بناء المشروع","التحقق من الأنواع","التكامل مع Claude Code","ضمان جودة الكود","أداة مطور لتحسين الإنتاجية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI工具","代码验证","自动化测试","Claude Code","npm","pnpm","类型检查"],"ja":["AIエージェント","コード検証","自動化テスト","Claude Code","npm","pnpm","タイプチェック"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","코드 검증","자동화 테스트","Claude Code","npm","pnpm","타입 체크"],"es":["Agentes de IA","Herramientas de desarrollo","Verificación de código","Claude Code","Productividad","Calidad del código","Desarrollo de software","Integración de herramientas"],"fr":["Agents d''IA","Outils de développement","Vérification de code","Claude Code","Productivité","Qualité du code","Développement de logiciels","Intégration d''outils"],"de":["KI-Agents","Entwicklungstools","Code-Überprüfung","Claude Code","Produktivität","Codequalität","Software-Entwicklung","Tool-Integration"],"pt":["Agente de IA","Desenvolvedor de software","Ferramenta de desenvolvedor","Qualidade do código","Claude Code","Verificação de loop"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","Разработчик программного обеспечения","Инструмент для разработчиков","Качество кода","Claude Code","Система верификации"],"ar":["وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي","مطور البرمجيات","أداة مطور","جودة الكود","Claude Code","دورة التحقق"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Analysis Agents needing automated build and type verification capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化构建和类型验证功能的代码分析代理。","ja":"コード解析エージェントが自動化されたビルドとタイプ検証機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 빌드 및 유형 확인 기능이 필요한 코드 분석 에이전트에게 완벽합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis de código que necesitan capacidades de verificación de compilación y verificación de tipo automatizadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse de code nécessitant des capacités de vérification de build et de vérification de type automatisées.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Analyse-Agenten, die automatisierte Build- und Typ-Überprüfungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Código que necessitam de capacidades de compilação automatizada e verificação de tipo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов Анализа Кодов, требующих автоматизированных возможностей сборки и проверки типов.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات تحليل الشفرة التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات بناء وتحقق من النوع آليًا."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce quality gates through npm or pnpm build verification and type checking, ensuring robust code integrity using protocols like Bash and libraries such as npm or pnpm.","zh":"赋予代理人通过npm或pnpm构建验证和类型检查强制执行质量门的能力，确保使用Bash等协议和npm或pnpm等库的强大代码完整性。","ja":"npmまたはpnpmによるビルド検証とタイプチェックを通じて、Bashなどのプロトコルやnpm/pnpmなどのライブラリを使用した堅牢なコードの完全性を確保することで、エージェントが品質ゲートを強制する能力を提供します。","ko":"npm 또는 pnpm을 통한 빌드 검증 및 유형 검사를 통해 Bash 등의 프로토콜 및 npm/pnpm 등의 라이브러리를 사용하여 강력한 코드 무결성을 보장하여 에이전트가 품질 게이트를 시행할 수 있는 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar puertas de calidad a través de la verificación de compilación de npm o pnpm y la verificación de tipos, garantizando la integridad del código robusta utilizando protocolos como Bash y bibliotecas como npm o pnpm.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des portes de qualité via la vérification de build de npm ou pnpm et la vérification de types, garantissant une intégrité de code robuste en utilisant des protocoles tels que Bash et des bibliothèques telles que npm ou pnpm.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Qualitätsschranken durch npm- oder pnpm-Build-Verifizierung und Typüberprüfung zu durchsetzen, wodurch robuste Code-Integrität unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie Bash und Bibliotheken wie npm oder pnpm gewährleistet wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor portais de qualidade por meio da verificação de compilação do npm ou pnpm e da verificação de tipo, garantindo a integridade robusta do código usando protocolos como Bash e bibliotecas como npm ou pnpm.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать качественные ворота посредством проверки сборки npm или pnpm и проверки типов, гарантируя прочную целостность кода с использованием протоколов типа Bash и библиотек типа npm или pnpm.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على فرض بوابات جودة من خلال التحقق من بناء npm أو pnpm والتحقق من النوع، مما يضمن صيانة الشفرة القوية باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل Bash ومكتبات مثل npm أو pnpm."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating build verification for Claude Code sessions","Validating type checks before creating pull requests","Debugging failed builds using tail command"],"zh":["为Claude代码会话自动化构建验证","在创建拉取请求之前验证类型检查","使用tail命令调试故障构建"],"ja":["Claudeコードセッションのビルド検証を自動化する","プルリクエストを作成する前にタイプチェックを検証する","tailコマンドを使用してビルドに失敗したデバッグ"],"ko":["클로드 코드 세션의 빌드 검증 자동화","풀 요청 생성 전 유형 검사 확인","tail 명령을 사용하여 빌드 실패 디버깅"],"es":["Automatizar la verificación de compilación para sesiones de Claude Code","Validar verificaciones de tipo antes de crear solicitudes de extracción","Depurar compilaciones fallidas utilizando el comando tail"],"fr":["Automatiser la vérification de build pour les sessions de code Claude","Valider les vérifications de type avant de créer des demandes d''extraction","Déboguer les builds échouées en utilisant la commande tail"],"de":["Automatisieren der Build-Verifizierung für Claude-Code-Sitzungen","Validieren von Typüberprüfungen vor der Erstellung von Pull-Requests","Fehlerhafte Builds mithilfe des tail-Befehls debuggen"],"pt":["Automatizar a verificação de compilação para sessões de código Claude","Validar verificações de tipo antes de criar solicitações de pull","Depurar compilações com falha usando o comando tail"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку сборки для сеансов кода Claude","Проверять проверки типов перед созданием запросов на включение","Отлаживать неудавшиеся сборки с помощью команды tail"],"ar":["تحسين processo بناء التلقائي للجلسات الشفرة Claude","التحقق من التحقق من النوع قبل إنشاء طلبات السحب","تصحيح أخطاء بناء الفشل باستخدام أمر tail"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm or pnpm installation","Limited to Bash-compatible environments","Dependent on successful build execution"],"zh":["需要npm或pnpm安装","仅限Bash兼容环境","依赖于成功的构建执行"],"ja":["npmまたはpnpmのインストールが必要","Bash互換環境のみ","正常なビルド実行に依存"],"ko":["npm 또는 pnpm 설치가 필요함","Bash 호환 환경만 해당","성공적인 빌드 실행에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de npm o pnpm","Limitado a entornos compatibles con Bash","Dependiente de la ejecución exitosa del build"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de npm ou pnpm","Limité aux environnements compatibles Bash","Dépend de l''exécution réussie du build"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von npm oder pnpm","Begrenzt auf Bash-kompatible Umgebungen","Abhängig von der erfolgreichen Build-Ausführung"],"pt":["Exige instalação do npm ou pnpm","Limitado a ambientes compatíveis com Bash","Dependente da execução bem-sucedida da compilação"],"ru":["Требует установки npm или pnpm","Ограничен средами, совместимыми с Bash","Зависит от успешного выполнения сборки"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت npm أو pnpm","محدود بالبيئات المتوافقة مع Bash","يعتمد على تنفيذ بناء ناجح"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"01a9ae310ad4426bb05660dda6cefdeaac9513417585c09c8bb1b94738649a78","repoEtag":"W/\"1d66934774ad40d3d916abf4c33c3e340ab032f8212b35e12a94daa7359886c9\"","qualityScore":84}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('cloudflare/skills/building-ai-agent-on-cloudflare', 'official', 'cloudflare', 'skills', 'cloudflare/skills', 'building-ai-agent-on-cloudflare', 387, 38, 84, '2026-02-28T23:20:41Z', '2026-03-01T05:14:09.740Z', '4add33224a12cc74533fcfd2813775ceaa98da5bbbea331a0378c16f551920ef', '{"id":"cloudflare/skills/building-ai-agent-on-cloudflare","name":"building-ai-agent-on-cloudflare","description":{"zh":"Cloudflare Agents SDK允许您构建AI智能代理，具有持久状态和实时通信功能","ja":"Cloudflare Agents SDKは、状態の保持とリアルタイム通信機能を持つAIエージェントの構築を可能にします","ko":"클라우드플레어 에이전트 SDK는 상태 유지와 실시간 통신 기능을 갖춘 AI 에이전트를 구축할 수 있습니다","es":"Crea agentes de IA en Cloudflare con estado persistente y comunicación en tiempo real","fr":"Créez des agents IA sur Cloudflare avec état persistant et communication en temps réel","de":"Erstellen Sie IA-Agenten in Cloudflare mit persistentem Zustand und Echtzeitkommunikation","pt":"Crie agentes de IA na Cloudflare com estado persistente e comunicação em tempo real usando o SDK de Agentes da Cloudflare","ru":"Создайте ИИ агентов на Cloudflare с постоянным состоянием и реальной связью, используя SDK ИИ Агентов Cloudflare","ar":"ابني وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي على كلاودفلير مع حالة مستمرة و通信 في الوقت الفعلي باستخدام SDK وكلاء كلاودفلير","en":"|"},"owner":"cloudflare","repo":"skills","repoPath":"cloudflare/skills","stars":387,"forks":38,"updatedAt":"2026-02-28T23:20:41Z","topics":["agents","cloudflare","skills","workers"],"skillMd":{"name":"building-ai-agent-on-cloudflare","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Building Cloudflare Agents\n\nCreates AI-powered agents using Cloudflare''s Agents SDK with persistent state, real-time communication, and tool integration.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User wants to build an AI agent or chatbot\n- User needs stateful, real-time AI interactions\n- User asks about the Cloudflare Agents SDK\n- User wants scheduled tasks or background AI work\n- User needs WebSocket-based AI communication\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Cloudflare account with Workers enabled\n- Node.js 18+ and npm/pnpm/yarn","body":"# Building Cloudflare Agents\n\nCreates AI-powered agents using Cloudflare''s Agents SDK with persistent state, real-time communication, and tool integration.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- User wants to build an AI agent or chatbot\n- User needs stateful, real-time AI interactions\n- User asks about the Cloudflare Agents SDK\n- User wants scheduled tasks or background AI work\n- User needs WebSocket-based AI communication\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- Cloudflare account with Workers enabled\n- Node.js 18+ and npm/pnpm/yarn\n- Wrangler CLI (`npm install -g wrangler`)\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\nnpm create cloudflare@latest -- my-agent --template=cloudflare/agents-starter\ncd my-agent\nnpm start\n```\n\nAgent runs at `http://localhost:8787`\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### What is an Agent?\n\nAn Agent is a stateful, persistent AI service that:\n- Maintains state across requests and reconnections\n- Communicates via WebSockets or HTTP\n- Runs on Cloudflare''s edge via Durable Objects\n- Can schedule tasks and call tools\n- Scales horizontally (each user/session gets own instance)\n\n### Agent Lifecycle\n\n```\nClient connects → Agent.onConnect() → Agent processes messages\n                                    → Agent.onMessage()\n                                    → Agent.setState() (persists + syncs)\nClient disconnects → State persists → Client reconnects → State restored\n```\n\n## Basic Agent Structure\n\n```typescript\nimport { Agent, Connection } from \"agents\";\n\ninterface Env {\n  AI: Ai;  // Siliconflow binding\n}\n\ninterface State {\n  messages: Array<{ role: string; content: string }>;\n  preferences: Record<string, string>;\n}\n\nexport class MyAgent extends Agent<Env, State> {\n  // Initial state for new instances\n  initialState: State = {\n    messages: [],\n    preferences: {},\n  };\n\n  // Called when agent starts or resumes\n  async onStart() {\n    console.log(\"Agent started with state:\", this.state);\n  }\n\n  // Handle WebSocket connections\n  async onConnect(connection: Connection) {\n    connection.send(JSON.stringify({\n      type: \"welcome\",\n      history: this.state.messages,\n    }));\n  }\n\n  // Handle incoming messages\n  async onMessage(connection: Connection, message: string) {\n    const data = JSON.parse(message);\n\n    if (data.type === \"chat\") {\n      await this.handleChat(connection, data.content);\n    }\n  }\n\n  // Handle disconnections\n  async onClose(connection: Connection) {\n    console.log(\"Client disconnected\");\n  }\n\n  // React to state changes\n  onStateUpdate(state: State, source: string) {\n    console.log(\"State updated by:\", source);\n  }\n\n  private async handleChat(connection: Connection, userMessage: string) {\n    // Add user message to history\n    const messages = [\n      ...this.state.messages,\n      { role: \"user\", content: userMessage },\n    ];\n\n    // Call AI\n    const response = await this.env.AI.run(\"@cf/meta/llama-3-8b-instruct\", {\n      messages,\n    });\n\n    // Update state (persists and syncs to all clients)\n    this.setState({\n      ...this.state,\n      messages: [\n        ...messages,\n        { role: \"assistant\", content: response.response },\n      ],\n    });\n\n    // Send response\n    connection.send(JSON.stringify({\n      type: \"response\",\n      content: response.response,\n    }));\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Entry Point Configuration\n\n```typescript\n// src/index.ts\nimport { routeAgentRequest } from \"agents\";\nimport { MyAgent } from \"./agent\";\n\nexport default {\n  async fetch(request: Request, env: Env) {\n    // routeAgentRequest handles routing to /agents/:class/:name\n    return (\n      (await routeAgentRequest(request, env)) ||\n      new Response(\"Not found\", { status: 404 })\n    );\n  },\n};\n\nexport { MyAgent };\n```\n\nClients connect via: `wss://my-agent.workers.dev/agents/MyAgent/session-id`\n\n## Wrangler Configuration\n\n```toml\nname = \"my-agent\"\nmain = \"src/index.ts\"\ncompatibility_date = \"2024-12-01\"\n\n[ai]\nbinding = \"AI\"\n\n[durable_objects]\nbindings = [{ name = \"AGENT\", class_name = \"MyAgent\" }]\n\n[[migrations]]\ntag = \"v1\"\nnew_classes = [\"MyAgent\"]\n```\n\n## State Management\n\n### Reading State\n\n```typescript\n// Current state is always available\nconst currentMessages = this.state.messages;\nconst userPrefs = this.state.preferences;\n```\n\n### Updating State\n\n```typescript\n// setState persists AND syncs to all connected clients\nthis.setState({\n  ...this.state,\n  messages: [...this.state.messages, newMessage],\n});\n\n// Partial updates work too\nthis.setState({\n  preferences: { ...this.state.preferences, theme: \"dark\" },\n});\n```\n\n### SQL Storage\n\nFor complex queries, use the embedded SQLite database:\n\n```typescript\n// Create tables\nawait this.sql`\n  CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS documents (\n    id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,\n    title TEXT NOT NULL,\n    content TEXT,\n    created_at DATETIME DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP\n  )\n`;\n\n// Insert\nawait this.sql`\n  INSERT INTO documents (title, content)\n  VALUES (${title}, ${content})\n`;\n\n// Query\nconst docs = await this.sql`\n  SELECT * FROM documents WHERE title LIKE ${`%${search}%`}\n`;\n```\n\n## Scheduled Tasks\n\nAgents can schedule future work:\n\n```typescript\nasync onMessage(connection: Connection, message: string) {\n  const data = JSON.parse(message);\n\n  if (data.type === \"schedule_reminder\") {\n    // Schedule task for 1 hour from now\n    const { id } = await this.schedule(3600, \"sendReminder\", {\n      message: data.reminderText,\n      userId: data.userId,\n    });\n\n    connection.send(JSON.stringify({ type: \"scheduled\", taskId: id }));\n  }\n}\n\n// Called when scheduled task fires\nasync sendReminder(data: { message: string; userId: string }) {\n  // Send notification, email, etc.\n  console.log(`Reminder for ${data.userId}: ${data.message}`);\n\n  // Can also update state\n  this.setState({\n    ...this.state,\n    lastReminder: new Date().toISOString(),\n  });\n}\n```\n\n### Schedule Options\n\n```typescript\n// Delay in seconds\nawait this.schedule(60, \"taskMethod\", { data });\n\n// Specific date\nawait this.schedule(new Date(\"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z\"), \"taskMethod\", { data });\n\n// Cron expression (recurring)\nawait this.schedule(\"0 9 * * *\", \"dailyTask\", {});  // 9 AM daily\nawait this.schedule(\"*/5 * * * *\", \"everyFiveMinutes\", {});  // Every 5 min\n\n// Manage schedules\nconst schedules = await this.getSchedules();\nawait this.cancelSchedule(taskId);\n```\n\n## Chat Agent (AI-Powered)\n\nFor chat-focused agents, extend `AIChatAgent`:\n\n```typescript\nimport { AIChatAgent } from \"agents/ai-chat-agent\";\n\nexport class ChatBot extends AIChatAgent<Env> {\n  // Called for each user message\n  async onChatMessage(message: string) {\n    const response = await this.env.AI.run(\"@cf/meta/llama-3-8b-instruct\", {\n      messages: [\n        { role: \"system\", content: \"You are a helpful assistant.\" },\n        ...this.messages,  // Automatic history management\n        { role: \"user\", content: message },\n      ],\n      stream: true,\n    });\n\n    // Stream response back to client\n    return response;\n  }\n}\n```\n\nFeatures included:\n- Automatic message history\n- Resumable streaming (survives disconnects)\n- Built-in `saveMessages()` for persistence\n\n## Client Integration\n\n### React Hook\n\n```tsx\nimport { useAgent } from \"agents/react\";\n\nfunction Chat() {\n  const { state, send, connected } = useAgent({\n    agent: \"my-agent\",\n    name: userId,  // Agent instance ID\n  });\n\n  const sendMessage = (text: string) => {\n    send(JSON.stringify({ type: \"chat\", content: text }));\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div>\n      {state.messages.map((msg, i) => (\n        <div key={i}>{msg.role}: {msg.content}</div>\n      ))}\n      <input onKeyDown={(e) => e.key === \"Enter\" && sendMessage(e.target.value)} />\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Vanilla JavaScript\n\n```javascript\nconst ws = new WebSocket(\"wss://my-agent.workers.dev/agents/MyAgent/user123\");\n\nws.onopen = () => {\n  console.log(\"Connected to agent\");\n};\n\nws.onmessage = (event) => {\n  const data = JSON.parse(event.data);\n  console.log(\"Received:\", data);\n};\n\nws.send(JSON.stringify({ type: \"chat\", content: \"Hello!\" }));\n```\n\n## Common Patterns\n\nSee [references/agent-patterns.md](references/agent-patterns.md) for:\n- Tool calling and function execution\n- Multi-agent orchestration\n- RAG (Retrieval Augmented Generation)\n- Human-in-the-loop workflows\n\n## Deployment\n\n```bash\n# Deploy\nnpx wrangler deploy\n\n# View logs\nwrangler tail\n\n# Test endpoint\ncurl https://my-agent.workers.dev/agents/MyAgent/test-user\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\nSee [references/troubleshooting.md](references/troubleshooting.md) for common issues.\n\n## References\n\n- [references/examples.md](references/examples.md) — Official templates and production examples\n- [references/agent-patterns.md](references/agent-patterns.md) — Advanced patterns\n- [references/state-patterns.md](references/state-patterns.md) — State management strategies\n- [references/troubleshooting.md](references/troubleshooting.md) — Error solutions\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:14:09.740Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"云flare AI智能代理构建","ja":"Cloudflare AIエージェントの構築","ko":"클라우드플레어 AI 에이전트 구축","es":"Construye Agentes de IA en Cloudflare","fr":"Créer des Agents IA sur Cloudflare","de":"Erstelle Cloudflare-IA-Agenten","pt":"Construir Agentes de IA na Cloudflare","ru":"Создание ИИ Агентов на Cloudflare","ar":"بناء وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي على كلاودفلير","en":"building-ai-agent-on-cloudflare"},"description":{"zh":"Cloudflare Agents SDK允许您构建AI智能代理，具有持久状态和实时通信功能","ja":"Cloudflare Agents SDKは、状態の保持とリアルタイム通信機能を持つAIエージェントの構築を可能にします","ko":"클라우드플레어 에이전트 SDK는 상태 유지와 실시간 통신 기능을 갖춘 AI 에이전트를 구축할 수 있습니다","es":"Crea agentes de IA en Cloudflare con estado persistente y comunicación en tiempo real","fr":"Créez des agents IA sur Cloudflare avec état persistant et communication en temps réel","de":"Erstellen Sie IA-Agenten in Cloudflare mit persistentem Zustand und Echtzeitkommunikation","pt":"Crie agentes de IA na Cloudflare com estado persistente e comunicação em tempo real usando o SDK de Agentes da Cloudflare","ru":"Создайте ИИ агентов на Cloudflare с постоянным состоянием и реальной связью, используя SDK ИИ Агентов Cloudflare","ar":"ابني وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي على كلاودفلير مع حالة مستمرة و通信 في الوقت الفعلي باستخدام SDK وكلاء كلاودفلير","en":"|"},"definition":{"en":"|"},"features":{"zh":["持久状态","实时通信","工具集成","状态保持","Node.js 18+支持","WebSocket-based通信"],"ja":["状態の保持","リアルタイム通信","ツールの統合","状態の保持","Node.js 18+対応","WebSocketベースの通信"],"ko":["상태 유지","실시간 통신","툴 통합","상태 유지","Node.js 18+ 지원","WebSocket 기반 통신"],"es":["Estado persistente","Comunicación en tiempo real","Integración de herramientas","Tareas programadas","Comunicación basada en WebSockets"],"fr":["État persistant","Communication en temps réel","Intégration d''outils","Tâches planifiées","Communication basée sur WebSockets"],"de":["Persistenter Zustand","Echtzeitkommunikation","Werkzeugintegration","Geplante Aufgaben","WebSocket-basierte Kommunikation"],"pt":["Estado persistente","Comunicação em tempo real","Integração com ferramentas","Tarefas agendadas","Comunicação baseada em WebSocket"],"ru":["Постоянное состояние","Реальная связь","Интеграция с инструментами","Запланированные задачи","Связь на основе WebSocket"],"ar":["حالة مستمرة","اتصال في الوقت الفعلي","تكامل مع الأدوات","مهام مجدولة","اتصال قائم على WebSocket"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","Cloudflare Agents SDK","持久状态","实时通信","工具集成","Node.js","WebSocket","云flare"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Cloudflare Agents SDK","状態の保持","リアルタイム通信","ツールの統合","Node.js","WebSocket","クラウドフレア"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","클라우드플레어 에이전트 SDK","상태 유지","실시간 통신","툴 통합","Node.js","WebSocket","클라우드플레어"],"es":["agentes de IA","Cloudflare","Workers","estado persistente","comunicación en tiempo real","inteligencia artificial"],"fr":["agents IA","Cloudflare","Workers","état persistant","communication en temps réel","intelligence artificielle"],"de":["IA-Agenten","Cloudflare","Workers","persistenter Zustand","Echtzeitkommunikation","künstliche Intelligenz"],"pt":["Agentes de IA","Cloudflare","SDK de Agentes","Desenvolvimento de IA","Inteligência artificial","Automação de tarefas"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","Cloudflare","SDK ИИ Агентов","Разработка ИИ","Искусственный интеллект","Автоматизация задач"],"ar":["وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","كلاودفلير","SDK وكلاء","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي","الذكاء الاصطناعي","أتمتة المهام"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloudflare Agents needing stateful, real-time AI interactions with persistent state and WebSocket-based communication.","zh":"适合需要有状态、实时 AI 交互和持久状态以及基于 WebSocket 的通信的 Cloudflare Agents。","ja":"状態を維持したリアルタイム AI インタラクションと WebSocket ベースの通信を必要とする Cloudflare Agents に最適です。","ko":"상태를 유지하고 실시간 AI 상호작용 및 WebSocket 기반 통신이 필요한 Cloudflare Agents에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de Cloudflare que necesitan interacciones de inteligencia artificial en tiempo real con estado persistente y comunicación basada en WebSocket.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Cloudflare nécessitant des interactions d''intelligence artificielle en temps réel avec état persistant et communication basée sur WebSocket.","de":"Perfekt für Cloudflare-Agents, die Zustandsbehaftete Echtzeit-KI-Interaktionen mit persistentem Zustand und WebSocket-basierter Kommunikation benötigen.","pt":"Perfect for Cloudflare Agents needing stateful, real-time AI interactions with persistent state and WebSocket-based communication.","ru":"Perfect for Cloudflare Agents needing stateful, real-time AI interactions with persistent state and WebSocket-based communication.","ar":"Perfect for Cloudflare Agents needing stateful, real-time AI interactions with persistent state and WebSocket-based communication."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create AI-powered experiences using Cloudflare''s Agents SDK, enabling real-time communication, tool integration, and scheduled tasks with Node.js 18+ and npm/pnpm/yarn, while leveraging WebSocket-based AI communication for seamless interactions.","zh":"赋予代理创建使用 Cloudflare 的 Agents SDK 的 AI 驱动体验的能力，实现实时通信、工具集成和计划任务，支持 Node.js 18+ 和 npm/pnpm/yarn，同时利用基于 WebSocket 的 AI 通信实现无缝交互。","ja":"Cloudflare の Agents SDK を使用して、リアルタイム通信、ツール統合、スケジュールされたタスクを可能にし、Node.js 18+ および npm/pnpm/yarn をサポートしながら、WebSocket ベースの AI コミュニケーションを使用してシームレスなインタラクションを実現します。","ko":"Cloudflare의 Agents SDK를 사용하여 실시간 통신, 툴 통합 및 예약된 작업을 가능하게 하며, Node.js 18+ 및 npm/pnpm/yarn을 지원하면서 WebSocket 기반의 AI 통신을 사용하여 무審 상호작용을 실현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear experiencias impulsadas por inteligencia artificial utilizando el SDK de Agents de Cloudflare, lo que permite la comunicación en tiempo real, la integración de herramientas y las tareas programadas con Node.js 18+ y npm/pnpm/yarn, aprovechando la comunicación de inteligencia artificial basada en WebSocket para interacciones sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des expériences alimentées par l''intelligence artificielle en utilisant le SDK Agents de Cloudflare, permettant ainsi une communication en temps réel, une intégration d''outils et des tâches planifiées avec Node.js 18+ et npm/pnpm/yarn, tout en exploitant la communication d''intelligence artificielle basée sur WebSocket pour des interactions sans accroc.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, mit dem Agents SDK von Cloudflare KI-gesteuerte Erfahrungen zu erstellen, wodurch Echtzeitkommunikation, Toolintegration und geplante Aufgaben mit Node.js 18+ und npm/pnpm/yarn ermöglicht werden, während die KI-Kommunikation auf WebSocket basiert, um nahtlose Interaktionen zu ermöglichen.","pt":"Empowers agents to create AI-powered experiences using Cloudflare''s Agents SDK, enabling real-time communication, tool integration, and scheduled tasks with Node.js 18+ and npm/pnpm/yarn, while leveraging WebSocket-based AI communication for seamless interactions.","ru":"Empowers agents to create AI-powered experiences using Cloudflare''s Agents SDK, enabling real-time communication, tool integration, and scheduled tasks with Node.js 18+ and npm/pnpm/yarn, while leveraging WebSocket-based AI communication for seamless interactions.","ar":"Empowers agents to create AI-powered experiences using Cloudflare''s Agents SDK, enabling real-time communication, tool integration, and scheduled tasks with Node.js 18+ and npm/pnpm/yarn, while leveraging WebSocket-based AI communication for seamless interactions."},"useCases":{"en":["Building AI-powered chatbots with persistent state","Creating real-time AI interactions with WebSocket-based communication","Scheduling tasks or background AI work with Cloudflare Workers","Integrating tools with AI agents using Cloudflare''s Agents SDK"],"zh":["构建具有持久状态的 AI 驱动聊天机器人","创建基于 WebSocket 通信的实时 AI 交互","使用 Cloudflare Workers 计划任务或后台 AI 工作","使用 Cloudflare 的 Agents SDK 将工具集成到 AI 代理中"],"ja":["状態を維持した AI ドリブンのチャットボットを構築する","WebSocket ベースの通信を使用したリアルタイム AI インタラクションを作成する","Cloudflare Workers を使用してタスクまたはバックグラウンド AI ワークをスケジュールする","Cloudflare の Agents SDK を使用してツールを AI エージェントに統合する"],"ko":["상태를 유지하는 AI 기반 챗봇을 구축하기","WebSocket 기반 통신을 사용한 실시간 AI 상호작용을 생성하기","Cloudflare Workers를 사용하여 작업 또는 백그라운드 AI 작업을 예약하기","Cloudflare의 Agents SDK를 사용하여 툴을 AI 에이전트에 통합하기"],"es":["Construir chatbots impulsados por inteligencia artificial con estado persistente","Crear interacciones de inteligencia artificial en tiempo real con comunicación basada en WebSocket","Programar tareas o trabajo de inteligencia artificial en segundo plano con Cloudflare Workers","Integrar herramientas con agentes de inteligencia artificial utilizando el SDK de Agents de Cloudflare"],"fr":["Créer des chatbots alimentés par l''intelligence artificielle avec état persistant","Créer des interactions d''intelligence artificielle en temps réel avec communication basée sur WebSocket","Planifier des tâches ou un travail d''intelligence artificielle en arrière-plan avec Cloudflare Workers","Intégrer des outils avec des agents d''intelligence artificielle en utilisant le SDK Agents de Cloudflare"],"de":["Zustandsbehaftete KI-Chatbots mit persistentem Zustand erstellen","Echtzeit-KI-Interaktionen mit WebSocket-basierter Kommunikation erstellen","Aufgaben oder Hintergrund-KI-Arbeit mit Cloudflare Workers planen","Tools mit KI-Agents mithilfe des Cloudflare Agents SDK integrieren"],"pt":["Building AI-powered chatbots with persistent state","Creating real-time AI interactions with WebSocket-based communication","Scheduling tasks or background AI work with Cloudflare Workers","Integrating tools with AI agents using Cloudflare''s Agents SDK"],"ru":["Building AI-powered chatbots with persistent state","Creating real-time AI interactions with WebSocket-based communication","Scheduling tasks or background AI work with Cloudflare Workers","Integrating tools with AI agents using Cloudflare''s Agents SDK"],"ar":["Building AI-powered chatbots with persistent state","Creating real-time AI interactions with WebSocket-based communication","Scheduling tasks or background AI work with Cloudflare Workers","Integrating tools with AI agents using Cloudflare''s Agents SDK"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Cloudflare account with Workers enabled","Needs Node.js 18+ and npm/pnpm/yarn","Limited to Cloudflare Agents SDK"],"zh":["需要启用 Workers 的 Cloudflare 账户","需要 Node.js 18+ 和 npm/pnpm/yarn","仅限 Cloudflare Agents SDK"],"ja":["Workers を有効にした Cloudflare アカウントが必要","Node.js 18+ および npm/pnpm/yarn が必要","Cloudflare Agents SDK 限定"],"ko":["Workers가 활성화된 Cloudflare 계정이 필요합니다","Node.js 18+ 및 npm/pnpm/yarn이 필요합니다","Cloudflare Agents SDK로만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere una cuenta de Cloudflare con Workers habilitados","Necesita Node.js 18+ y npm/pnpm/yarn","Limitado al SDK de Agents de Cloudflare"],"fr":["Nécessite un compte Cloudflare avec Workers activés","Nécessite Node.js 18+ et npm/pnpm/yarn","Limité au SDK Agents de Cloudflare"],"de":["Benötigt ein Cloudflare-Konto mit aktivierten Workers","Benötigt Node.js 18+ und npm/pnpm/yarn","Begrenzt auf das Cloudflare Agents SDK"],"pt":["Requires Cloudflare account with Workers enabled","Needs Node.js 18+ and npm/pnpm/yarn","Limited to Cloudflare Agents SDK"],"ru":["Requires Cloudflare account with Workers enabled","Needs Node.js 18+ and npm/pnpm/yarn","Limited to Cloudflare Agents SDK"],"ar":["Requires Cloudflare account with Workers enabled","Needs Node.js 18+ and npm/pnpm/yarn","Limited to Cloudflare Agents SDK"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4add33224a12cc74533fcfd2813775ceaa98da5bbbea331a0378c16f551920ef","repoEtag":"W/\"2050ff8b3c3e00d31ab6816727c74e0ab9c1b238360cd17bc6966651ab9c7ea4\"","qualityScore":84}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('affaan-m/everything-claude-code/swift-actor-persistence', 'official', 'affaan-m', 'everything-claude-code', 'affaan-m/everything-claude-code', 'swift-actor-persistence', 55024, 6781, 83, '2026-03-01T05:07:39Z', '2026-03-01T05:12:11.135Z', 'dddfd2f5da0c3fa674dfdd9c54abecb004be1259cb2a892b38dd703f02fbb6aa', '{"id":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code/swift-actor-persistence","name":"swift-actor-persistence","description":{"zh":"Swift Actor 持久性提供线程安全的数据存储，使用内存缓存和文件存储","ja":"Swift Actor パーシステンスは、メモリキャッシュとファイルストレージを使用したスレッドセーフなデータストレージを提供します","ko":"Swift Actor 지속성은 메모리 캐시와 파일 저장소를 사용하여 스레드 안전한 데이터 저장소를 제공합니다","es":"Swift Actor ofrece una forma segura de persistir datos, combinando caché en memoria con almacenamiento en archivo, eliminando las carreras de datos","fr":"Swift Actor propose une façon sécurisée de persister des données, en combinant le cache en mémoire avec le stockage en fichier, en éliminant les courses de données","de":"Swift Actor bietet eine sichere Möglichkeit, Daten zu persistent zu speichern, indem es In-Memory-Caching mit Dateispeicherung kombiniert und Datenraces eliminiert","pt":"Padrão de persistência de dados thread-safe em Swift usando atores, combinando cache em memória com armazenamento em arquivo","ru":"Шаблон потокобезопасного сохранения данных в Swift с помощью акторов, объединяющий кэш в памяти с файловым хранилищем","ar":"نمط استمرارية البيانات آمن على الخيط في سويفت باستخدام الممثلين، يجمع بين ذاكرة مؤقتة في الذاكرة وتخزين الملفات","en":"Thread-safe data persistence in Swift using actors — in-memory cache with file-backed storage, eliminating data races by design."},"owner":"affaan-m","repo":"everything-claude-code","repoPath":"affaan-m/everything-claude-code","stars":55024,"forks":6781,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T05:07:39Z","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","claude","claude-code","developer-tools","llm","mcp","productivity"],"skillMd":{"name":"swift-actor-persistence","description":"Thread-safe data persistence in Swift using actors — in-memory cache with file-backed storage, eliminating data races by design.","bodyPreview":"# Swift Actors for Thread-Safe Persistence\n\nPatterns for building thread-safe data persistence layers using Swift actors. Combines in-memory caching with file-backed storage, leveraging the actor model to eliminate data races at compile time.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Building a data persistence layer in Swift 5.5+\n- Need thread-safe access to shared mutable state\n- Want to eliminate manual synchronization (locks, DispatchQueues)\n- Building offline-first apps with local storage\n\n## Core Pattern\n\n#","body":"# Swift Actors for Thread-Safe Persistence\n\nPatterns for building thread-safe data persistence layers using Swift actors. Combines in-memory caching with file-backed storage, leveraging the actor model to eliminate data races at compile time.\n\n## When to Activate\n\n- Building a data persistence layer in Swift 5.5+\n- Need thread-safe access to shared mutable state\n- Want to eliminate manual synchronization (locks, DispatchQueues)\n- Building offline-first apps with local storage\n\n## Core Pattern\n\n### Actor-Based Repository\n\nThe actor model guarantees serialized access — no data races, enforced by the compiler.\n\n```swift\npublic actor LocalRepository<T: Codable & Identifiable> where T.ID == String {\n    private var cache: [String: T] = [:]\n    private let fileURL: URL\n\n    public init(directory: URL = .documentsDirectory, filename: String = \"data.json\") {\n        self.fileURL = directory.appendingPathComponent(filename)\n        // Synchronous load during init (actor isolation not yet active)\n        self.cache = Self.loadSynchronously(from: fileURL)\n    }\n\n    // MARK: - Public API\n\n    public func save(_ item: T) throws {\n        cache[item.id] = item\n        try persistToFile()\n    }\n\n    public func delete(_ id: String) throws {\n        cache[id] = nil\n        try persistToFile()\n    }\n\n    public func find(by id: String) -> T? {\n        cache[id]\n    }\n\n    public func loadAll() -> [T] {\n        Array(cache.values)\n    }\n\n    // MARK: - Private\n\n    private func persistToFile() throws {\n        let data = try JSONEncoder().encode(Array(cache.values))\n        try data.write(to: fileURL, options: .atomic)\n    }\n\n    private static func loadSynchronously(from url: URL) -> [String: T] {\n        guard let data = try? Data(contentsOf: url),\n              let items = try? JSONDecoder().decode([T].self, from: data) else {\n            return [:]\n        }\n        return Dictionary(uniqueKeysWithValues: items.map { ($0.id, $0) })\n    }\n}\n```\n\n### Usage\n\nAll calls are automatically async due to actor isolation:\n\n```swift\nlet repository = LocalRepository<Question>()\n\n// Read — fast O(1) lookup from in-memory cache\nlet question = await repository.find(by: \"q-001\")\nlet allQuestions = await repository.loadAll()\n\n// Write — updates cache and persists to file atomically\ntry await repository.save(newQuestion)\ntry await repository.delete(\"q-001\")\n```\n\n### Combining with @Observable ViewModel\n\n```swift\n@Observable\nfinal class QuestionListViewModel {\n    private(set) var questions: [Question] = []\n    private let repository: LocalRepository<Question>\n\n    init(repository: LocalRepository<Question> = LocalRepository()) {\n        self.repository = repository\n    }\n\n    func load() async {\n        questions = await repository.loadAll()\n    }\n\n    func add(_ question: Question) async throws {\n        try await repository.save(question)\n        questions = await repository.loadAll()\n    }\n}\n```\n\n## Key Design Decisions\n\n| Decision | Rationale |\n|----------|-----------|\n| Actor (not class + lock) | Compiler-enforced thread safety, no manual synchronization |\n| In-memory cache + file persistence | Fast reads from cache, durable writes to disk |\n| Synchronous init loading | Avoids async initialization complexity |\n| Dictionary keyed by ID | O(1) lookups by identifier |\n| Generic over `Codable & Identifiable` | Reusable across any model type |\n| Atomic file writes (`.atomic`) | Prevents partial writes on crash |\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- **Use `Sendable` types** for all data crossing actor boundaries\n- **Keep the actor''s public API minimal** — only expose domain operations, not persistence details\n- **Use `.atomic` writes** to prevent data corruption if the app crashes mid-write\n- **Load synchronously in `init`** — async initializers add complexity with minimal benefit for local files\n- **Combine with `@Observable`** ViewModels for reactive UI updates\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n\n- Using `DispatchQueue` or `NSLock` instead of actors for new Swift concurrency code\n- Exposing the internal cache dictionary to external callers\n- Making the file URL configurable without validation\n- Forgetting that all actor method calls are `await` — callers must handle async context\n- Using `nonisolated` to bypass actor isolation (defeats the purpose)\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Local data storage in iOS/macOS apps (user data, settings, cached content)\n- Offline-first architectures that sync to a server later\n- Any shared mutable state that multiple parts of the app access concurrently\n- Replacing legacy `DispatchQueue`-based thread safety with modern Swift concurrency\n"},"category":"official","lastSynced":"2026-03-01T05:12:11.135Z","seo":{"title":{"zh":"Swift Actor 持久性 - AI智能工具","ja":"Swift Actor パーシステンス - AIエージェント","ko":"Swift Actor 지속성 - AI 에이전트","es":"Herramientas de persistencia de datos seguras con Swift A...","fr":"Outils de persistence de données sécurisés avec Swift Actor","de":"Sichere Datenpersistenz mit Swift Actor","pt":"Agente de Persistência Swift com Ator","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Swift Actor Persistence","ar":"وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي: استمرارية سويفت بالتمثيل","en":"swift-actor-persistence"},"description":{"zh":"Swift Actor 持久性提供线程安全的数据存储，使用内存缓存和文件存储","ja":"Swift Actor パーシステンスは、メモリキャッシュとファイルストレージを使用したスレッドセーフなデータストレージを提供します","ko":"Swift Actor 지속성은 메모리 캐시와 파일 저장소를 사용하여 스레드 안전한 데이터 저장소를 제공합니다","es":"Swift Actor ofrece una forma segura de persistir datos, combinando caché en memoria con almacenamiento en archivo, eliminando las carreras de datos","fr":"Swift Actor propose une façon sécurisée de persister des données, en combinant le cache en mémoire avec le stockage en fichier, en éliminant les courses de d...","de":"Swift Actor bietet eine sichere Möglichkeit, Daten zu persistent zu speichern, indem es In-Memory-Caching mit Dateispeicherung kombiniert und Datenraces elim...","pt":"Padrão de persistência de dados thread-safe em Swift usando atores, combinando cache em memória com armazenamento em arquivo","ru":"Шаблон потокобезопасного сохранения данных в Swift с помощью акторов, объединяющий кэш в памяти с файловым хранилищем","ar":"نمط استمرارية البيانات آمن على الخيط في سويفت باستخدام الممثلين، يجمع بين ذاكرة مؤقتة في الذاكرة وتخزين الملفات","en":"Thread-safe data persistence in Swift using actors — in-memory cache with file-backed storage, eliminating data races by design."},"definition":{"en":"Thread-safe data persistence in Swift using actors — in-memory cache with file-backed storage, eliminating data races by design."},"features":{"zh":["线程安全的数据存储","内存缓存和文件存储","消除数据竞争","适用于 Swift 5.5+","适用于离线优先的应用程序","简化数据同步"],"ja":["スレッドセーフなデータストレージ","メモリキャッシュとファイルストレージ","データレースの排除","Swift 5.5+ 対応","オフライン優先アプリケーション向け","データ同期の簡素化"],"ko":["스레드 안전한 데이터 저장소","메모리 캐시와 파일 저장소","데이터 경쟁 제거","Swift 5.5+ 지원","오프라인 우선 애플리케이션을 위한","데이터 동기화 단순화"],"es":["Persistencia de datos segura con caché en memoria y almacenamiento en archivo","Evita las carreras de datos y mejora la productividad","Compatible con Swift 5.5+","Ideal para aplicaciones offline-first con almacenamiento local","Elimina la necesidad de sincronización manual"],"fr":["Persistence de données sécurisée avec cache en mémoire et stockage en fichier","Évite les courses de données et améliore la productivité","Compatible avec Swift 5.5+","Idéal pour les applications offline-first avec stockage local","Élimine la nécessité de synchronisation manuelle"],"de":["Sichere Datenpersistenz mit In-Memory-Caching und Dateispeicherung","Vermeidet Datenraces und verbessert die Produktivität","Kompatibel mit Swift 5.5+","Ideal für Offline-First-Anwendungen mit lokalem Speicher","Eliminiert die Notwendigkeit manueller Synchronisation"],"pt":["Persistência de dados thread-safe","Cache em memória e armazenamento em arquivo","Eliminação de corridas de dados por design","Suporte a aplicativos offline-first com armazenamento local","Integração com Swift 5.5+"],"ru":["Потокобезопасное сохранение данных","Кэш в памяти и файловое хранилище","Устранение гонок данных по конструкции","Поддержка офлайн-приложений с локальным хранилищем","Интеграция с Swift 5.5+"],"ar":["استمرارية البيانات آمنة على الخيط","ذاكرة مؤقتة في الذاكرة وتخزين الملفات","إزالة سباقات البيانات بالتصميم","دعم التطبيقات غير المتصل بالإنترنت مع التخزين المحلي","التكامل مع سويفت 5.5+"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Swift Actor","AI智能工具","数据持久性","线程安全","内存缓存","文件存储","Swift 5.5+","离线优先"],"ja":["Swift Actor","AIエージェント","データ永続化","スレッドセーフ","メモリキャッシュ","ファイルストレージ","Swift 5.5+","オフライン優先"],"ko":["Swift Actor","AI 에이전트","데이터 지속성","스레드 안전","메모리 캐시","파일 저장소","Swift 5.5+","오프라인 우선"],"es":["Agentes de inteligencia artificial","Herramientas de desarrollo de Swift","Persistencia de datos segura","Caché en memoria","Almacenamiento en archivo","Swift Actor","Desarrollo de aplicaciones móviles"],"fr":["Agents d''intelligence artificielle","Outils de développement Swift","Persistence de données sécurisée","Cache en mémoire","Stockage en fichier","Swift Actor","Développement d''applications mobiles"],"de":["Künstliche Intelligenz Agenten","Swift-Entwicklungstools","Sichere Datenpersistenz","In-Memory-Caching","Dateispeicherung","Swift Actor","Mobile App-Entwicklung"],"pt":["Agente de persistência Swift","Ator Swift","Persistência de dados thread-safe","Cache em memória","Armazenamento em arquivo","Swift 5.5+","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos móveis"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","Swift Actor","Потокобезопасное сохранение данных","Кэш в памяти","Файловое хранилище","Swift 5.5+","Разработка мобильных приложений"],"ar":["وكلاء ذكاء اصطناعي","سويفت بالتمثيل","استمرارية البيانات آمنة على الخيط","ذاكرة مؤقتة في الذاكرة","تخزين الملفات","سويفت 5.5+","تطوير التطبيقات المتنقلة"]}},"agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for iOS Agents requiring thread-safe data persistence in Swift 5.5+","zh":"适用于需要线程安全数据持久性的iOS代理，要求Swift 5.5+","ja":"Swift 5.5以上を必要とするスレッドセーフなデータ永続化を必要とするiOSエージェントに適しています","ko":"스레드 안전한 데이터 지속성을 요구하는 iOS 에이전트에 적합하며 Swift 5.5 이상이 필요합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de iOS que requieren persistencia de datos segura en hilos en Swift 5.5+","fr":"Idéal pour les agents iOS nécessitant une persistance de données thread-safe dans Swift 5.5+","de":"Ideal für iOS-Agents, die threadsichere Datenspeicherung in Swift 5.5+ benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes iOS que requerem persistência de dados thread-safe em Swift 5.5+","ru":"Идеально подходит для iOS-агентов, требующих потокобезопасного сохранения данных в Swift 5.5+","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء iOS التي تتطلب استدامة بيانات آمنة للمهام المتعددة في Swift 5.5+"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Swift actors for in-memory caching with file-backed storage, eliminating data races at compile time through thread-safe access to shared mutable state, and utilizes DispatchQueues for synchronization","zh":"赋予代理使用Swift actors进行内存缓存和文件支持存储的能力，通过线程安全的共享可变状态访问，消除编译时的数据竞争，并利用DispatchQueues进行同步","ja":"Swift actorsを使用したインメモリキャッシュとファイルバックストレージの機能をエージェントに与え、コンパイル時にはデータレースを排除し、スレッドセーフな共有可変状態へのアクセスを提供し、DispatchQueuesを使用して同期します","ko":"에이전트가 스레드 안전한 공유 가변 상태에 대한 액세스를 통해 컴파일 타임에 데이터 경쟁을 제거하고 DispatchQueues를 사용하여 동기화를 제공하며 Swift actors를 사용한 인메모리 캐싱 및 파일 백업 스토리지의 기능을 제공합니다","es":"Permite a los agentes aprovechar los actores de Swift para caché en memoria con almacenamiento respaldado por archivos, eliminando carreras de datos en tiempo de compilación a través del acceso seguro en hilos al estado mutable compartido, y utiliza DispatchQueues para la sincronización","fr":"Permet aux agents d''utiliser les acteurs Swift pour le cache en mémoire avec un stockage basé sur des fichiers, éliminant les courses de données au moment de la compilation grâce à un accès thread-safe à l''état mutable partagé, et utilise DispatchQueues pour la synchronisation","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, Swift-Aktoren für Zwischenspeicherung im Speicher mit dateibasiertem Speicher zu nutzen, wodurch Datenrennen zur Compile-Zeit durch threadsicheren Zugriff auf gemeinsamen mutablen Zustand eliminiert werden, und verwendet DispatchQueues für die Synchronisierung","pt":"Permite que os agentes utilizem Swift actors para caching em memória com armazenamento suportado por arquivo, eliminando condições de corrida em tempo de compilação através de acesso thread-safe ao estado mutável compartilhado, e utiliza DispatchQueues para sincronização","ru":"Позволяет агентам использовать Swift actors для кэширования в памяти с файловым хранилищем, устраняя состояния гонки во время компиляции за счет потокобезопасного доступа к общему изменяемому состоянию и использует DispatchQueues для синхронизации","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من الاستفادة من Swift actors للتخزين المؤقت في الذاكرة مع تخزين مدعوم بملفات، مما يزيل حالة السباق في وقت الترجمة من خلال الوصول الآمن للمهام المتعددة إلى الحالة المشتركة القابلة للتغيير، ويستخدم DispatchQueues للمزامنة"},"useCases":{"en":["Building offline-first apps with local storage","Implementing thread-safe data persistence layers in Swift","Eliminating manual synchronization in concurrent data access"],"zh":["构建离线优先的应用程序，具有本地存储","在Swift中实现线程安全的数据持久层","消除并发数据访问中的手动同步"],"ja":["ローカルストレージを備えたオフライン優先アプリケーションを構築する","Swiftでスレッドセーフなデータ永続化層を実装する","コンカレントデータアクセスにおける手動同期を排除する"],"ko":["로컬 스토리지를 갖춘 오프라인 우선 애플리케이션을 구축하는 것","Swift에서 스레드 안전한 데이터 지속성 계층을 구현하는 것","동시 데이터 액세스에서 수동 동기화를 제거하는 것"],"es":["Construir aplicaciones offline-first con almacenamiento local","Implementar capas de persistencia de datos seguras en hilos en Swift","Eliminar la sincronización manual en el acceso concurrente a datos"],"fr":["Créer des applications offline-first avec un stockage local","Mettre en œuvre des couches de persistance de données thread-safe dans Swift","Éliminer la synchronisation manuelle dans l''accès concurrent aux données"],"de":["Offline-first-Anwendungen mit lokalem Speicher erstellen","Threadsichere Datenspeicherschichten in Swift implementieren","Manuelle Synchronisierung bei gleichzeitigem Datenzugriff eliminieren"],"pt":["Construção de aplicativos offline-first com armazenamento local","Implementação de camadas de persistência de dados thread-safe em Swift","Eliminação de sincronização manual no acesso concorrente a dados"],"ru":["Создание офлайн-приложений с локальным хранилищем","Реализация потокобезопасных уровней сохранения данных в Swift","Устранение ручной синхронизации при параллельном доступе к данным"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات تعمل دون اتصال مع تخزين محلي","تنفيذ طبقات استدامة بيانات آمنة للمهام المتعددة في Swift","إزالة المزامنة اليدوية في الوصول المتزامن للبيانات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Swift 5.5 or later","Limited to iOS and macOS development"],"zh":["需要Swift 5.5或更高版本","仅限于iOS和macOS开发"],"ja":["Swift 5.5以上が必要","iOSおよびmacOS開発のみ"],"ko":["Swift 5.5 이상이 필요합니다","iOS 및 macOS 개발만 해당됨"],"es":["Requiere Swift 5.5 o posterior","Limitado al desarrollo de iOS y macOS"],"fr":["Nécessite Swift 5.5 ou ultérieur","Limité au développement d''iOS et de macOS"],"de":["Benötigt Swift 5.5 oder höher","Begrenzt auf die Entwicklung von iOS und macOS"],"pt":["Requer Swift 5.5 ou posterior","Limitado ao desenvolvimento para iOS e macOS"],"ru":["Требуется Swift 5.5 или новее","Ограничено разработкой для iOS и macOS"],"ar":["يتطلب Swift 5.5 أو أحدث","مقتصر على تطوير iOS و macOS"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"dddfd2f5da0c3fa674dfdd9c54abecb004be1259cb2a892b38dd703f02fbb6aa","repoEtag":"W/\"1d66934774ad40d3d916abf4c33c3e340ab032f8212b35e12a94daa7359886c9\"","qualityScore":83}');
